anted.", "tokens": [51042, 440, 12070, 18715, 307, 746, 321, 2584, 747, 337, 12344, 13, 51290], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14071531553526181, "compression_ratio": 1.657243816254417, "no_speech_prob": 7.944336377976868e-13}, {"id": 17, "seek": 2798, "start": 46.82, "end": 49.1, "text": " I mean, you can see the raw ingredients going in,", "tokens": [51307, 286, 914, 11, 291, 393, 536, 264, 8936, 6952, 516, 294, 11, 51421], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14071531553526181, "compression_ratio": 1.657243816254417, "no_speech_prob": 7.944336377976868e-13}, {"id": 18, "seek": 2798, "start": 49.400000000000006, "end": 51.7, "text": " you observe the exact mechanism of transformation,", "tokens": [51436, 291, 11441, 264, 1900, 7513, 295, 9887, 11, 51551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14071531553526181, "compression_ratio": 1.657243816254417, "no_speech_prob": 7.944336377976868e-13}, {"id": 19, "seek": 2798, "start": 51.7, "end": 55.28, "text": " and then you evaluate the final product based on that process.", "tokens": [51551, 293, 550, 291, 13059, 264, 2572, 1674, 2361, 322, 300, 1399, 13, 51730], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14071531553526181, "compression_ratio": 1.657243816254417, "no_speech_prob": 7.944336377976868e-13}, {"id": 20, "seek": 2798, "start": 55.38, "end": 55.56, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51735, 1779, 13, 51744], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14071531553526181, "compression_ratio": 1.657243816254417, "no_speech_prob": 7.944336377976868e-13}, {"id": 21, "seek": 5556, "start": 55.56, "end": 59.28, "text": " If the smoothie is chunky, you know it's just because the blades didn't spin long enough.", "tokens": [50365, 759, 264, 36328, 307, 45392, 11, 291, 458, 309, 311, 445, 570, 264, 20066, 994, 380, 6060, 938, 1547, 13, 50551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15212208737609206, "compression_ratio": 1.5743801652892562, "no_speech_prob": 2.0764512071586028e-12}, {"id": 22, "seek": 5556, "start": 59.400000000000006, "end": 60.440000000000005, "text": " The failure is obvious.", "tokens": [50557, 440, 7763, 307, 6322, 13, 50609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15212208737609206, "compression_ratio": 1.5743801652892562, "no_speech_prob": 2.0764512071586028e-12}, {"id": 23, "seek": 5556, "start": 60.540000000000006, "end": 62.2, "text": " Exactly, because the system is transparent.", "tokens": [50614, 7587, 11, 570, 264, 1185, 307, 12737, 13, 50697], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15212208737609206, "compression_ratio": 1.5743801652892562, "no_speech_prob": 2.0764512071586028e-12}, {"id": 24, "seek": 5556, "start": 62.52, "end": 65.14, "text": " But then you step into the modern digital world,", "tokens": [50713, 583, 550, 291, 1823, 666, 264, 4363, 4562, 1002, 11, 50844], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15212208737609206, "compression_ratio": 1.5743801652892562, "no_speech_prob": 2.0764512071586028e-12}, {"id": 25, "seek": 5556, "start": 65.60000000000001, "end": 68.98, "text": " specifically the world of using artificial intelligence to write,", "tokens": [50867, 4682, 264, 1002, 295, 1228, 11677, 7599, 281, 2464, 11, 51036], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15212208737609206, "compression_ratio": 1.5743801652892562, "no_speech_prob": 2.0764512071586028e-12}, {"id": 26, "seek": 5556, "start": 69.60000000000001, "end": 72.04, "text": " to brainstorm, or, you know, to code.", "tokens": [51067, 281, 35245, 11, 420, 11, 291, 458, 11, 281, 3089, 13, 51189], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15212208737609206, "compression_ratio": 1.5743801652892562, "no_speech_prob": 2.0764512071586028e-12}, {"id": 27, "seek": 5556, "start": 72.28, "end": 76.18, "text": " And suddenly that blender is completely covered in dark, opaque glass.", "tokens": [51201, 400, 5800, 300, 24564, 307, 2584, 5343, 294, 2877, 11, 42687, 4276, 13, 51396], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15212208737609206, "compression_ratio": 1.5743801652892562, "no_speech_prob": 2.0764512071586028e-12}, {"id": 28, "seek": 7618, "start": 76.18, "end": 76.54, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50365, 1079, 13, 50383], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11457379659016927, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667051210712212e-12}, {"id": 29, "seek": 7618, "start": 77.10000000000001, "end": 81.76, "text": " We are looking at a process that is, honestly, entirely murky.", "tokens": [50411, 492, 366, 1237, 412, 257, 1399, 300, 307, 11, 6095, 11, 7696, 5257, 4133, 13, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11457379659016927, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667051210712212e-12}, {"id": 30, "seek": 7618, "start": 82.16000000000001, "end": 86.46000000000001, "text": " Like, you type a prompt asking for an essay or a block of Python code,", "tokens": [50664, 1743, 11, 291, 2010, 257, 12391, 3365, 337, 364, 16238, 420, 257, 3461, 295, 15329, 3089, 11, 50879], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11457379659016927, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667051210712212e-12}, {"id": 31, "seek": 7618, "start": 86.54, "end": 92.60000000000001, "text": " you hit enter, and seconds later a fully formed piece of text just materializes on your screen.", "tokens": [50883, 291, 2045, 3242, 11, 293, 3949, 1780, 257, 4498, 8693, 2522, 295, 2487, 445, 2527, 5660, 322, 428, 2568, 13, 51186], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11457379659016927, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667051210712212e-12}, {"id": 32, "seek": 7618, "start": 92.74000000000001, "end": 94.38000000000001, "text": " You don't see the blades spinning at all.", "tokens": [51193, 509, 500, 380, 536, 264, 20066, 15640, 412, 439, 13, 51275], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11457379659016927, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667051210712212e-12}, {"id": 33, "seek": 7618, "start": 94.48, "end": 94.84, "text": " No.", "tokens": [51280, 883, 13, 51298], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11457379659016927, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667051210712212e-12}, {"id": 34, "seek": 7618, "start": 95.10000000000001, "end": 99.62, "text": " You have absolutely no idea how the ingredients were chopped or mixed or filtered.", "tokens": [51311, 509, 362, 3122, 572, 1558, 577, 264, 6952, 645, 16497, 420, 7467, 420, 37111, 13, 51537], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11457379659016927, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667051210712212e-12}, {"id": 35, "seek": 7618, "start": 99.86000000000001, "end": 103.12, "text": " And that opacity is the absolute definition of a black box.", "tokens": [51549, 400, 300, 41693, 307, 264, 8236, 7123, 295, 257, 2211, 2424, 13, 51712], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11457379659016927, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667051210712212e-12}, {"id": 36, "seek": 7618, "start": 103.38000000000001, "end": 104.26, "text": " It really is.", "tokens": [51725, 467, 534, 307, 13, 51769], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11457379659016927, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667051210712212e-12}, {"id": 37, "seek": 10426, "start": 104.26, "end": 107.30000000000001, "text": " And for a lot of people listening to this right now, whether you are relying on AI", "tokens": [50365, 400, 337, 257, 688, 295, 561, 4764, 281, 341, 558, 586, 11, 1968, 291, 366, 24140, 322, 7318, 50517], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10936940200929719, "compression_ratio": 1.598802395209581, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995363028207475e-12}, {"id": 38, "seek": 10426, "start": 107.30000000000001, "end": 111.94, "text": " to draft sensitive work emails or write complex blocks of code for your startup,", "tokens": [50517, 281, 11206, 9477, 589, 12524, 420, 2464, 3997, 8474, 295, 3089, 337, 428, 18578, 11, 50749], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10936940200929719, "compression_ratio": 1.598802395209581, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995363028207475e-12}, {"id": 39, "seek": 10426, "start": 112.44, "end": 115.86, "text": " or even just explore random philosophical ideas on a Tuesday night,", "tokens": [50774, 420, 754, 445, 6839, 4974, 25066, 3487, 322, 257, 10017, 1818, 11, 50945], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10936940200929719, "compression_ratio": 1.598802395209581, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995363028207475e-12}, {"id": 40, "seek": 10426, "start": 115.94, "end": 117.92, "text": " that opacity is incredibly frustrating.", "tokens": [50949, 300, 41693, 307, 6252, 16522, 13, 51048], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10936940200929719, "compression_ratio": 1.598802395209581, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995363028207475e-12}, {"id": 41, "seek": 10426, "start": 118.08000000000001, "end": 120.5, "text": " Yeah, because you were left staring at this final output,", "tokens": [51056, 865, 11, 570, 291, 645, 1411, 18043, 412, 341, 2572, 5598, 11, 51177], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10936940200929719, "compression_ratio": 1.598802395209581, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995363028207475e-12}, {"id": 42, "seek": 10426, "start": 120.74000000000001, "end": 123.88000000000001, "text": " wondering how on earth the system arrived at this specific conclusion.", "tokens": [51189, 6359, 577, 322, 4120, 264, 1185, 6678, 412, 341, 2685, 10063, 13, 51346], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10936940200929719, "compression_ratio": 1.598802395209581, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995363028207475e-12}, {"id": 43, "seek": 10426, "start": 124.22, "end": 124.4, "text": " Right?", "tokens": [51363, 1779, 30, 51372], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10936940200929719, "compression_ratio": 1.598802395209581, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995363028207475e-12}, {"id": 44, "seek": 10426, "start": 124.48, "end": 126.30000000000001, "text": " You don't know if it actually reasoned its way there,", "tokens": [51376, 509, 500, 380, 458, 498, 309, 767, 1778, 292, 1080, 636, 456, 11, 51467], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10936940200929719, "compression_ratio": 1.598802395209581, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995363028207475e-12}, {"id": 45, "seek": 10426, "start": 126.38000000000001, "end": 129.68, "text": " or if it just stitched together a bunch of statistically probable words.", "tokens": [51471, 420, 498, 309, 445, 48992, 1214, 257, 3840, 295, 36478, 21759, 2283, 13, 51636], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10936940200929719, "compression_ratio": 1.598802395209581, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995363028207475e-12}, {"id": 46, "seek": 12968, "start": 129.68, "end": 134.22, "text": " And that shared frustration is the exact reason we are bringing this to you today.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 300, 5507, 20491, 307, 264, 1900, 1778, 321, 366, 5062, 341, 281, 291, 965, 13, 50592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14310826646520736, "compression_ratio": 1.427906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.894049153627897e-12}, {"id": 47, "seek": 12968, "start": 134.4, "end": 140.12, "text": " We have a truly mind-bending new paper to explore for this deep dive.", "tokens": [50601, 492, 362, 257, 4908, 1575, 12, 65, 2029, 777, 3035, 281, 6839, 337, 341, 2452, 9192, 13, 50887], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14310826646520736, "compression_ratio": 1.427906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.894049153627897e-12}, {"id": 48, "seek": 12968, "start": 140.26000000000002, "end": 141.36, "text": " It's a fantastic paper.", "tokens": [50894, 467, 311, 257, 5456, 3035, 13, 50949], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14310826646520736, "compression_ratio": 1.427906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.894049153627897e-12}, {"id": 49, "seek": 12968, "start": 141.48000000000002, "end": 141.9, "text": " It is.", "tokens": [50955, 467, 307, 13, 50976], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14310826646520736, "compression_ratio": 1.427906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.894049153627897e-12}, {"id": 50, "seek": 12968, "start": 141.98000000000002, "end": 145.16, "text": " It's a 2026 paper by an author named Flixian,", "tokens": [50980, 467, 311, 257, 945, 10880, 3035, 538, 364, 3793, 4926, 3235, 970, 952, 11, 51139], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14310826646520736, "compression_ratio": 1.427906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.894049153627897e-12}, {"id": 51, "seek": 12968, "start": 145.62, "end": 146.26000000000002, "text": " and it's titled,", "tokens": [51162, 293, 309, 311, 19841, 11, 51194], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14310826646520736, "compression_ratio": 1.427906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.894049153627897e-12}, {"id": 52, "seek": 12968, "start": 146.64000000000001, "end": 150.66, "text": " The Essay as a Pipeline, External Memory, Asymmetric Models,", "tokens": [51213, 440, 14357, 320, 382, 257, 35396, 5440, 11, 48277, 38203, 11, 1018, 32497, 17475, 6583, 1625, 11, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14310826646520736, "compression_ratio": 1.427906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.894049153627897e-12}, {"id": 53, "seek": 15066, "start": 150.66, "end": 153.76, "text": " and Inspectable Repair in Local Language Model Writing.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 29552, 712, 3696, 1246, 294, 22755, 24445, 17105, 32774, 13, 50520], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17553823471069335, "compression_ratio": 1.3071895424836601, "no_speech_prob": 1.4550729328030587e-12}, {"id": 54, "seek": 15066, "start": 154.04, "end": 156.46, "text": " This is just a phenomenal piece of work to dig into,", "tokens": [50534, 639, 307, 445, 257, 17778, 2522, 295, 589, 281, 2528, 666, 11, 50655], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17553823471069335, "compression_ratio": 1.3071895424836601, "no_speech_prob": 1.4550729328030587e-12}, {"id": 55, "seek": 15066, "start": 156.94, "end": 161.72, "text": " primarily because it completely dismantles that black box we were just talking about.", "tokens": [50679, 10029, 570, 309, 2584, 30506, 904, 300, 2211, 2424, 321, 645, 445, 1417, 466, 13, 50918], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17553823471069335, "compression_ratio": 1.3071895424836601, "no_speech_prob": 1.4550729328030587e-12}, {"id": 56, "seek": 15066, "start": 161.85999999999999, "end": 162.14, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50925, 865, 13, 50939], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17553823471069335, "compression_ratio": 1.3071895424836601, "no_speech_prob": 1.4550729328030587e-12}, {"id": 57, "seek": 16214, "start": 162.14, "end": 165.82, "text": " I mean, the author challenges this default,", "tokens": [50365, 286, 914, 11, 264, 3793, 4759, 341, 7576, 11, 50549], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12767700289116532, "compression_ratio": 1.5771604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 1.675024593854324e-12}, {"id": 58, "seek": 16214, "start": 166.42, "end": 169.42, "text": " almost subconscious assumption we've all developed over the last few years.", "tokens": [50579, 1920, 27389, 15302, 321, 600, 439, 4743, 670, 264, 1036, 1326, 924, 13, 50729], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12767700289116532, "compression_ratio": 1.5771604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 1.675024593854324e-12}, {"id": 59, "seek": 16214, "start": 169.51999999999998, "end": 170.39999999999998, "text": " Which is what, exactly?", "tokens": [50734, 3013, 307, 437, 11, 2293, 30, 50778], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12767700289116532, "compression_ratio": 1.5771604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 1.675024593854324e-12}, {"id": 60, "seek": 16214, "start": 170.57999999999998, "end": 176.35999999999999, "text": " The idea that AI writing fundamentally have to be a single, opaque, magical generation button.", "tokens": [50787, 440, 1558, 300, 7318, 3579, 17879, 362, 281, 312, 257, 2167, 11, 42687, 11, 12066, 5125, 2960, 13, 51076], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12767700289116532, "compression_ratio": 1.5771604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 1.675024593854324e-12}, {"id": 61, "seek": 16214, "start": 176.82, "end": 177.11999999999998, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51099, 1779, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12767700289116532, "compression_ratio": 1.5771604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 1.675024593854324e-12}, {"id": 62, "seek": 16214, "start": 177.27999999999997, "end": 181.01999999999998, "text": " And our entire mission today is to explore this radical alternative.", "tokens": [51122, 400, 527, 2302, 4447, 965, 307, 281, 6839, 341, 12001, 8535, 13, 51309], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12767700289116532, "compression_ratio": 1.5771604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 1.675024593854324e-12}, {"id": 63, "seek": 16214, "start": 181.73999999999998, "end": 184.7, "text": " We are going to look at a framework that treats artificial intelligence", "tokens": [51345, 492, 366, 516, 281, 574, 412, 257, 8388, 300, 19566, 11677, 7599, 51493], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12767700289116532, "compression_ratio": 1.5771604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 1.675024593854324e-12}, {"id": 64, "seek": 16214, "start": 184.7, "end": 188.48, "text": " not as a single, omniscient brain that just spits out answers from the void,", "tokens": [51493, 406, 382, 257, 2167, 11, 3406, 10661, 5412, 3567, 300, 445, 637, 1208, 484, 6338, 490, 264, 22009, 11, 51682], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12767700289116532, "compression_ratio": 1.5771604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 1.675024593854324e-12}, {"id": 65, "seek": 16214, "start": 188.66, "end": 191.67999999999998, "text": " but as a transparent, multi-step assembly line.", "tokens": [51691, 457, 382, 257, 12737, 11, 4825, 12, 16792, 12103, 1622, 13, 51842], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12767700289116532, "compression_ratio": 1.5771604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 1.675024593854324e-12}, {"id": 66, "seek": 19168, "start": 191.68, "end": 195.44, "text": " A pipeline that we can actually pause and inspect", "tokens": [50365, 316, 15517, 300, 321, 393, 767, 10465, 293, 15018, 50553], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 67, "seek": 19168, "start": 195.44, "end": 199.54000000000002, "text": " and completely control at every single stage of the process.", "tokens": [50553, 293, 2584, 1969, 412, 633, 2167, 3233, 295, 264, 1399, 13, 50758], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 68, "seek": 19168, "start": 199.68, "end": 200.84, "text": " Okay, let's unpack this.", "tokens": [50765, 1033, 11, 718, 311, 26699, 341, 13, 50823], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 69, "seek": 19168, "start": 201.20000000000002, "end": 203.82, "text": " Because the author doesn't just present a new tool, right?", "tokens": [50841, 1436, 264, 3793, 1177, 380, 445, 1974, 257, 777, 2290, 11, 558, 30, 50972], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 70, "seek": 19168, "start": 204.38, "end": 207.86, "text": " They start by ruthlessly attacking the core flaw", "tokens": [51000, 814, 722, 538, 38225, 12048, 15010, 264, 4965, 13717, 51174], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 71, "seek": 19168, "start": 207.86, "end": 210.70000000000002, "text": " in how we currently interact with language models.", "tokens": [51174, 294, 577, 321, 4362, 4648, 365, 2856, 5245, 13, 51316], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 72, "seek": 19168, "start": 210.78, "end": 211.38, "text": " They really do.", "tokens": [51320, 814, 534, 360, 13, 51350], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 73, "seek": 19168, "start": 211.74, "end": 216.8, "text": " The paper goes straight for the throat of what it calls the illusion of instantaneous thought.", "tokens": [51368, 440, 3035, 1709, 2997, 337, 264, 12394, 295, 437, 309, 5498, 264, 18854, 295, 45596, 1194, 13, 51621], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 74, "seek": 19168, "start": 217.0, "end": 219.66, "text": " The illusion of instantaneous thought.", "tokens": [51631, 440, 18854, 295, 45596, 1194, 13, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 75, "seek": 19168, "start": 219.70000000000002, "end": 220.64000000000001, "text": " I love that phrasing.", "tokens": [51766, 286, 959, 300, 7636, 3349, 13, 51813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13685731128253767, "compression_ratio": 1.6945454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179306801244244e-12}, {"id": 76, "seek": 22064, "start": 220.64, "end": 221.7, "text": " It's very accurate.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 588, 8559, 13, 50418], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1869565555027553, "compression_ratio": 1.4666666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 2.0285251343260535e-12}, {"id": 77, "seek": 22064, "start": 221.88, "end": 224.54, "text": " When you use a standard chat interface with an AI,", "tokens": [50427, 1133, 291, 764, 257, 3832, 5081, 9226, 365, 364, 7318, 11, 50560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1869565555027553, "compression_ratio": 1.4666666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 2.0285251343260535e-12}, {"id": 78, "seek": 22064, "start": 225.22, "end": 230.79999999999998, "text": " the user interface itself naturally encourages a very specific and highly misleading picture", "tokens": [50594, 264, 4195, 9226, 2564, 8195, 28071, 257, 588, 2685, 293, 5405, 36429, 3036, 50873], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1869565555027553, "compression_ratio": 1.4666666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 2.0285251343260535e-12}, {"id": 79, "seek": 22064, "start": 230.79999999999998, "end": 233.77999999999997, "text": " of what machine-assisted writing actually is.", "tokens": [50873, 295, 437, 3479, 12, 640, 33250, 3579, 767, 307, 13, 51022], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1869565555027553, "compression_ratio": 1.4666666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 2.0285251343260535e-12}, {"id": 80, "seek": 22064, "start": 233.89999999999998, "end": 234.17999999999998, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51028, 865, 13, 51042], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1869565555027553, "compression_ratio": 1.4666666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 2.0285251343260535e-12}, {"id": 81, "seek": 22064, "start": 234.32, "end": 237.5, "text": " The chat window conditions us to expect a single transaction.", "tokens": [51049, 440, 5081, 4910, 4487, 505, 281, 2066, 257, 2167, 14425, 13, 51208], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1869565555027553, "compression_ratio": 1.4666666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 2.0285251343260535e-12}, {"id": 82, "seek": 22064, "start": 237.83999999999997, "end": 238.16, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51225, 7587, 13, 51241], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1869565555027553, "compression_ratio": 1.4666666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 2.0285251343260535e-12}, {"id": 83, "seek": 23816, "start": 238.16, "end": 239.7, "text": " It makes it look like a magic trick.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 1669, 309, 574, 411, 257, 5585, 4282, 13, 50442], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12610120137532552, "compression_ratio": 1.5618556701030928, "no_speech_prob": 1.5918505662931848e-12}, {"id": 84, "seek": 23816, "start": 239.78, "end": 241.94, "text": " Like you put a coin in the slot and a novel comes out.", "tokens": [50446, 1743, 291, 829, 257, 11464, 294, 264, 14747, 293, 257, 7613, 1487, 484, 13, 50554], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12610120137532552, "compression_ratio": 1.5618556701030928, "no_speech_prob": 1.5918505662931848e-12}, {"id": 85, "seek": 23816, "start": 242.02, "end": 244.32, "text": " And the interface actively hides the complexity.", "tokens": [50558, 400, 264, 9226, 13022, 35953, 264, 14024, 13, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12610120137532552, "compression_ratio": 1.5618556701030928, "no_speech_prob": 1.5918505662931848e-12}, {"id": 86, "seek": 23816, "start": 245.02, "end": 248.48, "text": " I mean, you supply an instruction, the model produces a sequence of tokens,", "tokens": [50708, 286, 914, 11, 291, 5847, 364, 10951, 11, 264, 2316, 14725, 257, 8310, 295, 22667, 11, 50881], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12610120137532552, "compression_ratio": 1.5618556701030928, "no_speech_prob": 1.5918505662931848e-12}, {"id": 87, "seek": 23816, "start": 248.8, "end": 253.6, "text": " and that completed sequence is simply handed to you as the final authoritative answer.", "tokens": [50897, 293, 300, 7365, 8310, 307, 2935, 16013, 281, 291, 382, 264, 2572, 3793, 14275, 1867, 13, 51137], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12610120137532552, "compression_ratio": 1.5618556701030928, "no_speech_prob": 1.5918505662931848e-12}, {"id": 88, "seek": 25360, "start": 253.6, "end": 260.6, "text": " The problem is that even if the underlying model internally executed something that resembles planning,", "tokens": [50365, 440, 1154, 307, 300, 754, 498, 264, 14217, 2316, 19501, 17577, 746, 300, 34433, 5038, 11, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15388727996308924, "compression_ratio": 1.5087719298245614, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006018105507174e-12}, {"id": 89, "seek": 25360, "start": 260.92, "end": 266.88, "text": " or, you know, if it reconsidered its word choices deep within its neural pathways,", "tokens": [50731, 420, 11, 291, 458, 11, 498, 309, 40497, 292, 1080, 1349, 7994, 2452, 1951, 1080, 18161, 22988, 11, 51029], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15388727996308924, "compression_ratio": 1.5087719298245614, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006018105507174e-12}, {"id": 90, "seek": 25360, "start": 267.08, "end": 272.08, "text": " the only artifact you, the user, ever get to see is that terminal text.", "tokens": [51039, 264, 787, 34806, 291, 11, 264, 4195, 11, 1562, 483, 281, 536, 307, 300, 14709, 2487, 13, 51289], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15388727996308924, "compression_ratio": 1.5087719298245614, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006018105507174e-12}, {"id": 91, "seek": 27208, "start": 272.08, "end": 274.44, "text": " So you are completely locked out of the cognition.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 291, 366, 2584, 9376, 484, 295, 264, 46905, 13, 50483], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 92, "seek": 27208, "start": 274.7, "end": 275.08, "text": " You are.", "tokens": [50496, 509, 366, 13, 50515], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 93, "seek": 27208, "start": 275.35999999999996, "end": 281.44, "text": " The paper actually uses a really clean mathematical formalization to describe this traditional setup.", "tokens": [50529, 440, 3035, 767, 4960, 257, 534, 2541, 18894, 9860, 2144, 281, 6786, 341, 5164, 8657, 13, 50833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 94, "seek": 27208, "start": 281.74, "end": 283.97999999999996, "text": " They call it the prompt to essay model.", "tokens": [50848, 814, 818, 309, 264, 12391, 281, 16238, 2316, 13, 50960], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 95, "seek": 27208, "start": 284.28, "end": 284.58, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50975, 1079, 13, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 96, "seek": 27208, "start": 284.68, "end": 287.14, "text": " Can we break down how they represent that mathematically?", "tokens": [50995, 1664, 321, 1821, 760, 577, 436, 2906, 300, 44003, 30, 51118], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 97, "seek": 27208, "start": 287.47999999999996, "end": 287.71999999999997, "text": " Sure.", "tokens": [51135, 4894, 13, 51147], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 98, "seek": 27208, "start": 288.03999999999996, "end": 291.09999999999997, "text": " They represent this standard interaction as a very simple function.", "tokens": [51163, 814, 2906, 341, 3832, 9285, 382, 257, 588, 2199, 2445, 13, 51316], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 99, "seek": 27208, "start": 291.36, "end": 292.62, "text": " F of P equals E.", "tokens": [51329, 479, 295, 430, 6915, 462, 13, 51392], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 100, "seek": 27208, "start": 292.91999999999996, "end": 293.18, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51407, 1033, 13, 51420], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 101, "seek": 27208, "start": 293.36, "end": 294.52, "text": " F of P equals E.", "tokens": [51429, 479, 295, 430, 6915, 462, 13, 51487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21254715116897432, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 3.2280044522797757e-12}, {"id": 102, "seek": 29452, "start": 294.97999999999996, "end": 299.35999999999996, "text": " In this equation, F is the generative function, so the AI model itself.", "tokens": [50388, 682, 341, 5367, 11, 479, 307, 264, 1337, 1166, 2445, 11, 370, 264, 7318, 2316, 2564, 13, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1280825907789816, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.335452473431864e-12}, {"id": 103, "seek": 29452, "start": 299.44, "end": 299.65999999999997, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50611, 1779, 13, 50622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1280825907789816, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.335452473431864e-12}, {"id": 104, "seek": 29452, "start": 299.82, "end": 305.14, "text": " The variable P is the prompt you type into the box, and E is the resulting essay or text block.", "tokens": [50630, 440, 7006, 430, 307, 264, 12391, 291, 2010, 666, 264, 2424, 11, 293, 462, 307, 264, 16505, 16238, 420, 2487, 3461, 13, 50896], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1280825907789816, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.335452473431864e-12}, {"id": 105, "seek": 29452, "start": 305.26, "end": 308.02, "text": " It's a simple, convenient way to represent what happens.", "tokens": [50902, 467, 311, 257, 2199, 11, 10851, 636, 281, 2906, 437, 2314, 13, 51040], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1280825907789816, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.335452473431864e-12}, {"id": 106, "seek": 29452, "start": 308.02, "end": 313.02, "text": " It is, but the author argues that this equation suppresses all the crucial distinctions of writing.", "tokens": [51040, 467, 307, 11, 457, 264, 3793, 38218, 300, 341, 5367, 26835, 279, 439, 264, 11462, 1483, 49798, 295, 3579, 13, 51290], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1280825907789816, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.335452473431864e-12}, {"id": 107, "seek": 29452, "start": 313.47999999999996, "end": 316.15999999999997, "text": " It completely hides the trajectory of the thought process.", "tokens": [51313, 467, 2584, 35953, 264, 21512, 295, 264, 1194, 1399, 13, 51447], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1280825907789816, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.335452473431864e-12}, {"id": 108, "seek": 29452, "start": 316.46, "end": 319.94, "text": " Collapsing the trajectory is the phrase that really stuck with me from the text.", "tokens": [51462, 4586, 2382, 278, 264, 21512, 307, 264, 9535, 300, 534, 5541, 365, 385, 490, 264, 2487, 13, 51636], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1280825907789816, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.335452473431864e-12}, {"id": 109, "seek": 29452, "start": 320.26, "end": 321.15999999999997, "text": " It's a great way to put it.", "tokens": [51652, 467, 311, 257, 869, 636, 281, 829, 309, 13, 51697], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1280825907789816, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.335452473431864e-12}, {"id": 110, "seek": 32116, "start": 321.16, "end": 327.98, "text": " Because if all we have is F of P equals E, we have no idea if the system actually built", "tokens": [50365, 1436, 498, 439, 321, 362, 307, 479, 295, 430, 6915, 462, 11, 321, 362, 572, 1558, 498, 264, 1185, 767, 3094, 50706], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1147996920805711, "compression_ratio": 1.6071428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 1.6484402818456312e-12}, {"id": 111, "seek": 32116, "start": 327.98, "end": 330.94, "text": " a logical plan before it started spitting out paragraphs.", "tokens": [50706, 257, 14978, 1393, 949, 309, 1409, 637, 2414, 484, 48910, 13, 50854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1147996920805711, "compression_ratio": 1.6071428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 1.6484402818456312e-12}, {"id": 112, "seek": 32116, "start": 331.3, "end": 331.8, "text": " Not at all.", "tokens": [50872, 1726, 412, 439, 13, 50897], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1147996920805711, "compression_ratio": 1.6071428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 1.6484402818456312e-12}, {"id": 113, "seek": 32116, "start": 332.14000000000004, "end": 337.5, "text": " We don't know if it noticed a massive contradiction in its own argument on paragraph two, and then", "tokens": [50914, 492, 500, 380, 458, 498, 309, 5694, 257, 5994, 34937, 294, 1080, 1065, 6770, 322, 18865, 732, 11, 293, 550, 51182], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1147996920805711, "compression_ratio": 1.6071428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 1.6484402818456312e-12}, {"id": 114, "seek": 32116, "start": 337.5, "end": 340.1, "text": " quietly fixed it before showing us the final draft.", "tokens": [51182, 19141, 6806, 309, 949, 4099, 505, 264, 2572, 11206, 13, 51312], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1147996920805711, "compression_ratio": 1.6071428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 1.6484402818456312e-12}, {"id": 115, "seek": 32116, "start": 340.3, "end": 340.54, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51322, 1779, 13, 51334], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1147996920805711, "compression_ratio": 1.6071428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 1.6484402818456312e-12}, {"id": 116, "seek": 32116, "start": 340.86, "end": 345.76000000000005, "text": " Honestly, we don't even know if the final text is actually logically sound, or if it just", "tokens": [51350, 12348, 11, 321, 500, 380, 754, 458, 498, 264, 2572, 2487, 307, 767, 38887, 1626, 11, 420, 498, 309, 445, 51595], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1147996920805711, "compression_ratio": 1.6071428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 1.6484402818456312e-12}, {"id": 117, "seek": 34576, "start": 345.76, "end": 351.3, "text": " sounds highly intelligent, because the AI happens to be incredibly good at stringing articulate", "tokens": [50365, 3263, 5405, 13232, 11, 570, 264, 7318, 2314, 281, 312, 6252, 665, 412, 6798, 278, 30305, 50642], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 118, "seek": 34576, "start": 351.3, "end": 351.98, "text": " words together.", "tokens": [50642, 2283, 1214, 13, 50676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 119, "seek": 34576, "start": 352.42, "end": 352.86, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50698, 7587, 13, 50720], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 120, "seek": 34576, "start": 353.36, "end": 359.12, "text": " In a one-shot system, the function only records the endpoints, the starting prompt, and the", "tokens": [50745, 682, 257, 472, 12, 18402, 1185, 11, 264, 2445, 787, 7724, 264, 917, 20552, 11, 264, 2891, 12391, 11, 293, 264, 51033], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 121, "seek": 34576, "start": 359.12, "end": 359.74, "text": " ending essay.", "tokens": [51033, 8121, 16238, 13, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 122, "seek": 34576, "start": 360.03999999999996, "end": 361.84, "text": " The alpha and the omega, basically.", "tokens": [51079, 440, 8961, 293, 264, 10498, 11, 1936, 13, 51169], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 123, "seek": 34576, "start": 361.84, "end": 362.14, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51169, 1079, 13, 51184], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 124, "seek": 34576, "start": 362.24, "end": 367.02, "text": " Everything that happens in the middle, the struggle, the drafting, the revisions, is entirely", "tokens": [51189, 5471, 300, 2314, 294, 264, 2808, 11, 264, 7799, 11, 264, 46378, 11, 264, 3698, 4252, 11, 307, 7696, 51428], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 125, "seek": 34576, "start": 367.02, "end": 368.34, "text": " erased from existence.", "tokens": [51428, 38359, 490, 9123, 13, 51494], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 126, "seek": 34576, "start": 368.53999999999996, "end": 371.03999999999996, "text": " If I can bring it back to the kitchen analogy for a second.", "tokens": [51504, 759, 286, 393, 1565, 309, 646, 281, 264, 6525, 21663, 337, 257, 1150, 13, 51629], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 127, "seek": 34576, "start": 371.2, "end": 371.64, "text": " Please do.", "tokens": [51637, 2555, 360, 13, 51659], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18405459107471114, "compression_ratio": 1.6308243727598566, "no_speech_prob": 1.839622421409559e-12}, {"id": 128, "seek": 37164, "start": 371.64, "end": 375.78, "text": " Standard AI is like going to a restaurant where you slide a piece of paper with your", "tokens": [50365, 21298, 7318, 307, 411, 516, 281, 257, 6383, 689, 291, 4137, 257, 2522, 295, 3035, 365, 428, 50572], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 129, "seek": 37164, "start": 375.78, "end": 378.21999999999997, "text": " order under a locked, solid steel kitchen door.", "tokens": [50572, 1668, 833, 257, 9376, 11, 5100, 8269, 6525, 2853, 13, 50694], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 130, "seek": 37164, "start": 378.5, "end": 378.7, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50708, 1779, 13, 50718], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 131, "seek": 37164, "start": 378.78, "end": 382.18, "text": " And then, ten minutes later, a fully cooked meal just slides back out.", "tokens": [50722, 400, 550, 11, 2064, 2077, 1780, 11, 257, 4498, 9267, 6791, 445, 9788, 646, 484, 13, 50892], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 132, "seek": 37164, "start": 382.28, "end": 383.38, "text": " You don't see the chef at all.", "tokens": [50897, 509, 500, 380, 536, 264, 10530, 412, 439, 13, 50952], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 133, "seek": 37164, "start": 384.09999999999997, "end": 384.5, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50988, 7587, 13, 51008], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 134, "seek": 37164, "start": 384.74, "end": 387.56, "text": " So if the meal tastes terrible, you have a massive problem.", "tokens": [51020, 407, 498, 264, 6791, 8666, 6237, 11, 291, 362, 257, 5994, 1154, 13, 51161], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 135, "seek": 37164, "start": 387.91999999999996, "end": 391.8, "text": " You don't know if the raw ingredients were rotten to begin with, or if the ingredients", "tokens": [51179, 509, 500, 380, 458, 498, 264, 8936, 6952, 645, 31977, 281, 1841, 365, 11, 420, 498, 264, 6952, 51373], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 136, "seek": 37164, "start": 391.8, "end": 394.15999999999997, "text": " were fresh, but the chef just burned them in the pan.", "tokens": [51373, 645, 4451, 11, 457, 264, 10530, 445, 13490, 552, 294, 264, 2462, 13, 51491], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 137, "seek": 37164, "start": 394.36, "end": 398.46, "text": " Or if the chef cooked it perfectly, but then dumped a pound of salt on it at the very end.", "tokens": [51501, 1610, 498, 264, 10530, 9267, 309, 6239, 11, 457, 550, 32131, 257, 12013, 295, 5139, 322, 309, 412, 264, 588, 917, 13, 51706], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 138, "seek": 37164, "start": 398.53999999999996, "end": 398.8, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51710, 1779, 13, 51723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 139, "seek": 37164, "start": 398.9, "end": 399.64, "text": " You have no idea.", "tokens": [51728, 509, 362, 572, 1558, 13, 51765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11988490935294858, "compression_ratio": 1.7446153846153847, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995419406720444e-12}, {"id": 140, "seek": 39964, "start": 399.64, "end": 405.34, "text": " But the pipeline alternative proposed in this paper is like cooking on your own kitchen", "tokens": [50365, 583, 264, 15517, 8535, 10348, 294, 341, 3035, 307, 411, 6361, 322, 428, 1065, 6525, 50650], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1171656658774928, "compression_ratio": 1.6644295302013423, "no_speech_prob": 1.537083177752252e-12}, {"id": 141, "seek": 39964, "start": 405.34, "end": 405.78, "text": " island.", "tokens": [50650, 6077, 13, 50672], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1171656658774928, "compression_ratio": 1.6644295302013423, "no_speech_prob": 1.537083177752252e-12}, {"id": 142, "seek": 39964, "start": 406.74, "end": 409.53999999999996, "text": " That visual works perfectly for what Fliction is building.", "tokens": [50720, 663, 5056, 1985, 6239, 337, 437, 3235, 4105, 307, 2390, 13, 50860], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1171656658774928, "compression_ratio": 1.6644295302013423, "no_speech_prob": 1.537083177752252e-12}, {"id": 143, "seek": 39964, "start": 409.78, "end": 409.97999999999996, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50872, 865, 13, 50882], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1171656658774928, "compression_ratio": 1.6644295302013423, "no_speech_prob": 1.537083177752252e-12}, {"id": 144, "seek": 39964, "start": 410.14, "end": 413.28, "text": " On this kitchen island, every single step is isolated.", "tokens": [50890, 1282, 341, 6525, 6077, 11, 633, 2167, 1823, 307, 14621, 13, 51047], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1171656658774928, "compression_ratio": 1.6644295302013423, "no_speech_prob": 1.537083177752252e-12}, {"id": 145, "seek": 39964, "start": 413.91999999999996, "end": 418.9, "text": " Every chopped onion, every measured spice, the raw meat, the cooked meat, they are all", "tokens": [51079, 2048, 16497, 10916, 11, 633, 12690, 19436, 11, 264, 8936, 4615, 11, 264, 9267, 4615, 11, 436, 366, 439, 51328], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1171656658774928, "compression_ratio": 1.6644295302013423, "no_speech_prob": 1.537083177752252e-12}, {"id": 146, "seek": 39964, "start": 418.9, "end": 422.26, "text": " saved in completely separate bowls right in front of you on the counter.", "tokens": [51328, 6624, 294, 2584, 4994, 28513, 558, 294, 1868, 295, 291, 322, 264, 5682, 13, 51496], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1171656658774928, "compression_ratio": 1.6644295302013423, "no_speech_prob": 1.537083177752252e-12}, {"id": 147, "seek": 39964, "start": 422.41999999999996, "end": 423.38, "text": " It's totally transparent.", "tokens": [51504, 467, 311, 3879, 12737, 13, 51552], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1171656658774928, "compression_ratio": 1.6644295302013423, "no_speech_prob": 1.537083177752252e-12}, {"id": 148, "seek": 39964, "start": 423.8, "end": 428.82, "text": " The pipeline breaks the writing process down into an ordered sequence of materially persistent", "tokens": [51573, 440, 15517, 9857, 264, 3579, 1399, 760, 666, 364, 8866, 8310, 295, 2389, 2270, 24315, 51824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1171656658774928, "compression_ratio": 1.6644295302013423, "no_speech_prob": 1.537083177752252e-12}, {"id": 149, "seek": 42882, "start": 428.82, "end": 429.56, "text": " transformations.", "tokens": [50365, 34852, 13, 50402], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24835295831003495, "compression_ratio": 1.421383647798742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279269378181472e-12}, {"id": 150, "seek": 42882, "start": 430.12, "end": 432.59999999999997, "text": " Materially persistent, meaning they stick around.", "tokens": [50430, 19188, 2270, 24315, 11, 3620, 436, 2897, 926, 13, 50554], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24835295831003495, "compression_ratio": 1.421383647798742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279269378181472e-12}, {"id": 151, "seek": 42882, "start": 432.65999999999997, "end": 432.92, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50557, 1079, 13, 50570], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24835295831003495, "compression_ratio": 1.421383647798742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279269378181472e-12}, {"id": 152, "seek": 42882, "start": 433.08, "end": 433.26, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50578, 865, 13, 50587], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24835295831003495, "compression_ratio": 1.421383647798742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279269378181472e-12}, {"id": 153, "seek": 42882, "start": 433.38, "end": 438.48, "text": " Instead of that one magic jump from the prompt straight to the final essay, the system forces", "tokens": [50593, 7156, 295, 300, 472, 5585, 3012, 490, 264, 12391, 2997, 281, 264, 2572, 16238, 11, 264, 1185, 5874, 50848], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24835295831003495, "compression_ratio": 1.421383647798742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279269378181472e-12}, {"id": 154, "seek": 42882, "start": 438.48, "end": 439.02, "text": " a progression.", "tokens": [50848, 257, 18733, 13, 50875], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24835295831003495, "compression_ratio": 1.421383647798742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279269378181472e-12}, {"id": 155, "seek": 42882, "start": 439.32, "end": 439.58, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50890, 1033, 13, 50903], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24835295831003495, "compression_ratio": 1.421383647798742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279269378181472e-12}, {"id": 156, "seek": 42882, "start": 439.74, "end": 440.82, "text": " Walk us through that progression.", "tokens": [50911, 10818, 505, 807, 300, 18733, 13, 50965], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24835295831003495, "compression_ratio": 1.421383647798742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279269378181472e-12}, {"id": 157, "seek": 44082, "start": 440.82, "end": 447.15999999999997, "text": " It goes from a topic file to generating an outline file, to writing a draft file, to producing", "tokens": [50365, 467, 1709, 490, 257, 4829, 3991, 281, 17746, 364, 16387, 3991, 11, 281, 3579, 257, 11206, 3991, 11, 281, 10501, 50682], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15313491573581448, "compression_ratio": 1.6020408163265305, "no_speech_prob": 1.472228805879383e-12}, {"id": 158, "seek": 44082, "start": 447.15999999999997, "end": 449.78, "text": " a review file, and finally a revision file.", "tokens": [50682, 257, 3131, 3991, 11, 293, 2721, 257, 34218, 3991, 13, 50813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15313491573581448, "compression_ratio": 1.6020408163265305, "no_speech_prob": 1.472228805879383e-12}, {"id": 159, "seek": 44082, "start": 449.96, "end": 451.56, "text": " So five distinct steps.", "tokens": [50822, 407, 1732, 10644, 4439, 13, 50902], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15313491573581448, "compression_ratio": 1.6020408163265305, "no_speech_prob": 1.472228805879383e-12}, {"id": 160, "seek": 44082, "start": 451.71999999999997, "end": 452.04, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50910, 1779, 13, 50926], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15313491573581448, "compression_ratio": 1.6020408163265305, "no_speech_prob": 1.472228805879383e-12}, {"id": 161, "seek": 44082, "start": 452.24, "end": 459.1, "text": " And what is perhaps the most striking revelation about this paper is the raw, almost aggressive", "tokens": [50936, 400, 437, 307, 4317, 264, 881, 18559, 23456, 466, 341, 3035, 307, 264, 8936, 11, 1920, 10762, 51279], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15313491573581448, "compression_ratio": 1.6020408163265305, "no_speech_prob": 1.472228805879383e-12}, {"id": 162, "seek": 44082, "start": 459.1, "end": 462.32, "text": " simplicity of how it achieves this architecture.", "tokens": [51279, 25632, 295, 577, 309, 3538, 977, 341, 9482, 13, 51440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15313491573581448, "compression_ratio": 1.6020408163265305, "no_speech_prob": 1.472228805879383e-12}, {"id": 163, "seek": 46232, "start": 462.32, "end": 467.15999999999997, "text": " Oh, I was genuinely shocked by the technical setup when I read that section.", "tokens": [50365, 876, 11, 286, 390, 17839, 12763, 538, 264, 6191, 8657, 562, 286, 1401, 300, 3541, 13, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1489065318431669, "compression_ratio": 1.5492424242424243, "no_speech_prob": 1.9272253064250844e-12}, {"id": 164, "seek": 46232, "start": 467.32, "end": 468.14, "text": " A lot of people are.", "tokens": [50615, 316, 688, 295, 561, 366, 13, 50656], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1489065318431669, "compression_ratio": 1.5492424242424243, "no_speech_prob": 1.9272253064250844e-12}, {"id": 165, "seek": 46232, "start": 468.2, "end": 472.71999999999997, "text": " Because, you know, you would naturally assume that a system this transparent, this meticulously", "tokens": [50659, 1436, 11, 291, 458, 11, 291, 576, 8195, 6552, 300, 257, 1185, 341, 12737, 11, 341, 41566, 25038, 50885], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1489065318431669, "compression_ratio": 1.5492424242424243, "no_speech_prob": 1.9272253064250844e-12}, {"id": 166, "seek": 46232, "start": 472.71999999999997, "end": 481.26, "text": " staged, would require some massive bloated orchestration framework, like something built by a trillion", "tokens": [50885, 45178, 11, 576, 3651, 512, 5994, 1749, 770, 14161, 2405, 8388, 11, 411, 746, 3094, 538, 257, 18723, 51312], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1489065318431669, "compression_ratio": 1.5492424242424243, "no_speech_prob": 1.9272253064250844e-12}, {"id": 167, "seek": 46232, "start": 481.26, "end": 482.2, "text": " dollar tech company.", "tokens": [51312, 7241, 7553, 2237, 13, 51359], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1489065318431669, "compression_ratio": 1.5492424242424243, "no_speech_prob": 1.9272253064250844e-12}, {"id": 168, "seek": 46232, "start": 482.28, "end": 482.44, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51363, 1779, 13, 51371], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1489065318431669, "compression_ratio": 1.5492424242424243, "no_speech_prob": 1.9272253064250844e-12}, {"id": 169, "seek": 46232, "start": 482.5, "end": 485.0, "text": " You'd think it requires a complex cloud infrastructure.", "tokens": [51374, 509, 1116, 519, 309, 7029, 257, 3997, 4588, 6896, 13, 51499], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1489065318431669, "compression_ratio": 1.5492424242424243, "no_speech_prob": 1.9272253064250844e-12}, {"id": 170, "seek": 46232, "start": 485.21999999999997, "end": 485.6, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51510, 865, 13, 51529], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1489065318431669, "compression_ratio": 1.5492424242424243, "no_speech_prob": 1.9272253064250844e-12}, {"id": 171, "seek": 46232, "start": 485.98, "end": 487.4, "text": " But it doesn't at all.", "tokens": [51548, 583, 309, 1177, 380, 412, 439, 13, 51619], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1489065318431669, "compression_ratio": 1.5492424242424243, "no_speech_prob": 1.9272253064250844e-12}, {"id": 172, "seek": 48740, "start": 487.4, "end": 490.29999999999995, "text": " No, it actively avoids all of that bloat.", "tokens": [50365, 883, 11, 309, 13022, 3641, 3742, 439, 295, 300, 1749, 267, 13, 50510], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 173, "seek": 48740, "start": 491.34, "end": 496.26, "text": " The implementation described in the paper uses local granite 4.1 models running through", "tokens": [50562, 440, 11420, 7619, 294, 264, 3035, 4960, 2654, 9370, 642, 1017, 13, 16, 5245, 2614, 807, 50808], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 174, "seek": 48740, "start": 496.26, "end": 496.62, "text": " Olama.", "tokens": [50808, 422, 40868, 13, 50826], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 175, "seek": 48740, "start": 496.96, "end": 500.5, "text": " And for those listening who might be unfamiliar, that means these are models running entirely", "tokens": [50843, 400, 337, 729, 4764, 567, 1062, 312, 29415, 11, 300, 1355, 613, 366, 5245, 2614, 7696, 51020], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 176, "seek": 48740, "start": 500.5, "end": 502.59999999999997, "text": " on the user's local personal computer.", "tokens": [51020, 322, 264, 4195, 311, 2654, 2973, 3820, 13, 51125], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 177, "seek": 48740, "start": 502.67999999999995, "end": 503.09999999999997, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51129, 7587, 13, 51150], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 178, "seek": 48740, "start": 503.35999999999996, "end": 504.76, "text": " No internet connection required.", "tokens": [51163, 883, 4705, 4984, 4739, 13, 51233], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 179, "seek": 48740, "start": 504.85999999999996, "end": 506.17999999999995, "text": " Which is huge for privacy.", "tokens": [51238, 3013, 307, 2603, 337, 11427, 13, 51304], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 180, "seek": 48740, "start": 506.32, "end": 506.76, "text": " Huge.", "tokens": [51311, 37043, 13, 51333], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 181, "seek": 48740, "start": 507.29999999999995, "end": 510.23999999999995, "text": " Furthermore, it relies on basic, old school shell scripts.", "tokens": [51360, 23999, 11, 309, 30910, 322, 3875, 11, 1331, 1395, 8720, 23294, 13, 51507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 182, "seek": 48740, "start": 510.41999999999996, "end": 510.58, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51516, 865, 13, 51524], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 183, "seek": 48740, "start": 510.64, "end": 516.64, "text": " A tiny custom Python substitution utility, and completely ordinary markdown text files sitting in standard", "tokens": [51527, 316, 5870, 2375, 15329, 35827, 14877, 11, 293, 2584, 10547, 1491, 5093, 2487, 7098, 3798, 294, 3832, 51827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17638922864057888, "compression_ratio": 1.5589123867069485, "no_speech_prob": 2.0206182647225512e-12}, {"id": 184, "seek": 51664, "start": 516.64, "end": 517.88, "text": " directories on a hard drive.", "tokens": [50365, 5391, 530, 322, 257, 1152, 3332, 13, 50427], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1676679808517982, "compression_ratio": 1.6591760299625469, "no_speech_prob": 1.6941433065437161e-12}, {"id": 185, "seek": 51664, "start": 518.12, "end": 521.1999999999999, "text": " So there is no hidden cloud service processing your data?", "tokens": [50439, 407, 456, 307, 572, 7633, 4588, 2643, 9007, 428, 1412, 30, 50593], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1676679808517982, "compression_ratio": 1.6591760299625469, "no_speech_prob": 1.6941433065437161e-12}, {"id": 186, "seek": 51664, "start": 521.5, "end": 521.76, "text": " None.", "tokens": [50608, 14492, 13, 50621], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1676679808517982, "compression_ratio": 1.6591760299625469, "no_speech_prob": 1.6941433065437161e-12}, {"id": 187, "seek": 51664, "start": 522.3, "end": 524.46, "text": " There are no opaque API calls.", "tokens": [50648, 821, 366, 572, 42687, 9362, 5498, 13, 50756], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1676679808517982, "compression_ratio": 1.6591760299625469, "no_speech_prob": 1.6941433065437161e-12}, {"id": 188, "seek": 51664, "start": 524.86, "end": 530.54, "text": " The entire state of the writing process can literally be inspected using standard Unix tools", "tokens": [50776, 440, 2302, 1785, 295, 264, 3579, 1399, 393, 3736, 312, 1028, 10729, 1228, 3832, 1156, 970, 3873, 51060], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1676679808517982, "compression_ratio": 1.6591760299625469, "no_speech_prob": 1.6941433065437161e-12}, {"id": 189, "seek": 51664, "start": 530.54, "end": 532.54, "text": " that were invented, like, decades ago.", "tokens": [51060, 300, 645, 14479, 11, 411, 11, 7878, 2057, 13, 51160], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1676679808517982, "compression_ratio": 1.6591760299625469, "no_speech_prob": 1.6941433065437161e-12}, {"id": 190, "seek": 51664, "start": 532.72, "end": 535.6, "text": " It's just simple text files, talking to other simple text files.", "tokens": [51169, 467, 311, 445, 2199, 2487, 7098, 11, 1417, 281, 661, 2199, 2487, 7098, 13, 51313], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1676679808517982, "compression_ratio": 1.6591760299625469, "no_speech_prob": 1.6941433065437161e-12}, {"id": 191, "seek": 51664, "start": 535.86, "end": 541.18, "text": " I mean, the system generates a text file, saves it, and then the next step just reads that text file.", "tokens": [51326, 286, 914, 11, 264, 1185, 23815, 257, 2487, 3991, 11, 19155, 309, 11, 293, 550, 264, 958, 1823, 445, 15700, 300, 2487, 3991, 13, 51592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1676679808517982, "compression_ratio": 1.6591760299625469, "no_speech_prob": 1.6941433065437161e-12}, {"id": 192, "seek": 51664, "start": 541.24, "end": 541.88, "text": " That's very elegant.", "tokens": [51595, 663, 311, 588, 21117, 13, 51627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1676679808517982, "compression_ratio": 1.6591760299625469, "no_speech_prob": 1.6941433065437161e-12}, {"id": 193, "seek": 54188, "start": 541.88, "end": 546.74, "text": " It feels so delightfully retro for something as advanced as generative AI.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 3417, 370, 11627, 2277, 18820, 337, 746, 382, 7339, 382, 1337, 1166, 7318, 13, 50608], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 194, "seek": 54188, "start": 547.2, "end": 549.68, "text": " Which is a methodologically brilliant choice by the author.", "tokens": [50631, 3013, 307, 257, 3170, 17157, 10248, 3922, 538, 264, 3793, 13, 50755], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 195, "seek": 54188, "start": 549.84, "end": 549.9399999999999, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50763, 865, 13, 50768], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 196, "seek": 54188, "start": 550.04, "end": 555.22, "text": " By relying on simple markdown files, the system makes the entire history of the essay materially", "tokens": [50773, 3146, 24140, 322, 2199, 1491, 5093, 7098, 11, 264, 1185, 1669, 264, 2302, 2503, 295, 264, 16238, 2389, 2270, 51032], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 197, "seek": 54188, "start": 555.22, "end": 556.22, "text": " visible to the user.", "tokens": [51032, 8974, 281, 264, 4195, 13, 51082], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 198, "seek": 54188, "start": 556.38, "end": 556.6, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51090, 1779, 13, 51101], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 199, "seek": 54188, "start": 557.18, "end": 562.62, "text": " And this leads us directly into a core formal concept the paper introduces, which they call", "tokens": [51130, 400, 341, 6689, 505, 3838, 666, 257, 4965, 9860, 3410, 264, 3035, 31472, 11, 597, 436, 818, 51402], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 200, "seek": 54188, "start": 562.62, "end": 565.88, "text": " Proposition 2.2, Failure Localization.", "tokens": [51402, 21944, 5830, 568, 13, 17, 11, 39094, 540, 22755, 2144, 13, 51565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 201, "seek": 54188, "start": 566.72, "end": 567.24, "text": " Okay, hold on.", "tokens": [51607, 1033, 11, 1797, 322, 13, 51633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 202, "seek": 54188, "start": 567.36, "end": 568.18, "text": " Failure Localization.", "tokens": [51639, 39094, 540, 22755, 2144, 13, 51680], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1426231484664114, "compression_ratio": 1.586080586080586, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279270462383645e-12}, {"id": 203, "seek": 56818, "start": 568.18, "end": 571.28, "text": " So if I'm thinking about our Kitchen Island analogy, this isn't just about figuring out", "tokens": [50365, 407, 498, 286, 478, 1953, 466, 527, 23135, 7637, 21663, 11, 341, 1943, 380, 445, 466, 15213, 484, 50520], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14364639241644678, "compression_ratio": 1.5793991416309012, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980715015184721e-12}, {"id": 204, "seek": 56818, "start": 571.28, "end": 572.3399999999999, "text": " the final meal tastes bad.", "tokens": [50520, 264, 2572, 6791, 8666, 1578, 13, 50573], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14364639241644678, "compression_ratio": 1.5793991416309012, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980715015184721e-12}, {"id": 205, "seek": 56818, "start": 572.4399999999999, "end": 573.14, "text": " No, it goes deeper.", "tokens": [50578, 883, 11, 309, 1709, 7731, 13, 50613], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14364639241644678, "compression_ratio": 1.5793991416309012, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980715015184721e-12}, {"id": 206, "seek": 56818, "start": 573.4, "end": 577.56, "text": " This is about being able to walk back to the specific bowl where the onions were chopped,", "tokens": [50626, 639, 307, 466, 885, 1075, 281, 1792, 646, 281, 264, 2685, 6571, 689, 264, 13146, 645, 16497, 11, 50834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14364639241644678, "compression_ratio": 1.5793991416309012, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980715015184721e-12}, {"id": 207, "seek": 56818, "start": 577.6999999999999, "end": 583.02, "text": " inspecting it, and realizing, ah, this specific onion was rotten before it even hit the pan.", "tokens": [50841, 15018, 278, 309, 11, 293, 16734, 11, 3716, 11, 341, 2685, 10916, 390, 31977, 949, 309, 754, 2045, 264, 2462, 13, 51107], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14364639241644678, "compression_ratio": 1.5793991416309012, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980715015184721e-12}, {"id": 208, "seek": 56818, "start": 583.2399999999999, "end": 585.18, "text": " That captures the core mechanism beautifully.", "tokens": [51118, 663, 27986, 264, 4965, 7513, 16525, 13, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14364639241644678, "compression_ratio": 1.5793991416309012, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980715015184721e-12}, {"id": 209, "seek": 56818, "start": 586.0, "end": 586.4, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [51256, 3153, 13, 51276], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14364639241644678, "compression_ratio": 1.5793991416309012, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980715015184721e-12}, {"id": 210, "seek": 58640, "start": 586.4, "end": 593.12, "text": " In that traditional one-shot system, if the final essay is bad, all you can do is blame", "tokens": [50365, 682, 300, 5164, 472, 12, 18402, 1185, 11, 498, 264, 2572, 16238, 307, 1578, 11, 439, 291, 393, 360, 307, 10127, 50701], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 211, "seek": 58640, "start": 593.12, "end": 595.1999999999999, "text": " the AI as a monolithic entity.", "tokens": [50701, 264, 7318, 382, 257, 1108, 42878, 13977, 13, 50805], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 212, "seek": 58640, "start": 595.72, "end": 600.02, "text": " You just throw your hands up and say, well, the model wrote a bad essay.", "tokens": [50831, 509, 445, 3507, 428, 2377, 493, 293, 584, 11, 731, 11, 264, 2316, 4114, 257, 1578, 16238, 13, 51046], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 213, "seek": 58640, "start": 600.1, "end": 600.3, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51050, 865, 13, 51060], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 214, "seek": 58640, "start": 600.6, "end": 603.68, "text": " And maybe you try tweaking your prompt and just rolling the dice again.", "tokens": [51075, 400, 1310, 291, 853, 6986, 2456, 428, 12391, 293, 445, 9439, 264, 10313, 797, 13, 51229], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 215, "seek": 58640, "start": 603.78, "end": 604.26, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51234, 7587, 13, 51258], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 216, "seek": 58640, "start": 604.4599999999999, "end": 604.62, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51268, 865, 13, 51276], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 217, "seek": 58640, "start": 604.62, "end": 609.8199999999999, "text": " But in this staged pipeline system, because every single step is saved as an independent text", "tokens": [51276, 583, 294, 341, 45178, 15517, 1185, 11, 570, 633, 2167, 1823, 307, 6624, 382, 364, 6695, 2487, 51536], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 218, "seek": 58640, "start": 609.8199999999999, "end": 613.96, "text": " file, you can pinpoint the exact moment the failure occurred.", "tokens": [51536, 3991, 11, 291, 393, 40837, 264, 1900, 1623, 264, 7763, 11068, 13, 51743], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 219, "seek": 58640, "start": 614.34, "end": 615.38, "text": " That is so powerful.", "tokens": [51762, 663, 307, 370, 4005, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12857194869749008, "compression_ratio": 1.6232394366197183, "no_speech_prob": 1.661732817320738e-12}, {"id": 220, "seek": 61538, "start": 615.38, "end": 615.9399999999999, "text": " It is.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 307, 13, 50393], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 221, "seek": 61538, "start": 616.22, "end": 620.66, "text": " Suppose the final essay relies on a terrible, logically flawed argument.", "tokens": [50407, 21360, 264, 2572, 16238, 30910, 322, 257, 6237, 11, 38887, 38823, 6770, 13, 50629], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 222, "seek": 61538, "start": 621.32, "end": 622.84, "text": " You don't just guess what went wrong.", "tokens": [50662, 509, 500, 380, 445, 2041, 437, 1437, 2085, 13, 50738], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 223, "seek": 61538, "start": 623.3, "end": 625.02, "text": " You open the saved outline file.", "tokens": [50761, 509, 1269, 264, 6624, 16387, 3991, 13, 50847], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 224, "seek": 61538, "start": 625.46, "end": 626.1, "text": " You read it.", "tokens": [50869, 509, 1401, 309, 13, 50901], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 225, "seek": 61538, "start": 626.18, "end": 629.58, "text": " And you check if that terrible argument was already present in the initial plan.", "tokens": [50905, 400, 291, 1520, 498, 300, 6237, 6770, 390, 1217, 1974, 294, 264, 5883, 1393, 13, 51075], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 226, "seek": 61538, "start": 629.72, "end": 630.0, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51082, 1079, 13, 51096], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 227, "seek": 61538, "start": 630.22, "end": 633.9, "text": " So if the bad argument is sitting right there in the outline bullet points, then we know", "tokens": [51107, 407, 498, 264, 1578, 6770, 307, 3798, 558, 456, 294, 264, 16387, 11632, 2793, 11, 550, 321, 458, 51291], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 228, "seek": 61538, "start": 633.9, "end": 636.3, "text": " for a fact the planning stage is what failed.", "tokens": [51291, 337, 257, 1186, 264, 5038, 3233, 307, 437, 7612, 13, 51411], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 229, "seek": 61538, "start": 636.4, "end": 636.62, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51416, 1779, 13, 51427], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 230, "seek": 61538, "start": 636.76, "end": 638.74, "text": " The foundation was cracked before the house was built.", "tokens": [51434, 440, 7030, 390, 25140, 949, 264, 1782, 390, 3094, 13, 51533], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 231, "seek": 61538, "start": 638.78, "end": 641.54, "text": " But what if you open the outline, and the outline is actually brilliant?", "tokens": [51535, 583, 437, 498, 291, 1269, 264, 16387, 11, 293, 264, 16387, 307, 767, 10248, 30, 51673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 232, "seek": 61538, "start": 641.7, "end": 642.5, "text": " That's the other scenario.", "tokens": [51681, 663, 311, 264, 661, 9005, 13, 51721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1210566372938559, "compression_ratio": 1.7556270096463023, "no_speech_prob": 1.4609739199672456e-12}, {"id": 233, "seek": 64250, "start": 642.5, "end": 646.74, "text": " What if it outlines a perfectly sound argument, but then you open the final essay, and the", "tokens": [50365, 708, 498, 309, 40125, 257, 6239, 1626, 6770, 11, 457, 550, 291, 1269, 264, 2572, 16238, 11, 293, 264, 50577], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465502708188949, "compression_ratio": 1.26, "no_speech_prob": 1.3300450150965926e-12}, {"id": 234, "seek": 64250, "start": 646.74, "end": 648.22, "text": " terrible argument is there instead?", "tokens": [50577, 6237, 6770, 307, 456, 2602, 30, 50651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465502708188949, "compression_ratio": 1.26, "no_speech_prob": 1.3300450150965926e-12}, {"id": 235, "seek": 64822, "start": 648.22, "end": 652.74, "text": " Oh, then you know the drafting stage failed to realize a good plan.", "tokens": [50365, 876, 11, 550, 291, 458, 264, 46378, 3233, 7612, 281, 4325, 257, 665, 1393, 13, 50591], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3147948099219281, "compression_ratio": 1.2573529411764706, "no_speech_prob": 1.6944976238136844e-12}, {"id": 236, "seek": 64822, "start": 653.0, "end": 653.6, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [50604, 48746, 736, 13, 50634], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3147948099219281, "compression_ratio": 1.2573529411764706, "no_speech_prob": 1.6944976238136844e-12}, {"id": 237, "seek": 64822, "start": 654.1, "end": 659.22, "text": " The AI got confused while writing the prose, and basically abandoned its own blueprint.", "tokens": [50659, 440, 7318, 658, 9019, 1339, 3579, 264, 12505, 11, 293, 1936, 13732, 1080, 1065, 35868, 13, 50915], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3147948099219281, "compression_ratio": 1.2573529411764706, "no_speech_prob": 1.6944976238136844e-12}, {"id": 238, "seek": 64822, "start": 659.5, "end": 660.0400000000001, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [50929, 3153, 13, 50956], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3147948099219281, "compression_ratio": 1.2573529411764706, "no_speech_prob": 1.6944976238136844e-12}, {"id": 239, "seek": 66004, "start": 660.04, "end": 666.4399999999999, "text": " Proposition 2.2 proves mathematically that any first stage whose output violates its requirements", "tokens": [50365, 21944, 5830, 568, 13, 17, 25019, 44003, 300, 604, 700, 3233, 6104, 5598, 3448, 1024, 1080, 7728, 50685], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10058782365587023, "compression_ratio": 1.5748031496062993, "no_speech_prob": 1.4047999959479474e-12}, {"id": 240, "seek": 66004, "start": 666.4399999999999, "end": 670.5, "text": " can be distinguished from failures that are introduced strictly after it.", "tokens": [50685, 393, 312, 21702, 490, 20774, 300, 366, 7268, 20792, 934, 309, 13, 50888], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10058782365587023, "compression_ratio": 1.5748031496062993, "no_speech_prob": 1.4047999959479474e-12}, {"id": 241, "seek": 66004, "start": 670.5999999999999, "end": 675.42, "text": " So you can trace a bad final result backward through the chain of saved files until you", "tokens": [50893, 407, 291, 393, 13508, 257, 1578, 2572, 1874, 23897, 807, 264, 5021, 295, 6624, 7098, 1826, 291, 51134], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10058782365587023, "compression_ratio": 1.5748031496062993, "no_speech_prob": 1.4047999959479474e-12}, {"id": 242, "seek": 66004, "start": 675.42, "end": 677.0999999999999, "text": " find the exact point of introduction.", "tokens": [51134, 915, 264, 1900, 935, 295, 9339, 13, 51218], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10058782365587023, "compression_ratio": 1.5748031496062993, "no_speech_prob": 1.4047999959479474e-12}, {"id": 243, "seek": 66004, "start": 677.28, "end": 677.48, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51227, 1079, 13, 51237], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10058782365587023, "compression_ratio": 1.5748031496062993, "no_speech_prob": 1.4047999959479474e-12}, {"id": 244, "seek": 66004, "start": 677.54, "end": 678.76, "text": " You can walk it all the way back.", "tokens": [51240, 509, 393, 1792, 309, 439, 264, 636, 646, 13, 51301], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10058782365587023, "compression_ratio": 1.5748031496062993, "no_speech_prob": 1.4047999959479474e-12}, {"id": 245, "seek": 66004, "start": 678.8199999999999, "end": 682.0799999999999, "text": " This entirely shifts the goal of using artificial intelligence.", "tokens": [51304, 639, 7696, 19201, 264, 3387, 295, 1228, 11677, 7599, 13, 51467], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10058782365587023, "compression_ratio": 1.5748031496062993, "no_speech_prob": 1.4047999959479474e-12}, {"id": 246, "seek": 68208, "start": 682.08, "end": 685.6800000000001, "text": " I mean, think about what this means for you listening right now.", "tokens": [50365, 286, 914, 11, 519, 466, 437, 341, 1355, 337, 291, 4764, 558, 586, 13, 50545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13036555778689501, "compression_ratio": 1.7262773722627738, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827727141761507e-12}, {"id": 247, "seek": 68208, "start": 685.9000000000001, "end": 686.82, "text": " It's a paradigm shift.", "tokens": [50556, 467, 311, 257, 24709, 5513, 13, 50602], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13036555778689501, "compression_ratio": 1.7262773722627738, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827727141761507e-12}, {"id": 248, "seek": 68208, "start": 687.22, "end": 691.5400000000001, "text": " We are no longer just trying to play a slot machine, hoping to get a good final score on", "tokens": [50622, 492, 366, 572, 2854, 445, 1382, 281, 862, 257, 14747, 3479, 11, 7159, 281, 483, 257, 665, 2572, 6175, 322, 50838], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13036555778689501, "compression_ratio": 1.7262773722627738, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827727141761507e-12}, {"id": 249, "seek": 68208, "start": 691.5400000000001, "end": 693.6, "text": " an essay or a good block of code.", "tokens": [50838, 364, 16238, 420, 257, 665, 3461, 295, 3089, 13, 50941], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13036555778689501, "compression_ratio": 1.7262773722627738, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827727141761507e-12}, {"id": 250, "seek": 68208, "start": 693.7800000000001, "end": 696.48, "text": " No, we are trying to create an inspectable process.", "tokens": [50950, 883, 11, 321, 366, 1382, 281, 1884, 364, 15018, 712, 1399, 13, 51085], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13036555778689501, "compression_ratio": 1.7262773722627738, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827727141761507e-12}, {"id": 251, "seek": 68208, "start": 696.58, "end": 701.74, "text": " We are taking a transient, fleeting act of text generation and turning it into a stable,", "tokens": [51090, 492, 366, 1940, 257, 41998, 11, 7025, 9880, 605, 295, 2487, 5125, 293, 6246, 309, 666, 257, 8351, 11, 51348], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13036555778689501, "compression_ratio": 1.7262773722627738, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827727141761507e-12}, {"id": 252, "seek": 68208, "start": 702.22, "end": 703.7800000000001, "text": " physical object of analysis.", "tokens": [51372, 4001, 2657, 295, 5215, 13, 51450], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13036555778689501, "compression_ratio": 1.7262773722627738, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827727141761507e-12}, {"id": 253, "seek": 68208, "start": 704.1800000000001, "end": 707.6400000000001, "text": " The author describes this as partitioning the failure space.", "tokens": [51470, 440, 3793, 15626, 341, 382, 24808, 278, 264, 7763, 1901, 13, 51643], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13036555778689501, "compression_ratio": 1.7262773722627738, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827727141761507e-12}, {"id": 254, "seek": 68208, "start": 708.6600000000001, "end": 710.2, "text": " Partitioning the failure space.", "tokens": [51694, 4100, 849, 278, 264, 7763, 1901, 13, 51771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13036555778689501, "compression_ratio": 1.7262773722627738, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827727141761507e-12}, {"id": 255, "seek": 71020, "start": 710.2, "end": 710.76, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50365, 865, 13, 50393], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11986738607424115, "compression_ratio": 1.6107142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667036031881797e-12}, {"id": 256, "seek": 71020, "start": 710.98, "end": 717.0400000000001, "text": " The architecture proves that the real epistemic value of this system, meaning how it helps", "tokens": [50404, 440, 9482, 25019, 300, 264, 957, 2388, 468, 3438, 2158, 295, 341, 1185, 11, 3620, 577, 309, 3665, 50707], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11986738607424115, "compression_ratio": 1.6107142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667036031881797e-12}, {"id": 257, "seek": 71020, "start": 717.0400000000001, "end": 722.5600000000001, "text": " us actually acquire true knowledge and understand the AI's reasoning, isn't just about guaranteeing", "tokens": [50707, 505, 767, 20001, 2074, 3601, 293, 1223, 264, 7318, 311, 21577, 11, 1943, 380, 445, 466, 10815, 278, 50983], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11986738607424115, "compression_ratio": 1.6107142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667036031881797e-12}, {"id": 258, "seek": 71020, "start": 722.5600000000001, "end": 723.6600000000001, "text": " better prose at the end.", "tokens": [50983, 1101, 12505, 412, 264, 917, 13, 51038], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11986738607424115, "compression_ratio": 1.6107142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667036031881797e-12}, {"id": 259, "seek": 71020, "start": 723.8000000000001, "end": 724.6400000000001, "text": " Then what is it about?", "tokens": [51045, 1396, 437, 307, 309, 466, 30, 51087], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11986738607424115, "compression_ratio": 1.6107142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667036031881797e-12}, {"id": 260, "seek": 71020, "start": 725.44, "end": 731.36, "text": " The real value is making the difference between what a system noticed and what has successfully", "tokens": [51127, 440, 957, 2158, 307, 1455, 264, 2649, 1296, 437, 257, 1185, 5694, 293, 437, 575, 10727, 51423], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11986738607424115, "compression_ratio": 1.6107142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667036031881797e-12}, {"id": 261, "seek": 71020, "start": 731.36, "end": 733.88, "text": " changed completely visible to the human operator.", "tokens": [51423, 3105, 2584, 8974, 281, 264, 1952, 12973, 13, 51549], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11986738607424115, "compression_ratio": 1.6107142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667036031881797e-12}, {"id": 262, "seek": 71020, "start": 734.12, "end": 736.46, "text": " But that raises a massive question for me.", "tokens": [51561, 583, 300, 19658, 257, 5994, 1168, 337, 385, 13, 51678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11986738607424115, "compression_ratio": 1.6107142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667036031881797e-12}, {"id": 263, "seek": 71020, "start": 736.7, "end": 737.34, "text": " Okay, what is it?", "tokens": [51690, 1033, 11, 437, 307, 309, 30, 51722], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11986738607424115, "compression_ratio": 1.6107142857142858, "no_speech_prob": 1.4667036031881797e-12}, {"id": 264, "seek": 73734, "start": 737.34, "end": 743.74, "text": " If we have our kitchen island and we have our separate bowls for the outline, the draft,", "tokens": [50365, 759, 321, 362, 527, 6525, 6077, 293, 321, 362, 527, 4994, 28513, 337, 264, 16387, 11, 264, 11206, 11, 50685], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12488914938534007, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 1.6363753884904297e-12}, {"id": 265, "seek": 73734, "start": 743.94, "end": 748.4, "text": " the review, and the revision, who is actually working at each station?", "tokens": [50695, 264, 3131, 11, 293, 264, 34218, 11, 567, 307, 767, 1364, 412, 1184, 5214, 30, 50918], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12488914938534007, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 1.6363753884904297e-12}, {"id": 266, "seek": 73734, "start": 748.5400000000001, "end": 754.0600000000001, "text": " Like, if we are breaking this kitchen down into distinct tasks, do we just have the exact", "tokens": [50925, 1743, 11, 498, 321, 366, 7697, 341, 6525, 760, 666, 10644, 9608, 11, 360, 321, 445, 362, 264, 1900, 51201], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12488914938534007, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 1.6363753884904297e-12}, {"id": 267, "seek": 73734, "start": 754.0600000000001, "end": 756.5600000000001, "text": " same chef doing every single step of the process?", "tokens": [51201, 912, 10530, 884, 633, 2167, 1823, 295, 264, 1399, 30, 51326], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12488914938534007, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 1.6363753884904297e-12}, {"id": 268, "seek": 73734, "start": 756.8000000000001, "end": 757.88, "text": " That is a great question.", "tokens": [51338, 663, 307, 257, 869, 1168, 13, 51392], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12488914938534007, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 1.6363753884904297e-12}, {"id": 269, "seek": 73734, "start": 758.02, "end": 760.9200000000001, "text": " And the paper introduces a concept here called asymmetric cognition.", "tokens": [51399, 400, 264, 3035, 31472, 257, 3410, 510, 1219, 37277, 17475, 46905, 13, 51544], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12488914938534007, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 1.6363753884904297e-12}, {"id": 270, "seek": 73734, "start": 761.12, "end": 762.08, "text": " Asymmetric cognition.", "tokens": [51554, 1018, 32497, 17475, 46905, 13, 51602], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12488914938534007, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 1.6363753884904297e-12}, {"id": 271, "seek": 76208, "start": 762.08, "end": 768.36, "text": " Yes, which fundamentally rejects the idea that all writing tasks require the same type", "tokens": [50365, 1079, 11, 597, 17879, 8248, 82, 264, 1558, 300, 439, 3579, 9608, 3651, 264, 912, 2010, 50679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 272, "seek": 76208, "start": 768.36, "end": 768.94, "text": " of intelligence.", "tokens": [50679, 295, 7599, 13, 50708], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 273, "seek": 76208, "start": 769.58, "end": 773.32, "text": " It rejects the idea that writing is a single, undifferentiated capability.", "tokens": [50740, 467, 8248, 82, 264, 1558, 300, 3579, 307, 257, 2167, 11, 674, 15790, 72, 770, 13759, 13, 50927], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 274, "seek": 76208, "start": 773.5400000000001, "end": 776.7800000000001, "text": " When you say asymmetric, you mean the system is deliberately unbalanced.", "tokens": [50938, 1133, 291, 584, 37277, 17475, 11, 291, 914, 264, 1185, 307, 23506, 517, 40251, 13, 51100], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 275, "seek": 76208, "start": 777.36, "end": 777.88, "text": " Unbalanced.", "tokens": [51129, 1156, 40251, 13, 51155], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 276, "seek": 76208, "start": 778.5600000000001, "end": 782.38, "text": " Specifically in terms of the computational resources assigned to different tasks.", "tokens": [51189, 26058, 294, 2115, 295, 264, 28270, 3593, 13279, 281, 819, 9608, 13, 51380], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 277, "seek": 76208, "start": 782.5400000000001, "end": 783.0600000000001, "text": " Oh, I see.", "tokens": [51388, 876, 11, 286, 536, 13, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 278, "seek": 76208, "start": 783.36, "end": 785.62, "text": " The pipeline doesn't just use one AI model.", "tokens": [51429, 440, 15517, 1177, 380, 445, 764, 472, 7318, 2316, 13, 51542], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 279, "seek": 76208, "start": 786.0, "end": 789.46, "text": " It uses two different sizes of the Granite 4.1 model.", "tokens": [51561, 467, 4960, 732, 819, 11602, 295, 264, 23554, 642, 1017, 13, 16, 2316, 13, 51734], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 280, "seek": 76208, "start": 789.5200000000001, "end": 789.74, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51737, 1033, 13, 51748], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 281, "seek": 76208, "start": 789.96, "end": 790.82, "text": " Two different sizes.", "tokens": [51759, 4453, 819, 11602, 13, 51802], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344294738769533, "compression_ratio": 1.6996466431095407, "no_speech_prob": 1.3509888737231468e-12}, {"id": 282, "seek": 79082, "start": 790.82, "end": 796.32, "text": " For the majority of the work, it uses a smaller 3 billion parameter model, which is highly", "tokens": [50365, 1171, 264, 6286, 295, 264, 589, 11, 309, 4960, 257, 4356, 805, 5218, 13075, 2316, 11, 597, 307, 5405, 50640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10877255882535662, "compression_ratio": 1.6553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.2644994643387641e-12}, {"id": 283, "seek": 79082, "start": 796.32, "end": 801.8000000000001, "text": " efficient and takes up roughly 2.1 gigabytes of space on your hard drive.", "tokens": [50640, 7148, 293, 2516, 493, 9810, 568, 13, 16, 42741, 295, 1901, 322, 428, 1152, 3332, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10877255882535662, "compression_ratio": 1.6553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.2644994643387641e-12}, {"id": 284, "seek": 79082, "start": 801.88, "end": 802.32, "text": " Pretty lightweight.", "tokens": [50918, 10693, 22052, 13, 50940], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10877255882535662, "compression_ratio": 1.6553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.2644994643387641e-12}, {"id": 285, "seek": 79082, "start": 802.6, "end": 803.12, "text": " Very lightweight.", "tokens": [50954, 4372, 22052, 13, 50980], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10877255882535662, "compression_ratio": 1.6553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.2644994643387641e-12}, {"id": 286, "seek": 79082, "start": 803.5400000000001, "end": 809.4000000000001, "text": " But then it introduces a larger, much more powerful 8 billion parameter model, which takes", "tokens": [51001, 583, 550, 309, 31472, 257, 4833, 11, 709, 544, 4005, 1649, 5218, 13075, 2316, 11, 597, 2516, 51294], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10877255882535662, "compression_ratio": 1.6553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.2644994643387641e-12}, {"id": 287, "seek": 79082, "start": 809.4000000000001, "end": 811.0600000000001, "text": " up about 5.3 gigabytes.", "tokens": [51294, 493, 466, 1025, 13, 18, 42741, 13, 51377], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10877255882535662, "compression_ratio": 1.6553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.2644994643387641e-12}, {"id": 288, "seek": 79082, "start": 811.44, "end": 814.32, "text": " So we have a small brain and a big brain in the same pipeline.", "tokens": [51396, 407, 321, 362, 257, 1359, 3567, 293, 257, 955, 3567, 294, 264, 912, 15517, 13, 51540], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10877255882535662, "compression_ratio": 1.6553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.2644994643387641e-12}, {"id": 289, "seek": 79082, "start": 814.6400000000001, "end": 814.8800000000001, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51556, 1079, 13, 51568], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10877255882535662, "compression_ratio": 1.6553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.2644994643387641e-12}, {"id": 290, "seek": 79082, "start": 815.1400000000001, "end": 817.7, "text": " How are the tasks actually divided up between them?", "tokens": [51581, 1012, 366, 264, 9608, 767, 6666, 493, 1296, 552, 30, 51709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10877255882535662, "compression_ratio": 1.6553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.2644994643387641e-12}, {"id": 291, "seek": 81770, "start": 817.7, "end": 823.76, "text": " The architecture assigns the smaller 3 billion parameter model to handle outlining, drafting", "tokens": [50365, 440, 9482, 6269, 82, 264, 4356, 805, 5218, 13075, 2316, 281, 4813, 484, 31079, 11, 46378, 50668], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13565265268519305, "compression_ratio": 1.5380434782608696, "no_speech_prob": 1.727080609602305e-12}, {"id": 292, "seek": 81770, "start": 823.76, "end": 826.5400000000001, "text": " the actual prose, and performing the final revisions.", "tokens": [50668, 264, 3539, 12505, 11, 293, 10205, 264, 2572, 3698, 4252, 13, 50807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13565265268519305, "compression_ratio": 1.5380434782608696, "no_speech_prob": 1.727080609602305e-12}, {"id": 293, "seek": 81770, "start": 826.6800000000001, "end": 826.9000000000001, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50814, 1033, 13, 50825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13565265268519305, "compression_ratio": 1.5380434782608696, "no_speech_prob": 1.727080609602305e-12}, {"id": 294, "seek": 81770, "start": 827.0600000000001, "end": 831.2800000000001, "text": " And it reserves the larger 8 billion parameter model strictly for the review state.", "tokens": [50833, 400, 309, 27483, 264, 4833, 1649, 5218, 13075, 2316, 20792, 337, 264, 3131, 1785, 13, 51044], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13565265268519305, "compression_ratio": 1.5380434782608696, "no_speech_prob": 1.727080609602305e-12}, {"id": 295, "seek": 81770, "start": 831.32, "end": 833.2, "text": " Anyway, I want to make sure I'm grasping this.", "tokens": [51046, 5684, 11, 286, 528, 281, 652, 988, 286, 478, 29444, 3381, 341, 13, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13565265268519305, "compression_ratio": 1.5380434782608696, "no_speech_prob": 1.727080609602305e-12}, {"id": 296, "seek": 83320, "start": 833.2, "end": 839.72, "text": " The system uses the smaller, less capable model to do almost all the heavy lifting of actually", "tokens": [50365, 440, 1185, 4960, 264, 4356, 11, 1570, 8189, 2316, 281, 360, 1920, 439, 264, 4676, 15798, 295, 767, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11551158986193069, "compression_ratio": 1.547008547008547, "no_speech_prob": 1.7967527422488305e-12}, {"id": 297, "seek": 83320, "start": 839.72, "end": 840.5, "text": " writing the text.", "tokens": [50691, 3579, 264, 2487, 13, 50730], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11551158986193069, "compression_ratio": 1.547008547008547, "no_speech_prob": 1.7967527422488305e-12}, {"id": 298, "seek": 83320, "start": 840.96, "end": 847.1, "text": " But the big, powerful model just sits back in a chair, reads the draft, and criticizes", "tokens": [50753, 583, 264, 955, 11, 4005, 2316, 445, 12696, 646, 294, 257, 6090, 11, 15700, 264, 11206, 11, 293, 7850, 5660, 51060], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11551158986193069, "compression_ratio": 1.547008547008547, "no_speech_prob": 1.7967527422488305e-12}, {"id": 299, "seek": 83320, "start": 847.1, "end": 847.32, "text": " it.", "tokens": [51060, 309, 13, 51071], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11551158986193069, "compression_ratio": 1.547008547008547, "no_speech_prob": 1.7967527422488305e-12}, {"id": 300, "seek": 83320, "start": 847.5600000000001, "end": 849.2, "text": " That is precisely the setup.", "tokens": [51083, 663, 307, 13402, 264, 8657, 13, 51165], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11551158986193069, "compression_ratio": 1.547008547008547, "no_speech_prob": 1.7967527422488305e-12}, {"id": 301, "seek": 83320, "start": 849.4000000000001, "end": 850.24, "text": " That sounds crazy.", "tokens": [51175, 663, 3263, 3219, 13, 51217], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11551158986193069, "compression_ratio": 1.547008547008547, "no_speech_prob": 1.7967527422488305e-12}, {"id": 302, "seek": 83320, "start": 850.4000000000001, "end": 851.46, "text": " Why do it that way?", "tokens": [51225, 1545, 360, 309, 300, 636, 30, 51278], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11551158986193069, "compression_ratio": 1.547008547008547, "no_speech_prob": 1.7967527422488305e-12}, {"id": 303, "seek": 83320, "start": 851.58, "end": 856.4200000000001, "text": " Well, the motivation for this choice is rooted in a brilliant insight into the fundamental", "tokens": [51284, 1042, 11, 264, 12335, 337, 341, 3922, 307, 25277, 294, 257, 10248, 11269, 666, 264, 8088, 51526], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11551158986193069, "compression_ratio": 1.547008547008547, "no_speech_prob": 1.7967527422488305e-12}, {"id": 304, "seek": 85642, "start": 856.42, "end": 860.5799999999999, "text": " cognitive differences between text generation and text criticism.", "tokens": [50365, 15605, 7300, 1296, 2487, 5125, 293, 2487, 15835, 13, 50573], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18173148234685263, "compression_ratio": 1.6031128404669261, "no_speech_prob": 2.0595370027465254e-12}, {"id": 305, "seek": 85642, "start": 861.12, "end": 861.3399999999999, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50600, 1033, 13, 50611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18173148234685263, "compression_ratio": 1.6031128404669261, "no_speech_prob": 2.0595370027465254e-12}, {"id": 306, "seek": 85642, "start": 861.42, "end": 862.3199999999999, "text": " How are they different?", "tokens": [50615, 1012, 366, 436, 819, 30, 50660], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18173148234685263, "compression_ratio": 1.6031128404669261, "no_speech_prob": 2.0595370027465254e-12}, {"id": 307, "seek": 85642, "start": 862.9799999999999, "end": 866.3399999999999, "text": " Think about what is required to actually write a first draft.", "tokens": [50693, 6557, 466, 437, 307, 4739, 281, 767, 2464, 257, 700, 11206, 13, 50861], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18173148234685263, "compression_ratio": 1.6031128404669261, "no_speech_prob": 2.0595370027465254e-12}, {"id": 308, "seek": 85642, "start": 867.0799999999999, "end": 871.9599999999999, "text": " Generation benefits heavily from fluency, associative reach, and forward momentum.", "tokens": [50898, 23898, 5311, 10950, 490, 5029, 3020, 11, 4180, 1166, 2524, 11, 293, 2128, 11244, 13, 51142], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18173148234685263, "compression_ratio": 1.6031128404669261, "no_speech_prob": 2.0595370027465254e-12}, {"id": 309, "seek": 85642, "start": 872.14, "end": 873.28, "text": " Forward momentum, yeah.", "tokens": [51151, 35524, 11244, 11, 1338, 13, 51208], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18173148234685263, "compression_ratio": 1.6031128404669261, "no_speech_prob": 2.0595370027465254e-12}, {"id": 310, "seek": 85642, "start": 873.28, "end": 878.24, "text": " What a model is drafting, it is essentially asking itself, based on my training data, what", "tokens": [51208, 708, 257, 2316, 307, 46378, 11, 309, 307, 4476, 3365, 2564, 11, 2361, 322, 452, 3097, 1412, 11, 437, 51456], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18173148234685263, "compression_ratio": 1.6031128404669261, "no_speech_prob": 2.0595370027465254e-12}, {"id": 311, "seek": 85642, "start": 878.24, "end": 880.9399999999999, "text": " words most naturally follow from the words I just wrote.", "tokens": [51456, 2283, 881, 8195, 1524, 490, 264, 2283, 286, 445, 4114, 13, 51591], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18173148234685263, "compression_ratio": 1.6031128404669261, "no_speech_prob": 2.0595370027465254e-12}, {"id": 312, "seek": 88094, "start": 880.94, "end": 881.2600000000001, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 13, 50381], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 313, "seek": 88094, "start": 881.4000000000001, "end": 882.7600000000001, "text": " It's coasting on its own momentum.", "tokens": [50388, 467, 311, 8684, 278, 322, 1080, 1065, 11244, 13, 50456], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 314, "seek": 88094, "start": 883.12, "end": 887.3800000000001, "text": " It's in a flow state, just getting words onto the page without overthinking every single", "tokens": [50474, 467, 311, 294, 257, 3095, 1785, 11, 445, 1242, 2283, 3911, 264, 3028, 1553, 30998, 12408, 633, 2167, 50687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 315, "seek": 88094, "start": 887.3800000000001, "end": 887.7, "text": " syllable.", "tokens": [50687, 40151, 13, 50703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 316, "seek": 88094, "start": 887.94, "end": 888.32, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50715, 7587, 13, 50734], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 317, "seek": 88094, "start": 889.3000000000001, "end": 892.9000000000001, "text": " Criticism, however, requires the exact opposite cognitive stance.", "tokens": [50783, 23202, 26356, 11, 4461, 11, 7029, 264, 1900, 6182, 15605, 21033, 13, 50963], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 318, "seek": 88094, "start": 893.0600000000001, "end": 893.5, "text": " How so?", "tokens": [50971, 1012, 370, 30, 50993], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 319, "seek": 88094, "start": 893.6, "end": 895.94, "text": " Criticism requires immense cognitive friction.", "tokens": [50998, 23202, 26356, 7029, 22920, 15605, 17710, 13, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 320, "seek": 88094, "start": 896.36, "end": 898.58, "text": " A critic cannot just coast on the flow of the words.", "tokens": [51136, 316, 7850, 2644, 445, 8684, 322, 264, 3095, 295, 264, 2283, 13, 51247], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 321, "seek": 88094, "start": 898.6400000000001, "end": 898.7600000000001, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51250, 1779, 13, 51256], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 322, "seek": 88094, "start": 898.8000000000001, "end": 899.7, "text": " They have to stop and think.", "tokens": [51258, 814, 362, 281, 1590, 293, 519, 13, 51303], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 323, "seek": 88094, "start": 899.94, "end": 904.1400000000001, "text": " A critic has to actively resist the momentum of the text.", "tokens": [51315, 316, 7850, 575, 281, 13022, 4597, 264, 11244, 295, 264, 2487, 13, 51525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 324, "seek": 88094, "start": 904.5600000000001, "end": 909.2, "text": " It has to stop the flow and ask difficult structural questions.", "tokens": [51546, 467, 575, 281, 1590, 264, 3095, 293, 1029, 2252, 15067, 1651, 13, 51778], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 325, "seek": 88094, "start": 909.34, "end": 910.48, "text": " Like what kind of questions?", "tokens": [51785, 1743, 437, 733, 295, 1651, 30, 51842], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14891572559581084, "compression_ratio": 1.7406143344709897, "no_speech_prob": 2.092916551871271e-12}, {"id": 326, "seek": 91048, "start": 910.48, "end": 915.6, "text": " Like, does this specific conclusion actually follow from the premise established two paragraphs", "tokens": [50365, 1743, 11, 775, 341, 2685, 10063, 767, 1524, 490, 264, 22045, 7545, 732, 48910, 50621], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 327, "seek": 91048, "start": 915.6, "end": 916.0600000000001, "text": " ago?", "tokens": [50621, 2057, 30, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 328, "seek": 91048, "start": 916.5600000000001, "end": 921.48, "text": " Or, did the definition of this key term secretly change halfway through the argument?", "tokens": [50669, 1610, 11, 630, 264, 7123, 295, 341, 2141, 1433, 22611, 1319, 15461, 807, 264, 6770, 30, 50915], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 329, "seek": 91048, "start": 921.86, "end": 926.5, "text": " It really is the difference between a writer in a creative flow state at two in the morning", "tokens": [50934, 467, 534, 307, 264, 2649, 1296, 257, 9936, 294, 257, 5880, 3095, 1785, 412, 732, 294, 264, 2446, 51166], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 330, "seek": 91048, "start": 926.5, "end": 931.94, "text": " and a grumpy, highly analytical editor sitting at a desk with a red pen the next day.", "tokens": [51166, 293, 257, 677, 36142, 11, 5405, 29579, 9839, 3798, 412, 257, 10026, 365, 257, 2182, 3435, 264, 958, 786, 13, 51438], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 331, "seek": 91048, "start": 932.0600000000001, "end": 933.34, "text": " That is a perfect analogy.", "tokens": [51444, 663, 307, 257, 2176, 21663, 13, 51508], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 332, "seek": 91048, "start": 933.46, "end": 933.6800000000001, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51514, 865, 13, 51525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 333, "seek": 91048, "start": 933.9, "end": 939.1, "text": " And the paper backs this psychological distinction up with a formal mathematical proof.", "tokens": [51536, 400, 264, 3035, 19513, 341, 14346, 16844, 493, 365, 257, 9860, 18894, 8177, 13, 51796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 334, "seek": 91048, "start": 939.1800000000001, "end": 939.58, "text": " Oh, really?", "tokens": [51800, 876, 11, 534, 30, 51820], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 335, "seek": 91048, "start": 939.58, "end": 940.1, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51820, 1079, 13, 51846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13026719133393103, "compression_ratio": 1.6193548387096774, "no_speech_prob": 1.610845463094479e-12}, {"id": 336, "seek": 94048, "start": 940.48, "end": 945.6, "text": " It introduces proposition 3.1, which states, generation does not imply diagnosis.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 31472, 24830, 805, 13, 16, 11, 597, 4368, 11, 5125, 775, 406, 33616, 15217, 13, 50621], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19838875532150269, "compression_ratio": 1.0125, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685320439012053e-12}, {"id": 337, "seek": 94560, "start": 945.6, "end": 946.82, "text": " Let's slow down and unpack that.", "tokens": [50365, 961, 311, 2964, 760, 293, 26699, 300, 13, 50426], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16038746669374662, "compression_ratio": 1.4817813765182186, "no_speech_prob": 2.4036339325156364e-12}, {"id": 338, "seek": 94560, "start": 947.1800000000001, "end": 949.0400000000001, "text": " Generation does not imply diagnosis.", "tokens": [50444, 23898, 775, 406, 33616, 15217, 13, 50537], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16038746669374662, "compression_ratio": 1.4817813765182186, "no_speech_prob": 2.4036339325156364e-12}, {"id": 339, "seek": 94560, "start": 949.0400000000001, "end": 952.26, "text": " I think I see where this is going, but how does this paper explain it?", "tokens": [50537, 286, 519, 286, 536, 689, 341, 307, 516, 11, 457, 577, 775, 341, 3035, 2903, 309, 30, 50698], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16038746669374662, "compression_ratio": 1.4817813765182186, "no_speech_prob": 2.4036339325156364e-12}, {"id": 340, "seek": 94560, "start": 952.34, "end": 957.6800000000001, "text": " It means that an AI model can be absolutely fantastic at spinning out highly fluent, very", "tokens": [50702, 467, 1355, 300, 364, 7318, 2316, 393, 312, 3122, 5456, 412, 15640, 484, 5405, 40799, 11, 588, 50969], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16038746669374662, "compression_ratio": 1.4817813765182186, "no_speech_prob": 2.4036339325156364e-12}, {"id": 341, "seek": 94560, "start": 957.6800000000001, "end": 959.82, "text": " readable, grammatically perfect prose.", "tokens": [50969, 49857, 11, 17570, 5030, 2176, 12505, 13, 51076], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16038746669374662, "compression_ratio": 1.4817813765182186, "no_speech_prob": 2.4036339325156364e-12}, {"id": 342, "seek": 94560, "start": 959.98, "end": 960.28, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51084, 1779, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16038746669374662, "compression_ratio": 1.4817813765182186, "no_speech_prob": 2.4036339325156364e-12}, {"id": 343, "seek": 94560, "start": 960.5, "end": 965.08, "text": " While simultaneously being terribly equipped to spot a logical fallacy hidden within that", "tokens": [51110, 3987, 16561, 885, 22903, 15218, 281, 4008, 257, 14978, 2100, 2551, 7633, 1951, 300, 51339], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16038746669374662, "compression_ratio": 1.4817813765182186, "no_speech_prob": 2.4036339325156364e-12}, {"id": 344, "seek": 96508, "start": 965.08, "end": 966.08, "text": " exact same prose.", "tokens": [50365, 1900, 912, 12505, 13, 50415], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20505893230438232, "compression_ratio": 1.3740458015267176, "no_speech_prob": 2.4848101007335366e-12}, {"id": 345, "seek": 96508, "start": 966.08, "end": 972.0600000000001, "text": " The paper proves this by showing that generative success on a specific writing task does not", "tokens": [50415, 440, 3035, 25019, 341, 538, 4099, 300, 1337, 1166, 2245, 322, 257, 2685, 3579, 5633, 775, 406, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20505893230438232, "compression_ratio": 1.3740458015267176, "no_speech_prob": 2.4848101007335366e-12}, {"id": 346, "seek": 96508, "start": 972.0600000000001, "end": 976.6600000000001, "text": " logically entail diagnostic success when analyzing an arbitrary text.", "tokens": [50714, 38887, 948, 864, 27897, 2245, 562, 23663, 364, 23211, 2487, 13, 50944], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20505893230438232, "compression_ratio": 1.3740458015267176, "no_speech_prob": 2.4848101007335366e-12}, {"id": 347, "seek": 97666, "start": 976.66, "end": 989.7199999999999, "text": " So if you are listening to this and wondering why your favorite AI chatbot can write a beautiful sounding poem or incredibly polished corporate email, but then completely fails to realize that the argument in the email makes absolutely no logical sense.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 498, 291, 366, 4764, 281, 341, 293, 6359, 983, 428, 2954, 7318, 5081, 18870, 393, 2464, 257, 2238, 24931, 13065, 420, 6252, 29079, 10896, 3796, 11, 457, 550, 2584, 18199, 281, 4325, 300, 264, 6770, 294, 264, 3796, 1669, 3122, 572, 14978, 2020, 13, 51018], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14716559190016526, "compression_ratio": 1.518348623853211, "no_speech_prob": 2.1976660942446546e-12}, {"id": 348, "seek": 97666, "start": 989.88, "end": 990.04, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51026, 1079, 13, 51034], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14716559190016526, "compression_ratio": 1.518348623853211, "no_speech_prob": 2.1976660942446546e-12}, {"id": 349, "seek": 97666, "start": 990.24, "end": 991.3199999999999, "text": " This is exactly why.", "tokens": [51044, 639, 307, 2293, 983, 13, 51098], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14716559190016526, "compression_ratio": 1.518348623853211, "no_speech_prob": 2.1976660942446546e-12}, {"id": 350, "seek": 97666, "start": 991.42, "end": 993.3, "text": " Fluency is not the same thing as logic.", "tokens": [51103, 33612, 3020, 307, 406, 264, 912, 551, 382, 9952, 13, 51197], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14716559190016526, "compression_ratio": 1.518348623853211, "no_speech_prob": 2.1976660942446546e-12}, {"id": 351, "seek": 97666, "start": 993.62, "end": 994.14, "text": " Not at all.", "tokens": [51213, 1726, 412, 439, 13, 51239], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14716559190016526, "compression_ratio": 1.518348623853211, "no_speech_prob": 2.1976660942446546e-12}, {"id": 352, "seek": 99414, "start": 994.14, "end": 998.78, "text": " Just because an AI writes beautifully does not mean it can edit itself beautifully.", "tokens": [50365, 1449, 570, 364, 7318, 13657, 16525, 775, 406, 914, 309, 393, 8129, 2564, 16525, 13, 50597], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16117481349669782, "compression_ratio": 1.524, "no_speech_prob": 2.3806278129367975e-12}, {"id": 353, "seek": 99414, "start": 999.14, "end": 1004.64, "text": " And the converse is equally true, which brings us to proposition 3.2.", "tokens": [50615, 400, 264, 416, 4308, 307, 12309, 2074, 11, 597, 5607, 505, 281, 24830, 805, 13, 17, 13, 50890], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16117481349669782, "compression_ratio": 1.524, "no_speech_prob": 2.3806278129367975e-12}, {"id": 354, "seek": 99414, "start": 1004.9, "end": 1005.1, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50903, 865, 13, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16117481349669782, "compression_ratio": 1.524, "no_speech_prob": 2.3806278129367975e-12}, {"id": 355, "seek": 99414, "start": 1005.54, "end": 1007.68, "text": " Diagnosis does not imply generation.", "tokens": [50935, 8789, 4535, 8211, 775, 406, 33616, 5125, 13, 51042], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16117481349669782, "compression_ratio": 1.524, "no_speech_prob": 2.3806278129367975e-12}, {"id": 356, "seek": 99414, "start": 1008.1999999999999, "end": 1009.22, "text": " So it works both ways.", "tokens": [51068, 407, 309, 1985, 1293, 2098, 13, 51119], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16117481349669782, "compression_ratio": 1.524, "no_speech_prob": 2.3806278129367975e-12}, {"id": 357, "seek": 99414, "start": 1009.36, "end": 1009.64, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51126, 1079, 13, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16117481349669782, "compression_ratio": 1.524, "no_speech_prob": 2.3806278129367975e-12}, {"id": 358, "seek": 99414, "start": 1010.14, "end": 1016.14, "text": " A model might be incredibly sharp, highly analytical, and perfectly capable of pointing out a massive", "tokens": [51165, 316, 2316, 1062, 312, 6252, 8199, 11, 5405, 29579, 11, 293, 6239, 8189, 295, 12166, 484, 257, 5994, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16117481349669782, "compression_ratio": 1.524, "no_speech_prob": 2.3806278129367975e-12}, {"id": 359, "seek": 99414, "start": 1016.14, "end": 1019.16, "text": " gap in an argument when reading a fully written draft.", "tokens": [51465, 7417, 294, 364, 6770, 562, 3760, 257, 4498, 3720, 11206, 13, 51616], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16117481349669782, "compression_ratio": 1.524, "no_speech_prob": 2.3806278129367975e-12}, {"id": 360, "seek": 101916, "start": 1019.16, "end": 1021.8, "text": " Because all the context is right there on the page to be analyzed.", "tokens": [50365, 1436, 439, 264, 4319, 307, 558, 456, 322, 264, 3028, 281, 312, 28181, 13, 50497], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 361, "seek": 101916, "start": 1021.9399999999999, "end": 1022.3399999999999, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50504, 7587, 13, 50524], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 362, "seek": 101916, "start": 1022.88, "end": 1028.04, "text": " But if you gave that exact same analytical model a blank page and a topic, it might struggle", "tokens": [50551, 583, 498, 291, 2729, 300, 1900, 912, 29579, 2316, 257, 8247, 3028, 293, 257, 4829, 11, 309, 1062, 7799, 50809], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 363, "seek": 101916, "start": 1028.04, "end": 1030.76, "text": " immensely to generate that complex argument from scratch.", "tokens": [50809, 38674, 281, 8460, 300, 3997, 6770, 490, 8459, 13, 50945], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 364, "seek": 101916, "start": 1031.1, "end": 1035.78, "text": " I know the paper gives a really specific, concrete example of this from their experimental runs.", "tokens": [50962, 286, 458, 264, 3035, 2709, 257, 534, 2685, 11, 9859, 1365, 295, 341, 490, 641, 17069, 6676, 13, 51196], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 365, "seek": 101916, "start": 1035.8999999999999, "end": 1036.22, "text": " They do.", "tokens": [51202, 814, 360, 13, 51218], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 366, "seek": 101916, "start": 1036.48, "end": 1041.18, "text": " The essay, they forced the pipeline to write about continuation and trajectories.", "tokens": [51231, 440, 16238, 11, 436, 7579, 264, 15517, 281, 2464, 466, 29357, 293, 18257, 2083, 13, 51466], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 367, "seek": 101916, "start": 1041.28, "end": 1042.1, "text": " Can we dive into that?", "tokens": [51471, 1664, 321, 9192, 666, 300, 30, 51512], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 368, "seek": 101916, "start": 1042.22, "end": 1044.42, "text": " Because I think this crystallizes the entire concept.", "tokens": [51518, 1436, 286, 519, 341, 31924, 5660, 264, 2302, 3410, 13, 51628], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 369, "seek": 101916, "start": 1044.68, "end": 1045.28, "text": " Let's do it.", "tokens": [51641, 961, 311, 360, 309, 13, 51671], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13541032434479008, "compression_ratio": 1.6205787781350482, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552120138581649e-12}, {"id": 370, "seek": 104528, "start": 1045.28, "end": 1048.6399999999999, "text": " So the pipeline was fed a highly academic prompt.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 264, 15517, 390, 4636, 257, 5405, 7778, 12391, 13, 50533], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 371, "seek": 104528, "start": 1049.3, "end": 1054.6, "text": " It was asked to write a conceptual essay exploring how the concept of continuation relates", "tokens": [50566, 467, 390, 2351, 281, 2464, 257, 24106, 16238, 12736, 577, 264, 3410, 295, 29357, 16155, 50831], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 372, "seek": 104528, "start": 1054.6, "end": 1056.7, "text": " to trajectories across different fields.", "tokens": [50831, 281, 18257, 2083, 2108, 819, 7909, 13, 50936], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 373, "seek": 104528, "start": 1056.96, "end": 1058.84, "text": " Like physics, biology, computation.", "tokens": [50949, 1743, 10649, 11, 14956, 11, 24903, 13, 51043], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 374, "seek": 104528, "start": 1058.98, "end": 1059.28, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51050, 7587, 13, 51065], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 375, "seek": 104528, "start": 1059.98, "end": 1062.06, "text": " The smaller 3B model got to work.", "tokens": [51100, 440, 4356, 805, 33, 2316, 658, 281, 589, 13, 51204], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 376, "seek": 104528, "start": 1062.6, "end": 1067.28, "text": " It drafted a very broad, very fluent, confident-sounding argument.", "tokens": [51231, 467, 36288, 257, 588, 4152, 11, 588, 40799, 11, 6679, 12, 82, 24625, 6770, 13, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 377, "seek": 104528, "start": 1067.3999999999999, "end": 1067.58, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51471, 1779, 13, 51480], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 378, "seek": 104528, "start": 1067.66, "end": 1069.1399999999999, "text": " It sounded like a decent college paper.", "tokens": [51484, 467, 17714, 411, 257, 8681, 3859, 3035, 13, 51558], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 379, "seek": 104528, "start": 1069.28, "end": 1069.68, "text": " It did.", "tokens": [51565, 467, 630, 13, 51585], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 380, "seek": 104528, "start": 1070.02, "end": 1073.8799999999999, "text": " But then that draft was handed off to the 8B reviewer model.", "tokens": [51602, 583, 550, 300, 11206, 390, 16013, 766, 281, 264, 1649, 33, 3131, 260, 2316, 13, 51795], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15422869951297075, "compression_ratio": 1.5765124555160142, "no_speech_prob": 1.4783823037295418e-12}, {"id": 381, "seek": 107388, "start": 1073.88, "end": 1078.48, "text": " And from what I read, the 8B model basically tore the draft to shreds.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 490, 437, 286, 1401, 11, 264, 1649, 33, 2316, 1936, 37341, 264, 11206, 281, 21567, 82, 13, 50595], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11490829785664876, "compression_ratio": 1.617283950617284, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013881623006988e-12}, {"id": 382, "seek": 107388, "start": 1078.6000000000001, "end": 1079.8200000000002, "text": " It completely dismantled it.", "tokens": [50601, 467, 2584, 30506, 1493, 309, 13, 50662], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11490829785664876, "compression_ratio": 1.617283950617284, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013881623006988e-12}, {"id": 383, "seek": 107388, "start": 1080.16, "end": 1084.3600000000001, "text": " It caught a massive conceptual flaw that the smaller model completely glossed over.", "tokens": [50679, 467, 5415, 257, 5994, 24106, 13717, 300, 264, 4356, 2316, 2584, 19574, 292, 670, 13, 50889], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11490829785664876, "compression_ratio": 1.617283950617284, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013881623006988e-12}, {"id": 384, "seek": 107388, "start": 1084.42, "end": 1085.0400000000002, "text": " What was the flaw?", "tokens": [50892, 708, 390, 264, 13717, 30, 50923], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11490829785664876, "compression_ratio": 1.617283950617284, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013881623006988e-12}, {"id": 385, "seek": 107388, "start": 1085.24, "end": 1090.96, "text": " The 3B draft essentially assumed that a trajectory, like the path of an object in physics, always", "tokens": [50933, 440, 805, 33, 11206, 4476, 15895, 300, 257, 21512, 11, 411, 264, 3100, 295, 364, 2657, 294, 10649, 11, 1009, 51219], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11490829785664876, "compression_ratio": 1.617283950617284, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013881623006988e-12}, {"id": 386, "seek": 107388, "start": 1090.96, "end": 1092.7, "text": " implies mathematical continuity.", "tokens": [51219, 18779, 18894, 23807, 13, 51306], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11490829785664876, "compression_ratio": 1.617283950617284, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013881623006988e-12}, {"id": 387, "seek": 107388, "start": 1093.0, "end": 1096.0200000000002, "text": " It assumed trajectories were always smooth, unbroken lines.", "tokens": [51321, 467, 15895, 18257, 2083, 645, 1009, 5508, 11, 517, 37947, 3876, 13, 51472], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11490829785664876, "compression_ratio": 1.617283950617284, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013881623006988e-12}, {"id": 388, "seek": 109602, "start": 1096.02, "end": 1096.74, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50365, 1079, 13, 50401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1484206219514211, "compression_ratio": 1.616600790513834, "no_speech_prob": 1.7011380368595064e-12}, {"id": 389, "seek": 109602, "start": 1097.3, "end": 1102.18, "text": " It completely ignored the fact that in quantum physics, or even in computer state machines,", "tokens": [50429, 467, 2584, 19735, 264, 1186, 300, 294, 13018, 10649, 11, 420, 754, 294, 3820, 1785, 8379, 11, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1484206219514211, "compression_ratio": 1.616600790513834, "no_speech_prob": 1.7011380368595064e-12}, {"id": 390, "seek": 109602, "start": 1102.74, "end": 1108.52, "text": " trajectories can have discrete jumps, sudden phase changes, or complete discontinuities.", "tokens": [50701, 18257, 2083, 393, 362, 27706, 16704, 11, 3990, 5574, 2962, 11, 420, 3566, 31420, 84, 1088, 13, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1484206219514211, "compression_ratio": 1.616600790513834, "no_speech_prob": 1.7011380368595064e-12}, {"id": 391, "seek": 109602, "start": 1108.72, "end": 1108.94, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51000, 1779, 13, 51011], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1484206219514211, "compression_ratio": 1.616600790513834, "no_speech_prob": 1.7011380368595064e-12}, {"id": 392, "seek": 109602, "start": 1108.98, "end": 1111.3, "text": " Like a bouncing ball hitting a wall is a discontinuity.", "tokens": [51013, 1743, 257, 27380, 2594, 8850, 257, 2929, 307, 257, 31420, 21757, 13, 51129], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1484206219514211, "compression_ratio": 1.616600790513834, "no_speech_prob": 1.7011380368595064e-12}, {"id": 393, "seek": 109602, "start": 1111.52, "end": 1111.9, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51140, 7587, 13, 51159], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1484206219514211, "compression_ratio": 1.616600790513834, "no_speech_prob": 1.7011380368595064e-12}, {"id": 394, "seek": 109602, "start": 1112.3799999999999, "end": 1118.06, "text": " The smaller model just blended the words trajectory and continuous together because they probably", "tokens": [51183, 440, 4356, 2316, 445, 27048, 264, 2283, 21512, 293, 10957, 1214, 570, 436, 1391, 51467], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1484206219514211, "compression_ratio": 1.616600790513834, "no_speech_prob": 1.7011380368595064e-12}, {"id": 395, "seek": 109602, "start": 1118.06, "end": 1120.66, "text": " appear next to each other a lot in its training data.", "tokens": [51467, 4204, 958, 281, 1184, 661, 257, 688, 294, 1080, 3097, 1412, 13, 51597], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1484206219514211, "compression_ratio": 1.616600790513834, "no_speech_prob": 1.7011380368595064e-12}, {"id": 396, "seek": 112066, "start": 1120.66, "end": 1126.1200000000001, "text": " So it used statistical fluency to sound smart while making a fundamental physics error.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 309, 1143, 22820, 5029, 3020, 281, 1626, 4069, 1339, 1455, 257, 8088, 10649, 6713, 13, 50638], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 397, "seek": 112066, "start": 1126.66, "end": 1127.1000000000001, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [50665, 48746, 736, 13, 50687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 398, "seek": 112066, "start": 1127.74, "end": 1132.3600000000001, "text": " But the 8B model didn't just fix typos or smooth out the grammar.", "tokens": [50719, 583, 264, 1649, 33, 2316, 994, 380, 445, 3191, 2125, 329, 420, 5508, 484, 264, 22317, 13, 50950], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 399, "seek": 112066, "start": 1132.8200000000002, "end": 1136.28, "text": " It evaluated the deep inferential structure of the argument.", "tokens": [50973, 467, 25509, 264, 2452, 13596, 2549, 3877, 295, 264, 6770, 13, 51146], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 400, "seek": 112066, "start": 1136.42, "end": 1140.74, "text": " It pointed out that the draft was wildly conflating two completely distinct concepts.", "tokens": [51153, 467, 10932, 484, 300, 264, 11206, 390, 34731, 1497, 75, 990, 732, 2584, 10644, 10392, 13, 51369], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 401, "seek": 112066, "start": 1140.94, "end": 1143.26, "text": " It demonstrated that cognitive friction we talked about.", "tokens": [51379, 467, 18772, 300, 15605, 17710, 321, 2825, 466, 13, 51495], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 402, "seek": 112066, "start": 1143.3200000000002, "end": 1144.16, "text": " Okay, I hear all of that.", "tokens": [51498, 1033, 11, 286, 1568, 439, 295, 300, 13, 51540], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 403, "seek": 112066, "start": 1144.22, "end": 1147.5, "text": " But I am struggling to see the ultimate logic of the pipeline design here, though.", "tokens": [51543, 583, 286, 669, 9314, 281, 536, 264, 9705, 9952, 295, 264, 15517, 1715, 510, 11, 1673, 13, 51707], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 404, "seek": 112066, "start": 1147.6200000000001, "end": 1148.2, "text": " Why is that?", "tokens": [51713, 1545, 307, 300, 30, 51742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 405, "seek": 112066, "start": 1148.38, "end": 1149.8000000000002, "text": " Let me push back on this architecture.", "tokens": [51751, 961, 385, 2944, 646, 322, 341, 9482, 13, 51822], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974763506241427, "compression_ratio": 1.6226993865030674, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945007679999846e-12}, {"id": 406, "seek": 114980, "start": 1149.8, "end": 1155.74, "text": " If this 8B model is so smart, if it has the cognitive friction to catch these deep conceptual", "tokens": [50365, 759, 341, 1649, 33, 2316, 307, 370, 4069, 11, 498, 309, 575, 264, 15605, 17710, 281, 3745, 613, 2452, 24106, 50662], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11388301849365234, "compression_ratio": 1.5571955719557196, "no_speech_prob": 1.8393600444838176e-12}, {"id": 407, "seek": 114980, "start": 1155.74, "end": 1161.6599999999999, "text": " flaws in quantum physics and math, why go through this whole complex tag team routine", "tokens": [50662, 27108, 294, 13018, 10649, 293, 5221, 11, 983, 352, 807, 341, 1379, 3997, 6162, 1469, 9927, 50958], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11388301849365234, "compression_ratio": 1.5571955719557196, "no_speech_prob": 1.8393600444838176e-12}, {"id": 408, "seek": 114980, "start": 1161.6599999999999, "end": 1162.78, "text": " with multiple files?", "tokens": [50958, 365, 3866, 7098, 30, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11388301849365234, "compression_ratio": 1.5571955719557196, "no_speech_prob": 1.8393600444838176e-12}, {"id": 409, "seek": 114980, "start": 1163.36, "end": 1166.8799999999999, "text": " Why not just have the big, smart 8B model do everything?", "tokens": [51043, 1545, 406, 445, 362, 264, 955, 11, 4069, 1649, 33, 2316, 360, 1203, 30, 51219], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11388301849365234, "compression_ratio": 1.5571955719557196, "no_speech_prob": 1.8393600444838176e-12}, {"id": 410, "seek": 114980, "start": 1167.08, "end": 1167.98, "text": " That's a fair question.", "tokens": [51229, 663, 311, 257, 3143, 1168, 13, 51274], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11388301849365234, "compression_ratio": 1.5571955719557196, "no_speech_prob": 1.8393600444838176e-12}, {"id": 411, "seek": 114980, "start": 1168.22, "end": 1174.22, "text": " Like, let the big brain write the outline, write the draft, review its own work, and revise", "tokens": [51286, 1743, 11, 718, 264, 955, 3567, 2464, 264, 16387, 11, 2464, 264, 11206, 11, 3131, 1080, 1065, 589, 11, 293, 44252, 51586], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11388301849365234, "compression_ratio": 1.5571955719557196, "no_speech_prob": 1.8393600444838176e-12}, {"id": 412, "seek": 114980, "start": 1174.22, "end": 1174.44, "text": " it.", "tokens": [51586, 309, 13, 51597], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11388301849365234, "compression_ratio": 1.5571955719557196, "no_speech_prob": 1.8393600444838176e-12}, {"id": 413, "seek": 114980, "start": 1174.52, "end": 1176.6599999999999, "text": " Wouldn't that yield the best possible essay?", "tokens": [51601, 26291, 380, 300, 11257, 264, 1151, 1944, 16238, 30, 51708], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11388301849365234, "compression_ratio": 1.5571955719557196, "no_speech_prob": 1.8393600444838176e-12}, {"id": 414, "seek": 117666, "start": 1176.66, "end": 1181.94, "text": " What's fascinating here is that this leads us to one of the most interesting economic", "tokens": [50365, 708, 311, 10343, 510, 307, 300, 341, 6689, 505, 281, 472, 295, 264, 881, 1880, 4836, 50629], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17226169167495356, "compression_ratio": 1.6183574879227054, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980786572528105e-12}, {"id": 415, "seek": 117666, "start": 1181.94, "end": 1185.8400000000001, "text": " arguments in the paper, the concept of rule-sensitive allocation.", "tokens": [50629, 12869, 294, 264, 3035, 11, 264, 3410, 295, 4978, 12, 82, 34465, 27599, 13, 50824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17226169167495356, "compression_ratio": 1.6183574879227054, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980786572528105e-12}, {"id": 416, "seek": 117666, "start": 1185.8600000000001, "end": 1186.94, "text": " Rule-sensitive allocation.", "tokens": [50825, 27533, 12, 82, 34465, 27599, 13, 50879], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17226169167495356, "compression_ratio": 1.6183574879227054, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980786572528105e-12}, {"id": 417, "seek": 117666, "start": 1187.0400000000002, "end": 1189.52, "text": " Okay, you have to look at the economics of computational power.", "tokens": [50884, 1033, 11, 291, 362, 281, 574, 412, 264, 14564, 295, 28270, 1347, 13, 51008], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17226169167495356, "compression_ratio": 1.6183574879227054, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980786572528105e-12}, {"id": 418, "seek": 117666, "start": 1189.8200000000002, "end": 1194.1200000000001, "text": " The paper breaks down a literal cost function for running these models.", "tokens": [51023, 440, 3035, 9857, 760, 257, 20411, 2063, 2445, 337, 2614, 613, 5245, 13, 51238], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17226169167495356, "compression_ratio": 1.6183574879227054, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980786572528105e-12}, {"id": 419, "seek": 117666, "start": 1194.28, "end": 1194.8600000000001, "text": " Let's hear the math.", "tokens": [51246, 961, 311, 1568, 264, 5221, 13, 51275], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17226169167495356, "compression_ratio": 1.6183574879227054, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980786572528105e-12}, {"id": 420, "seek": 119486, "start": 1194.86, "end": 1199.62, "text": " Let's say the cost of invoking the small model, in terms of time and processing power, is C", "tokens": [50365, 961, 311, 584, 264, 2063, 295, 1048, 5953, 264, 1359, 2316, 11, 294, 2115, 295, 565, 293, 9007, 1347, 11, 307, 383, 50603], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15174656725944358, "compression_ratio": 1.5918367346938775, "no_speech_prob": 1.4378086395094858e-12}, {"id": 421, "seek": 119486, "start": 1199.62, "end": 1200.1799999999998, "text": " of MS.", "tokens": [50603, 295, 7395, 13, 50631], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15174656725944358, "compression_ratio": 1.5918367346938775, "no_speech_prob": 1.4378086395094858e-12}, {"id": 422, "seek": 119486, "start": 1200.6399999999999, "end": 1203.1799999999998, "text": " And the cost of the large model is C of ML.", "tokens": [50654, 400, 264, 2063, 295, 264, 2416, 2316, 307, 383, 295, 21601, 13, 50781], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15174656725944358, "compression_ratio": 1.5918367346938775, "no_speech_prob": 1.4378086395094858e-12}, {"id": 423, "seek": 119486, "start": 1203.4199999999998, "end": 1203.6999999999998, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50793, 1033, 13, 50807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15174656725944358, "compression_ratio": 1.5918367346938775, "no_speech_prob": 1.4378086395094858e-12}, {"id": 424, "seek": 119486, "start": 1203.84, "end": 1208.04, "text": " If you run the whole pipeline asymmetrically, meaning the small model outlines, drafts, and", "tokens": [50814, 759, 291, 1190, 264, 1379, 15517, 37277, 27965, 984, 11, 3620, 264, 1359, 2316, 40125, 11, 11206, 82, 11, 293, 51024], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15174656725944358, "compression_ratio": 1.5918367346938775, "no_speech_prob": 1.4378086395094858e-12}, {"id": 425, "seek": 119486, "start": 1208.04, "end": 1210.84, "text": " revises, while the large model only reviews.", "tokens": [51024, 3698, 3598, 11, 1339, 264, 2416, 2316, 787, 10229, 13, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15174656725944358, "compression_ratio": 1.5918367346938775, "no_speech_prob": 1.4378086395094858e-12}, {"id": 426, "seek": 119486, "start": 1211.0, "end": 1211.2199999999998, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51172, 1779, 13, 51183], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15174656725944358, "compression_ratio": 1.5918367346938775, "no_speech_prob": 1.4378086395094858e-12}, {"id": 427, "seek": 119486, "start": 1211.32, "end": 1212.2199999999998, "text": " The tag team setup.", "tokens": [51188, 440, 6162, 1469, 8657, 13, 51233], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15174656725944358, "compression_ratio": 1.5918367346938775, "no_speech_prob": 1.4378086395094858e-12}, {"id": 428, "seek": 121222, "start": 1212.22, "end": 1216.52, "text": " The total cost is three times the small model, plus one time the large model.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 3217, 2063, 307, 1045, 1413, 264, 1359, 2316, 11, 1804, 472, 565, 264, 2416, 2316, 13, 50580], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13659031677246095, "compression_ratio": 1.6860068259385665, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995407480496547e-12}, {"id": 429, "seek": 121222, "start": 1216.7, "end": 1217.6200000000001, "text": " Okay, I follow the math.", "tokens": [50589, 1033, 11, 286, 1524, 264, 5221, 13, 50635], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13659031677246095, "compression_ratio": 1.6860068259385665, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995407480496547e-12}, {"id": 430, "seek": 121222, "start": 1217.76, "end": 1219.58, "text": " Three X small, plus one X big.", "tokens": [50642, 6244, 1783, 1359, 11, 1804, 472, 1783, 955, 13, 50733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13659031677246095, "compression_ratio": 1.6860068259385665, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995407480496547e-12}, {"id": 431, "seek": 121222, "start": 1219.9, "end": 1225.78, "text": " But, if you use the big model uniformly, for every single step, like you suggested, the", "tokens": [50749, 583, 11, 498, 291, 764, 264, 955, 2316, 48806, 11, 337, 633, 2167, 1823, 11, 411, 291, 10945, 11, 264, 51043], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13659031677246095, "compression_ratio": 1.6860068259385665, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995407480496547e-12}, {"id": 432, "seek": 121222, "start": 1225.78, "end": 1227.82, "text": " cost would be four times the large model.", "tokens": [51043, 2063, 576, 312, 1451, 1413, 264, 2416, 2316, 13, 51145], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13659031677246095, "compression_ratio": 1.6860068259385665, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995407480496547e-12}, {"id": 433, "seek": 121222, "start": 1227.94, "end": 1228.96, "text": " Ah, yeah.", "tokens": [51151, 2438, 11, 1338, 13, 51202], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13659031677246095, "compression_ratio": 1.6860068259385665, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995407480496547e-12}, {"id": 434, "seek": 121222, "start": 1228.96, "end": 1233.8, "text": " Given how exponentially more expensive large models are to run, taking up more RAM, burning", "tokens": [51202, 18600, 577, 37330, 544, 5124, 2416, 5245, 366, 281, 1190, 11, 1940, 493, 544, 14561, 11, 9488, 51444], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13659031677246095, "compression_ratio": 1.6860068259385665, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995407480496547e-12}, {"id": 435, "seek": 121222, "start": 1233.8, "end": 1239.8, "text": " more GPU power, taking longer to generate tokens, the asymmetric architecture saves a massive", "tokens": [51444, 544, 18407, 1347, 11, 1940, 2854, 281, 8460, 22667, 11, 264, 37277, 17475, 9482, 19155, 257, 5994, 51744], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13659031677246095, "compression_ratio": 1.6860068259385665, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995407480496547e-12}, {"id": 436, "seek": 121222, "start": 1239.8, "end": 1241.38, "text": " amount of computational resources.", "tokens": [51744, 2372, 295, 28270, 3593, 13, 51823], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13659031677246095, "compression_ratio": 1.6860068259385665, "no_speech_prob": 1.3995407480496547e-12}, {"id": 437, "seek": 124138, "start": 1241.38, "end": 1244.7600000000002, "text": " So, it maximizes your utility per computational dollar.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 11, 309, 5138, 5660, 428, 14877, 680, 28270, 7241, 13, 50534], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 438, "seek": 124138, "start": 1245.14, "end": 1245.6200000000001, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50553, 7587, 13, 50577], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 439, "seek": 124138, "start": 1245.8000000000002, "end": 1247.22, "text": " That completely reframes it.", "tokens": [50586, 663, 2584, 13334, 1632, 309, 13, 50657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 440, "seek": 124138, "start": 1247.4, "end": 1247.5400000000002, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50666, 1779, 13, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 441, "seek": 124138, "start": 1247.68, "end": 1252.46, "text": " It's treating artificial intelligence not as a magic spirit, but like computer hardware.", "tokens": [50680, 467, 311, 15083, 11677, 7599, 406, 382, 257, 5585, 3797, 11, 457, 411, 3820, 8837, 13, 50919], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 442, "seek": 124138, "start": 1252.5800000000002, "end": 1253.46, "text": " It absolutely is.", "tokens": [50925, 467, 3122, 307, 13, 50969], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 443, "seek": 124138, "start": 1253.5, "end": 1257.3400000000001, "text": " It's like having a computer with a standard CPU and a high-end graphics card.", "tokens": [50971, 467, 311, 411, 1419, 257, 3820, 365, 257, 3832, 13199, 293, 257, 1090, 12, 521, 11837, 2920, 13, 51163], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 444, "seek": 124138, "start": 1257.44, "end": 1257.88, "text": " A GPU.", "tokens": [51168, 316, 18407, 13, 51190], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 445, "seek": 124138, "start": 1258.2, "end": 1264.7, "text": " You don't use your expensive, specialized, power-hungry GPU to write your computer's basic desktop clock", "tokens": [51206, 509, 500, 380, 764, 428, 5124, 11, 19813, 11, 1347, 12, 71, 1063, 627, 18407, 281, 2464, 428, 3820, 311, 3875, 14502, 7830, 51531], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 446, "seek": 124138, "start": 1264.7, "end": 1266.4, "text": " or to open a text document.", "tokens": [51531, 420, 281, 1269, 257, 2487, 4166, 13, 51616], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 447, "seek": 124138, "start": 1266.6000000000001, "end": 1269.8600000000001, "text": " No, you save the GPU for rendering intense 3D graphics.", "tokens": [51626, 883, 11, 291, 3155, 264, 18407, 337, 22407, 9447, 805, 35, 11837, 13, 51789], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 448, "seek": 124138, "start": 1270.24, "end": 1270.48, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51808, 1779, 13, 51820], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.137714199553755, "compression_ratio": 1.5691318327974277, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830370426658027e-12}, {"id": 449, "seek": 127048, "start": 1270.48, "end": 1275.32, "text": " Here, the author is using the cheap, fast 3B model for the heavy lifting of simply getting", "tokens": [50365, 1692, 11, 264, 3793, 307, 1228, 264, 7084, 11, 2370, 805, 33, 2316, 337, 264, 4676, 15798, 295, 2935, 1242, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09934497366146165, "compression_ratio": 1.4852941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 2.059963527881181e-12}, {"id": 450, "seek": 127048, "start": 1275.32, "end": 1280.58, "text": " words onto the page and saving the expensive heavy 8B model for the highly intensive task", "tokens": [50607, 2283, 3911, 264, 3028, 293, 6816, 264, 5124, 4676, 1649, 33, 2316, 337, 264, 5405, 18957, 5633, 50870], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09934497366146165, "compression_ratio": 1.4852941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 2.059963527881181e-12}, {"id": 451, "seek": 127048, "start": 1280.58, "end": 1281.72, "text": " of logical diagnosis.", "tokens": [50870, 295, 14978, 15217, 13, 50927], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09934497366146165, "compression_ratio": 1.4852941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 2.059963527881181e-12}, {"id": 452, "seek": 128172, "start": 1281.72, "end": 1284.1000000000001, "text": " That is precisely the architectural philosophy.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 13402, 264, 26621, 10675, 13, 50484], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.114822142464774, "compression_ratio": 1.5885167464114833, "no_speech_prob": 1.7963680673180327e-12}, {"id": 453, "seek": 128172, "start": 1284.1000000000001, "end": 1286.94, "text": " It is heterogeneous computing applied to language models.", "tokens": [50484, 467, 307, 20789, 31112, 15866, 6456, 281, 2856, 5245, 13, 50626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.114822142464774, "compression_ratio": 1.5885167464114833, "no_speech_prob": 1.7963680673180327e-12}, {"id": 454, "seek": 128172, "start": 1286.94, "end": 1292.34, "text": " The hypothesis encoded into this entire pipeline is that the marginal benefit of additional model", "tokens": [50626, 440, 17291, 2058, 12340, 666, 341, 2302, 15517, 307, 300, 264, 16885, 5121, 295, 4497, 2316, 50896], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.114822142464774, "compression_ratio": 1.5885167464114833, "no_speech_prob": 1.7963680673180327e-12}, {"id": 455, "seek": 128172, "start": 1292.34, "end": 1298.48, "text": " capacity, adding more billions of parameters, is unusually large at the diagnostic stage, but", "tokens": [50896, 6042, 11, 5127, 544, 17375, 295, 9834, 11, 307, 10054, 671, 2416, 412, 264, 27897, 3233, 11, 457, 51203], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.114822142464774, "compression_ratio": 1.5885167464114833, "no_speech_prob": 1.7963680673180327e-12}, {"id": 456, "seek": 128172, "start": 1298.48, "end": 1300.56, "text": " diminishing at the drafting stage.", "tokens": [51203, 15739, 3807, 412, 264, 46378, 3233, 13, 51307], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.114822142464774, "compression_ratio": 1.5885167464114833, "no_speech_prob": 1.7963680673180327e-12}, {"id": 457, "seek": 130056, "start": 1300.56, "end": 1304.94, "text": " So it's not about declaring which model is universally better.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 309, 311, 406, 466, 40374, 597, 2316, 307, 43995, 1101, 13, 50584], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23577059951483034, "compression_ratio": 1.5632183908045978, "no_speech_prob": 1.839815192555827e-12}, {"id": 458, "seek": 130056, "start": 1304.94, "end": 1305.54, "text": " No.", "tokens": [50584, 883, 13, 50614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23577059951483034, "compression_ratio": 1.5632183908045978, "no_speech_prob": 1.839815192555827e-12}, {"id": 459, "seek": 130056, "start": 1305.54, "end": 1311.24, "text": " It is about asking where placing a stronger model gives you the absolute highest return", "tokens": [50614, 467, 307, 466, 3365, 689, 17221, 257, 7249, 2316, 2709, 291, 264, 8236, 6343, 2736, 50899], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23577059951483034, "compression_ratio": 1.5632183908045978, "no_speech_prob": 1.839815192555827e-12}, {"id": 460, "seek": 130056, "start": 1311.24, "end": 1312.74, "text": " on your computational investment.", "tokens": [50899, 322, 428, 28270, 6078, 13, 50974], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23577059951483034, "compression_ratio": 1.5632183908045978, "no_speech_prob": 1.839815192555827e-12}, {"id": 461, "seek": 130056, "start": 1312.74, "end": 1314.6, "text": " Okay, so we have this brilliant 8B critic.", "tokens": [50974, 1033, 11, 370, 321, 362, 341, 10248, 1649, 33, 7850, 13, 51067], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23577059951483034, "compression_ratio": 1.5632183908045978, "no_speech_prob": 1.839815192555827e-12}, {"id": 462, "seek": 130056, "start": 1314.6, "end": 1320.22, "text": " It's sitting at the end of the assembly line, inspecting the 3B model's draft, and writing up these", "tokens": [51067, 467, 311, 3798, 412, 264, 917, 295, 264, 12103, 1622, 11, 15018, 278, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 311, 11206, 11, 293, 3579, 493, 613, 51348], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23577059951483034, "compression_ratio": 1.5632183908045978, "no_speech_prob": 1.839815192555827e-12}, {"id": 463, "seek": 130056, "start": 1320.22, "end": 1325.36, "text": " devastatingly accurate, highly logical critiques in a file called review.md.", "tokens": [51348, 21280, 356, 8559, 11, 5405, 14978, 3113, 4911, 294, 257, 3991, 1219, 3131, 13, 76, 67, 13, 51605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23577059951483034, "compression_ratio": 1.5632183908045978, "no_speech_prob": 1.839815192555827e-12}, {"id": 464, "seek": 132536, "start": 1325.36, "end": 1325.8, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 13, 50387], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11144568579537528, "compression_ratio": 1.46875, "no_speech_prob": 1.6879029640995413e-12}, {"id": 465, "seek": 132536, "start": 1326.1999999999998, "end": 1329.3, "text": " But the pipeline doesn't just stop there and hand the critique to the human, does it?", "tokens": [50407, 583, 264, 15517, 1177, 380, 445, 1590, 456, 293, 1011, 264, 25673, 281, 264, 1952, 11, 775, 309, 30, 50562], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11144568579537528, "compression_ratio": 1.46875, "no_speech_prob": 1.6879029640995413e-12}, {"id": 466, "seek": 132536, "start": 1329.34, "end": 1330.0, "text": " No, it does not.", "tokens": [50564, 883, 11, 309, 775, 406, 13, 50597], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11144568579537528, "compression_ratio": 1.46875, "no_speech_prob": 1.6879029640995413e-12}, {"id": 467, "seek": 132536, "start": 1330.28, "end": 1334.5, "text": " We have to take that critique file and hand it back to the 3B model to actually execute", "tokens": [50611, 492, 362, 281, 747, 300, 25673, 3991, 293, 1011, 309, 646, 281, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 281, 767, 14483, 50822], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11144568579537528, "compression_ratio": 1.46875, "no_speech_prob": 1.6879029640995413e-12}, {"id": 468, "seek": 132536, "start": 1334.5, "end": 1336.36, "text": " the revisions and fix the essay.", "tokens": [50822, 264, 3698, 4252, 293, 3191, 264, 16238, 13, 50915], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11144568579537528, "compression_ratio": 1.46875, "no_speech_prob": 1.6879029640995413e-12}, {"id": 469, "seek": 132536, "start": 1336.58, "end": 1336.8999999999999, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50926, 1079, 13, 50942], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11144568579537528, "compression_ratio": 1.46875, "no_speech_prob": 1.6879029640995413e-12}, {"id": 470, "seek": 133690, "start": 1336.9, "end": 1341.6000000000001, "text": " And here is where the paper reveals a distinctly human flaw buried inside the machine.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 510, 307, 689, 264, 3035, 20893, 257, 10644, 356, 1952, 13717, 14101, 1854, 264, 3479, 13, 50600], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11832995568552325, "compression_ratio": 1.662162162162162, "no_speech_prob": 1.761996147944811e-12}, {"id": 471, "seek": 133690, "start": 1341.8200000000002, "end": 1345.02, "text": " We step right into the perilous gap between diagnosis and repair.", "tokens": [50611, 492, 1823, 558, 666, 264, 46118, 563, 7417, 1296, 15217, 293, 10535, 13, 50771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11832995568552325, "compression_ratio": 1.662162162162162, "no_speech_prob": 1.761996147944811e-12}, {"id": 472, "seek": 133690, "start": 1345.3400000000001, "end": 1350.88, "text": " What actually happens when the 3B model, the original author, reads the 8B model's brilliant", "tokens": [50787, 708, 767, 2314, 562, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 11, 264, 3380, 3793, 11, 15700, 264, 1649, 33, 2316, 311, 10248, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11832995568552325, "compression_ratio": 1.662162162162162, "no_speech_prob": 1.761996147944811e-12}, {"id": 473, "seek": 133690, "start": 1350.88, "end": 1351.3000000000002, "text": " critique?", "tokens": [51064, 25673, 30, 51085], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11832995568552325, "compression_ratio": 1.662162162162162, "no_speech_prob": 1.761996147944811e-12}, {"id": 474, "seek": 133690, "start": 1351.74, "end": 1357.14, "text": " In a significant number of the experimental runs detailed in the paper, the 3B model completely", "tokens": [51107, 682, 257, 4776, 1230, 295, 264, 17069, 6676, 9942, 294, 264, 3035, 11, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 2584, 51377], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11832995568552325, "compression_ratio": 1.662162162162162, "no_speech_prob": 1.761996147944811e-12}, {"id": 475, "seek": 133690, "start": 1357.14, "end": 1358.6000000000001, "text": " fails to fix the draft.", "tokens": [51377, 18199, 281, 3191, 264, 11206, 13, 51450], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11832995568552325, "compression_ratio": 1.662162162162162, "no_speech_prob": 1.761996147944811e-12}, {"id": 476, "seek": 133690, "start": 1358.9, "end": 1360.5400000000002, "text": " Wait, it just ignores the critique?", "tokens": [51465, 3802, 11, 309, 445, 5335, 2706, 264, 25673, 30, 51547], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11832995568552325, "compression_ratio": 1.662162162162162, "no_speech_prob": 1.761996147944811e-12}, {"id": 477, "seek": 133690, "start": 1360.6200000000001, "end": 1360.8400000000001, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51551, 1079, 13, 51562], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11832995568552325, "compression_ratio": 1.662162162162162, "no_speech_prob": 1.761996147944811e-12}, {"id": 478, "seek": 133690, "start": 1360.92, "end": 1365.2, "text": " The big boss hands down the edits and the small model just says, no thanks.", "tokens": [51566, 440, 955, 5741, 2377, 760, 264, 41752, 293, 264, 1359, 2316, 445, 1619, 11, 572, 3231, 13, 51780], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11832995568552325, "compression_ratio": 1.662162162162162, "no_speech_prob": 1.761996147944811e-12}, {"id": 479, "seek": 136520, "start": 1365.2, "end": 1367.16, "text": " The paper describes it as a divergence.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 3035, 15626, 309, 382, 257, 47387, 13, 50463], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 480, "seek": 136520, "start": 1368.1000000000001, "end": 1373.74, "text": " The 8B model produces a stunning, perfectly accurate diagnosis of the structural flaws.", "tokens": [50510, 440, 1649, 33, 2316, 14725, 257, 18550, 11, 6239, 8559, 15217, 295, 264, 15067, 27108, 13, 50792], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 481, "seek": 136520, "start": 1373.88, "end": 1374.1200000000001, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50799, 1033, 13, 50811], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 482, "seek": 136520, "start": 1374.5800000000002, "end": 1380.3400000000001, "text": " The 3B model takes that diagnosis, reads it, attempts a revision phase, and returns a final", "tokens": [50834, 440, 805, 33, 2316, 2516, 300, 15217, 11, 15700, 309, 11, 15257, 257, 34218, 5574, 11, 293, 11247, 257, 2572, 51122], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 483, "seek": 136520, "start": 1380.3400000000001, "end": 1384.22, "text": " essay that looks almost completely identical to the flawed original draft.", "tokens": [51122, 16238, 300, 1542, 1920, 2584, 14800, 281, 264, 38823, 3380, 11206, 13, 51316], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 484, "seek": 136520, "start": 1384.3600000000001, "end": 1385.22, "text": " That is wild.", "tokens": [51323, 663, 307, 4868, 13, 51366], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 485, "seek": 136520, "start": 1385.5, "end": 1390.3400000000001, "text": " I mean, we have all had coworkers like that who nod at feedback and then change absolutely", "tokens": [51380, 286, 914, 11, 321, 362, 439, 632, 43465, 411, 300, 567, 15224, 412, 5824, 293, 550, 1319, 3122, 51622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 486, "seek": 136520, "start": 1390.3400000000001, "end": 1390.78, "text": " nothing.", "tokens": [51622, 1825, 13, 51644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 487, "seek": 136520, "start": 1390.88, "end": 1391.02, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51649, 1779, 13, 51656], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 488, "seek": 136520, "start": 1391.0800000000002, "end": 1391.9, "text": " It's very human.", "tokens": [51659, 467, 311, 588, 1952, 13, 51700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 489, "seek": 136520, "start": 1391.92, "end": 1394.54, "text": " But you don't expect that kind of stubbornness from code.", "tokens": [51701, 583, 291, 500, 380, 2066, 300, 733, 295, 24137, 1287, 490, 3089, 13, 51832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10538645396156916, "compression_ratio": 1.5796178343949046, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735364400359941e-12}, {"id": 490, "seek": 139454, "start": 1394.54, "end": 1395.68, "text": " Why does it do that?", "tokens": [50365, 1545, 775, 309, 360, 300, 30, 50422], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17594011306762694, "compression_ratio": 1.6563706563706564, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404752568363376e-12}, {"id": 491, "seek": 139454, "start": 1395.78, "end": 1399.26, "text": " Does the 3B model just not understand the big words in the critique?", "tokens": [50427, 4402, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 445, 406, 1223, 264, 955, 2283, 294, 264, 25673, 30, 50601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17594011306762694, "compression_ratio": 1.6563706563706564, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404752568363376e-12}, {"id": 492, "seek": 139454, "start": 1399.7, "end": 1403.58, "text": " It's a complex combination of factors, but it fundamentally starts with how the prompt", "tokens": [50623, 467, 311, 257, 3997, 6562, 295, 6771, 11, 457, 309, 17879, 3719, 365, 577, 264, 12391, 50817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17594011306762694, "compression_ratio": 1.6563706563706564, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404752568363376e-12}, {"id": 493, "seek": 139454, "start": 1403.58, "end": 1404.48, "text": " instructions are written.", "tokens": [50817, 9415, 366, 3720, 13, 50862], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17594011306762694, "compression_ratio": 1.6563706563706564, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404752568363376e-12}, {"id": 494, "seek": 139454, "start": 1405.12, "end": 1407.8, "text": " The pipeline enforces a concept called conservative revision.", "tokens": [50894, 440, 15517, 25495, 887, 257, 3410, 1219, 13780, 34218, 13, 51028], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17594011306762694, "compression_ratio": 1.6563706563706564, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404752568363376e-12}, {"id": 495, "seek": 139454, "start": 1408.04, "end": 1408.98, "text": " Conservative revision.", "tokens": [51040, 46054, 34218, 13, 51087], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17594011306762694, "compression_ratio": 1.6563706563706564, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404752568363376e-12}, {"id": 496, "seek": 139454, "start": 1409.1, "end": 1409.84, "text": " What does that mean?", "tokens": [51093, 708, 775, 300, 914, 30, 51130], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17594011306762694, "compression_ratio": 1.6563706563706564, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404752568363376e-12}, {"id": 497, "seek": 139454, "start": 1410.28, "end": 1416.26, "text": " The prompt explicitly tells the revising model that it must preserve any claims and passages", "tokens": [51152, 440, 12391, 20803, 5112, 264, 3698, 3436, 2316, 300, 309, 1633, 15665, 604, 9441, 293, 31589, 51451], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17594011306762694, "compression_ratio": 1.6563706563706564, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404752568363376e-12}, {"id": 498, "seek": 139454, "start": 1416.26, "end": 1417.92, "text": " that survive the criticism.", "tokens": [51451, 300, 7867, 264, 15835, 13, 51534], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17594011306762694, "compression_ratio": 1.6563706563706564, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404752568363376e-12}, {"id": 499, "seek": 141792, "start": 1417.92, "end": 1422.5, "text": " It establishes what researchers call a null intervention.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 8327, 279, 437, 10309, 818, 257, 18184, 13176, 13, 50594], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16126999052444307, "compression_ratio": 1.61328125, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901912591211655e-12}, {"id": 500, "seek": 141792, "start": 1422.68, "end": 1427.1000000000001, "text": " A null intervention, meaning the act of doing nothing.", "tokens": [50603, 316, 18184, 13176, 11, 3620, 264, 605, 295, 884, 1825, 13, 50824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16126999052444307, "compression_ratio": 1.61328125, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901912591211655e-12}, {"id": 501, "seek": 141792, "start": 1427.3400000000001, "end": 1427.78, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50836, 7587, 13, 50858], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16126999052444307, "compression_ratio": 1.61328125, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901912591211655e-12}, {"id": 502, "seek": 141792, "start": 1428.0600000000002, "end": 1433.6000000000001, "text": " Doing nothing is a perfectly valid and often optimal choice if a safe repair cannot be found.", "tokens": [50872, 18496, 1825, 307, 257, 6239, 7363, 293, 2049, 16252, 3922, 498, 257, 3273, 10535, 2644, 312, 1352, 13, 51149], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16126999052444307, "compression_ratio": 1.61328125, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901912591211655e-12}, {"id": 503, "seek": 141792, "start": 1433.7, "end": 1433.9, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51154, 1033, 13, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16126999052444307, "compression_ratio": 1.61328125, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901912591211655e-12}, {"id": 504, "seek": 141792, "start": 1434.0, "end": 1434.6000000000001, "text": " I think I see.", "tokens": [51169, 286, 519, 286, 536, 13, 51199], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16126999052444307, "compression_ratio": 1.61328125, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901912591211655e-12}, {"id": 505, "seek": 141792, "start": 1434.92, "end": 1439.7, "text": " If the model is explicitly told to improve the essay, but strictly told not to destroy", "tokens": [51215, 759, 264, 2316, 307, 20803, 1907, 281, 3470, 264, 16238, 11, 457, 20792, 1907, 406, 281, 5293, 51454], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16126999052444307, "compression_ratio": 1.61328125, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901912591211655e-12}, {"id": 506, "seek": 141792, "start": 1439.7, "end": 1443.92, "text": " the paragraphs that already work, and it realizes it doesn't know how to fix the specific", "tokens": [51454, 264, 48910, 300, 1217, 589, 11, 293, 309, 29316, 309, 1177, 380, 458, 577, 281, 3191, 264, 2685, 51665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16126999052444307, "compression_ratio": 1.61328125, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901912591211655e-12}, {"id": 507, "seek": 144392, "start": 1443.92, "end": 1445.78, "text": " complex flaw the reviewer pointed out.", "tokens": [50365, 3997, 13717, 264, 3131, 260, 10932, 484, 13, 50458], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13524804665492132, "compression_ratio": 1.5261044176706828, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074287947047018e-12}, {"id": 508, "seek": 144392, "start": 1445.88, "end": 1446.68, "text": " Then what does it do?", "tokens": [50463, 1396, 437, 775, 309, 360, 30, 50503], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13524804665492132, "compression_ratio": 1.5261044176706828, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074287947047018e-12}, {"id": 509, "seek": 144392, "start": 1447.18, "end": 1452.28, "text": " It will conservatively choose to leave the text unchanged, rather than risk breaking the", "tokens": [50528, 467, 486, 13780, 356, 2826, 281, 1856, 264, 2487, 44553, 11, 2831, 813, 3148, 7697, 264, 50783], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13524804665492132, "compression_ratio": 1.5261044176706828, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074287947047018e-12}, {"id": 510, "seek": 144392, "start": 1452.28, "end": 1454.78, "text": " entire argument by hallucinating a bad fix.", "tokens": [50783, 2302, 6770, 538, 35212, 8205, 257, 1578, 3191, 13, 50908], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13524804665492132, "compression_ratio": 1.5261044176706828, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074287947047018e-12}, {"id": 511, "seek": 144392, "start": 1454.96, "end": 1457.38, "text": " But the reviewer literally told it what was wrong.", "tokens": [50917, 583, 264, 3131, 260, 3736, 1907, 309, 437, 390, 2085, 13, 51038], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13524804665492132, "compression_ratio": 1.5261044176706828, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074287947047018e-12}, {"id": 512, "seek": 144392, "start": 1457.78, "end": 1459.5, "text": " The critique is sitting right there on the file.", "tokens": [51058, 440, 25673, 307, 3798, 558, 456, 322, 264, 3991, 13, 51144], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13524804665492132, "compression_ratio": 1.5261044176706828, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074287947047018e-12}, {"id": 513, "seek": 144392, "start": 1459.6200000000001, "end": 1461.6200000000001, "text": " And that leads us to theorem 1.3.", "tokens": [51150, 400, 300, 6689, 505, 281, 20904, 502, 13, 18, 13, 51250], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13524804665492132, "compression_ratio": 1.5261044176706828, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074287947047018e-12}, {"id": 514, "seek": 144392, "start": 1462.3000000000002, "end": 1464.18, "text": " Diagnosis repair non-equivalence.", "tokens": [51284, 8789, 4535, 8211, 10535, 2107, 12, 12816, 3576, 655, 13, 51378], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13524804665492132, "compression_ratio": 1.5261044176706828, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074287947047018e-12}, {"id": 515, "seek": 144392, "start": 1464.24, "end": 1464.94, "text": " That sounds heavy.", "tokens": [51381, 663, 3263, 4676, 13, 51416], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13524804665492132, "compression_ratio": 1.5261044176706828, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074287947047018e-12}, {"id": 516, "seek": 146494, "start": 1464.94, "end": 1469.42, "text": " This is arguably one of the most crucial formal proofs in the entire paper.", "tokens": [50365, 639, 307, 26771, 472, 295, 264, 881, 11462, 9860, 8177, 82, 294, 264, 2302, 3035, 13, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.168944578904372, "compression_ratio": 1.6171003717472119, "no_speech_prob": 2.1174039084581597e-12}, {"id": 517, "seek": 146494, "start": 1470.3600000000001, "end": 1476.1000000000001, "text": " It proves mathematically that a perfect diagnostic score can coexist with an absolute zero repair", "tokens": [50636, 467, 25019, 44003, 300, 257, 2176, 27897, 6175, 393, 48086, 365, 364, 8236, 4018, 10535, 50923], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.168944578904372, "compression_ratio": 1.6171003717472119, "no_speech_prob": 2.1174039084581597e-12}, {"id": 518, "seek": 146494, "start": 1476.1000000000001, "end": 1476.48, "text": " score.", "tokens": [50923, 6175, 13, 50942], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.168944578904372, "compression_ratio": 1.6171003717472119, "no_speech_prob": 2.1174039084581597e-12}, {"id": 519, "seek": 146494, "start": 1476.76, "end": 1479.46, "text": " I really want to spend some time on theorem 1.3.", "tokens": [50956, 286, 534, 528, 281, 3496, 512, 565, 322, 20904, 502, 13, 18, 13, 51091], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.168944578904372, "compression_ratio": 1.6171003717472119, "no_speech_prob": 2.1174039084581597e-12}, {"id": 520, "seek": 146494, "start": 1480.26, "end": 1483.3, "text": " How can perfect diagnosis equal zero repair?", "tokens": [51131, 1012, 393, 2176, 15217, 2681, 4018, 10535, 30, 51283], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.168944578904372, "compression_ratio": 1.6171003717472119, "no_speech_prob": 2.1174039084581597e-12}, {"id": 521, "seek": 146494, "start": 1484.1000000000001, "end": 1487.06, "text": " If you know what is wrong, shouldn't you be able to fix it?", "tokens": [51323, 759, 291, 458, 437, 307, 2085, 11, 4659, 380, 291, 312, 1075, 281, 3191, 309, 30, 51471], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.168944578904372, "compression_ratio": 1.6171003717472119, "no_speech_prob": 2.1174039084581597e-12}, {"id": 522, "seek": 146494, "start": 1487.18, "end": 1492.46, "text": " The core takeaway is that information availability does not equal capability transfer.", "tokens": [51477, 440, 4965, 30681, 307, 300, 1589, 17945, 775, 406, 2681, 13759, 5003, 13, 51741], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.168944578904372, "compression_ratio": 1.6171003717472119, "no_speech_prob": 2.1174039084581597e-12}, {"id": 523, "seek": 146494, "start": 1492.8, "end": 1493.44, "text": " Meaning what?", "tokens": [51758, 19948, 437, 30, 51790], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.168944578904372, "compression_ratio": 1.6171003717472119, "no_speech_prob": 2.1174039084581597e-12}, {"id": 524, "seek": 149344, "start": 1493.44, "end": 1499.44, "text": " Let's imagine the reviewer model tells the drafter, your definition of algorithmic admissibility", "tokens": [50365, 961, 311, 3811, 264, 3131, 260, 2316, 5112, 264, 1617, 828, 11, 428, 7123, 295, 9284, 299, 5910, 891, 2841, 50665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 525, "seek": 149344, "start": 1499.44, "end": 1501.28, "text": " lacks measurable criteria.", "tokens": [50665, 31132, 43615, 11101, 13, 50757], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 526, "seek": 149344, "start": 1501.6000000000001, "end": 1501.8400000000001, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50773, 1033, 13, 50785], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 527, "seek": 149344, "start": 1502.06, "end": 1503.38, "text": " A very specific critique.", "tokens": [50796, 316, 588, 2685, 25673, 13, 50862], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 528, "seek": 149344, "start": 1503.72, "end": 1507.16, "text": " The drafter now possesses that critical information.", "tokens": [50879, 440, 1617, 828, 586, 17490, 279, 300, 4924, 1589, 13, 51051], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 529, "seek": 149344, "start": 1507.76, "end": 1509.6000000000001, "text": " It knows its definition is bad.", "tokens": [51081, 467, 3255, 1080, 7123, 307, 1578, 13, 51173], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 530, "seek": 149344, "start": 1510.1000000000001, "end": 1515.42, "text": " But merely possessing that information does not magically download the domain knowledge required", "tokens": [51198, 583, 17003, 17490, 278, 300, 1589, 775, 406, 39763, 5484, 264, 9274, 3601, 4739, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 531, "seek": 149344, "start": 1515.42, "end": 1520.4, "text": " to invent a mathematically coherent, empirically meaningful criterion from scratch.", "tokens": [51464, 281, 7962, 257, 44003, 36239, 11, 25790, 984, 10995, 46691, 490, 8459, 13, 51713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 532, "seek": 149344, "start": 1520.5800000000002, "end": 1521.02, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [51722, 3153, 13, 51744], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 533, "seek": 149344, "start": 1521.02, "end": 1523.16, "text": " I'm trying to picture this in a human context.", "tokens": [51744, 286, 478, 1382, 281, 3036, 341, 294, 257, 1952, 4319, 13, 51851], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16355348066850142, "compression_ratio": 1.6310344827586207, "no_speech_prob": 1.708046573102584e-12}, {"id": 534, "seek": 152316, "start": 1523.16, "end": 1524.42, "text": " It's a very relatable problem.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 257, 588, 42355, 1154, 13, 50428], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 535, "seek": 152316, "start": 1524.5800000000002, "end": 1529.5400000000002, "text": " It's like an undergraduate math student submitting a five-page proof for a final exam.", "tokens": [50436, 467, 311, 411, 364, 19113, 5221, 3107, 31836, 257, 1732, 12, 15161, 8177, 337, 257, 2572, 1139, 13, 50684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 536, "seek": 152316, "start": 1529.66, "end": 1529.78, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50690, 1033, 13, 50696], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 537, "seek": 152316, "start": 1529.8600000000001, "end": 1530.0400000000002, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50700, 865, 13, 50709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 538, "seek": 152316, "start": 1530.28, "end": 1534.18, "text": " And the professor who acts as the reviewer hands the paper back with a massive red circle", "tokens": [50721, 400, 264, 8304, 567, 10672, 382, 264, 3131, 260, 2377, 264, 3035, 646, 365, 257, 5994, 2182, 6329, 50916], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 539, "seek": 152316, "start": 1534.18, "end": 1537.0, "text": " and says, line four is fundamentally wrong.", "tokens": [50916, 293, 1619, 11, 1622, 1451, 307, 17879, 2085, 13, 51057], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 540, "seek": 152316, "start": 1537.1000000000001, "end": 1538.8600000000001, "text": " There is a massive logical gap here.", "tokens": [51062, 821, 307, 257, 5994, 14978, 7417, 510, 13, 51150], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 541, "seek": 152316, "start": 1538.96, "end": 1539.22, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51155, 1779, 13, 51168], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 542, "seek": 152316, "start": 1539.4, "end": 1541.96, "text": " The student now knows exactly where the error is located.", "tokens": [51177, 440, 3107, 586, 3255, 2293, 689, 264, 6713, 307, 6870, 13, 51305], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 543, "seek": 152316, "start": 1542.16, "end": 1543.5400000000002, "text": " The failure has been localized.", "tokens": [51315, 440, 7763, 575, 668, 44574, 13, 51384], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14819290524437315, "compression_ratio": 1.5691699604743083, "no_speech_prob": 1.969799323653376e-12}, {"id": 544, "seek": 154354, "start": 1543.54, "end": 1548.82, "text": " But that doesn't mean the student actually knows the highly advanced mathematical lemma required", "tokens": [50365, 583, 300, 1177, 380, 914, 264, 3107, 767, 3255, 264, 5405, 7339, 18894, 7495, 1696, 4739, 50629], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15547876004819516, "compression_ratio": 1.183673469387755, "no_speech_prob": 1.6420223470856032e-12}, {"id": 545, "seek": 154354, "start": 1548.82, "end": 1549.92, "text": " to bridge that gap.", "tokens": [50629, 281, 7283, 300, 7417, 13, 50684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15547876004819516, "compression_ratio": 1.183673469387755, "no_speech_prob": 1.6420223470856032e-12}, {"id": 546, "seek": 154992, "start": 1549.92, "end": 1550.52, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50395], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17881721174213247, "compression_ratio": 1.461139896373057, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685264060499084e-12}, {"id": 547, "seek": 154992, "start": 1550.52, "end": 1555.76, "text": " Knowing you are wrong doesn't magically bestow upon you the knowledge of how to be right.", "tokens": [50395, 25499, 291, 366, 2085, 1177, 380, 39763, 1151, 305, 3564, 291, 264, 3601, 295, 577, 281, 312, 558, 13, 50657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17881721174213247, "compression_ratio": 1.461139896373057, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685264060499084e-12}, {"id": 548, "seek": 154992, "start": 1556.3000000000002, "end": 1559.1000000000001, "text": " That analogy perfectly encapsulates the dynamic.", "tokens": [50684, 663, 21663, 6239, 38745, 26192, 264, 8546, 13, 50824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17881721174213247, "compression_ratio": 1.461139896373057, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685264060499084e-12}, {"id": 549, "seek": 154992, "start": 1560.22, "end": 1565.26, "text": " Recognizing a gap in a proof is not equivalent to possessing a proof of the theorem.", "tokens": [50880, 44682, 3319, 257, 7417, 294, 257, 8177, 307, 406, 10344, 281, 17490, 278, 257, 8177, 295, 264, 20904, 13, 51132], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17881721174213247, "compression_ratio": 1.461139896373057, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685264060499084e-12}, {"id": 550, "seek": 154992, "start": 1565.4, "end": 1567.6000000000001, "text": " It makes total sense when you frame it like that.", "tokens": [51139, 467, 1669, 3217, 2020, 562, 291, 3920, 309, 411, 300, 13, 51249], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17881721174213247, "compression_ratio": 1.461139896373057, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685264060499084e-12}, {"id": 551, "seek": 156760, "start": 1567.6, "end": 1574.28, "text": " The paper actually details an experiment on an essay about admissibility and optimization", "tokens": [50365, 440, 3035, 767, 4365, 364, 5120, 322, 364, 16238, 466, 5910, 891, 2841, 293, 19618, 50699], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14415395961088293, "compression_ratio": 1.264957264957265, "no_speech_prob": 1.5009359857418025e-12}, {"id": 552, "seek": 156760, "start": 1574.28, "end": 1576.34, "text": " that demonstrated this perfectly.", "tokens": [50699, 300, 18772, 341, 6239, 13, 50802], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14415395961088293, "compression_ratio": 1.264957264957265, "no_speech_prob": 1.5009359857418025e-12}, {"id": 553, "seek": 156760, "start": 1576.52, "end": 1577.52, "text": " Oh, what happened there?", "tokens": [50811, 876, 11, 437, 2011, 456, 30, 50861], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14415395961088293, "compression_ratio": 1.264957264957265, "no_speech_prob": 1.5009359857418025e-12}, {"id": 554, "seek": 157752, "start": 1577.52, "end": 1583.5, "text": " The 8B reviewer absolutely tore into the draft, pointing out incredibly vague definitions,", "tokens": [50365, 440, 1649, 33, 3131, 260, 3122, 37341, 666, 264, 11206, 11, 12166, 484, 6252, 24247, 21988, 11, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1397745396831248, "compression_ratio": 1.5968992248062015, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922299286333375e-12}, {"id": 555, "seek": 157752, "start": 1584.02, "end": 1587.72, "text": " abrupt logical transitions, and several hidden unstated assumptions.", "tokens": [50690, 33401, 14978, 23767, 11, 293, 2940, 7633, 18799, 770, 17695, 13, 50875], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1397745396831248, "compression_ratio": 1.5968992248062015, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922299286333375e-12}, {"id": 556, "seek": 157752, "start": 1588.3799999999999, "end": 1590.02, "text": " It provided a roadmap for fixing it.", "tokens": [50908, 467, 5649, 257, 35738, 337, 19442, 309, 13, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1397745396831248, "compression_ratio": 1.5968992248062015, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922299286333375e-12}, {"id": 557, "seek": 157752, "start": 1590.08, "end": 1590.66, "text": " In the drafter.", "tokens": [50993, 682, 264, 1617, 828, 13, 51022], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1397745396831248, "compression_ratio": 1.5968992248062015, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922299286333375e-12}, {"id": 558, "seek": 157752, "start": 1590.92, "end": 1594.24, "text": " The final revised essay barely changed a single word.", "tokens": [51035, 440, 2572, 35228, 16238, 10268, 3105, 257, 2167, 1349, 13, 51201], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1397745396831248, "compression_ratio": 1.5968992248062015, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922299286333375e-12}, {"id": 559, "seek": 157752, "start": 1594.34, "end": 1599.9, "text": " Because the 3B model fundamentally lacked the reachability, as the paper terms it, to execute", "tokens": [51206, 1436, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 17879, 41481, 264, 2524, 2310, 11, 382, 264, 3035, 2115, 309, 11, 281, 14483, 51484], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1397745396831248, "compression_ratio": 1.5968992248062015, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922299286333375e-12}, {"id": 560, "seek": 157752, "start": 1599.9, "end": 1600.42, "text": " the fix.", "tokens": [51484, 264, 3191, 13, 51510], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1397745396831248, "compression_ratio": 1.5968992248062015, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922299286333375e-12}, {"id": 561, "seek": 157752, "start": 1600.48, "end": 1602.42, "text": " Yes, reachability is the key concept here.", "tokens": [51513, 1079, 11, 2524, 2310, 307, 264, 2141, 3410, 510, 13, 51610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1397745396831248, "compression_ratio": 1.5968992248062015, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922299286333375e-12}, {"id": 562, "seek": 160242, "start": 1602.42, "end": 1608.16, "text": " The actual mathematical requirement for a successful repair is that the correct textual state must", "tokens": [50365, 440, 3539, 18894, 11695, 337, 257, 4406, 10535, 307, 300, 264, 3006, 2487, 901, 1785, 1633, 50652], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14874109540666852, "compression_ratio": 1.6136363636363635, "no_speech_prob": 1.8182002127845043e-12}, {"id": 563, "seek": 160242, "start": 1608.16, "end": 1611.1200000000001, "text": " be reachable by the specific neural network attempting the repair.", "tokens": [50652, 312, 2524, 712, 538, 264, 2685, 18161, 3209, 22001, 264, 10535, 13, 50800], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14874109540666852, "compression_ratio": 1.6136363636363635, "no_speech_prob": 1.8182002127845043e-12}, {"id": 564, "seek": 160242, "start": 1611.4, "end": 1616.8200000000002, "text": " If the 3B model's latent knowledge space simply doesn't contain the highly complex quantum physics", "tokens": [50814, 759, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 311, 48994, 3601, 1901, 2935, 1177, 380, 5304, 264, 5405, 3997, 13018, 10649, 51085], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14874109540666852, "compression_ratio": 1.6136363636363635, "no_speech_prob": 1.8182002127845043e-12}, {"id": 565, "seek": 160242, "start": 1616.8200000000002, "end": 1621.52, "text": " concept, or the advanced algorithmic theorem needed to fix the hidden assumption.", "tokens": [51085, 3410, 11, 420, 264, 7339, 9284, 299, 20904, 2978, 281, 3191, 264, 7633, 15302, 13, 51320], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14874109540666852, "compression_ratio": 1.6136363636363635, "no_speech_prob": 1.8182002127845043e-12}, {"id": 566, "seek": 160242, "start": 1621.8400000000001, "end": 1625.3600000000001, "text": " Then no amount of aggressive prompting will make it generate that concept.", "tokens": [51336, 1396, 572, 2372, 295, 10762, 12391, 278, 486, 652, 309, 8460, 300, 3410, 13, 51512], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14874109540666852, "compression_ratio": 1.6136363636363635, "no_speech_prob": 1.8182002127845043e-12}, {"id": 567, "seek": 160242, "start": 1625.5600000000002, "end": 1626.02, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51522, 7587, 13, 51545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14874109540666852, "compression_ratio": 1.6136363636363635, "no_speech_prob": 1.8182002127845043e-12}, {"id": 568, "seek": 160242, "start": 1626.88, "end": 1629.8600000000001, "text": " You cannot prompt a model into knowing something it never learned.", "tokens": [51588, 509, 2644, 12391, 257, 2316, 666, 5276, 746, 309, 1128, 3264, 13, 51737], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14874109540666852, "compression_ratio": 1.6136363636363635, "no_speech_prob": 1.8182002127845043e-12}, {"id": 569, "seek": 162986, "start": 1629.86, "end": 1635.26, "text": " And this is where the transparency of the pipeline architecture proves its worth all over again,", "tokens": [50365, 400, 341, 307, 689, 264, 17131, 295, 264, 15517, 9482, 25019, 1080, 3163, 439, 670, 797, 11, 50635], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1568610901926078, "compression_ratio": 1.5924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 2.6043969498373842e-12}, {"id": 570, "seek": 162986, "start": 1635.32, "end": 1635.6599999999999, "text": " isn't it?", "tokens": [50638, 1943, 380, 309, 30, 50655], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1568610901926078, "compression_ratio": 1.5924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 2.6043969498373842e-12}, {"id": 571, "seek": 162986, "start": 1635.8799999999999, "end": 1636.24, "text": " Absolutely.", "tokens": [50666, 7021, 13, 50684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1568610901926078, "compression_ratio": 1.5924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 2.6043969498373842e-12}, {"id": 572, "seek": 162986, "start": 1636.86, "end": 1640.3999999999999, "text": " In this architecture, failure is treated as highly valuable data.", "tokens": [50715, 682, 341, 9482, 11, 7763, 307, 8668, 382, 5405, 8263, 1412, 13, 50892], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1568610901926078, "compression_ratio": 1.5924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 2.6043969498373842e-12}, {"id": 573, "seek": 162986, "start": 1640.84, "end": 1641.78, "text": " Think about the alternative.", "tokens": [50914, 6557, 466, 264, 8535, 13, 50961], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1568610901926078, "compression_ratio": 1.5924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 2.6043969498373842e-12}, {"id": 574, "seek": 162986, "start": 1642.1999999999998, "end": 1642.4199999999998, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50982, 1779, 13, 50993], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1568610901926078, "compression_ratio": 1.5924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 2.6043969498373842e-12}, {"id": 575, "seek": 162986, "start": 1642.6, "end": 1649.04, "text": " If we were using a standard one-shot chat prompt, this entire failure cascade would just look", "tokens": [51002, 759, 321, 645, 1228, 257, 3832, 472, 12, 18402, 5081, 12391, 11, 341, 2302, 7763, 50080, 576, 445, 574, 51324], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1568610901926078, "compression_ratio": 1.5924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 2.6043969498373842e-12}, {"id": 576, "seek": 162986, "start": 1649.04, "end": 1651.54, "text": " like the AI wrote a slightly mediocre essay.", "tokens": [51324, 411, 264, 7318, 4114, 257, 4748, 45415, 16238, 13, 51449], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1568610901926078, "compression_ratio": 1.5924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 2.6043969498373842e-12}, {"id": 577, "seek": 162986, "start": 1651.8799999999999, "end": 1654.6999999999998, "text": " We would have no idea that a massive internal debate happened.", "tokens": [51466, 492, 576, 362, 572, 1558, 300, 257, 5994, 6920, 7958, 2011, 13, 51607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1568610901926078, "compression_ratio": 1.5924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 2.6043969498373842e-12}, {"id": 578, "seek": 165470, "start": 1654.7, "end": 1661.72, "text": " But because this pipeline physically saved draft.md and separately saved review.md, we can definitively", "tokens": [50365, 583, 570, 341, 15517, 9762, 6624, 11206, 13, 76, 67, 293, 14759, 6624, 3131, 13, 76, 67, 11, 321, 393, 28152, 356, 50716], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11758505144426899, "compression_ratio": 1.6928327645051195, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201210496062494e-12}, {"id": 579, "seek": 165470, "start": 1661.72, "end": 1663.74, "text": " prove that the system represented the error.", "tokens": [50716, 7081, 300, 264, 1185, 10379, 264, 6713, 13, 50817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11758505144426899, "compression_ratio": 1.6928327645051195, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201210496062494e-12}, {"id": 580, "seek": 165470, "start": 1663.96, "end": 1666.8, "text": " We know the 8B model saw it and articulated it perfectly.", "tokens": [50828, 492, 458, 264, 1649, 33, 2316, 1866, 309, 293, 43322, 309, 6239, 13, 50970], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11758505144426899, "compression_ratio": 1.6928327645051195, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201210496062494e-12}, {"id": 581, "seek": 165470, "start": 1666.92, "end": 1667.18, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50976, 1779, 13, 50989], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11758505144426899, "compression_ratio": 1.6928327645051195, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201210496062494e-12}, {"id": 582, "seek": 165470, "start": 1667.4, "end": 1672.5800000000002, "text": " But we also know that the 3B model lacked the generative capacity to execute the repair.", "tokens": [51000, 583, 321, 611, 458, 300, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 41481, 264, 1337, 1166, 6042, 281, 14483, 264, 10535, 13, 51259], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11758505144426899, "compression_ratio": 1.6928327645051195, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201210496062494e-12}, {"id": 583, "seek": 165470, "start": 1672.8400000000001, "end": 1676.6000000000001, "text": " So we could distinguish between a failure of recognition and a failure of intervention.", "tokens": [51272, 407, 321, 727, 20206, 1296, 257, 7763, 295, 11150, 293, 257, 7763, 295, 13176, 13, 51460], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11758505144426899, "compression_ratio": 1.6928327645051195, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201210496062494e-12}, {"id": 584, "seek": 165470, "start": 1677.04, "end": 1680.54, "text": " The system recognized the fire, but it didn't have the water to put it out.", "tokens": [51482, 440, 1185, 9823, 264, 2610, 11, 457, 309, 994, 380, 362, 264, 1281, 281, 829, 309, 484, 13, 51657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11758505144426899, "compression_ratio": 1.6928327645051195, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201210496062494e-12}, {"id": 585, "seek": 165470, "start": 1680.68, "end": 1681.7, "text": " That's a great way to put it.", "tokens": [51664, 663, 311, 257, 869, 636, 281, 829, 309, 13, 51715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11758505144426899, "compression_ratio": 1.6928327645051195, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201210496062494e-12}, {"id": 586, "seek": 168170, "start": 1681.7, "end": 1688.4, "text": " Furthermore, it proves that iterative criticism, you know, the popular idea of just looping critique", "tokens": [50365, 23999, 11, 309, 25019, 300, 17138, 1166, 15835, 11, 291, 458, 11, 264, 3743, 1558, 295, 445, 6367, 278, 25673, 50700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10667063314703447, "compression_ratio": 1.6043478260869566, "no_speech_prob": 2.0522513809878573e-12}, {"id": 587, "seek": 168170, "start": 1688.4, "end": 1694.38, "text": " and revise in a chat window over and over until the text is perfect, does not mathematically", "tokens": [50700, 293, 44252, 294, 257, 5081, 4910, 670, 293, 670, 1826, 264, 2487, 307, 2176, 11, 775, 406, 44003, 50999], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10667063314703447, "compression_ratio": 1.6043478260869566, "no_speech_prob": 2.0522513809878573e-12}, {"id": 588, "seek": 168170, "start": 1694.38, "end": 1696.22, "text": " guarantee convergence on a good essay.", "tokens": [50999, 10815, 32181, 322, 257, 665, 16238, 13, 51091], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10667063314703447, "compression_ratio": 1.6043478260869566, "no_speech_prob": 2.0522513809878573e-12}, {"id": 589, "seek": 168170, "start": 1696.38, "end": 1701.54, "text": " Because if diagnostic competence and repair competence are entirely independent variables,", "tokens": [51099, 1436, 498, 27897, 39965, 293, 10535, 39965, 366, 7696, 6695, 9102, 11, 51357], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10667063314703447, "compression_ratio": 1.6043478260869566, "no_speech_prob": 2.0522513809878573e-12}, {"id": 590, "seek": 168170, "start": 1701.8600000000001, "end": 1704.18, "text": " you might just get stuck in an infinite loop.", "tokens": [51373, 291, 1062, 445, 483, 5541, 294, 364, 13785, 6367, 13, 51489], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10667063314703447, "compression_ratio": 1.6043478260869566, "no_speech_prob": 2.0522513809878573e-12}, {"id": 591, "seek": 170418, "start": 1704.18, "end": 1710.14, "text": " Yes, where the system repeatedly identifies the exact same defect, but the revising model", "tokens": [50365, 1079, 11, 689, 264, 1185, 18227, 34597, 264, 1900, 912, 16445, 11, 457, 264, 3698, 3436, 2316, 50663], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13640911322979887, "compression_ratio": 1.6075949367088607, "no_speech_prob": 1.6682368377332613e-12}, {"id": 592, "seek": 170418, "start": 1710.14, "end": 1712.6200000000001, "text": " is fundamentally incapable of repairing it.", "tokens": [50663, 307, 17879, 44174, 295, 46158, 309, 13, 50787], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13640911322979887, "compression_ratio": 1.6075949367088607, "no_speech_prob": 1.6682368377332613e-12}, {"id": 593, "seek": 170418, "start": 1712.8200000000002, "end": 1714.1000000000001, "text": " Resulting in a total stalemate.", "tokens": [50797, 5015, 723, 278, 294, 257, 3217, 49875, 443, 473, 13, 50861], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13640911322979887, "compression_ratio": 1.6075949367088607, "no_speech_prob": 1.6682368377332613e-12}, {"id": 594, "seek": 170418, "start": 1714.26, "end": 1714.6200000000001, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50869, 7587, 13, 50887], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13640911322979887, "compression_ratio": 1.6075949367088607, "no_speech_prob": 1.6682368377332613e-12}, {"id": 595, "seek": 170418, "start": 1714.94, "end": 1719.9, "text": " So if repairing a fully written draft is this fraught with failure, if the AI gets paralyzed", "tokens": [50903, 407, 498, 46158, 257, 4498, 3720, 11206, 307, 341, 6600, 1599, 365, 7763, 11, 498, 264, 7318, 2170, 41919, 51151], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13640911322979887, "compression_ratio": 1.6075949367088607, "no_speech_prob": 1.6682368377332613e-12}, {"id": 596, "seek": 170418, "start": 1719.9, "end": 1724.42, "text": " because it just doesn't possess the latent knowledge to fix a structural error once it", "tokens": [51151, 570, 309, 445, 1177, 380, 17490, 264, 48994, 3601, 281, 3191, 257, 15067, 6713, 1564, 309, 51377], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13640911322979887, "compression_ratio": 1.6075949367088607, "no_speech_prob": 1.6682368377332613e-12}, {"id": 597, "seek": 170418, "start": 1724.42, "end": 1726.98, "text": " is baked into five paragraphs of dense prose.", "tokens": [51377, 307, 19453, 666, 1732, 48910, 295, 18011, 12505, 13, 51505], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13640911322979887, "compression_ratio": 1.6075949367088607, "no_speech_prob": 1.6682368377332613e-12}, {"id": 598, "seek": 170418, "start": 1727.0800000000002, "end": 1727.26, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51510, 1779, 13, 51519], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13640911322979887, "compression_ratio": 1.6075949367088607, "no_speech_prob": 1.6682368377332613e-12}, {"id": 599, "seek": 170418, "start": 1727.76, "end": 1732.42, "text": " How on earth does this pipeline prevent these catastrophic errors from cascading in the first place?", "tokens": [51544, 1012, 322, 4120, 775, 341, 15517, 4871, 613, 34915, 13603, 490, 3058, 66, 8166, 294, 264, 700, 1081, 30, 51777], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13640911322979887, "compression_ratio": 1.6075949367088607, "no_speech_prob": 1.6682368377332613e-12}, {"id": 600, "seek": 173242, "start": 1732.42, "end": 1737.28, "text": " By enforcing a strict planning phase before a single sentence of prose is allowed to be", "tokens": [50365, 3146, 25495, 2175, 257, 10910, 5038, 5574, 949, 257, 2167, 8174, 295, 12505, 307, 4350, 281, 312, 50608], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 601, "seek": 173242, "start": 1737.28, "end": 1737.7, "text": " generated.", "tokens": [50608, 10833, 13, 50629], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 602, "seek": 173242, "start": 1737.8400000000001, "end": 1738.2, "text": " Ah.", "tokens": [50636, 2438, 13, 50654], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 603, "seek": 173242, "start": 1738.8000000000002, "end": 1743.72, "text": " The very first active step of this pipeline isn't drafting, it is outlining.", "tokens": [50684, 440, 588, 700, 4967, 1823, 295, 341, 15517, 1943, 380, 46378, 11, 309, 307, 484, 31079, 13, 50930], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 604, "seek": 173242, "start": 1744.02, "end": 1746.14, "text": " The outline as an argumentative blueprint.", "tokens": [50945, 440, 16387, 382, 364, 6770, 1166, 35868, 13, 51051], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 605, "seek": 173242, "start": 1746.48, "end": 1747.94, "text": " Let's get deeply into this.", "tokens": [51068, 961, 311, 483, 8760, 666, 341, 13, 51141], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 606, "seek": 173242, "start": 1748.0600000000002, "end": 1748.92, "text": " It's a crucial step.", "tokens": [51147, 467, 311, 257, 11462, 1823, 13, 51190], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 607, "seek": 173242, "start": 1749.14, "end": 1752.68, "text": " Because anyone who has used an LLM has seen it just start rambling.", "tokens": [51201, 1436, 2878, 567, 575, 1143, 364, 441, 43, 44, 575, 1612, 309, 445, 722, 367, 19391, 13, 51378], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 608, "seek": 173242, "start": 1753.0, "end": 1757.42, "text": " Like it associates one word with the next and suddenly a paragraph about software engineering", "tokens": [51394, 1743, 309, 36914, 472, 1349, 365, 264, 958, 293, 5800, 257, 18865, 466, 4722, 7043, 51615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 609, "seek": 173242, "start": 1757.42, "end": 1760.22, "text": " turns into a tangent about the history of the abacus.", "tokens": [51615, 4523, 666, 257, 27747, 466, 264, 2503, 295, 264, 410, 326, 301, 13, 51755], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12951908414326016, "compression_ratio": 1.6233333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.4668397789810439e-12}, {"id": 610, "seek": 176022, "start": 1760.22, "end": 1761.58, "text": " We've all seen it happen.", "tokens": [50365, 492, 600, 439, 1612, 309, 1051, 13, 50433], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10617551397770009, "compression_ratio": 1.6130268199233717, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349459542626011e-12}, {"id": 611, "seek": 176022, "start": 1762.54, "end": 1767.56, "text": " The paper argues that certain types of errors are vastly cheaper to prevent at the level", "tokens": [50481, 440, 3035, 38218, 300, 1629, 3467, 295, 13603, 366, 41426, 12284, 281, 4871, 412, 264, 1496, 50732], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10617551397770009, "compression_ratio": 1.6130268199233717, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349459542626011e-12}, {"id": 612, "seek": 176022, "start": 1767.56, "end": 1772.72, "text": " of high-level structure than they are to repair after they have been realized across several", "tokens": [50732, 295, 1090, 12, 12418, 3877, 813, 436, 366, 281, 10535, 934, 436, 362, 668, 5334, 2108, 2940, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10617551397770009, "compression_ratio": 1.6130268199233717, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349459542626011e-12}, {"id": 613, "seek": 176022, "start": 1772.72, "end": 1774.18, "text": " pages of generated prose.", "tokens": [50990, 7183, 295, 10833, 12505, 13, 51063], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10617551397770009, "compression_ratio": 1.6130268199233717, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349459542626011e-12}, {"id": 614, "seek": 176022, "start": 1774.32, "end": 1774.96, "text": " Makes sense.", "tokens": [51070, 25245, 2020, 13, 51102], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10617551397770009, "compression_ratio": 1.6130268199233717, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349459542626011e-12}, {"id": 615, "seek": 176022, "start": 1775.24, "end": 1779.78, "text": " An essay isn't just a random sequence of acceptable sentences strung together.", "tokens": [51116, 1107, 16238, 1943, 380, 445, 257, 4974, 8310, 295, 15513, 16579, 1056, 1063, 1214, 13, 51343], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10617551397770009, "compression_ratio": 1.6130268199233717, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349459542626011e-12}, {"id": 616, "seek": 176022, "start": 1780.48, "end": 1785.82, "text": " Its core identity depends on complex relations that are distributed across the entire document.", "tokens": [51378, 6953, 4965, 6575, 5946, 322, 3997, 2299, 300, 366, 12631, 2108, 264, 2302, 4166, 13, 51645], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10617551397770009, "compression_ratio": 1.6130268199233717, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349459542626011e-12}, {"id": 617, "seek": 178582, "start": 1785.82, "end": 1786.26, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 13, 50387], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14549103237333752, "compression_ratio": 1.4910714285714286, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735444631320705e-12}, {"id": 618, "seek": 178582, "start": 1786.3999999999999, "end": 1791.84, "text": " Like a definition established on page one strictly constrains the conclusions you are logically", "tokens": [50394, 1743, 257, 7123, 7545, 322, 3028, 472, 20792, 11525, 1292, 264, 22865, 291, 366, 38887, 50666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14549103237333752, "compression_ratio": 1.4910714285714286, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735444631320705e-12}, {"id": 619, "seek": 178582, "start": 1791.84, "end": 1793.46, "text": " allowed to draw on page five.", "tokens": [50666, 4350, 281, 2642, 322, 3028, 1732, 13, 50747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14549103237333752, "compression_ratio": 1.4910714285714286, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735444631320705e-12}, {"id": 620, "seek": 178582, "start": 1793.62, "end": 1794.1399999999999, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [50755, 48746, 736, 13, 50781], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14549103237333752, "compression_ratio": 1.4910714285714286, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735444631320705e-12}, {"id": 621, "seek": 178582, "start": 1794.6399999999999, "end": 1799.28, "text": " And if you don't force the model to plan that dependency out in advance, the AI will", "tokens": [50806, 400, 498, 291, 500, 380, 3464, 264, 2316, 281, 1393, 300, 33621, 484, 294, 7295, 11, 264, 7318, 486, 51038], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14549103237333752, "compression_ratio": 1.4910714285714286, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735444631320705e-12}, {"id": 622, "seek": 178582, "start": 1799.28, "end": 1802.4399999999998, "text": " just blindly paint itself into a logical corner by page three.", "tokens": [51038, 445, 47744, 4225, 2564, 666, 257, 14978, 4538, 538, 3028, 1045, 13, 51196], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14549103237333752, "compression_ratio": 1.4910714285714286, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735444631320705e-12}, {"id": 623, "seek": 178582, "start": 1802.54, "end": 1805.08, "text": " So how does the outlining prompt fix this?", "tokens": [51201, 407, 577, 775, 264, 484, 31079, 12391, 3191, 341, 30, 51328], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14549103237333752, "compression_ratio": 1.4910714285714286, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735444631320705e-12}, {"id": 624, "seek": 180508, "start": 1805.08, "end": 1810.74, "text": " The outlining prompt in this pipeline forces the AI to define a central argument, articulate", "tokens": [50365, 440, 484, 31079, 12391, 294, 341, 15517, 5874, 264, 7318, 281, 6964, 257, 5777, 6770, 11, 30305, 50648], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 625, "seek": 180508, "start": 1810.74, "end": 1816.46, "text": " a specific conceptual problem, state a thesis, map out logically dependent sections, and crucially", "tokens": [50648, 257, 2685, 24106, 1154, 11, 1785, 257, 22288, 11, 4471, 484, 38887, 12334, 10863, 11, 293, 5140, 1909, 50934], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 626, "seek": 180508, "start": 1816.46, "end": 1819.6399999999999, "text": " anticipate a serious counter-argument or objection.", "tokens": [50934, 21685, 257, 3156, 5682, 12, 33544, 2206, 420, 35756, 13, 51093], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 627, "seek": 180508, "start": 1820.04, "end": 1820.5, "text": " Oh wow.", "tokens": [51113, 876, 6076, 13, 51136], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 628, "seek": 180508, "start": 1820.58, "end": 1822.46, "text": " It forces it to anticipate objections.", "tokens": [51140, 467, 5874, 309, 281, 21685, 44649, 13, 51234], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 629, "seek": 180508, "start": 1822.6999999999998, "end": 1823.0, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51246, 1079, 13, 51261], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 630, "seek": 180508, "start": 1823.3999999999999, "end": 1826.48, "text": " It demands what computer scientists call an intermediate representation.", "tokens": [51281, 467, 15107, 437, 3820, 7708, 818, 364, 19376, 10290, 13, 51435], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 631, "seek": 180508, "start": 1827.26, "end": 1829.6799999999998, "text": " The outline isn't just a mini-essay or a summary.", "tokens": [51474, 440, 16387, 1943, 380, 445, 257, 8382, 12, 442, 320, 420, 257, 12691, 13, 51595], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 632, "seek": 180508, "start": 1829.86, "end": 1830.6399999999999, "text": " Then what is it?", "tokens": [51604, 1396, 437, 307, 309, 30, 51643], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 633, "seek": 180508, "start": 1830.74, "end": 1833.6599999999999, "text": " It is quite literally a dependency graph of claims.", "tokens": [51648, 467, 307, 1596, 3736, 257, 33621, 4295, 295, 9441, 13, 51794], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11821674088300285, "compression_ratio": 1.6909722222222223, "no_speech_prob": 1.661987604831272e-12}, {"id": 634, "seek": 183366, "start": 1833.66, "end": 1837.26, "text": " When you say dependency graph, you mean like a flowchart of logic?", "tokens": [50365, 1133, 291, 584, 33621, 4295, 11, 291, 914, 411, 257, 3095, 339, 446, 295, 9952, 30, 50545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 635, "seek": 183366, "start": 1837.5, "end": 1837.76, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50557, 1079, 13, 50570], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 636, "seek": 183366, "start": 1838.3400000000001, "end": 1840.0800000000002, "text": " Think of it as a strict logical map.", "tokens": [50599, 6557, 295, 309, 382, 257, 10910, 14978, 4471, 13, 50686], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 637, "seek": 183366, "start": 1840.66, "end": 1845.64, "text": " The outline states that claim B mathematically or logically depends on claim A being firmly", "tokens": [50715, 440, 16387, 4368, 300, 3932, 363, 44003, 420, 38887, 5946, 322, 3932, 316, 885, 20031, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 638, "seek": 183366, "start": 1845.64, "end": 1846.48, "text": " established first.", "tokens": [50964, 7545, 700, 13, 51006], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 639, "seek": 183366, "start": 1846.5600000000002, "end": 1847.02, "text": " Okay, I see.", "tokens": [51010, 1033, 11, 286, 536, 13, 51033], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 640, "seek": 183366, "start": 1847.3200000000002, "end": 1851.76, "text": " The outline maps this entire web of dependencies out before any actual prose is generated.", "tokens": [51048, 440, 16387, 11317, 341, 2302, 3670, 295, 36606, 484, 949, 604, 3539, 12505, 307, 10833, 13, 51270], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 641, "seek": 183366, "start": 1852.38, "end": 1858.5400000000002, "text": " And the paper formalizes the absolute necessity of this in Proposition 6.2, non-decreasing", "tokens": [51301, 400, 264, 3035, 9860, 5660, 264, 8236, 24217, 295, 341, 294, 21944, 5830, 1386, 13, 17, 11, 2107, 12, 1479, 14066, 3349, 51609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 642, "seek": 183366, "start": 1858.5400000000002, "end": 1859.8000000000002, "text": " downstream repair costs.", "tokens": [51609, 30621, 10535, 5497, 13, 51672], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 643, "seek": 183366, "start": 1859.8200000000002, "end": 1862.28, "text": " Okay, I want to unpack the math of Proposition 6.2.", "tokens": [51673, 1033, 11, 286, 528, 281, 26699, 264, 5221, 295, 21944, 5830, 1386, 13, 17, 13, 51796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12244047859842463, "compression_ratio": 1.6700680272108843, "no_speech_prob": 1.9205945427785975e-12}, {"id": 644, "seek": 186228, "start": 1862.28, "end": 1864.3, "text": " Non-Decreasing Downstream Repair Cost.", "tokens": [50365, 8774, 12, 35, 3045, 265, 3349, 9506, 9291, 3696, 1246, 20863, 13, 50466], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1880933277642549, "compression_ratio": 1.4224598930481283, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750236180723688e-12}, {"id": 645, "seek": 186228, "start": 1864.46, "end": 1866.34, "text": " What is that telling us about how we should write?", "tokens": [50474, 708, 307, 300, 3585, 505, 466, 577, 321, 820, 2464, 30, 50568], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1880933277642549, "compression_ratio": 1.4224598930481283, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750236180723688e-12}, {"id": 646, "seek": 186228, "start": 1866.56, "end": 1872.44, "text": " The proposition proves that if a foundational structural error, say, relying on a completely", "tokens": [50579, 440, 24830, 25019, 300, 498, 257, 32195, 15067, 6713, 11, 584, 11, 24140, 322, 257, 2584, 50873], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1880933277642549, "compression_ratio": 1.4224598930481283, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750236180723688e-12}, {"id": 647, "seek": 186228, "start": 1872.44, "end": 1878.08, "text": " false dichotomy or a broken definition, is made early in a text generation process,", "tokens": [50873, 7908, 10390, 310, 8488, 420, 257, 5463, 7123, 11, 307, 1027, 2440, 294, 257, 2487, 5125, 1399, 11, 51155], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1880933277642549, "compression_ratio": 1.4224598930481283, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750236180723688e-12}, {"id": 648, "seek": 187808, "start": 1878.08, "end": 1884.46, "text": " the computational and semantic cost of repairing that specific error only increases as more", "tokens": [50365, 264, 28270, 293, 47982, 2063, 295, 46158, 300, 2685, 6713, 787, 8637, 382, 544, 50684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1163118535822088, "compression_ratio": 1.6073059360730593, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858791059877864e-12}, {"id": 649, "seek": 187808, "start": 1884.46, "end": 1886.02, "text": " text is generated based on it.", "tokens": [50684, 2487, 307, 10833, 2361, 322, 309, 13, 50762], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1163118535822088, "compression_ratio": 1.6073059360730593, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858791059877864e-12}, {"id": 650, "seek": 187808, "start": 1886.1399999999999, "end": 1887.24, "text": " Oh, that makes total sense.", "tokens": [50768, 876, 11, 300, 1669, 3217, 2020, 13, 50823], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1163118535822088, "compression_ratio": 1.6073059360730593, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858791059877864e-12}, {"id": 651, "seek": 187808, "start": 1887.46, "end": 1892.9399999999998, "text": " Every single new paragraph that builds on that false distinction exponentially increases", "tokens": [50834, 2048, 2167, 777, 18865, 300, 15182, 322, 300, 7908, 16844, 37330, 8637, 51108], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1163118535822088, "compression_ratio": 1.6073059360730593, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858791059877864e-12}, {"id": 652, "seek": 187808, "start": 1892.9399999999998, "end": 1896.6999999999998, "text": " the amount of collateral damage you have to deal with when you finally try to uproot", "tokens": [51108, 264, 2372, 295, 41875, 4344, 291, 362, 281, 2028, 365, 562, 291, 2721, 853, 281, 493, 44147, 51296], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1163118535822088, "compression_ratio": 1.6073059360730593, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858791059877864e-12}, {"id": 653, "seek": 187808, "start": 1896.6999999999998, "end": 1898.22, "text": " and fix the original error.", "tokens": [51296, 293, 3191, 264, 3380, 6713, 13, 51372], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1163118535822088, "compression_ratio": 1.6073059360730593, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858791059877864e-12}, {"id": 654, "seek": 189822, "start": 1898.22, "end": 1898.82, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50395], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965864181518555, "compression_ratio": 1.606694560669456, "no_speech_prob": 1.7080600172095228e-12}, {"id": 655, "seek": 189822, "start": 1899.08, "end": 1902.96, "text": " Because if you wait until the very end of the essay to fix the foundation, you literally", "tokens": [50408, 1436, 498, 291, 1699, 1826, 264, 588, 917, 295, 264, 16238, 281, 3191, 264, 7030, 11, 291, 3736, 50602], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965864181518555, "compression_ratio": 1.606694560669456, "no_speech_prob": 1.7080600172095228e-12}, {"id": 656, "seek": 189822, "start": 1902.96, "end": 1904.4, "text": " have to tear down the entire house.", "tokens": [50602, 362, 281, 12556, 760, 264, 2302, 1782, 13, 50674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965864181518555, "compression_ratio": 1.606694560669456, "no_speech_prob": 1.7080600172095228e-12}, {"id": 657, "seek": 189822, "start": 1904.56, "end": 1904.78, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50682, 1779, 13, 50693], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965864181518555, "compression_ratio": 1.606694560669456, "no_speech_prob": 1.7080600172095228e-12}, {"id": 658, "seek": 189822, "start": 1905.14, "end": 1908.3, "text": " Every sentence that references the bad premise has to be rewritten.", "tokens": [50711, 2048, 8174, 300, 15400, 264, 1578, 22045, 575, 281, 312, 319, 26859, 13, 50869], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965864181518555, "compression_ratio": 1.606694560669456, "no_speech_prob": 1.7080600172095228e-12}, {"id": 659, "seek": 189822, "start": 1908.66, "end": 1913.76, "text": " But if you catch and fix the bad foundation, while it is just a single bullet point on", "tokens": [50887, 583, 498, 291, 3745, 293, 3191, 264, 1578, 7030, 11, 1339, 309, 307, 445, 257, 2167, 11632, 935, 322, 51142], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965864181518555, "compression_ratio": 1.606694560669456, "no_speech_prob": 1.7080600172095228e-12}, {"id": 660, "seek": 189822, "start": 1913.76, "end": 1917.82, "text": " a blueprint, the outline stage, it's incredibly cheap.", "tokens": [51142, 257, 35868, 11, 264, 16387, 3233, 11, 309, 311, 6252, 7084, 13, 51345], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965864181518555, "compression_ratio": 1.606694560669456, "no_speech_prob": 1.7080600172095228e-12}, {"id": 661, "seek": 189822, "start": 1917.88, "end": 1919.5, "text": " You just delete one line of text.", "tokens": [51348, 509, 445, 12097, 472, 1622, 295, 2487, 13, 51429], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965864181518555, "compression_ratio": 1.606694560669456, "no_speech_prob": 1.7080600172095228e-12}, {"id": 662, "seek": 191950, "start": 1919.5, "end": 1922.72, "text": " That is the exact mathematical justification.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 264, 1900, 18894, 31591, 13, 50526], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 663, "seek": 191950, "start": 1923.38, "end": 1927.88, "text": " Outlining shifts some forms of repair into a highly compressed representation where their", "tokens": [50559, 5925, 31079, 19201, 512, 6422, 295, 10535, 666, 257, 5405, 30353, 10290, 689, 641, 50784], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 664, "seek": 191950, "start": 1927.88, "end": 1930.0, "text": " propagation cost is vastly lower.", "tokens": [50784, 38377, 2063, 307, 41426, 3126, 13, 50890], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 665, "seek": 191950, "start": 1930.12, "end": 1930.92, "text": " That's a great summary.", "tokens": [50896, 663, 311, 257, 869, 12691, 13, 50936], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 666, "seek": 191950, "start": 1931.18, "end": 1934.56, "text": " But the pipeline does something very clever, almost paranoid here, doesn't it?", "tokens": [50949, 583, 264, 15517, 775, 746, 588, 13494, 11, 1920, 43948, 510, 11, 1177, 380, 309, 30, 51118], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 667, "seek": 191950, "start": 1934.8, "end": 1935.18, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51130, 1079, 13, 51149], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 668, "seek": 191950, "start": 1935.86, "end": 1938.86, "text": " It builds in a layer of informational redundancy.", "tokens": [51183, 467, 15182, 294, 257, 4583, 295, 49391, 27830, 6717, 13, 51333], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 669, "seek": 191950, "start": 1939.24, "end": 1940.04, "text": " Tell me about that.", "tokens": [51352, 5115, 385, 466, 300, 13, 51392], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 670, "seek": 191950, "start": 1940.22, "end": 1946.86, "text": " When the system finally moves from the outlining stage to the drafting stage, the 3B model isn't", "tokens": [51401, 1133, 264, 1185, 2721, 6067, 490, 264, 484, 31079, 3233, 281, 264, 46378, 3233, 11, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 1943, 380, 51733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 671, "seek": 191950, "start": 1946.86, "end": 1948.48, "text": " just handed the outline it just wrote.", "tokens": [51733, 445, 16013, 264, 16387, 309, 445, 4114, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15066200647598657, "compression_ratio": 1.6262626262626263, "no_speech_prob": 1.4724393579412798e-12}, {"id": 672, "seek": 194848, "start": 1948.48, "end": 1949.82, "text": " What else does it get?", "tokens": [50365, 708, 1646, 775, 309, 483, 30, 50432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 673, "seek": 194848, "start": 1950.14, "end": 1956.0, "text": " It is simultaneously fed both the original user-provided topic file and the newly generated", "tokens": [50448, 467, 307, 16561, 4636, 1293, 264, 3380, 4195, 12, 49911, 2112, 4829, 3991, 293, 264, 15109, 10833, 50741], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 674, "seek": 194848, "start": 1956.0, "end": 1956.8, "text": " outline file.", "tokens": [50741, 16387, 3991, 13, 50781], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 675, "seek": 194848, "start": 1956.96, "end": 1958.66, "text": " See, I'm struggling to see the logic there.", "tokens": [50789, 3008, 11, 286, 478, 9314, 281, 536, 264, 9952, 456, 13, 50874], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 676, "seek": 194848, "start": 1958.88, "end": 1959.1200000000001, "text": " Why?", "tokens": [50885, 1545, 30, 50897], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 677, "seek": 194848, "start": 1959.42, "end": 1964.98, "text": " If the outline is the ultimate blueprint for the essay, why give the AI the original topic", "tokens": [50912, 759, 264, 16387, 307, 264, 9705, 35868, 337, 264, 16238, 11, 983, 976, 264, 7318, 264, 3380, 4829, 51190], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 678, "seek": 194848, "start": 1964.98, "end": 1965.58, "text": " file too?", "tokens": [51190, 3991, 886, 30, 51220], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 679, "seek": 194848, "start": 1966.18, "end": 1970.26, "text": " Isn't the outline supposed to be the perfected, final summary of what needs to be done?", "tokens": [51250, 6998, 380, 264, 16387, 3442, 281, 312, 264, 2176, 292, 11, 2572, 12691, 295, 437, 2203, 281, 312, 1096, 30, 51454], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 680, "seek": 194848, "start": 1970.52, "end": 1971.24, "text": " You'd think so.", "tokens": [51467, 509, 1116, 519, 370, 13, 51503], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 681, "seek": 194848, "start": 1971.32, "end": 1973.78, "text": " Why clutter its context window with the old prompt?", "tokens": [51507, 1545, 40614, 1080, 4319, 4910, 365, 264, 1331, 12391, 30, 51630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1266716851128472, "compression_ratio": 1.6692307692307693, "no_speech_prob": 2.0524372132402213e-12}, {"id": 682, "seek": 197378, "start": 1973.78, "end": 1980.26, "text": " If we connect this to the bigger picture, this touches on Proposition 4.3, safe retention", "tokens": [50365, 759, 321, 1745, 341, 281, 264, 3801, 3036, 11, 341, 17431, 322, 21944, 5830, 1017, 13, 18, 11, 3273, 22871, 50689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14625950960012582, "compression_ratio": 1.7471698113207548, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832384673437281e-12}, {"id": 683, "seek": 197378, "start": 1980.26, "end": 1981.62, "text": " under uncertain sufficiency.", "tokens": [50689, 833, 11308, 459, 49086, 13, 50757], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14625950960012582, "compression_ratio": 1.7471698113207548, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832384673437281e-12}, {"id": 684, "seek": 197378, "start": 1982.1, "end": 1984.1399999999999, "text": " Safe retention under uncertain sufficiency.", "tokens": [50781, 27030, 22871, 833, 11308, 459, 49086, 13, 50883], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14625950960012582, "compression_ratio": 1.7471698113207548, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832384673437281e-12}, {"id": 685, "seek": 197378, "start": 1984.52, "end": 1990.04, "text": " The author argues that we cannot simply trust that the generated outline is a perfect, lossless", "tokens": [50902, 440, 3793, 38218, 300, 321, 2644, 2935, 3361, 300, 264, 10833, 16387, 307, 257, 2176, 11, 4470, 1832, 51178], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14625950960012582, "compression_ratio": 1.7471698113207548, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832384673437281e-12}, {"id": 686, "seek": 197378, "start": 1990.04, "end": 1992.24, "text": " compression of the original topic prompt.", "tokens": [51178, 19355, 295, 264, 3380, 4829, 12391, 13, 51288], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14625950960012582, "compression_ratio": 1.7471698113207548, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832384673437281e-12}, {"id": 687, "seek": 197378, "start": 1992.3, "end": 1993.3, "text": " A lossless compression.", "tokens": [51291, 316, 4470, 1832, 19355, 13, 51341], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14625950960012582, "compression_ratio": 1.7471698113207548, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832384673437281e-12}, {"id": 688, "seek": 197378, "start": 1993.6399999999999, "end": 1998.5, "text": " Meaning we can't guarantee the AI didn't accidentally forget something incredibly important when it", "tokens": [51358, 19948, 321, 393, 380, 10815, 264, 7318, 994, 380, 15715, 2870, 746, 6252, 1021, 562, 309, 51601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14625950960012582, "compression_ratio": 1.7471698113207548, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832384673437281e-12}, {"id": 689, "seek": 197378, "start": 1998.5, "end": 2000.1, "text": " summarized the prompt into an outline.", "tokens": [51601, 14611, 1602, 264, 12391, 666, 364, 16387, 13, 51681], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14625950960012582, "compression_ratio": 1.7471698113207548, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832384673437281e-12}, {"id": 690, "seek": 200010, "start": 2000.1, "end": 2000.54, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50387], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10941038981522663, "compression_ratio": 1.5657370517928286, "no_speech_prob": 2.1423529183300927e-12}, {"id": 691, "seek": 200010, "start": 2001.54, "end": 2006.62, "text": " What if the original user prompt contained a highly specific, subtle nuance about the", "tokens": [50437, 708, 498, 264, 3380, 4195, 12391, 16212, 257, 5405, 2685, 11, 13743, 42625, 466, 264, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10941038981522663, "compression_ratio": 1.5657370517928286, "no_speech_prob": 2.1423529183300927e-12}, {"id": 692, "seek": 200010, "start": 2006.62, "end": 2007.4599999999998, "text": " tone of the essay?", "tokens": [50691, 8027, 295, 264, 16238, 30, 50733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10941038981522663, "compression_ratio": 1.5657370517928286, "no_speech_prob": 2.1423529183300927e-12}, {"id": 693, "seek": 200010, "start": 2008.12, "end": 2013.34, "text": " Or a secondary constraint that the AI just failed to include in its bullet points?", "tokens": [50766, 1610, 257, 11396, 25534, 300, 264, 7318, 445, 7612, 281, 4090, 294, 1080, 11632, 2793, 30, 51027], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10941038981522663, "compression_ratio": 1.5657370517928286, "no_speech_prob": 2.1423529183300927e-12}, {"id": 694, "seek": 200010, "start": 2013.4599999999998, "end": 2013.6399999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51033, 1779, 13, 51042], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10941038981522663, "compression_ratio": 1.5657370517928286, "no_speech_prob": 2.1423529183300927e-12}, {"id": 695, "seek": 200010, "start": 2013.7199999999998, "end": 2019.4599999999998, "text": " If the drafter model is only allowed to see the outline, that original nuance is gone forever.", "tokens": [51046, 759, 264, 1617, 828, 2316, 307, 787, 4350, 281, 536, 264, 16387, 11, 300, 3380, 42625, 307, 2780, 5680, 13, 51333], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10941038981522663, "compression_ratio": 1.5657370517928286, "no_speech_prob": 2.1423529183300927e-12}, {"id": 696, "seek": 200010, "start": 2019.58, "end": 2022.2199999999998, "text": " It's an irreversible informational bottleneck.", "tokens": [51339, 467, 311, 364, 16014, 840, 964, 49391, 44641, 547, 13, 51471], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10941038981522663, "compression_ratio": 1.5657370517928286, "no_speech_prob": 2.1423529183300927e-12}, {"id": 697, "seek": 200010, "start": 2022.3, "end": 2024.1999999999998, "text": " It's the classic game of broken telephone.", "tokens": [51475, 467, 311, 264, 7230, 1216, 295, 5463, 19800, 13, 51570], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10941038981522663, "compression_ratio": 1.5657370517928286, "no_speech_prob": 2.1423529183300927e-12}, {"id": 698, "seek": 200010, "start": 2024.4399999999998, "end": 2024.78, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51582, 1079, 13, 51599], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10941038981522663, "compression_ratio": 1.5657370517928286, "no_speech_prob": 2.1423529183300927e-12}, {"id": 699, "seek": 202478, "start": 2024.78, "end": 2029.58, "text": " Like, if the human whispers the topic to the outliner and the outliner whispers a summary", "tokens": [50365, 1743, 11, 498, 264, 1952, 315, 31018, 264, 4829, 281, 264, 484, 36849, 293, 264, 484, 36849, 315, 31018, 257, 12691, 50605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07772356492501718, "compression_ratio": 1.8846153846153846, "no_speech_prob": 2.0761159718468702e-12}, {"id": 700, "seek": 202478, "start": 2029.58, "end": 2033.24, "text": " to the drafter, the original message inevitably gets distorted.", "tokens": [50605, 281, 264, 1617, 828, 11, 264, 3380, 3636, 28171, 2170, 33431, 13, 50788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07772356492501718, "compression_ratio": 1.8846153846153846, "no_speech_prob": 2.0761159718468702e-12}, {"id": 701, "seek": 202478, "start": 2033.86, "end": 2038.76, "text": " But by giving the drafter the original topic file alongside the outline, you are effectively", "tokens": [50819, 583, 538, 2902, 264, 1617, 828, 264, 3380, 4829, 3991, 12385, 264, 16387, 11, 291, 366, 8659, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07772356492501718, "compression_ratio": 1.8846153846153846, "no_speech_prob": 2.0761159718468702e-12}, {"id": 702, "seek": 202478, "start": 2038.76, "end": 2043.06, "text": " letting the drafter double-check the outline against the raw source material.", "tokens": [51064, 8295, 264, 1617, 828, 3834, 12, 15723, 264, 16387, 1970, 264, 8936, 4009, 2527, 13, 51279], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07772356492501718, "compression_ratio": 1.8846153846153846, "no_speech_prob": 2.0761159718468702e-12}, {"id": 703, "seek": 202478, "start": 2043.32, "end": 2047.56, "text": " The architecture retains the original topic because the storage cost of a tiny text file", "tokens": [51292, 440, 9482, 1533, 2315, 264, 3380, 4829, 570, 264, 6725, 2063, 295, 257, 5870, 2487, 3991, 51504], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07772356492501718, "compression_ratio": 1.8846153846153846, "no_speech_prob": 2.0761159718468702e-12}, {"id": 704, "seek": 202478, "start": 2047.56, "end": 2052.1, "text": " is negligible, but the expected informational benefit is massively positive.", "tokens": [51504, 307, 32570, 964, 11, 457, 264, 5176, 49391, 5121, 307, 29379, 3353, 13, 51731], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07772356492501718, "compression_ratio": 1.8846153846153846, "no_speech_prob": 2.0761159718468702e-12}, {"id": 705, "seek": 205210, "start": 2052.1, "end": 2054.18, "text": " It actively prevents structural drift.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 13022, 22367, 15067, 19699, 13, 50469], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 706, "seek": 205210, "start": 2055.12, "end": 2059.8199999999997, "text": " It forces the drafting model to remain tightly constrained by the original problem statement,", "tokens": [50516, 467, 5874, 264, 46378, 2316, 281, 6222, 21952, 38901, 538, 264, 3380, 1154, 5629, 11, 50751], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 707, "seek": 205210, "start": 2060.2799999999997, "end": 2063.66, "text": " even if its own planning stage slightly distorted or oversimplified it.", "tokens": [50774, 754, 498, 1080, 1065, 5038, 3233, 4748, 33431, 420, 15488, 332, 564, 2587, 309, 13, 50943], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 708, "seek": 205210, "start": 2063.8199999999997, "end": 2064.7599999999998, "text": " That is so smart.", "tokens": [50951, 663, 307, 370, 4069, 13, 50998], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 709, "seek": 205210, "start": 2065.1, "end": 2072.04, "text": " So we have all these highly specific, rigidly enforced stages, outlining, drafting, reviewing,", "tokens": [51015, 407, 321, 362, 439, 613, 5405, 2685, 11, 22195, 356, 40953, 10232, 11, 484, 31079, 11, 46378, 11, 19576, 11, 51362], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 710, "seek": 205210, "start": 2072.2999999999997, "end": 2072.7599999999998, "text": " revising.", "tokens": [51375, 3698, 3436, 13, 51398], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 711, "seek": 205210, "start": 2072.98, "end": 2073.24, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51409, 1079, 13, 51422], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 712, "seek": 205210, "start": 2073.6, "end": 2074.94, "text": " But I'm still caught up on the mechanics.", "tokens": [51440, 583, 286, 478, 920, 5415, 493, 322, 264, 12939, 13, 51507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 713, "seek": 205210, "start": 2075.64, "end": 2080.7, "text": " How does the pipeline actually force these granite models to behave so radically differently", "tokens": [51542, 1012, 775, 264, 15517, 767, 3464, 613, 9370, 642, 5245, 281, 15158, 370, 35508, 7614, 51795], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 714, "seek": 205210, "start": 2080.7, "end": 2081.72, "text": " at each stage?", "tokens": [51795, 412, 1184, 3233, 30, 51846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14838099683451855, "compression_ratio": 1.6563573883161513, "no_speech_prob": 1.8037932258962996e-12}, {"id": 715, "seek": 208172, "start": 2081.72, "end": 2083.04, "text": " That's a really important question.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 311, 257, 534, 1021, 1168, 13, 50431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1391068947415392, "compression_ratio": 1.5986159169550174, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613376898818368e-12}, {"id": 716, "seek": 208172, "start": 2083.2, "end": 2088.7, "text": " Because, as we established, it's the exact same 3B model doing the drafting and the revising.", "tokens": [50439, 1436, 11, 382, 321, 7545, 11, 309, 311, 264, 1900, 912, 805, 33, 2316, 884, 264, 46378, 293, 264, 3698, 3436, 13, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1391068947415392, "compression_ratio": 1.5986159169550174, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613376898818368e-12}, {"id": 717, "seek": 208172, "start": 2088.8799999999997, "end": 2090.18, "text": " It's the same neural network.", "tokens": [50723, 467, 311, 264, 912, 18161, 3209, 13, 50788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1391068947415392, "compression_ratio": 1.5986159169550174, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613376898818368e-12}, {"id": 718, "seek": 208172, "start": 2090.3599999999997, "end": 2090.74, "text": " It is.", "tokens": [50797, 467, 307, 13, 50816], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1391068947415392, "compression_ratio": 1.5986159169550174, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613376898818368e-12}, {"id": 719, "seek": 208172, "start": 2090.8199999999997, "end": 2095.7599999999998, "text": " How does it know to act like a creative writer one minute and a conservative, highly cautious", "tokens": [50820, 1012, 775, 309, 458, 281, 605, 411, 257, 5880, 9936, 472, 3456, 293, 257, 13780, 11, 5405, 25278, 51067], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1391068947415392, "compression_ratio": 1.5986159169550174, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613376898818368e-12}, {"id": 720, "seek": 208172, "start": 2095.7599999999998, "end": 2097.2599999999998, "text": " repairman the next?", "tokens": [51067, 10535, 1601, 264, 958, 30, 51142], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1391068947415392, "compression_ratio": 1.5986159169550174, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613376898818368e-12}, {"id": 721, "seek": 208172, "start": 2097.3799999999997, "end": 2101.02, "text": " It achieves this by fundamentally changing how we view the concept of prompts.", "tokens": [51148, 467, 3538, 977, 341, 538, 17879, 4473, 577, 321, 1910, 264, 3410, 295, 41095, 13, 51330], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1391068947415392, "compression_ratio": 1.5986159169550174, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613376898818368e-12}, {"id": 722, "seek": 208172, "start": 2101.8399999999997, "end": 2102.52, "text": " In what way?", "tokens": [51371, 682, 437, 636, 30, 51405], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1391068947415392, "compression_ratio": 1.5986159169550174, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613376898818368e-12}, {"id": 723, "seek": 208172, "start": 2102.7799999999997, "end": 2108.3199999999997, "text": " In everyday use, we have been trained to think of prompts as loose, creative suggestions.", "tokens": [51418, 682, 7429, 764, 11, 321, 362, 668, 8895, 281, 519, 295, 41095, 382, 9612, 11, 5880, 13396, 13, 51695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1391068947415392, "compression_ratio": 1.5986159169550174, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613376898818368e-12}, {"id": 724, "seek": 210832, "start": 2108.32, "end": 2112.3, "text": " Like, hey, AI, please write me a funny poem about a cat.", "tokens": [50365, 1743, 11, 4177, 11, 7318, 11, 1767, 2464, 385, 257, 4074, 13065, 466, 257, 3857, 13, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1504423364679864, "compression_ratio": 1.5491803278688525, "no_speech_prob": 1.800716368551003e-12}, {"id": 725, "seek": 210832, "start": 2112.52, "end": 2114.76, "text": " Or, can you brainstorm some marketing ideas?", "tokens": [50575, 1610, 11, 393, 291, 35245, 512, 6370, 3487, 30, 50687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1504423364679864, "compression_ratio": 1.5491803278688525, "no_speech_prob": 1.800716368551003e-12}, {"id": 726, "seek": 210832, "start": 2114.8, "end": 2115.02, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50689, 1779, 13, 50700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1504423364679864, "compression_ratio": 1.5491803278688525, "no_speech_prob": 1.800716368551003e-12}, {"id": 727, "seek": 210832, "start": 2115.1000000000004, "end": 2115.9, "text": " Very conversational.", "tokens": [50704, 4372, 2615, 1478, 13, 50744], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1504423364679864, "compression_ratio": 1.5491803278688525, "no_speech_prob": 1.800716368551003e-12}, {"id": 728, "seek": 210832, "start": 2116.1000000000004, "end": 2118.88, "text": " In this pipeline architecture, prompts are not suggestions.", "tokens": [50754, 682, 341, 15517, 9482, 11, 41095, 366, 406, 13396, 13, 50893], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1504423364679864, "compression_ratio": 1.5491803278688525, "no_speech_prob": 1.800716368551003e-12}, {"id": 729, "seek": 210832, "start": 2119.6600000000003, "end": 2124.36, "text": " They are isolated text files acting as strict, rigid, experimental protocols.", "tokens": [50932, 814, 366, 14621, 2487, 7098, 6577, 382, 10910, 11, 22195, 11, 17069, 20618, 13, 51167], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1504423364679864, "compression_ratio": 1.5491803278688525, "no_speech_prob": 1.800716368551003e-12}, {"id": 730, "seek": 210832, "start": 2124.52, "end": 2126.04, "text": " Prompts as experimental protocols.", "tokens": [51175, 15833, 39280, 382, 17069, 20618, 13, 51251], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1504423364679864, "compression_ratio": 1.5491803278688525, "no_speech_prob": 1.800716368551003e-12}, {"id": 731, "seek": 210832, "start": 2126.1600000000003, "end": 2128.96, "text": " This is where the paper gets into the power of negative constraints, right?", "tokens": [51257, 639, 307, 689, 264, 3035, 2170, 666, 264, 1347, 295, 3671, 18491, 11, 558, 30, 51397], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1504423364679864, "compression_ratio": 1.5491803278688525, "no_speech_prob": 1.800716368551003e-12}, {"id": 732, "seek": 212896, "start": 2128.96, "end": 2129.52, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50365, 1079, 13, 50393], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18277498653956822, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.513261738139704e-12}, {"id": 733, "seek": 212896, "start": 2130.2400000000002, "end": 2135.16, "text": " The pipeline uses a very small Python script to dynamically substitute the generated text", "tokens": [50429, 440, 15517, 4960, 257, 588, 1359, 15329, 5755, 281, 43492, 15802, 264, 10833, 2487, 50675], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18277498653956822, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.513261738139704e-12}, {"id": 734, "seek": 212896, "start": 2135.16, "end": 2137.42, "text": " files into static prompt templates.", "tokens": [50675, 7098, 666, 13437, 12391, 21165, 13, 50788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18277498653956822, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.513261738139704e-12}, {"id": 735, "seek": 212896, "start": 2138.02, "end": 2143.2200000000003, "text": " But the true magic is in how those prompt templates are written by the author, specifically", "tokens": [50818, 583, 264, 2074, 5585, 307, 294, 577, 729, 12391, 21165, 366, 3720, 538, 264, 3793, 11, 4682, 51078], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18277498653956822, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.513261738139704e-12}, {"id": 736, "seek": 212896, "start": 2143.2200000000003, "end": 2145.1, "text": " relying on negative constraints.", "tokens": [51078, 24140, 322, 3671, 18491, 13, 51172], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18277498653956822, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.513261738139704e-12}, {"id": 737, "seek": 214510, "start": 2145.1, "end": 2147.36, "text": " What is a negative constraint in this context?", "tokens": [50365, 708, 307, 257, 3671, 25534, 294, 341, 4319, 30, 50478], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 738, "seek": 214510, "start": 2147.48, "end": 2149.38, "text": " Can you give me an example from the review prompt?", "tokens": [50484, 1664, 291, 976, 385, 364, 1365, 490, 264, 3131, 12391, 30, 50579], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 739, "seek": 214510, "start": 2149.62, "end": 2154.72, "text": " The review prompt, the one handed to the big 8B model, explicitly and aggressively tells", "tokens": [50591, 440, 3131, 12391, 11, 264, 472, 16013, 281, 264, 955, 1649, 33, 2316, 11, 20803, 293, 32024, 5112, 50846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 740, "seek": 214510, "start": 2154.72, "end": 2156.7799999999997, "text": " the model, do not rewrite the essay.", "tokens": [50846, 264, 2316, 11, 360, 406, 28132, 264, 16238, 13, 50949], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 741, "seek": 214510, "start": 2157.18, "end": 2158.86, "text": " Do not provide corrected prose.", "tokens": [50969, 1144, 406, 2893, 31687, 12505, 13, 51053], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 742, "seek": 214510, "start": 2159.14, "end": 2161.3399999999997, "text": " Wait, why is that prohibition so crucial?", "tokens": [51067, 3802, 11, 983, 307, 300, 16015, 849, 370, 11462, 30, 51177], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 743, "seek": 214510, "start": 2161.46, "end": 2165.86, "text": " If the 8B model is the smartest one in the room, why not let it just rewrite the terrible", "tokens": [51183, 759, 264, 1649, 33, 2316, 307, 264, 41491, 472, 294, 264, 1808, 11, 983, 406, 718, 309, 445, 28132, 264, 6237, 51403], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 744, "seek": 214510, "start": 2165.86, "end": 2167.8399999999997, "text": " paragraphs while it is critiquing them?", "tokens": [51403, 48910, 1339, 309, 307, 3113, 3221, 278, 552, 30, 51502], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 745, "seek": 214510, "start": 2168.0, "end": 2173.46, "text": " Because if allowed, a generative AI model will almost always take the path of least computational", "tokens": [51510, 1436, 498, 4350, 11, 257, 1337, 1166, 7318, 2316, 486, 1920, 1009, 747, 264, 3100, 295, 1935, 28270, 51783], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 746, "seek": 214510, "start": 2173.46, "end": 2174.06, "text": " resistance.", "tokens": [51783, 7335, 13, 51813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 747, "seek": 214510, "start": 2174.3399999999997, "end": 2174.72, "text": " Meaning?", "tokens": [51827, 19948, 30, 51846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1320803388417196, "compression_ratio": 1.6956521739130435, "no_speech_prob": 2.2366689663572137e-12}, {"id": 748, "seek": 217472, "start": 2174.72, "end": 2180.4599999999996, "text": " It is mathematically and computationally much easier for a language model to simply, fluently", "tokens": [50365, 467, 307, 44003, 293, 24903, 379, 709, 3571, 337, 257, 2856, 2316, 281, 2935, 11, 5029, 2276, 50652], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07550070502541283, "compression_ratio": 1.6013513513513513, "no_speech_prob": 2.05223078114658e-12}, {"id": 749, "seek": 217472, "start": 2180.4599999999996, "end": 2185.74, "text": " rewrite a bad paragraph to just generate new, better sounding text than it is to force", "tokens": [50652, 28132, 257, 1578, 18865, 281, 445, 8460, 777, 11, 1101, 24931, 2487, 813, 309, 307, 281, 3464, 50916], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07550070502541283, "compression_ratio": 1.6013513513513513, "no_speech_prob": 2.05223078114658e-12}, {"id": 750, "seek": 217472, "start": 2185.74, "end": 2190.8399999999997, "text": " itself to articulate a precise, diagnostic, meta-level theory of why the original paragraph", "tokens": [50916, 2564, 281, 30305, 257, 13600, 11, 27897, 11, 19616, 12, 12418, 5261, 295, 983, 264, 3380, 18865, 51171], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07550070502541283, "compression_ratio": 1.6013513513513513, "no_speech_prob": 2.05223078114658e-12}, {"id": 751, "seek": 217472, "start": 2190.8399999999997, "end": 2191.98, "text": " was logically bad.", "tokens": [51171, 390, 38887, 1578, 13, 51228], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07550070502541283, "compression_ratio": 1.6013513513513513, "no_speech_prob": 2.05223078114658e-12}, {"id": 752, "seek": 217472, "start": 2192.18, "end": 2192.74, "text": " Oh, wow.", "tokens": [51238, 876, 11, 6076, 13, 51266], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07550070502541283, "compression_ratio": 1.6013513513513513, "no_speech_prob": 2.05223078114658e-12}, {"id": 753, "seek": 217472, "start": 2192.8399999999997, "end": 2198.04, "text": " So if you don't explicitly forbid the AI from rewriting the text, it will just overwrite", "tokens": [51271, 407, 498, 291, 500, 380, 20803, 34117, 264, 7318, 490, 319, 19868, 264, 2487, 11, 309, 486, 445, 670, 21561, 51531], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07550070502541283, "compression_ratio": 1.6013513513513513, "no_speech_prob": 2.05223078114658e-12}, {"id": 754, "seek": 217472, "start": 2198.04, "end": 2201.9399999999996, "text": " the problem to make it go away instead of actually analyzing the structural failure.", "tokens": [51531, 264, 1154, 281, 652, 309, 352, 1314, 2602, 295, 767, 23663, 264, 15067, 7763, 13, 51726], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07550070502541283, "compression_ratio": 1.6013513513513513, "no_speech_prob": 2.05223078114658e-12}, {"id": 755, "seek": 220194, "start": 2201.94, "end": 2205.6, "text": " It will hide the symptom instead of diagnosing the disease.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 486, 6479, 264, 29370, 2602, 295, 7234, 6110, 264, 4752, 13, 50548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2161944345994429, "compression_ratio": 1.0394736842105263, "no_speech_prob": 2.827308049138666e-12}, {"id": 756, "seek": 220194, "start": 2205.7200000000003, "end": 2207.2000000000003, "text": " That is incredible.", "tokens": [50554, 663, 307, 4651, 13, 50628], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2161944345994429, "compression_ratio": 1.0394736842105263, "no_speech_prob": 2.827308049138666e-12}, {"id": 757, "seek": 220720, "start": 2207.2, "end": 2212.02, "text": " Prohibiting rewriting intentionally creates that cognitive friction we discussed earlier.", "tokens": [50365, 1705, 5455, 1748, 319, 19868, 22062, 7829, 300, 15605, 17710, 321, 7152, 3071, 13, 50606], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.190944420663934, "compression_ratio": 1.5562130177514792, "no_speech_prob": 1.7281974462601823e-12}, {"id": 758, "seek": 220720, "start": 2212.4199999999996, "end": 2218.2999999999997, "text": " It forces the AI completely out of the role of a writer and strictly into the role of a critic.", "tokens": [50626, 467, 5874, 264, 7318, 2584, 484, 295, 264, 3090, 295, 257, 9936, 293, 20792, 666, 264, 3090, 295, 257, 7850, 13, 50920], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.190944420663934, "compression_ratio": 1.5562130177514792, "no_speech_prob": 1.7281974462601823e-12}, {"id": 759, "seek": 220720, "start": 2218.2999999999997, "end": 2223.3999999999996, "text": " It has to externalize its internal objections into a readable diagnostic map.", "tokens": [50920, 467, 575, 281, 8320, 1125, 1080, 6920, 44649, 666, 257, 49857, 27897, 4471, 13, 51175], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.190944420663934, "compression_ratio": 1.5562130177514792, "no_speech_prob": 1.7281974462601823e-12}, {"id": 760, "seek": 222340, "start": 2223.4, "end": 2229.76, "text": " And there is another vital negative constraint found in the revision prompt, the one handed back to the 3B model.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 456, 307, 1071, 11707, 3671, 25534, 1352, 294, 264, 34218, 12391, 11, 264, 472, 16013, 646, 281, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 13, 50683], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13018692864312065, "compression_ratio": 1.50253807106599, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613398582861818e-12}, {"id": 761, "seek": 222340, "start": 2229.92, "end": 2230.52, "text": " What's that one?", "tokens": [50691, 708, 311, 300, 472, 30, 50721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13018692864312065, "compression_ratio": 1.50253807106599, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613398582861818e-12}, {"id": 762, "seek": 222340, "start": 2230.62, "end": 2233.44, "text": " Preserve material not implicated by criticism.", "tokens": [50726, 2718, 3768, 2527, 406, 8484, 3587, 538, 15835, 13, 50867], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13018692864312065, "compression_ratio": 1.50253807106599, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613398582861818e-12}, {"id": 763, "seek": 222340, "start": 2233.78, "end": 2237.12, "text": " Oh, that sounds like the conservative revision rule we talked about earlier.", "tokens": [50884, 876, 11, 300, 3263, 411, 264, 13780, 34218, 4978, 321, 2825, 466, 3071, 13, 51051], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13018692864312065, "compression_ratio": 1.50253807106599, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613398582861818e-12}, {"id": 764, "seek": 222340, "start": 2237.28, "end": 2239.2400000000002, "text": " It is the exact enforcement of that rule.", "tokens": [51059, 467, 307, 264, 1900, 11475, 295, 300, 4978, 13, 51157], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13018692864312065, "compression_ratio": 1.50253807106599, "no_speech_prob": 1.8613398582861818e-12}, {"id": 765, "seek": 223924, "start": 2239.24, "end": 2246.66, "text": " It prevents the revising AI from reading a critique about paragraph 3 panicking and just regenerating a whole new,", "tokens": [50365, 467, 22367, 264, 3698, 3436, 7318, 490, 3760, 257, 25673, 466, 18865, 805, 2462, 10401, 293, 445, 26358, 990, 257, 1379, 777, 11, 50736], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15362956606108566, "compression_ratio": 1.6335616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754484948201421e-12}, {"id": 766, "seek": 223924, "start": 2246.8399999999997, "end": 2248.4599999999996, "text": " completely different essay from scratch.", "tokens": [50745, 2584, 819, 16238, 490, 8459, 13, 50826], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15362956606108566, "compression_ratio": 1.6335616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754484948201421e-12}, {"id": 767, "seek": 223924, "start": 2248.72, "end": 2248.7799999999997, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50839, 1779, 13, 50842], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15362956606108566, "compression_ratio": 1.6335616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754484948201421e-12}, {"id": 768, "seek": 223924, "start": 2249.14, "end": 2254.24, "text": " It forces the AI into a strict repair mindset rather than an unbounded optimization mindset.", "tokens": [50860, 467, 5874, 264, 7318, 666, 257, 10910, 10535, 12543, 2831, 813, 364, 517, 18767, 292, 19618, 12543, 13, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15362956606108566, "compression_ratio": 1.6335616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754484948201421e-12}, {"id": 769, "seek": 223924, "start": 2255.08, "end": 2264.58, "text": " It establishes the rule that existing uncriticized text is a success and that existing success is part of the constraint set for the next draft.", "tokens": [51157, 467, 8327, 279, 264, 4978, 300, 6741, 6219, 3210, 299, 1602, 2487, 307, 257, 2245, 293, 300, 6741, 2245, 307, 644, 295, 264, 25534, 992, 337, 264, 958, 11206, 13, 51632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15362956606108566, "compression_ratio": 1.6335616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754484948201421e-12}, {"id": 770, "seek": 223924, "start": 2264.74, "end": 2265.24, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51640, 7587, 13, 51665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15362956606108566, "compression_ratio": 1.6335616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754484948201421e-12}, {"id": 771, "seek": 223924, "start": 2265.2599999999998, "end": 2267.3599999999997, "text": " Here's where it gets really interesting for me.", "tokens": [51666, 1692, 311, 689, 309, 2170, 534, 1880, 337, 385, 13, 51771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15362956606108566, "compression_ratio": 1.6335616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754484948201421e-12}, {"id": 772, "seek": 223924, "start": 2267.3799999999997, "end": 2268.12, "text": " Okay, lay it on me.", "tokens": [51772, 1033, 11, 2360, 309, 322, 385, 13, 51809], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15362956606108566, "compression_ratio": 1.6335616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754484948201421e-12}, {"id": 773, "seek": 226812, "start": 2268.12, "end": 2276.62, "text": " We are using the exact same literal model parameters, the same weights and biases on the hard drive for drafting and revising, right?", "tokens": [50365, 492, 366, 1228, 264, 1900, 912, 20411, 2316, 9834, 11, 264, 912, 17443, 293, 32152, 322, 264, 1152, 3332, 337, 46378, 293, 3698, 3436, 11, 558, 30, 50790], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07940668978933561, "compression_ratio": 1.6405693950177935, "no_speech_prob": 1.4837647169946289e-12}, {"id": 774, "seek": 226812, "start": 2277.1, "end": 2279.7, "text": " It's the granite 3B model both times.", "tokens": [50814, 467, 311, 264, 9370, 642, 805, 33, 2316, 1293, 1413, 13, 50944], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07940668978933561, "compression_ratio": 1.6405693950177935, "no_speech_prob": 1.4837647169946289e-12}, {"id": 775, "seek": 226812, "start": 2279.8399999999997, "end": 2280.68, "text": " Yes, that's correct.", "tokens": [50951, 1079, 11, 300, 311, 3006, 13, 50993], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07940668978933561, "compression_ratio": 1.6405693950177935, "no_speech_prob": 1.4837647169946289e-12}, {"id": 776, "seek": 226812, "start": 2280.7999999999997, "end": 2286.5, "text": " But the prompt completely alters the model's effective relationship to the text it is processing.", "tokens": [50999, 583, 264, 12391, 2584, 419, 1559, 264, 2316, 311, 4942, 2480, 281, 264, 2487, 309, 307, 9007, 13, 51284], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07940668978933561, "compression_ratio": 1.6405693950177935, "no_speech_prob": 1.4837647169946289e-12}, {"id": 777, "seek": 226812, "start": 2286.74, "end": 2288.5, "text": " It's like a human putting on different hats.", "tokens": [51296, 467, 311, 411, 257, 1952, 3372, 322, 819, 20549, 13, 51384], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07940668978933561, "compression_ratio": 1.6405693950177935, "no_speech_prob": 1.4837647169946289e-12}, {"id": 778, "seek": 226812, "start": 2288.66, "end": 2290.08, "text": " That's a great way to visualize it.", "tokens": [51392, 663, 311, 257, 869, 636, 281, 23273, 309, 13, 51463], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07940668978933561, "compression_ratio": 1.6405693950177935, "no_speech_prob": 1.4837647169946289e-12}, {"id": 779, "seek": 226812, "start": 2290.08, "end": 2296.02, "text": " When the AI wears the drafting hat, it sees the outline file as an open pass to run down.", "tokens": [51463, 1133, 264, 7318, 20877, 264, 46378, 2385, 11, 309, 8194, 264, 16387, 3991, 382, 364, 1269, 1320, 281, 1190, 760, 13, 51760], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07940668978933561, "compression_ratio": 1.6405693950177935, "no_speech_prob": 1.4837647169946289e-12}, {"id": 780, "seek": 229602, "start": 2296.02, "end": 2301.14, "text": " But when it wears the revising hat and it's holding the review file, its entire stance shifts.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 562, 309, 20877, 264, 3698, 3436, 2385, 293, 309, 311, 5061, 264, 3131, 3991, 11, 1080, 2302, 21033, 19201, 13, 50621], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 781, "seek": 229602, "start": 2301.46, "end": 2301.9, "text": " It is us.", "tokens": [50637, 467, 307, 505, 13, 50659], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 782, "seek": 229602, "start": 2301.96, "end": 2305.08, "text": " It sees the draft as a suspect that needs to be interrogated.", "tokens": [50662, 467, 8194, 264, 11206, 382, 257, 9091, 300, 2203, 281, 312, 24871, 770, 13, 50818], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 783, "seek": 229602, "start": 2305.2, "end": 2306.8, "text": " That is a profound observation.", "tokens": [50824, 663, 307, 257, 14382, 14816, 13, 50904], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 784, "seek": 229602, "start": 2307.16, "end": 2311.62, "text": " And the paper actually formalizes this exact dynamic in theorem 7.2.", "tokens": [50922, 400, 264, 3035, 767, 9860, 5660, 341, 1900, 8546, 294, 20904, 1614, 13, 17, 13, 51145], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 785, "seek": 229602, "start": 2311.82, "end": 2312.8, "text": " Theorem 7.2.", "tokens": [51155, 440, 37956, 1614, 13, 17, 13, 51204], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 786, "seek": 229602, "start": 2312.86, "end": 2313.38, "text": " What does it say?", "tokens": [51207, 708, 775, 309, 584, 30, 51233], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 787, "seek": 229602, "start": 2313.54, "end": 2317.54, "text": " It proves that semantic operators in AI are not just the models themselves.", "tokens": [51241, 467, 25019, 300, 47982, 19077, 294, 7318, 366, 406, 445, 264, 5245, 2969, 13, 51441], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 788, "seek": 229602, "start": 2318.14, "end": 2320.58, "text": " Semantic operators are actually model prompt pairs.", "tokens": [51471, 14421, 7128, 19077, 366, 767, 2316, 12391, 15494, 13, 51593], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 789, "seek": 229602, "start": 2321.18, "end": 2322.12, "text": " Model prompt pairs.", "tokens": [51623, 17105, 12391, 15494, 13, 51670], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1770526091257731, "compression_ratio": 1.6893939393939394, "no_speech_prob": 1.5853074061822348e-12}, {"id": 790, "seek": 232212, "start": 2322.12, "end": 2324.64, "text": " What does that mean for how we build these systems?", "tokens": [50365, 708, 775, 300, 914, 337, 577, 321, 1322, 613, 3652, 30, 50491], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14585866367115694, "compression_ratio": 1.7024390243902439, "no_speech_prob": 1.635960681159454e-12}, {"id": 791, "seek": 232212, "start": 2325.22, "end": 2331.68, "text": " It means that the agent doing the intellectual work at any given stage is not just the bare granite 3B model.", "tokens": [50520, 467, 1355, 300, 264, 9461, 884, 264, 12576, 589, 412, 604, 2212, 3233, 307, 406, 445, 264, 6949, 9370, 642, 805, 33, 2316, 13, 50843], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14585866367115694, "compression_ratio": 1.7024390243902439, "no_speech_prob": 1.635960681159454e-12}, {"id": 792, "seek": 232212, "start": 2331.9, "end": 2332.18, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50854, 1033, 13, 50868], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14585866367115694, "compression_ratio": 1.7024390243902439, "no_speech_prob": 1.635960681159454e-12}, {"id": 793, "seek": 232212, "start": 2332.56, "end": 2336.6, "text": " The functional operator is the 3B model paired with the drafting prompt.", "tokens": [50887, 440, 11745, 12973, 307, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 25699, 365, 264, 46378, 12391, 13, 51089], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14585866367115694, "compression_ratio": 1.7024390243902439, "no_speech_prob": 1.635960681159454e-12}, {"id": 794, "seek": 232212, "start": 2337.1, "end": 2343.48, "text": " A completely different functional operator is that exact same 3B model paired with the revision prompt.", "tokens": [51114, 316, 2584, 819, 11745, 12973, 307, 300, 1900, 912, 805, 33, 2316, 25699, 365, 264, 34218, 12391, 13, 51433], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14585866367115694, "compression_ratio": 1.7024390243902439, "no_speech_prob": 1.635960681159454e-12}, {"id": 795, "seek": 232212, "start": 2343.64, "end": 2344.0, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [51441, 3153, 13, 51459], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14585866367115694, "compression_ratio": 1.7024390243902439, "no_speech_prob": 1.635960681159454e-12}, {"id": 796, "seek": 234400, "start": 2344.0, "end": 2346.1, "text": " The prompt isn't just a friendly instruction.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 12391, 1943, 380, 445, 257, 9208, 10951, 13, 50470], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10193552829251432, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 1.6423571487164668e-12}, {"id": 797, "seek": 234400, "start": 2346.6, "end": 2357.46, "text": " It acts as a rigid boundary layer between the highly deterministic code of the shell scripts running the pipeline and the wild, stochastic, probabilistic cognition of the large language model.", "tokens": [50495, 467, 10672, 382, 257, 22195, 12866, 4583, 1296, 264, 5405, 15957, 3142, 3089, 295, 264, 8720, 23294, 2614, 264, 15517, 293, 264, 4868, 11, 342, 8997, 2750, 11, 31959, 3142, 46905, 295, 264, 2416, 2856, 2316, 13, 51038], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10193552829251432, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 1.6423571487164668e-12}, {"id": 798, "seek": 234400, "start": 2357.6, "end": 2361.1, "text": " You are literally programming the AI's psychological stance.", "tokens": [51045, 509, 366, 3736, 9410, 264, 7318, 311, 14346, 21033, 13, 51220], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10193552829251432, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 1.6423571487164668e-12}, {"id": 799, "seek": 234400, "start": 2361.38, "end": 2361.8, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51234, 7587, 13, 51255], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10193552829251432, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 1.6423571487164668e-12}, {"id": 800, "seek": 234400, "start": 2362.44, "end": 2369.62, "text": " The system doesn't need to load a separate neural network trained exclusively for planning and another trained for generation and a third trained for criticism.", "tokens": [51287, 440, 1185, 1177, 380, 643, 281, 3677, 257, 4994, 18161, 3209, 8895, 20638, 337, 5038, 293, 1071, 8895, 337, 5125, 293, 257, 2636, 8895, 337, 15835, 13, 51646], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10193552829251432, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 1.6423571487164668e-12}, {"id": 801, "seek": 234400, "start": 2369.72, "end": 2370.06, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51651, 1779, 13, 51668], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10193552829251432, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 1.6423571487164668e-12}, {"id": 802, "seek": 237006, "start": 2370.06, "end": 2378.96, "text": " It creates functional differentiation by taking a general purpose model and placing it under completely different textual contracts at each stage of the pipeline.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 7829, 11745, 38902, 538, 1940, 257, 2674, 4334, 2316, 293, 17221, 309, 833, 2584, 819, 2487, 901, 13952, 412, 1184, 3233, 295, 264, 15517, 13, 50810], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1195614602830675, "compression_ratio": 1.5961538461538463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414757786868296e-12}, {"id": 803, "seek": 237006, "start": 2379.14, "end": 2379.4, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50819, 1033, 13, 50832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1195614602830675, "compression_ratio": 1.5961538461538463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414757786868296e-12}, {"id": 804, "seek": 237006, "start": 2379.48, "end": 2386.18, "text": " So we have all these specific prompts, these carefully managed stages, these distinct textual contracts, all these files being passed around.", "tokens": [50836, 407, 321, 362, 439, 613, 2685, 41095, 11, 613, 7500, 6453, 10232, 11, 613, 10644, 2487, 901, 13952, 11, 439, 613, 7098, 885, 4678, 926, 13, 51171], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1195614602830675, "compression_ratio": 1.5961538461538463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414757786868296e-12}, {"id": 805, "seek": 237006, "start": 2386.54, "end": 2387.66, "text": " It's a lot to juggle.", "tokens": [51189, 467, 311, 257, 688, 281, 361, 31726, 13, 51245], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1195614602830675, "compression_ratio": 1.5961538461538463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414757786868296e-12}, {"id": 806, "seek": 238766, "start": 2387.66, "end": 2391.24, "text": " But how does the system keep track of all this information?", "tokens": [50365, 583, 577, 775, 264, 1185, 1066, 2837, 295, 439, 341, 1589, 30, 50544], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09296103774524125, "compression_ratio": 1.7116104868913857, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661279982569058e-12}, {"id": 807, "seek": 238766, "start": 2391.7599999999998, "end": 2404.0, "text": " If you try to do this in a standard chat window, like if you say, here's my outline, now here's my draft, now here's a critique, now revise it based on the outline, the AI eventually just loses the plot.", "tokens": [50570, 759, 291, 853, 281, 360, 341, 294, 257, 3832, 5081, 4910, 11, 411, 498, 291, 584, 11, 510, 311, 452, 16387, 11, 586, 510, 311, 452, 11206, 11, 586, 510, 311, 257, 25673, 11, 586, 44252, 309, 2361, 322, 264, 16387, 11, 264, 7318, 4728, 445, 18293, 264, 7542, 13, 51182], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09296103774524125, "compression_ratio": 1.7116104868913857, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661279982569058e-12}, {"id": 808, "seek": 238766, "start": 2404.08, "end": 2404.54, "text": " Oh, absolutely.", "tokens": [51186, 876, 11, 3122, 13, 51209], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09296103774524125, "compression_ratio": 1.7116104868913857, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661279982569058e-12}, {"id": 809, "seek": 238766, "start": 2404.66, "end": 2405.8399999999997, "text": " Its context window fills up.", "tokens": [51215, 6953, 4319, 4910, 22498, 493, 13, 51274], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09296103774524125, "compression_ratio": 1.7116104868913857, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661279982569058e-12}, {"id": 810, "seek": 238766, "start": 2405.8599999999997, "end": 2406.02, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51275, 865, 13, 51283], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09296103774524125, "compression_ratio": 1.7116104868913857, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661279982569058e-12}, {"id": 811, "seek": 238766, "start": 2406.1, "end": 2407.5, "text": " It forgets what was in the outline.", "tokens": [51287, 467, 2870, 82, 437, 390, 294, 264, 16387, 13, 51357], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09296103774524125, "compression_ratio": 1.7116104868913857, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661279982569058e-12}, {"id": 812, "seek": 238766, "start": 2407.66, "end": 2410.96, "text": " It gets confused about what the review actually said and it starts hallucinating.", "tokens": [51365, 467, 2170, 9019, 466, 437, 264, 3131, 767, 848, 293, 309, 3719, 35212, 8205, 13, 51530], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09296103774524125, "compression_ratio": 1.7116104868913857, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661279982569058e-12}, {"id": 813, "seek": 238766, "start": 2410.98, "end": 2411.8399999999997, "text": " It happens all the time.", "tokens": [51531, 467, 2314, 439, 264, 565, 13, 51574], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09296103774524125, "compression_ratio": 1.7116104868913857, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661279982569058e-12}, {"id": 814, "seek": 241184, "start": 2411.84, "end": 2417.96, "text": " It would collapse into absolute chaos if the AI had to hold all of this in its active short-term memory.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 576, 15584, 666, 8236, 14158, 498, 264, 7318, 632, 281, 1797, 439, 295, 341, 294, 1080, 4967, 2099, 12, 7039, 4675, 13, 50671], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1017110516326596, "compression_ratio": 1.5719424460431655, "no_speech_prob": 1.3043230774958947e-12}, {"id": 815, "seek": 241184, "start": 2417.96, "end": 2423.6600000000003, "text": " Which brings us to what I consider one of the most elegant, beautifully simplistic parts of the entire architecture.", "tokens": [50671, 3013, 5607, 505, 281, 437, 286, 1949, 472, 295, 264, 881, 21117, 11, 16525, 44199, 3166, 295, 264, 2302, 9482, 13, 50956], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1017110516326596, "compression_ratio": 1.5719424460431655, "no_speech_prob": 1.3043230774958947e-12}, {"id": 816, "seek": 241184, "start": 2423.8, "end": 2424.34, "text": " Let's hear it.", "tokens": [50963, 961, 311, 1568, 309, 13, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1017110516326596, "compression_ratio": 1.5719424460431655, "no_speech_prob": 1.3043230774958947e-12}, {"id": 817, "seek": 241184, "start": 2425.1600000000003, "end": 2431.54, "text": " The pipeline's secret weapon to solve the context window problem is actually one of the oldest tricks in the history of computing.", "tokens": [51031, 440, 15517, 311, 4054, 7463, 281, 5039, 264, 4319, 4910, 1154, 307, 767, 472, 295, 264, 14026, 11733, 294, 264, 2503, 295, 15866, 13, 51350], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1017110516326596, "compression_ratio": 1.5719424460431655, "no_speech_prob": 1.3043230774958947e-12}, {"id": 818, "seek": 241184, "start": 2431.86, "end": 2435.44, "text": " We are talking about using the file system as external memory, right?", "tokens": [51366, 492, 366, 1417, 466, 1228, 264, 3991, 1185, 382, 8320, 4675, 11, 558, 30, 51545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1017110516326596, "compression_ratio": 1.5719424460431655, "no_speech_prob": 1.3043230774958947e-12}, {"id": 819, "seek": 243544, "start": 2435.44, "end": 2437.52, "text": " The paper mentions the Unix philosophy here.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 3035, 23844, 264, 1156, 970, 10675, 510, 13, 50469], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13753026326497395, "compression_ratio": 1.6631205673758864, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204069758027575e-12}, {"id": 820, "seek": 243544, "start": 2437.62, "end": 2437.9, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50474, 1079, 13, 50488], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13753026326497395, "compression_ratio": 1.6631205673758864, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204069758027575e-12}, {"id": 821, "seek": 243544, "start": 2438.66, "end": 2452.2000000000003, "text": " The system completely bypasses the context window problem by using the computer's basic underlying file system, just saving markdown files in standard folders on the hard drive as a form of external memory.", "tokens": [50526, 440, 1185, 2584, 24996, 279, 264, 4319, 4910, 1154, 538, 1228, 264, 3820, 311, 3875, 14217, 3991, 1185, 11, 445, 6816, 1491, 5093, 7098, 294, 3832, 31082, 322, 264, 1152, 3332, 382, 257, 1254, 295, 8320, 4675, 13, 51203], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13753026326497395, "compression_ratio": 1.6631205673758864, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204069758027575e-12}, {"id": 822, "seek": 243544, "start": 2452.32, "end": 2460.38, "text": " So instead of a massive scrolling conversational history window on a website that eats up RAM, it's just saving text files to a local folder.", "tokens": [51209, 407, 2602, 295, 257, 5994, 29053, 2615, 1478, 2503, 4910, 322, 257, 3144, 300, 18109, 493, 14561, 11, 309, 311, 445, 6816, 2487, 7098, 281, 257, 2654, 10820, 13, 51612], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13753026326497395, "compression_ratio": 1.6631205673758864, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204069758027575e-12}, {"id": 823, "seek": 243544, "start": 2460.76, "end": 2461.3, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [51631, 48746, 736, 13, 51658], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13753026326497395, "compression_ratio": 1.6631205673758864, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204069758027575e-12}, {"id": 824, "seek": 243544, "start": 2461.64, "end": 2464.7200000000003, "text": " And this solves the memory degradation problem brilliantly.", "tokens": [51675, 400, 341, 39890, 264, 4675, 40519, 1154, 8695, 42580, 13, 51829], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13753026326497395, "compression_ratio": 1.6631205673758864, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204069758027575e-12}, {"id": 825, "seek": 246472, "start": 2464.72, "end": 2465.3999999999996, "text": " How so?", "tokens": [50365, 1012, 370, 30, 50399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12318214069713246, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945046711278056e-12}, {"id": 826, "seek": 246472, "start": 2465.7599999999998, "end": 2479.2, "text": " Instead of feeding a language model a massive, overwhelming history of every single prompt and output that has happened over the last hour, the pipeline selectively reconstructs the necessary context for each specific task.", "tokens": [50417, 7156, 295, 12919, 257, 2856, 2316, 257, 5994, 11, 13373, 2503, 295, 633, 2167, 12391, 293, 5598, 300, 575, 2011, 670, 264, 1036, 1773, 11, 264, 15517, 3048, 3413, 31499, 82, 264, 4818, 4319, 337, 1184, 2685, 5633, 13, 51089], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12318214069713246, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945046711278056e-12}, {"id": 827, "seek": 246472, "start": 2479.3199999999997, "end": 2479.62, "text": " Oh.", "tokens": [51095, 876, 13, 51110], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12318214069713246, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945046711278056e-12}, {"id": 828, "seek": 246472, "start": 2479.8599999999997, "end": 2487.64, "text": " When the revisor model is booted up to do its job, it is only given the draft.md file and the review.md file.", "tokens": [51122, 1133, 264, 20767, 284, 2316, 307, 11450, 292, 493, 281, 360, 1080, 1691, 11, 309, 307, 787, 2212, 264, 11206, 13, 76, 67, 3991, 293, 264, 3131, 13, 76, 67, 3991, 13, 51511], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12318214069713246, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945046711278056e-12}, {"id": 829, "seek": 246472, "start": 2488.3599999999997, "end": 2491.3399999999997, "text": " It is not given the entire history of how the outline was generated.", "tokens": [51547, 467, 307, 406, 2212, 264, 2302, 2503, 295, 577, 264, 16387, 390, 10833, 13, 51696], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12318214069713246, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945046711278056e-12}, {"id": 830, "seek": 246472, "start": 2491.3999999999996, "end": 2492.58, "text": " It doesn't need it.", "tokens": [51699, 467, 1177, 380, 643, 309, 13, 51758], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12318214069713246, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 1.6945046711278056e-12}, {"id": 831, "seek": 249258, "start": 2492.58, "end": 2495.04, "text": " It doesn't even need to see the original topic prompt again.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 1177, 380, 754, 643, 281, 536, 264, 3380, 4829, 12391, 797, 13, 50488], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10843674104605149, "compression_ratio": 1.4578947368421054, "no_speech_prob": 2.0761274643898986e-12}, {"id": 832, "seek": 249258, "start": 2495.62, "end": 2503.7599999999998, "text": " Context is assembled strictly according to causal relevance for the immediate task rather than just accumulating indiscriminately like a giant chat log.", "tokens": [50517, 4839, 3828, 307, 24204, 20792, 4650, 281, 38755, 32684, 337, 264, 11629, 5633, 2831, 813, 445, 12989, 12162, 1016, 5606, 16796, 1592, 411, 257, 7410, 5081, 3565, 13, 50924], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10843674104605149, "compression_ratio": 1.4578947368421054, "no_speech_prob": 2.0761274643898986e-12}, {"id": 833, "seek": 249258, "start": 2503.94, "end": 2507.72, "text": " It's like the movie Memento or the fish Dory from Finding Nemo.", "tokens": [50933, 467, 311, 411, 264, 3169, 376, 1712, 78, 420, 264, 3506, 413, 827, 490, 31947, 22210, 78, 13, 51122], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10843674104605149, "compression_ratio": 1.4578947368421054, "no_speech_prob": 2.0761274643898986e-12}, {"id": 834, "seek": 250772, "start": 2507.72, "end": 2510.48, "text": " That is a hilarious but perfectly accurate comparison.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 257, 19796, 457, 6239, 8559, 9660, 13, 50503], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15434530336562902, "compression_ratio": 1.4352331606217616, "no_speech_prob": 1.762010567833705e-12}, {"id": 835, "seek": 250772, "start": 2510.68, "end": 2513.4599999999996, "text": " The AI is essentially a total amnesiac.", "tokens": [50513, 440, 7318, 307, 4476, 257, 3217, 669, 4081, 13921, 13, 50652], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15434530336562902, "compression_ratio": 1.4352331606217616, "no_speech_prob": 1.762010567833705e-12}, {"id": 836, "seek": 250772, "start": 2514.1, "end": 2521.8199999999997, "text": " Every single time a shell script calls the model to do a job, it wakes up in a dark room with zero memory of what happened five minutes ago.", "tokens": [50684, 2048, 2167, 565, 257, 8720, 5755, 5498, 264, 2316, 281, 360, 257, 1691, 11, 309, 29610, 493, 294, 257, 2877, 1808, 365, 4018, 4675, 295, 437, 2011, 1732, 2077, 2057, 13, 51070], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15434530336562902, "compression_ratio": 1.4352331606217616, "no_speech_prob": 1.762010567833705e-12}, {"id": 837, "seek": 250772, "start": 2522.08, "end": 2522.8999999999996, "text": " It has no idea.", "tokens": [51083, 467, 575, 572, 1558, 13, 51124], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15434530336562902, "compression_ratio": 1.4352331606217616, "no_speech_prob": 1.762010567833705e-12}, {"id": 838, "seek": 250772, "start": 2522.98, "end": 2523.7599999999998, "text": " It just wrote an outline.", "tokens": [51128, 467, 445, 4114, 364, 16387, 13, 51167], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15434530336562902, "compression_ratio": 1.4352331606217616, "no_speech_prob": 1.762010567833705e-12}, {"id": 839, "seek": 252376, "start": 2523.76, "end": 2531.0200000000004, "text": " It only knows what it's supposed to do because of the tattoos the text file is left behind by its past self on the hard drive.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 787, 3255, 437, 309, 311, 3442, 281, 360, 570, 295, 264, 28662, 264, 2487, 3991, 307, 1411, 2261, 538, 1080, 1791, 2698, 322, 264, 1152, 3332, 13, 50728], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15885657480318252, "compression_ratio": 1.5048543689320388, "no_speech_prob": 2.0044061896373755e-12}, {"id": 840, "seek": 252376, "start": 2531.3, "end": 2533.26, "text": " That is exactly the mechanism at play.", "tokens": [50742, 663, 307, 2293, 264, 7513, 412, 862, 13, 50840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15885657480318252, "compression_ratio": 1.5048543689320388, "no_speech_prob": 2.0044061896373755e-12}, {"id": 841, "seek": 252376, "start": 2533.7200000000003, "end": 2543.78, "text": " The pipeline possesses a robust form of long-term memory without requiring the actual AI model to possess any persistent memory whatsoever.", "tokens": [50863, 440, 15517, 17490, 279, 257, 13956, 1254, 295, 938, 12, 7039, 4675, 1553, 24165, 264, 3539, 7318, 2316, 281, 17490, 604, 24315, 4675, 17076, 13, 51366], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15885657480318252, "compression_ratio": 1.5048543689320388, "no_speech_prob": 2.0044061896373755e-12}, {"id": 842, "seek": 252376, "start": 2544.1400000000003, "end": 2544.5800000000004, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [51384, 3153, 13, 51406], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15885657480318252, "compression_ratio": 1.5048543689320388, "no_speech_prob": 2.0044061896373755e-12}, {"id": 843, "seek": 254458, "start": 2544.58, "end": 2550.74, "text": " The text files carry the critical information across otherwise completely discontinuous isolated inference events.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 2487, 7098, 3985, 264, 4924, 1589, 2108, 5911, 2584, 31420, 12549, 14621, 38253, 3931, 13, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12391209602355957, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 1.443741610637761e-12}, {"id": 844, "seek": 254458, "start": 2551.64, "end": 2558.2, "text": " And the paper takes this concept of file system memory a massive step further by introducing Git into the workflow.", "tokens": [50718, 400, 264, 3035, 2516, 341, 3410, 295, 3991, 1185, 4675, 257, 5994, 1823, 3052, 538, 15424, 16939, 666, 264, 20993, 13, 51046], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12391209602355957, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 1.443741610637761e-12}, {"id": 845, "seek": 254458, "start": 2558.36, "end": 2558.96, "text": " Wait, Git?", "tokens": [51054, 3802, 11, 16939, 30, 51084], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12391209602355957, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 1.443741610637761e-12}, {"id": 846, "seek": 254458, "start": 2559.1, "end": 2563.96, "text": " Like the version control system that software engineers use to track changes in their code?", "tokens": [51091, 1743, 264, 3037, 1969, 1185, 300, 4722, 11955, 764, 281, 2837, 2962, 294, 641, 3089, 30, 51334], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12391209602355957, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 1.443741610637761e-12}, {"id": 847, "seek": 254458, "start": 2564.16, "end": 2564.92, "text": " The very same.", "tokens": [51344, 440, 588, 912, 13, 51382], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12391209602355957, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 1.443741610637761e-12}, {"id": 848, "seek": 254458, "start": 2565.02, "end": 2566.5, "text": " How does that apply to writing an essay?", "tokens": [51387, 1012, 775, 300, 3079, 281, 3579, 364, 16238, 30, 51461], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12391209602355957, "compression_ratio": 1.5375494071146245, "no_speech_prob": 1.443741610637761e-12}, {"id": 849, "seek": 256650, "start": 2566.5, "end": 2570.64, "text": " Well, Git isn't just used here as a glorified backup folder to save your work.", "tokens": [50365, 1042, 11, 16939, 1943, 380, 445, 1143, 510, 382, 257, 26623, 2587, 14807, 10820, 281, 3155, 428, 589, 13, 50572], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 850, "seek": 256650, "start": 2571.06, "end": 2577.94, "text": " In this pipeline, Git provides what the author formalizes in Theorem 4.4 as two-dimensional provenance.", "tokens": [50593, 682, 341, 15517, 11, 16939, 6417, 437, 264, 3793, 9860, 5660, 294, 440, 37956, 1017, 13, 19, 382, 732, 12, 18759, 12785, 719, 13, 50937], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 851, "seek": 256650, "start": 2578.12, "end": 2579.94, "text": " Let's unpack two-dimensional provenance.", "tokens": [50946, 961, 311, 26699, 732, 12, 18759, 12785, 719, 13, 51037], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 852, "seek": 256650, "start": 2580.0, "end": 2581.6, "text": " That sounds incredibly dense.", "tokens": [51040, 663, 3263, 6252, 18011, 13, 51120], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 853, "seek": 256650, "start": 2581.74, "end": 2582.76, "text": " It's actually quite intuitive.", "tokens": [51127, 467, 311, 767, 1596, 21769, 13, 51178], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 854, "seek": 256650, "start": 2583.02, "end": 2584.7, "text": " Think about any software-mediated experiment.", "tokens": [51191, 6557, 466, 604, 4722, 12, 3130, 770, 5120, 13, 51275], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 855, "seek": 256650, "start": 2584.86, "end": 2587.92, "text": " You actually have two completely separate things evolving over time.", "tokens": [51283, 509, 767, 362, 732, 2584, 4994, 721, 21085, 670, 565, 13, 51436], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 856, "seek": 256650, "start": 2588.0, "end": 2588.66, "text": " Okay, what's the first?", "tokens": [51440, 1033, 11, 437, 311, 264, 700, 30, 51473], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 857, "seek": 256650, "start": 2589.02, "end": 2591.8, "text": " First, you have the specimens evolving in this case.", "tokens": [51491, 2386, 11, 291, 362, 264, 41007, 21085, 294, 341, 1389, 13, 51630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 858, "seek": 256650, "start": 2592.08, "end": 2596.18, "text": " The text of the essay mutating as it moves from outline to draft to revision.", "tokens": [51644, 440, 2487, 295, 264, 16238, 5839, 990, 382, 309, 6067, 490, 16387, 281, 11206, 281, 34218, 13, 51849], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08857373024919908, "compression_ratio": 1.6488095238095237, "no_speech_prob": 1.7349477974062943e-12}, {"id": 859, "seek": 259650, "start": 2596.5, "end": 2599.52, "text": " That is the first dimension, the artifact trajectory.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 264, 700, 10139, 11, 264, 34806, 21512, 13, 50516], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 860, "seek": 259650, "start": 2599.68, "end": 2600.06, "text": " Got it.", "tokens": [50524, 5803, 309, 13, 50543], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 861, "seek": 259650, "start": 2600.24, "end": 2600.82, "text": " And the second?", "tokens": [50552, 400, 264, 1150, 30, 50581], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 862, "seek": 259650, "start": 2601.34, "end": 2605.4, "text": " Crucially, you also have the experimental apparatus itself evolving.", "tokens": [50607, 13586, 1909, 11, 291, 611, 362, 264, 17069, 38573, 2564, 21085, 13, 50810], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 863, "seek": 259650, "start": 2606.1, "end": 2611.0, "text": " You, the user, might decide to tweak the wording of the review prompt template.", "tokens": [50845, 509, 11, 264, 4195, 11, 1062, 4536, 281, 29879, 264, 47602, 295, 264, 3131, 12391, 12379, 13, 51090], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 864, "seek": 259650, "start": 2611.5, "end": 2614.72, "text": " You might swap out the 3B model for a newer 4B model.", "tokens": [51115, 509, 1062, 18135, 484, 264, 805, 33, 2316, 337, 257, 17628, 1017, 33, 2316, 13, 51276], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 865, "seek": 259650, "start": 2615.08, "end": 2616.32, "text": " You might change a shell script.", "tokens": [51294, 509, 1062, 1319, 257, 8720, 5755, 13, 51356], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 866, "seek": 259650, "start": 2616.42, "end": 2616.96, "text": " Okay, yeah.", "tokens": [51361, 1033, 11, 1338, 13, 51388], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 867, "seek": 259650, "start": 2617.34, "end": 2619.98, "text": " That is the second dimension, the apparatus history.", "tokens": [51407, 663, 307, 264, 1150, 10139, 11, 264, 38573, 2503, 13, 51539], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 868, "seek": 259650, "start": 2619.98, "end": 2625.12, "text": " So Git is tracking both the essay and the machine, building the essay at the exact same time.", "tokens": [51539, 407, 16939, 307, 11603, 1293, 264, 16238, 293, 264, 3479, 11, 2390, 264, 16238, 412, 264, 1900, 912, 565, 13, 51796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 869, "seek": 259650, "start": 2625.26, "end": 2626.28, "text": " Why is that so important?", "tokens": [51803, 1545, 307, 300, 370, 1021, 30, 51854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17771297192755547, "compression_ratio": 1.7054794520547945, "no_speech_prob": 1.3666194911832186e-12}, {"id": 870, "seek": 262650, "start": 2626.56, "end": 2628.4, "text": " Imagine you generate an essay on Tuesday.", "tokens": [50368, 11739, 291, 8460, 364, 16238, 322, 10017, 13, 50460], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17778646028958833, "compression_ratio": 1.551440329218107, "no_speech_prob": 1.59846051325796e-12}, {"id": 871, "seek": 262650, "start": 2629.2, "end": 2632.08, "text": " Then on Thursday, you run the pipeline again on the exact same topic.", "tokens": [50500, 1396, 322, 10383, 11, 291, 1190, 264, 15517, 797, 322, 264, 1900, 912, 4829, 13, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17778646028958833, "compression_ratio": 1.551440329218107, "no_speech_prob": 1.59846051325796e-12}, {"id": 872, "seek": 262650, "start": 2632.4, "end": 2635.32, "text": " But the new essay looks completely different and is full of errors.", "tokens": [50660, 583, 264, 777, 16238, 1542, 2584, 819, 293, 307, 1577, 295, 13603, 13, 50806], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17778646028958833, "compression_ratio": 1.551440329218107, "no_speech_prob": 1.59846051325796e-12}, {"id": 873, "seek": 262650, "start": 2635.58, "end": 2636.56, "text": " I'd be so frustrated.", "tokens": [50819, 286, 1116, 312, 370, 15751, 13, 50868], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17778646028958833, "compression_ratio": 1.551440329218107, "no_speech_prob": 1.59846051325796e-12}, {"id": 874, "seek": 262650, "start": 2636.9, "end": 2637.16, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50885, 1779, 13, 50898], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17778646028958833, "compression_ratio": 1.551440329218107, "no_speech_prob": 1.59846051325796e-12}, {"id": 875, "seek": 262650, "start": 2637.54, "end": 2645.32, "text": " But because Git tracked both dimensions, you can look at the commit history and see if you accidentally altered the reviewing prompt instructions on Wednesday.", "tokens": [50917, 583, 570, 16939, 31703, 1293, 12819, 11, 291, 393, 574, 412, 264, 5599, 2503, 293, 536, 498, 291, 15715, 28783, 264, 19576, 12391, 9415, 322, 10579, 13, 51306], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17778646028958833, "compression_ratio": 1.551440329218107, "no_speech_prob": 1.59846051325796e-12}, {"id": 876, "seek": 262650, "start": 2645.6, "end": 2646.4, "text": " Oh, wow.", "tokens": [51320, 876, 11, 6076, 13, 51360], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17778646028958833, "compression_ratio": 1.551440329218107, "no_speech_prob": 1.59846051325796e-12}, {"id": 877, "seek": 264640, "start": 2646.4, "end": 2653.56, "text": " You can trace a failure not just to a bad draft, but to a specific moment in time where you altered the underlying apparatus.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 393, 13508, 257, 7763, 406, 445, 281, 257, 1578, 11206, 11, 457, 281, 257, 2685, 1623, 294, 565, 689, 291, 28783, 264, 14217, 38573, 13, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16422994371870875, "compression_ratio": 1.5780346820809248, "no_speech_prob": 1.6165669063789023e-12}, {"id": 878, "seek": 264640, "start": 2654.14, "end": 2656.78, "text": " It creates a state of historical monotonicity.", "tokens": [50752, 467, 7829, 257, 1785, 295, 8584, 1108, 310, 11630, 507, 13, 50884], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16422994371870875, "compression_ratio": 1.5780346820809248, "no_speech_prob": 1.6165669063789023e-12}, {"id": 879, "seek": 264640, "start": 2657.14, "end": 2658.38, "text": " Historical monotonicity.", "tokens": [50902, 46124, 1108, 310, 11630, 507, 13, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16422994371870875, "compression_ratio": 1.5780346820809248, "no_speech_prob": 1.6165669063789023e-12}, {"id": 880, "seek": 264640, "start": 2658.52, "end": 2660.96, "text": " I assume that means the history only ever goes forward.", "tokens": [50971, 286, 6552, 300, 1355, 264, 2503, 787, 1562, 1709, 2128, 13, 51093], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16422994371870875, "compression_ratio": 1.5780346820809248, "no_speech_prob": 1.6165669063789023e-12}, {"id": 881, "seek": 264640, "start": 2661.14, "end": 2662.1600000000003, "text": " It only ever grows.", "tokens": [51102, 467, 787, 1562, 13156, 13, 51153], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16422994371870875, "compression_ratio": 1.5780346820809248, "no_speech_prob": 1.6165669063789023e-12}, {"id": 882, "seek": 266216, "start": 2662.16, "end": 2662.56, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 13, 50385], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13467887595847802, "compression_ratio": 1.4491017964071857, "no_speech_prob": 1.4543580098905218e-12}, {"id": 883, "seek": 266216, "start": 2662.56, "end": 2667.52, "text": " You can delete paragraphs, rewrite the essay, and destroy files on your local drive all you want.", "tokens": [50385, 509, 393, 12097, 48910, 11, 28132, 264, 16238, 11, 293, 5293, 7098, 322, 428, 2654, 3332, 439, 291, 528, 13, 50633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13467887595847802, "compression_ratio": 1.4491017964071857, "no_speech_prob": 1.4543580098905218e-12}, {"id": 884, "seek": 266216, "start": 2667.7799999999997, "end": 2676.64, "text": " But the historical evidence of that text's existence and the exact prompts that generated it only grows inside the hidden Git repository.", "tokens": [50646, 583, 264, 8584, 4467, 295, 300, 2487, 311, 9123, 293, 264, 1900, 41095, 300, 10833, 309, 787, 13156, 1854, 264, 7633, 16939, 25841, 13, 51089], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13467887595847802, "compression_ratio": 1.4491017964071857, "no_speech_prob": 1.4543580098905218e-12}, {"id": 885, "seek": 267664, "start": 2676.64, "end": 2678.14, "text": " So you can always rewind.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 291, 393, 1009, 41458, 13, 50440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19249734213185865, "compression_ratio": 1.4357142857142857, "no_speech_prob": 2.011819747252397e-12}, {"id": 886, "seek": 267664, "start": 2678.3599999999997, "end": 2678.6, "text": " Always.", "tokens": [50451, 11270, 13, 50463], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19249734213185865, "compression_ratio": 1.4357142857142857, "no_speech_prob": 2.011819747252397e-12}, {"id": 887, "seek": 267664, "start": 2679.16, "end": 2683.2799999999997, "text": " The computational cost of generating radical alternatives is incredibly low.", "tokens": [50491, 440, 28270, 2063, 295, 17746, 12001, 20478, 307, 6252, 2295, 13, 50697], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19249734213185865, "compression_ratio": 1.4357142857142857, "no_speech_prob": 2.011819747252397e-12}, {"id": 888, "seek": 267664, "start": 2683.48, "end": 2688.3399999999997, "text": " But the historical record of those alternatives is essentially permanent and never erased.", "tokens": [50707, 583, 264, 8584, 2136, 295, 729, 20478, 307, 4476, 10996, 293, 1128, 38359, 13, 50950], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19249734213185865, "compression_ratio": 1.4357142857142857, "no_speech_prob": 2.011819747252397e-12}, {"id": 889, "seek": 268834, "start": 2688.34, "end": 2695.52, "text": " If I try to visualize this entire system we've been discussing, it doesn't look like a sleek, modern web app with glowing buttons.", "tokens": [50365, 759, 286, 853, 281, 23273, 341, 2302, 1185, 321, 600, 668, 10850, 11, 309, 1177, 380, 574, 411, 257, 43464, 11, 4363, 3670, 724, 365, 27064, 9905, 13, 50724], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13007213074026755, "compression_ratio": 1.585551330798479, "no_speech_prob": 2.697526447006937e-12}, {"id": 890, "seek": 268834, "start": 2695.7200000000003, "end": 2696.42, "text": " No, not at all.", "tokens": [50734, 883, 11, 406, 412, 439, 13, 50769], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13007213074026755, "compression_ratio": 1.585551330798479, "no_speech_prob": 2.697526447006937e-12}, {"id": 891, "seek": 268834, "start": 2696.44, "end": 2699.42, "text": " It looks like a retro Unix terminal screen.", "tokens": [50770, 467, 1542, 411, 257, 18820, 1156, 970, 14709, 2568, 13, 50919], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13007213074026755, "compression_ratio": 1.585551330798479, "no_speech_prob": 2.697526447006937e-12}, {"id": 892, "seek": 268834, "start": 2700.1200000000003, "end": 2706.58, "text": " Just simple, text-based, modular commands piping data from one small program to another.", "tokens": [50954, 1449, 2199, 11, 2487, 12, 6032, 11, 31111, 16901, 35204, 1412, 490, 472, 1359, 1461, 281, 1071, 13, 51277], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13007213074026755, "compression_ratio": 1.585551330798479, "no_speech_prob": 2.697526447006937e-12}, {"id": 893, "seek": 268834, "start": 2706.82, "end": 2712.56, "text": " The author explicitly frames this as a realization of the Unix philosophy of compositional intelligence.", "tokens": [51289, 440, 3793, 20803, 12083, 341, 382, 257, 25138, 295, 264, 1156, 970, 10675, 295, 10199, 2628, 7599, 13, 51576], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13007213074026755, "compression_ratio": 1.585551330798479, "no_speech_prob": 2.697526447006937e-12}, {"id": 894, "seek": 268834, "start": 2712.8, "end": 2713.88, "text": " Compositional intelligence.", "tokens": [51588, 6620, 329, 2628, 7599, 13, 51642], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13007213074026755, "compression_ratio": 1.585551330798479, "no_speech_prob": 2.697526447006937e-12}, {"id": 895, "seek": 268834, "start": 2714.08, "end": 2714.3, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51652, 1079, 13, 51663], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13007213074026755, "compression_ratio": 1.585551330798479, "no_speech_prob": 2.697526447006937e-12}, {"id": 896, "seek": 271430, "start": 2714.3, "end": 2723.8, "text": " The core idea of Unix was always that small programs should do one thing extremely well, and they should seamlessly pass universal text streams to one another.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 4965, 1558, 295, 1156, 970, 390, 1009, 300, 1359, 4268, 820, 360, 472, 551, 4664, 731, 11, 293, 436, 820, 38083, 1320, 11455, 2487, 15842, 281, 472, 1071, 13, 50840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12343203636907762, "compression_ratio": 1.5714285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.950641688105992e-12}, {"id": 897, "seek": 271430, "start": 2724.04, "end": 2725.7200000000003, "text": " And that's what we're doing with the LLMs here.", "tokens": [50852, 400, 300, 311, 437, 321, 434, 884, 365, 264, 441, 43, 26386, 510, 13, 50936], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12343203636907762, "compression_ratio": 1.5714285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.950641688105992e-12}, {"id": 898, "seek": 271430, "start": 2726.0600000000004, "end": 2726.46, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50953, 7587, 13, 50973], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12343203636907762, "compression_ratio": 1.5714285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.950641688105992e-12}, {"id": 899, "seek": 271430, "start": 2726.8, "end": 2737.32, "text": " What this paper proves is that we don't need one monolithic, godlike, multi-trillion parameter AI that tries to remember everything and do everything internally.", "tokens": [50990, 708, 341, 3035, 25019, 307, 300, 321, 500, 380, 643, 472, 1108, 42878, 11, 3044, 4092, 11, 4825, 12, 6903, 11836, 13075, 7318, 300, 9898, 281, 1604, 1203, 293, 360, 1203, 19501, 13, 51516], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12343203636907762, "compression_ratio": 1.5714285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.950641688105992e-12}, {"id": 900, "seek": 271430, "start": 2737.48, "end": 2737.7400000000002, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51524, 1779, 13, 51537], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12343203636907762, "compression_ratio": 1.5714285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.950641688105992e-12}, {"id": 901, "seek": 273774, "start": 2737.74, "end": 2747.8199999999997, "text": " We just need bounded, fallible, highly constrained AI components that pass perfectly saved, strictly typed text files to one another.", "tokens": [50365, 492, 445, 643, 37498, 11, 2100, 964, 11, 5405, 38901, 7318, 6677, 300, 1320, 6239, 6624, 11, 20792, 33941, 2487, 7098, 281, 472, 1071, 13, 50869], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10013701802208311, "compression_ratio": 1.5725806451612903, "no_speech_prob": 1.7482884714578595e-12}, {"id": 902, "seek": 273774, "start": 2747.9799999999996, "end": 2756.9599999999996, "text": " The true intelligence of the system emerges from the architecture and the organization of the components, not just the raw processing power of a single massive model.", "tokens": [50877, 440, 2074, 7599, 295, 264, 1185, 38965, 490, 264, 9482, 293, 264, 4475, 295, 264, 6677, 11, 406, 445, 264, 8936, 9007, 1347, 295, 257, 2167, 5994, 2316, 13, 51326], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10013701802208311, "compression_ratio": 1.5725806451612903, "no_speech_prob": 1.7482884714578595e-12}, {"id": 903, "seek": 273774, "start": 2757.08, "end": 2757.9799999999996, "text": " That's a perfect summary.", "tokens": [51332, 663, 311, 257, 2176, 12691, 13, 51377], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10013701802208311, "compression_ratio": 1.5725806451612903, "no_speech_prob": 1.7482884714578595e-12}, {"id": 904, "seek": 273774, "start": 2758.16, "end": 2760.9799999999996, "text": " It makes so much intuitive sense when you lay it out like that.", "tokens": [51386, 467, 1669, 370, 709, 21769, 2020, 562, 291, 2360, 309, 484, 411, 300, 13, 51527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10013701802208311, "compression_ratio": 1.5725806451612903, "no_speech_prob": 1.7482884714578595e-12}, {"id": 905, "seek": 276098, "start": 2760.98, "end": 2765.34, "text": " But, as with all revolutionary tech, we have to look at the dark side.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 11, 382, 365, 439, 22687, 7553, 11, 321, 362, 281, 574, 412, 264, 2877, 1252, 13, 50583], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170397230557033, "compression_ratio": 1.643598615916955, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754426401284107e-12}, {"id": 906, "seek": 276098, "start": 2765.46, "end": 2765.9, "text": " Yes, we do.", "tokens": [50589, 1079, 11, 321, 360, 13, 50611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170397230557033, "compression_ratio": 1.643598615916955, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754426401284107e-12}, {"id": 907, "seek": 276098, "start": 2766.2, "end": 2772.18, "text": " The paper includes an entire section dedicated to limitations, risks, and what it calls the illusion of rigor.", "tokens": [50626, 440, 3035, 5974, 364, 2302, 3541, 8374, 281, 15705, 11, 10888, 11, 293, 437, 309, 5498, 264, 18854, 295, 42191, 13, 50925], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170397230557033, "compression_ratio": 1.643598615916955, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754426401284107e-12}, {"id": 908, "seek": 276098, "start": 2772.44, "end": 2773.7400000000002, "text": " It's a very sobering section.", "tokens": [50938, 467, 311, 257, 588, 26212, 278, 3541, 13, 51003], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170397230557033, "compression_ratio": 1.643598615916955, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754426401284107e-12}, {"id": 909, "seek": 276098, "start": 2773.84, "end": 2778.14, "text": " Because this entire system we've spent the last hour unpacking sounds incredibly rigorous.", "tokens": [51008, 1436, 341, 2302, 1185, 321, 600, 4418, 264, 1036, 1773, 26699, 278, 3263, 6252, 29882, 13, 51223], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170397230557033, "compression_ratio": 1.643598615916955, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754426401284107e-12}, {"id": 910, "seek": 276098, "start": 2778.52, "end": 2785.76, "text": " It sounds deeply scientific, tracking every variable in Git, mathematically localizing failures, isolating cognitive tasks.", "tokens": [51242, 467, 3263, 8760, 8134, 11, 11603, 633, 7006, 294, 16939, 11, 44003, 2654, 3319, 20774, 11, 48912, 15605, 9608, 13, 51604], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170397230557033, "compression_ratio": 1.643598615916955, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754426401284107e-12}, {"id": 911, "seek": 276098, "start": 2785.86, "end": 2787.28, "text": " Yeah, the aesthetic of science, yes.", "tokens": [51609, 865, 11, 264, 20092, 295, 3497, 11, 2086, 13, 51680], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170397230557033, "compression_ratio": 1.643598615916955, "no_speech_prob": 1.7754426401284107e-12}, {"id": 912, "seek": 278728, "start": 2787.28, "end": 2792.5600000000004, "text": " But the author explicitly warns us, the readers, not to fall for the illusion of total control.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 264, 3793, 20803, 12286, 82, 505, 11, 264, 17147, 11, 406, 281, 2100, 337, 264, 18854, 295, 3217, 1969, 13, 50629], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974680527396823, "compression_ratio": 1.7583892617449663, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 913, "seek": 278728, "start": 2792.76, "end": 2797.2000000000003, "text": " And that is a vital caveat that anyone building AI pipelines must understand.", "tokens": [50639, 400, 300, 307, 257, 11707, 43012, 300, 2878, 2390, 7318, 40168, 1633, 1223, 13, 50861], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974680527396823, "compression_ratio": 1.7583892617449663, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 914, "seek": 278728, "start": 2797.8, "end": 2801.7400000000002, "text": " The pipeline dramatically increases the inspectability of the writing process.", "tokens": [50891, 440, 15517, 17548, 8637, 264, 15018, 2310, 295, 264, 3579, 1399, 13, 51088], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974680527396823, "compression_ratio": 1.7583892617449663, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 915, "seek": 278728, "start": 2802.1400000000003, "end": 2806.92, "text": " But the author warns that inspectability should never be confused with epistemic sufficiency.", "tokens": [51108, 583, 264, 3793, 12286, 82, 300, 15018, 2310, 820, 1128, 312, 9019, 365, 2388, 468, 3438, 459, 49086, 13, 51347], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974680527396823, "compression_ratio": 1.7583892617449663, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 916, "seek": 278728, "start": 2807.32, "end": 2815.86, "text": " Epistemic sufficiency, meaning just because we can clearly see every single step the AI took to write the essay, that doesn't mean the final essay is actually telling the truth.", "tokens": [51367, 9970, 468, 3438, 459, 49086, 11, 3620, 445, 570, 321, 393, 4448, 536, 633, 2167, 1823, 264, 7318, 1890, 281, 2464, 264, 16238, 11, 300, 1177, 380, 914, 264, 2572, 16238, 307, 767, 3585, 264, 3494, 13, 51794], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11974680527396823, "compression_ratio": 1.7583892617449663, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 917, "seek": 281586, "start": 2815.86, "end": 2816.34, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50389], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17840713924831814, "compression_ratio": 1.5584415584415585, "no_speech_prob": 1.655508521068716e-12}, {"id": 918, "seek": 281586, "start": 2816.94, "end": 2822.86, "text": " The pipeline is designed to produce highly structured, logically sound, internally consistent essays.", "tokens": [50419, 440, 15517, 307, 4761, 281, 5258, 5405, 18519, 11, 38887, 1626, 11, 19501, 8398, 35123, 13, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17840713924831814, "compression_ratio": 1.5584415584415585, "no_speech_prob": 1.655508521068716e-12}, {"id": 919, "seek": 281586, "start": 2823.2200000000003, "end": 2826.94, "text": " It forces the models to evaluate their own inferential warrant.", "tokens": [50733, 467, 5874, 264, 5245, 281, 13059, 641, 1065, 13596, 2549, 16354, 13, 50919], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17840713924831814, "compression_ratio": 1.5584415584415585, "no_speech_prob": 1.655508521068716e-12}, {"id": 920, "seek": 281586, "start": 2827.1400000000003, "end": 2827.54, "text": " What?", "tokens": [50929, 708, 30, 50949], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17840713924831814, "compression_ratio": 1.5584415584415585, "no_speech_prob": 1.655508521068716e-12}, {"id": 921, "seek": 281586, "start": 2827.84, "end": 2830.6200000000003, "text": " But as currently constructed, it has no retrieval stage.", "tokens": [50964, 583, 382, 4362, 17083, 11, 309, 575, 572, 19817, 3337, 3233, 13, 51103], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17840713924831814, "compression_ratio": 1.5584415584415585, "no_speech_prob": 1.655508521068716e-12}, {"id": 922, "seek": 281586, "start": 2830.88, "end": 2832.06, "text": " It has no web browser.", "tokens": [51116, 467, 575, 572, 3670, 11185, 13, 51175], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17840713924831814, "compression_ratio": 1.5584415584415585, "no_speech_prob": 1.655508521068716e-12}, {"id": 923, "seek": 281586, "start": 2832.54, "end": 2833.86, "text": " It has no research module.", "tokens": [51199, 467, 575, 572, 2132, 10088, 13, 51265], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17840713924831814, "compression_ratio": 1.5584415584415585, "no_speech_prob": 1.655508521068716e-12}, {"id": 924, "seek": 281586, "start": 2833.96, "end": 2837.08, "text": " So it literally cannot verify external facts against the real world.", "tokens": [51270, 407, 309, 3736, 2644, 16888, 8320, 9130, 1970, 264, 957, 1002, 13, 51426], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17840713924831814, "compression_ratio": 1.5584415584415585, "no_speech_prob": 1.655508521068716e-12}, {"id": 925, "seek": 281586, "start": 2837.28, "end": 2837.48, "text": " No.", "tokens": [51436, 883, 13, 51446], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17840713924831814, "compression_ratio": 1.5584415584415585, "no_speech_prob": 1.655508521068716e-12}, {"id": 926, "seek": 283748, "start": 2837.48, "end": 2846.58, "text": " So it is entirely possible for this beautiful, complex machine to write a perfectly structured, mathematically sound essay based on a complete hallucination.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 309, 307, 7696, 1944, 337, 341, 2238, 11, 3997, 3479, 281, 2464, 257, 6239, 18519, 11, 44003, 1626, 16238, 2361, 322, 257, 3566, 35212, 2486, 13, 50820], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068310681511373, "compression_ratio": 1.5089285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356211090390316e-12}, {"id": 927, "seek": 283748, "start": 2846.7400000000002, "end": 2847.54, "text": " Yes, absolutely.", "tokens": [50828, 1079, 11, 3122, 13, 50868], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068310681511373, "compression_ratio": 1.5089285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356211090390316e-12}, {"id": 928, "seek": 283748, "start": 2847.7, "end": 2851.02, "text": " And this danger is formalized in theorem 13.1.", "tokens": [50876, 400, 341, 4330, 307, 9860, 1602, 294, 20904, 3705, 13, 16, 13, 51042], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068310681511373, "compression_ratio": 1.5089285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356211090390316e-12}, {"id": 929, "seek": 283748, "start": 2851.68, "end": 2854.5, "text": " Internal coherence does not entail external truth.", "tokens": [51075, 47836, 26528, 655, 775, 406, 948, 864, 8320, 3494, 13, 51216], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068310681511373, "compression_ratio": 1.5089285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356211090390316e-12}, {"id": 930, "seek": 283748, "start": 2854.58, "end": 2855.72, "text": " That is a scary thought.", "tokens": [51220, 663, 307, 257, 6958, 1194, 13, 51277], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068310681511373, "compression_ratio": 1.5089285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356211090390316e-12}, {"id": 931, "seek": 283748, "start": 2856.0, "end": 2856.46, "text": " It is.", "tokens": [51291, 467, 307, 13, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068310681511373, "compression_ratio": 1.5089285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356211090390316e-12}, {"id": 932, "seek": 283748, "start": 2857.14, "end": 2858.58, "text": " An essay can be perfectly argued.", "tokens": [51348, 1107, 16238, 393, 312, 6239, 20219, 13, 51420], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068310681511373, "compression_ratio": 1.5089285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356211090390316e-12}, {"id": 933, "seek": 285858, "start": 2858.58, "end": 2869.36, "text": " It can have incredibly rigorous transitions, flawless definitions, and survive brutal critiques from the A-B model and still be based entirely on a fabricated premise.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 393, 362, 6252, 29882, 23767, 11, 45693, 21988, 11, 293, 7867, 17878, 3113, 4911, 490, 264, 316, 12, 33, 2316, 293, 920, 312, 2361, 7696, 322, 257, 7253, 770, 22045, 13, 50904], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11570577338190362, "compression_ratio": 1.6498194945848375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5549715378163076e-12}, {"id": 934, "seek": 285858, "start": 2869.92, "end": 2873.2, "text": " Because a coherent lie is still fundamentally a lie.", "tokens": [50932, 1436, 257, 36239, 4544, 307, 920, 17879, 257, 4544, 13, 51096], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11570577338190362, "compression_ratio": 1.6498194945848375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5549715378163076e-12}, {"id": 935, "seek": 285858, "start": 2873.52, "end": 2874.08, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51112, 7587, 13, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11570577338190362, "compression_ratio": 1.6498194945848375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5549715378163076e-12}, {"id": 936, "seek": 285858, "start": 2874.42, "end": 2882.48, "text": " And what terrifies me is that the architecture itself might actually make human users more blind to that lie because of automation bias.", "tokens": [51157, 400, 437, 7245, 11221, 385, 307, 300, 264, 9482, 2564, 1062, 767, 652, 1952, 5022, 544, 6865, 281, 300, 4544, 570, 295, 17769, 12577, 13, 51560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11570577338190362, "compression_ratio": 1.6498194945848375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5549715378163076e-12}, {"id": 937, "seek": 285858, "start": 2882.62, "end": 2885.2799999999997, "text": " Automation bias is a massive documented risk here.", "tokens": [51567, 24619, 399, 12577, 307, 257, 5994, 23007, 3148, 510, 13, 51700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11570577338190362, "compression_ratio": 1.6498194945848375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5549715378163076e-12}, {"id": 938, "seek": 285858, "start": 2885.56, "end": 2887.06, "text": " Think about the psychology of the user.", "tokens": [51714, 6557, 466, 264, 15105, 295, 264, 4195, 13, 51789], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11570577338190362, "compression_ratio": 1.6498194945848375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5549715378163076e-12}, {"id": 939, "seek": 288706, "start": 2887.06, "end": 2887.4, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50365, 865, 13, 50382], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10644835978746414, "compression_ratio": 1.64797507788162, "no_speech_prob": 1.5308676635378271e-12}, {"id": 940, "seek": 288706, "start": 2887.52, "end": 2891.18, "text": " Because a file is confidently generated and named review.md.", "tokens": [50388, 1436, 257, 3991, 307, 41956, 10833, 293, 4926, 3131, 13, 76, 67, 13, 50571], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10644835978746414, "compression_ratio": 1.64797507788162, "no_speech_prob": 1.5308676635378271e-12}, {"id": 941, "seek": 288706, "start": 2891.46, "end": 2891.62, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50585, 865, 13, 50593], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10644835978746414, "compression_ratio": 1.64797507788162, "no_speech_prob": 1.5308676635378271e-12}, {"id": 942, "seek": 288706, "start": 2891.7, "end": 2899.34, "text": " And because the user knows it was written by this smarter, heavier 8B model, a human reader might subconsciously blindly trust it.", "tokens": [50597, 400, 570, 264, 4195, 3255, 309, 390, 3720, 538, 341, 20294, 11, 18279, 1649, 33, 2316, 11, 257, 1952, 15149, 1062, 27389, 356, 47744, 3361, 309, 13, 50979], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10644835978746414, "compression_ratio": 1.64797507788162, "no_speech_prob": 1.5308676635378271e-12}, {"id": 943, "seek": 288706, "start": 2899.56, "end": 2906.2999999999997, "text": " We might assume the critique is valid simply because of the authoritative file name and the model's reputation for being analytical.", "tokens": [50990, 492, 1062, 6552, 264, 25673, 307, 7363, 2935, 570, 295, 264, 3793, 14275, 3991, 1315, 293, 264, 2316, 311, 13061, 337, 885, 29579, 13, 51327], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10644835978746414, "compression_ratio": 1.64797507788162, "no_speech_prob": 1.5308676635378271e-12}, {"id": 944, "seek": 288706, "start": 2906.6, "end": 2906.7799999999997, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51342, 1779, 13, 51351], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10644835978746414, "compression_ratio": 1.64797507788162, "no_speech_prob": 1.5308676635378271e-12}, {"id": 945, "seek": 288706, "start": 2906.82, "end": 2914.14, "text": " We forget that the 8B model can still wildly hallucinate a critique just to fulfill its prompt requirements to find an error.", "tokens": [51353, 492, 2870, 300, 264, 1649, 33, 2316, 393, 920, 34731, 35212, 13923, 257, 25673, 445, 281, 13875, 1080, 12391, 7728, 281, 915, 364, 6713, 13, 51719], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10644835978746414, "compression_ratio": 1.64797507788162, "no_speech_prob": 1.5308676635378271e-12}, {"id": 946, "seek": 288706, "start": 2914.14, "end": 2916.86, "text": " It's like an AI wearing a lab coat and holding a clipboard.", "tokens": [51719, 467, 311, 411, 364, 7318, 4769, 257, 2715, 10690, 293, 5061, 257, 7353, 3787, 13, 51855], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10644835978746414, "compression_ratio": 1.64797507788162, "no_speech_prob": 1.5308676635378271e-12}, {"id": 947, "seek": 291686, "start": 2916.86, "end": 2918.08, "text": " That's exactly what it's like.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 311, 2293, 437, 309, 311, 411, 13, 50426], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13482093811035156, "compression_ratio": 1.5158371040723981, "no_speech_prob": 1.7014051842748068e-12}, {"id": 948, "seek": 291686, "start": 2918.08, "end": 2925.8, "text": " If the AI hands you a file called review.md filled with bullet points and academic jargon, it looks incredibly official.", "tokens": [50426, 759, 264, 7318, 2377, 291, 257, 3991, 1219, 3131, 13, 76, 67, 6412, 365, 11632, 2793, 293, 7778, 15181, 10660, 11, 309, 1542, 6252, 4783, 13, 50812], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13482093811035156, "compression_ratio": 1.5158371040723981, "no_speech_prob": 1.7014051842748068e-12}, {"id": 949, "seek": 291686, "start": 2926.0, "end": 2927.1400000000003, "text": " It looks like hard science.", "tokens": [50822, 467, 1542, 411, 1152, 3497, 13, 50879], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13482093811035156, "compression_ratio": 1.5158371040723981, "no_speech_prob": 1.7014051842748068e-12}, {"id": 950, "seek": 291686, "start": 2927.6, "end": 2935.6200000000003, "text": " But it could just be making up completely fake logical objections because the prompt essentially held a gun to its head and said, you must find objections.", "tokens": [50902, 583, 309, 727, 445, 312, 1455, 493, 2584, 7592, 14978, 44649, 570, 264, 12391, 4476, 5167, 257, 3874, 281, 1080, 1378, 293, 848, 11, 291, 1633, 915, 44649, 13, 51303], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13482093811035156, "compression_ratio": 1.5158371040723981, "no_speech_prob": 1.7014051842748068e-12}, {"id": 951, "seek": 293562, "start": 2935.62, "end": 2940.1, "text": " It is the aesthetic of rigor masking a lack of ground truth.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 307, 264, 20092, 295, 42191, 31226, 257, 5011, 295, 2727, 3494, 13, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23543083377000762, "compression_ratio": 1.4827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.59427245311028e-12}, {"id": 952, "seek": 293562, "start": 2940.22, "end": 2940.58, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [50595, 3153, 13, 50613], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23543083377000762, "compression_ratio": 1.4827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.59427245311028e-12}, {"id": 953, "seek": 293562, "start": 2941.06, "end": 2945.7599999999998, "text": " And there's another profound, perhaps more insidious risk the paper identifies.", "tokens": [50637, 400, 456, 311, 1071, 14382, 11, 4317, 544, 1028, 327, 851, 3148, 264, 3035, 34597, 13, 50872], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23543083377000762, "compression_ratio": 1.4827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.59427245311028e-12}, {"id": 954, "seek": 293562, "start": 2946.42, "end": 2947.92, "text": " Intellectual homogenization.", "tokens": [50905, 18762, 557, 901, 3655, 8799, 2144, 13, 50980], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23543083377000762, "compression_ratio": 1.4827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.59427245311028e-12}, {"id": 955, "seek": 293562, "start": 2948.68, "end": 2949.2, "text": " Homogenization.", "tokens": [51018, 20903, 8799, 2144, 13, 51044], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23543083377000762, "compression_ratio": 1.4827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.59427245311028e-12}, {"id": 956, "seek": 293562, "start": 2949.4, "end": 2949.52, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51054, 865, 13, 51060], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23543083377000762, "compression_ratio": 1.4827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.59427245311028e-12}, {"id": 957, "seek": 293562, "start": 2949.52, "end": 2949.98, "text": " Like milk.", "tokens": [51060, 1743, 5392, 13, 51083], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23543083377000762, "compression_ratio": 1.4827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.59427245311028e-12}, {"id": 958, "seek": 293562, "start": 2950.44, "end": 2954.7999999999997, "text": " Blending everything until all the distinct parts are exactly the same and nothing stands out.", "tokens": [51106, 2177, 2029, 1203, 1826, 439, 264, 10644, 3166, 366, 2293, 264, 912, 293, 1825, 7382, 484, 13, 51324], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23543083377000762, "compression_ratio": 1.4827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.59427245311028e-12}, {"id": 959, "seek": 295480, "start": 2954.8, "end": 2956.7200000000003, "text": " How does the pipeline cause that?", "tokens": [50365, 1012, 775, 264, 15517, 3082, 300, 30, 50461], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16822366245457385, "compression_ratio": 1.4585635359116023, "no_speech_prob": 1.9968950538268304e-12}, {"id": 960, "seek": 295480, "start": 2956.84, "end": 2966.0, "text": " By constantly forcing a draft essay through a highly conservative critic and an equally conservative reviser, the system exerts an immense pressure to normalize the text.", "tokens": [50467, 3146, 6460, 19030, 257, 11206, 16238, 807, 257, 5405, 13780, 7850, 293, 364, 12309, 13780, 3698, 6694, 11, 264, 1185, 31941, 82, 364, 22920, 3321, 281, 2710, 1125, 264, 2487, 13, 50925], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16822366245457385, "compression_ratio": 1.4585635359116023, "no_speech_prob": 1.9968950538268304e-12}, {"id": 961, "seek": 295480, "start": 2966.2400000000002, "end": 2967.1200000000003, "text": " Normalize it how?", "tokens": [50937, 21277, 1125, 309, 577, 30, 50981], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16822366245457385, "compression_ratio": 1.4585635359116023, "no_speech_prob": 1.9968950538268304e-12}, {"id": 962, "seek": 295480, "start": 2967.2400000000002, "end": 2968.7400000000002, "text": " Think about how these models are trained.", "tokens": [50987, 6557, 466, 577, 613, 5245, 366, 8895, 13, 51062], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16822366245457385, "compression_ratio": 1.4585635359116023, "no_speech_prob": 1.9968950538268304e-12}, {"id": 963, "seek": 296874, "start": 2968.74, "end": 2977.4799999999996, "text": " If you introduce a radically new, weird, completely non-standard theoretical idea in your draft, something genuinely novel that breaks the mold.", "tokens": [50365, 759, 291, 5366, 257, 35508, 777, 11, 3657, 11, 2584, 2107, 12, 1115, 515, 20864, 1558, 294, 428, 11206, 11, 746, 17839, 7613, 300, 9857, 264, 11102, 13, 50802], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495603673598345, "compression_ratio": 1.5527426160337552, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179316559063796e-12}, {"id": 964, "seek": 296874, "start": 2977.58, "end": 2977.8399999999997, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50807, 865, 13, 50820], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495603673598345, "compression_ratio": 1.5527426160337552, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179316559063796e-12}, {"id": 965, "seek": 296874, "start": 2977.9799999999996, "end": 2984.58, "text": " The reviewer model, which was trained on millions of conventional boring academic papers, might view your novelty as ambiguity.", "tokens": [50827, 440, 3131, 260, 2316, 11, 597, 390, 8895, 322, 6803, 295, 16011, 9989, 7778, 10577, 11, 1062, 1910, 428, 44805, 382, 46519, 13, 51157], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495603673598345, "compression_ratio": 1.5527426160337552, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179316559063796e-12}, {"id": 966, "seek": 296874, "start": 2985.02, "end": 2985.72, "text": " Oh, wow.", "tokens": [51179, 876, 11, 6076, 13, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495603673598345, "compression_ratio": 1.5527426160337552, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179316559063796e-12}, {"id": 967, "seek": 296874, "start": 2986.18, "end": 2989.72, "text": " It punishes originality because originality doesn't look like the training data.", "tokens": [51237, 467, 9842, 279, 4957, 1860, 570, 4957, 1860, 1177, 380, 574, 411, 264, 3097, 1412, 13, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495603673598345, "compression_ratio": 1.5527426160337552, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179316559063796e-12}, {"id": 968, "seek": 298972, "start": 2989.72, "end": 2990.3599999999997, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50397], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1459562381108602, "compression_ratio": 1.5570776255707763, "no_speech_prob": 1.935172508349403e-12}, {"id": 969, "seek": 298972, "start": 2990.56, "end": 3000.0, "text": " It might actively try to repair your novel groundbreaking idea until it sounds exactly like generic conventional academic prose.", "tokens": [50407, 467, 1062, 13022, 853, 281, 10535, 428, 7613, 42491, 1558, 1826, 309, 3263, 2293, 411, 19577, 16011, 7778, 12505, 13, 50879], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1459562381108602, "compression_ratio": 1.5570776255707763, "no_speech_prob": 1.935172508349403e-12}, {"id": 970, "seek": 298972, "start": 3000.24, "end": 3000.9199999999996, "text": " That's depressing.", "tokens": [50891, 663, 311, 36355, 13, 50925], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1459562381108602, "compression_ratio": 1.5570776255707763, "no_speech_prob": 1.935172508349403e-12}, {"id": 971, "seek": 298972, "start": 3001.4199999999996, "end": 3001.8599999999997, "text": " It is.", "tokens": [50950, 467, 307, 13, 50972], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1459562381108602, "compression_ratio": 1.5570776255707763, "no_speech_prob": 1.935172508349403e-12}, {"id": 972, "seek": 298972, "start": 3002.1, "end": 3010.8599999999997, "text": " It might ruthlessly erase the very conceptual distinction you were trying to make simply because the pattern matching neural network doesn't recognize the shape of the new idea.", "tokens": [50984, 467, 1062, 38225, 12048, 23525, 264, 588, 24106, 16844, 291, 645, 1382, 281, 652, 2935, 570, 264, 5102, 14324, 18161, 3209, 1177, 380, 5521, 264, 3909, 295, 264, 777, 1558, 13, 51422], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1459562381108602, "compression_ratio": 1.5570776255707763, "no_speech_prob": 1.935172508349403e-12}, {"id": 973, "seek": 301086, "start": 3010.86, "end": 3027.1, "text": " So wait, if I'm hearing this right, this whole beautiful, transparent, meticulously designed, Unix-inspired machine can just end up spitting out highly polished, confidently argued, generic, boring lies.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 1699, 11, 498, 286, 478, 4763, 341, 558, 11, 341, 1379, 2238, 11, 12737, 11, 41566, 25038, 4761, 11, 1156, 970, 12, 31637, 1824, 3479, 393, 445, 917, 493, 637, 2414, 484, 5405, 29079, 11, 41956, 20219, 11, 19577, 11, 9989, 9134, 13, 51177], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08285354966876887, "compression_ratio": 1.5743243243243243, "no_speech_prob": 1.610609432281529e-12}, {"id": 974, "seek": 301086, "start": 3027.1800000000003, "end": 3027.98, "text": " Well, yes, it can.", "tokens": [51181, 1042, 11, 2086, 11, 309, 393, 13, 51221], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08285354966876887, "compression_ratio": 1.5743243243243243, "no_speech_prob": 1.610609432281529e-12}, {"id": 975, "seek": 301086, "start": 3028.1800000000003, "end": 3031.1400000000003, "text": " If that is the case, what are we even doing here?", "tokens": [51231, 759, 300, 307, 264, 1389, 11, 437, 366, 321, 754, 884, 510, 30, 51379], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08285354966876887, "compression_ratio": 1.5743243243243243, "no_speech_prob": 1.610609432281529e-12}, {"id": 976, "seek": 301086, "start": 3031.2400000000002, "end": 3035.7000000000003, "text": " Why go through all this immense effort with shell scripts and local models and Git repositories?", "tokens": [51384, 1545, 352, 807, 439, 341, 22920, 4630, 365, 8720, 23294, 293, 2654, 5245, 293, 16939, 22283, 2083, 30, 51607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08285354966876887, "compression_ratio": 1.5743243243243243, "no_speech_prob": 1.610609432281529e-12}, {"id": 977, "seek": 301086, "start": 3035.92, "end": 3037.08, "text": " This raises an important question.", "tokens": [51618, 639, 19658, 364, 1021, 1168, 13, 51676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08285354966876887, "compression_ratio": 1.5743243243243243, "no_speech_prob": 1.610609432281529e-12}, {"id": 978, "seek": 301086, "start": 3037.2400000000002, "end": 3039.2400000000002, "text": " What is the actual goal of this experiment?", "tokens": [51684, 708, 307, 264, 3539, 3387, 295, 341, 5120, 30, 51784], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08285354966876887, "compression_ratio": 1.5743243243243243, "no_speech_prob": 1.610609432281529e-12}, {"id": 979, "seek": 301086, "start": 3039.42, "end": 3040.2200000000003, "text": " Yeah, what is it?", "tokens": [51793, 865, 11, 437, 307, 309, 30, 51833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08285354966876887, "compression_ratio": 1.5743243243243243, "no_speech_prob": 1.610609432281529e-12}, {"id": 980, "seek": 304022, "start": 3040.22, "end": 3042.7, "text": " And the author of the paper is very clear in the conclusion.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 264, 3793, 295, 264, 3035, 307, 588, 1850, 294, 264, 10063, 13, 50489], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1337176901953561, "compression_ratio": 1.727891156462585, "no_speech_prob": 2.881711362590078e-12}, {"id": 981, "seek": 304022, "start": 3043.4199999999996, "end": 3046.14, "text": " The primary goal was never to build a perfect truth machine.", "tokens": [50525, 440, 6194, 3387, 390, 1128, 281, 1322, 257, 2176, 3494, 3479, 13, 50661], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1337176901953561, "compression_ratio": 1.727891156462585, "no_speech_prob": 2.881711362590078e-12}, {"id": 982, "seek": 304022, "start": 3046.3799999999997, "end": 3051.2, "text": " The goal was not to build a commercial product that guarantees a flawless essay every single time you hit enter.", "tokens": [50673, 440, 3387, 390, 406, 281, 1322, 257, 6841, 1674, 300, 32567, 257, 45693, 16238, 633, 2167, 565, 291, 2045, 3242, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1337176901953561, "compression_ratio": 1.727891156462585, "no_speech_prob": 2.881711362590078e-12}, {"id": 983, "seek": 304022, "start": 3051.58, "end": 3056.04, "text": " The goal was to build a research architecture where failures are localizable.", "tokens": [50933, 440, 3387, 390, 281, 1322, 257, 2132, 9482, 689, 20774, 366, 2654, 22395, 13, 51156], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1337176901953561, "compression_ratio": 1.727891156462585, "no_speech_prob": 2.881711362590078e-12}, {"id": 984, "seek": 304022, "start": 3056.04, "end": 3059.22, "text": " Where we can finally see exactly where the machine broke down.", "tokens": [51156, 2305, 321, 393, 2721, 536, 2293, 689, 264, 3479, 6902, 760, 13, 51315], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1337176901953561, "compression_ratio": 1.727891156462585, "no_speech_prob": 2.881711362590078e-12}, {"id": 985, "seek": 304022, "start": 3059.4399999999996, "end": 3059.68, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51326, 1079, 13, 51338], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1337176901953561, "compression_ratio": 1.727891156462585, "no_speech_prob": 2.881711362590078e-12}, {"id": 986, "seek": 304022, "start": 3060.2599999999998, "end": 3070.0, "text": " When a monolithic black box AI chat interface produces a bad essay, you learn absolutely nothing about artificial intelligence.", "tokens": [51367, 1133, 257, 1108, 42878, 2211, 2424, 7318, 5081, 9226, 14725, 257, 1578, 16238, 11, 291, 1466, 3122, 1825, 466, 11677, 7599, 13, 51854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1337176901953561, "compression_ratio": 1.727891156462585, "no_speech_prob": 2.881711362590078e-12}, {"id": 987, "seek": 307000, "start": 3070.0, "end": 3071.22, "text": " You just get a bad essay.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 445, 483, 257, 1578, 16238, 13, 50426], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09064974103655134, "compression_ratio": 1.6578947368421053, "no_speech_prob": 1.7620080741687083e-12}, {"id": 988, "seek": 307000, "start": 3071.36, "end": 3071.56, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50433, 1779, 13, 50443], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09064974103655134, "compression_ratio": 1.6578947368421053, "no_speech_prob": 1.7620080741687083e-12}, {"id": 989, "seek": 307000, "start": 3071.92, "end": 3083.36, "text": " But when this pipeline produces a bad essay, when it homogenizes a novel idea, or when the revisor stubbornly ignores the reviewer, you can open the files and find out exactly where and why it failed.", "tokens": [50461, 583, 562, 341, 15517, 14725, 257, 1578, 16238, 11, 562, 309, 3655, 8799, 5660, 257, 7613, 1558, 11, 420, 562, 264, 20767, 284, 24137, 356, 5335, 2706, 264, 3131, 260, 11, 291, 393, 1269, 264, 7098, 293, 915, 484, 2293, 689, 293, 983, 309, 7612, 13, 51033], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09064974103655134, "compression_ratio": 1.6578947368421053, "no_speech_prob": 1.7620080741687083e-12}, {"id": 990, "seek": 307000, "start": 3083.48, "end": 3087.84, "text": " You can see the exact line where the reviewer flagged the novel idea as an error.", "tokens": [51039, 509, 393, 536, 264, 1900, 1622, 689, 264, 3131, 260, 7166, 3004, 264, 7613, 1558, 382, 364, 6713, 13, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09064974103655134, "compression_ratio": 1.6578947368421053, "no_speech_prob": 1.7620080741687083e-12}, {"id": 991, "seek": 308784, "start": 3087.84, "end": 3090.92, "text": " You can see the exact moment the revisor enacted that erasure.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 393, 536, 264, 1900, 1623, 264, 20767, 284, 41313, 300, 1189, 2508, 13, 50519], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15416032418437386, "compression_ratio": 1.530701754385965, "no_speech_prob": 1.507131659056471e-12}, {"id": 992, "seek": 308784, "start": 3091.46, "end": 3096.6000000000004, "text": " By making the failure visible and material, we can actually study and improve AI cognition.", "tokens": [50546, 3146, 1455, 264, 7763, 8974, 293, 2527, 11, 321, 393, 767, 2979, 293, 3470, 7318, 46905, 13, 50803], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15416032418437386, "compression_ratio": 1.530701754385965, "no_speech_prob": 1.507131659056471e-12}, {"id": 993, "seek": 308784, "start": 3096.76, "end": 3098.78, "text": " So it's a diagnostic tool for researchers.", "tokens": [50811, 407, 309, 311, 257, 27897, 2290, 337, 10309, 13, 50912], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15416032418437386, "compression_ratio": 1.530701754385965, "no_speech_prob": 1.507131659056471e-12}, {"id": 994, "seek": 308784, "start": 3099.02, "end": 3099.32, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50924, 7587, 13, 50939], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15416032418437386, "compression_ratio": 1.530701754385965, "no_speech_prob": 1.507131659056471e-12}, {"id": 995, "seek": 308784, "start": 3099.52, "end": 3100.94, "text": " We can test different prompt structures.", "tokens": [50949, 492, 393, 1500, 819, 12391, 9227, 13, 51020], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15416032418437386, "compression_ratio": 1.530701754385965, "no_speech_prob": 1.507131659056471e-12}, {"id": 996, "seek": 308784, "start": 3101.44, "end": 3107.1800000000003, "text": " We can measure empirically if swapping the 8B model for a 12B model fixes the homogenization problem.", "tokens": [51045, 492, 393, 3481, 25790, 984, 498, 1693, 10534, 264, 1649, 33, 2316, 337, 257, 2272, 33, 2316, 32539, 264, 3655, 8799, 2144, 1154, 13, 51332], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15416032418437386, "compression_ratio": 1.530701754385965, "no_speech_prob": 1.507131659056471e-12}, {"id": 997, "seek": 310718, "start": 3107.18, "end": 3113.5, "text": " The pipeline is an experimental apparatus designed to help us understand AI, not just a tool to churn out text.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 15517, 307, 364, 17069, 38573, 4761, 281, 854, 505, 1223, 7318, 11, 406, 445, 257, 2290, 281, 417, 925, 484, 2487, 13, 50681], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10747518077973396, "compression_ratio": 1.5759493670886076, "no_speech_prob": 1.708051343592143e-12}, {"id": 998, "seek": 310718, "start": 3113.74, "end": 3117.7799999999997, "text": " So what does this all mean, bringing all of this together for the listener?", "tokens": [50693, 407, 437, 775, 341, 439, 914, 11, 5062, 439, 295, 341, 1214, 337, 264, 31569, 30, 50895], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10747518077973396, "compression_ratio": 1.5759493670886076, "no_speech_prob": 1.708051343592143e-12}, {"id": 999, "seek": 310718, "start": 3117.96, "end": 3118.68, "text": " It means a lot.", "tokens": [50904, 467, 1355, 257, 688, 13, 50940], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10747518077973396, "compression_ratio": 1.5759493670886076, "no_speech_prob": 1.708051343592143e-12}, {"id": 1000, "seek": 310718, "start": 3118.94, "end": 3127.52, "text": " What Fliction's 2026 paper is really showing us is that the future of artificial intelligence might not be what we see in sci-fi movies or tech keynotes.", "tokens": [50953, 708, 3235, 4105, 311, 945, 10880, 3035, 307, 534, 4099, 505, 307, 300, 264, 2027, 295, 11677, 7599, 1062, 406, 312, 437, 321, 536, 294, 2180, 12, 13325, 6233, 420, 7553, 2141, 2247, 279, 13, 51382], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10747518077973396, "compression_ratio": 1.5759493670886076, "no_speech_prob": 1.708051343592143e-12}, {"id": 1001, "seek": 310718, "start": 3127.56, "end": 3128.1, "text": " Definitely not.", "tokens": [51384, 12151, 406, 13, 51411], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10747518077973396, "compression_ratio": 1.5759493670886076, "no_speech_prob": 1.708051343592143e-12}, {"id": 1002, "seek": 310718, "start": 3128.16, "end": 3135.22, "text": " It might not be a single opaque, omniscient superbrain sitting in a server farm that we just blindly trust with our prompts.", "tokens": [51414, 467, 1062, 406, 312, 257, 2167, 42687, 11, 3406, 10661, 5412, 1687, 6198, 259, 3798, 294, 257, 7154, 5421, 300, 321, 445, 47744, 3361, 365, 527, 41095, 13, 51767], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10747518077973396, "compression_ratio": 1.5759493670886076, "no_speech_prob": 1.708051343592143e-12}, {"id": 1003, "seek": 313522, "start": 3135.22, "end": 3143.3999999999996, "text": " The evidence strongly suggests that the future of productive, reliable, safe AI is likely compositional.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 4467, 10613, 13409, 300, 264, 2027, 295, 13304, 11, 12924, 11, 3273, 7318, 307, 3700, 10199, 2628, 13, 50774], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08363908270130986, "compression_ratio": 1.5119617224880382, "no_speech_prob": 1.573530260083611e-12}, {"id": 1004, "seek": 313522, "start": 3144.04, "end": 3144.68, "text": " Compositional.", "tokens": [50806, 6620, 329, 2628, 13, 50838], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08363908270130986, "compression_ratio": 1.5119617224880382, "no_speech_prob": 1.573530260083611e-12}, {"id": 1005, "seek": 313522, "start": 3144.8599999999997, "end": 3158.2999999999997, "text": " It is a transparent, modular, highly constrained assembly line where we can inspect every single thought process, every logical plan, and every critique as a saved text file on a local hard drive.", "tokens": [50847, 467, 307, 257, 12737, 11, 31111, 11, 5405, 38901, 12103, 1622, 689, 321, 393, 15018, 633, 2167, 1194, 1399, 11, 633, 14978, 1393, 11, 293, 633, 25673, 382, 257, 6624, 2487, 3991, 322, 257, 2654, 1152, 3332, 13, 51519], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08363908270130986, "compression_ratio": 1.5119617224880382, "no_speech_prob": 1.573530260083611e-12}, {"id": 1006, "seek": 315830, "start": 3158.3, "end": 3165.6000000000004, "text": " It is entirely about breaking the illusion of the magic generation button and taking physical, architectural control over the trajectory of machine thought.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 307, 7696, 466, 7697, 264, 18854, 295, 264, 5585, 5125, 2960, 293, 1940, 4001, 11, 26621, 1969, 670, 264, 21512, 295, 3479, 1194, 13, 50730], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09982107687687529, "compression_ratio": 1.5627906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.9129142714291447e-12}, {"id": 1007, "seek": 315830, "start": 3165.98, "end": 3169.48, "text": " And in doing so, we fundamentally demystify the technology.", "tokens": [50749, 400, 294, 884, 370, 11, 321, 17879, 1371, 38593, 2505, 264, 2899, 13, 50924], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09982107687687529, "compression_ratio": 1.5627906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.9129142714291447e-12}, {"id": 1008, "seek": 315830, "start": 3169.98, "end": 3176.1400000000003, "text": " We stop treating these language models as infallible digital oracles and start treating them as what they actually are.", "tokens": [50949, 492, 1590, 15083, 613, 2856, 5245, 382, 1536, 336, 964, 4562, 420, 9918, 293, 722, 15083, 552, 382, 437, 436, 767, 366, 13, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09982107687687529, "compression_ratio": 1.5627906976744186, "no_speech_prob": 1.9129142714291447e-12}, {"id": 1009, "seek": 317614, "start": 3176.14, "end": 3187.4, "text": " A sequence of bounded, fallible, probabilistic operations that absolutely require strict human oversight and rigid architectural constraints to produce truly reliable work.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 8310, 295, 37498, 11, 2100, 964, 11, 31959, 3142, 7705, 300, 3122, 3651, 10910, 1952, 29146, 293, 22195, 26621, 18491, 281, 5258, 4908, 12924, 589, 13, 50928], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07967888155291157, "compression_ratio": 1.323076923076923, "no_speech_prob": 1.649056108679603e-12}, {"id": 1010, "seek": 318740, "start": 3187.4, "end": 3193.58, "text": " Which leaves me with one final, deeply provocative thought that I want to leave you, the listener, with today.", "tokens": [50365, 3013, 5510, 385, 365, 472, 2572, 11, 8760, 47663, 1194, 300, 286, 528, 281, 1856, 291, 11, 264, 31569, 11, 365, 965, 13, 50674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11414177894592285, "compression_ratio": 1.3466666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.5743055690613525e-12}, {"id": 1011, "seek": 318740, "start": 3193.6600000000003, "end": 3194.36, "text": " Oh, let's hear it.", "tokens": [50678, 876, 11, 718, 311, 1568, 309, 13, 50713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11414177894592285, "compression_ratio": 1.3466666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.5743055690613525e-12}, {"id": 1012, "seek": 318740, "start": 3194.48, "end": 3197.7200000000003, "text": " Building heavily on what we've learned about this pipeline architecture.", "tokens": [50719, 18974, 10950, 322, 437, 321, 600, 3264, 466, 341, 15517, 9482, 13, 50881], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11414177894592285, "compression_ratio": 1.3466666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.5743055690613525e-12}, {"id": 1013, "seek": 319772, "start": 3197.72, "end": 3208.22, "text": " If forcing an AI to externalize its memory into physical files, if forcing an AI to logically plan its dependencies before it is allowed to speak,", "tokens": [50365, 759, 19030, 364, 7318, 281, 8320, 1125, 1080, 4675, 666, 4001, 7098, 11, 498, 19030, 364, 7318, 281, 38887, 1393, 1080, 36606, 949, 309, 307, 4350, 281, 1710, 11, 50890], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16027316241197184, "compression_ratio": 1.6699507389162562, "no_speech_prob": 1.7214593465986194e-12}, {"id": 1014, "seek": 319772, "start": 3208.6, "end": 3215.72, "text": " if forcing an AI to endure isolated negative cognitive friction makes it so much more effective and logically sound,", "tokens": [50909, 498, 19030, 364, 7318, 281, 24732, 14621, 3671, 15605, 17710, 1669, 309, 370, 709, 544, 4942, 293, 38887, 1626, 11, 51265], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16027316241197184, "compression_ratio": 1.6699507389162562, "no_speech_prob": 1.7214593465986194e-12}, {"id": 1015, "seek": 319772, "start": 3216.68, "end": 3220.64, "text": " shouldn't we be building this exact same strict pipeline for human thought?", "tokens": [51313, 4659, 380, 321, 312, 2390, 341, 1900, 912, 10910, 15517, 337, 1952, 1194, 30, 51511], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16027316241197184, "compression_ratio": 1.6699507389162562, "no_speech_prob": 1.7214593465986194e-12}, {"id": 1016, "seek": 322064, "start": 3220.64, "end": 3224.58, "text": " That is a fascinating application of the pipeline theory to human psychology.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 257, 10343, 3861, 295, 264, 15517, 5261, 281, 1952, 15105, 13, 50562], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07980419656504756, "compression_ratio": 1.6276923076923078, "no_speech_prob": 1.8982072857998133e-12}, {"id": 1017, "seek": 322064, "start": 3224.74, "end": 3232.9, "text": " Imagine a future digital workspace where you, the human employee, are physically not allowed by your software to send a project proposal or an email.", "tokens": [50570, 11739, 257, 2027, 4562, 32706, 689, 291, 11, 264, 1952, 10738, 11, 366, 9762, 406, 4350, 538, 428, 4722, 281, 2845, 257, 1716, 11494, 420, 364, 3796, 13, 50978], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07980419656504756, "compression_ratio": 1.6276923076923078, "no_speech_prob": 1.8982072857998133e-12}, {"id": 1018, "seek": 322064, "start": 3233.2, "end": 3233.7999999999997, "text": " Until what?", "tokens": [50993, 9088, 437, 30, 51023], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07980419656504756, "compression_ratio": 1.6276923076923078, "no_speech_prob": 1.8982072857998133e-12}, {"id": 1019, "seek": 322064, "start": 3233.94, "end": 3241.44, "text": " Until a local system forces you to stop, step out of your flow state, and write out your unstated assumptions into an inspectable review.md file.", "tokens": [51030, 9088, 257, 2654, 1185, 5874, 291, 281, 1590, 11, 1823, 484, 295, 428, 3095, 1785, 11, 293, 2464, 484, 428, 18799, 770, 17695, 666, 364, 15018, 712, 3131, 13, 76, 67, 3991, 13, 51405], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07980419656504756, "compression_ratio": 1.6276923076923078, "no_speech_prob": 1.8982072857998133e-12}, {"id": 1020, "seek": 322064, "start": 3241.44, "end": 3250.4, "text": " What if the ultimate hidden value of this entire AI architecture isn't just that it teaches us how to deconstruct and debug machine generation?", "tokens": [51405, 708, 498, 264, 9705, 7633, 2158, 295, 341, 2302, 7318, 9482, 1943, 380, 445, 300, 309, 16876, 505, 577, 281, 49473, 1757, 293, 24083, 3479, 5125, 30, 51853], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07980419656504756, "compression_ratio": 1.6276923076923078, "no_speech_prob": 1.8982072857998133e-12}, {"id": 1021, "seek": 325064, "start": 3250.64, "end": 3251.66, "text": " What if it serves as a mirror?", "tokens": [50365, 708, 498, 309, 13451, 382, 257, 8013, 30, 50416], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10973368281811739, "compression_ratio": 1.576271186440678, "no_speech_prob": 1.762272294238143e-12}, {"id": 1022, "seek": 325064, "start": 3251.8599999999997, "end": 3252.2799999999997, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50426, 7587, 13, 50447], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10973368281811739, "compression_ratio": 1.576271186440678, "no_speech_prob": 1.762272294238143e-12}, {"id": 1023, "seek": 325064, "start": 3252.58, "end": 3259.3399999999997, "text": " What if it teaches us how to deconstruct, inspect, and debug our own flawed, impulsive, black box human reasoning?", "tokens": [50462, 708, 498, 309, 16876, 505, 577, 281, 49473, 1757, 11, 15018, 11, 293, 24083, 527, 1065, 38823, 11, 704, 32657, 11, 2211, 2424, 1952, 21577, 30, 50800], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10973368281811739, "compression_ratio": 1.576271186440678, "no_speech_prob": 1.762272294238143e-12}, {"id": 1024, "seek": 325064, "start": 3259.62, "end": 3265.96, "text": " It forces us to confront the reality that human cognition is often the original black box.", "tokens": [50814, 467, 5874, 505, 281, 12422, 264, 4103, 300, 1952, 46905, 307, 2049, 264, 3380, 2211, 2424, 13, 51131], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10973368281811739, "compression_ratio": 1.576271186440678, "no_speech_prob": 1.762272294238143e-12}, {"id": 1025, "seek": 325064, "start": 3266.2, "end": 3266.5, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51143, 1079, 13, 51158], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10973368281811739, "compression_ratio": 1.576271186440678, "no_speech_prob": 1.762272294238143e-12}, {"id": 1026, "seek": 325064, "start": 3266.8199999999997, "end": 3272.22, "text": " Because whether you are a biological human or a massive language model running on a GPU,", "tokens": [51174, 1436, 1968, 291, 366, 257, 13910, 1952, 420, 257, 5994, 2856, 2316, 2614, 322, 257, 18407, 11, 51444], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10973368281811739, "compression_ratio": 1.576271186440678, "no_speech_prob": 1.762272294238143e-12}, {"id": 1027, "seek": 325064, "start": 3272.58, "end": 3278.4, "text": " sometimes you just need to stop, step back, look at the raw ingredients sitting in the separate bowls on your kitchen island.", "tokens": [51462, 2171, 291, 445, 643, 281, 1590, 11, 1823, 646, 11, 574, 412, 264, 8936, 6952, 3798, 294, 264, 4994, 28513, 322, 428, 6525, 6077, 13, 51753], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10973368281811739, "compression_ratio": 1.576271186440678, "no_speech_prob": 1.762272294238143e-12}, {"id": 1028, "seek": 327840, "start": 3278.4, "end": 3282.1800000000003, "text": " And figure out exactly where the recipe went wrong before you blindly put it in the blender.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 2573, 484, 2293, 689, 264, 6782, 1437, 2085, 949, 291, 47744, 829, 309, 294, 264, 24564, 13, 50554], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12076342264811198, "compression_ratio": 1.475, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191813735812576e-12}, {"id": 1029, "seek": 327840, "start": 3282.5, "end": 3283.26, "text": " Perfectly said.", "tokens": [50570, 10246, 356, 848, 13, 50608], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12076342264811198, "compression_ratio": 1.475, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191813735812576e-12}, {"id": 1030, "seek": 327840, "start": 3283.56, "end": 3286.54, "text": " Thank you so much for joining us on this deep dive today.", "tokens": [50623, 1044, 291, 370, 709, 337, 5549, 505, 322, 341, 2452, 9192, 965, 13, 50772], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12076342264811198, "compression_ratio": 1.475, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191813735812576e-12}, {"id": 1031, "seek": 327840, "start": 3287.0, "end": 3291.78, "text": " Keep questioning the black boxes in your own lives, whether they are made of silicon or synapses,", "tokens": [50795, 5527, 21257, 264, 2211, 9002, 294, 428, 1065, 2909, 11, 1968, 436, 366, 1027, 295, 22848, 420, 5451, 2382, 279, 11, 51034], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12076342264811198, "compression_ratio": 1.475, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191813735812576e-12}, {"id": 1032, "seek": 327840, "start": 3291.88, "end": 3293.2000000000003, "text": " and we will see you next time.", "tokens": [51039, 293, 321, 486, 536, 291, 958, 565, 13, 51105], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12076342264811198, "compression_ratio": 1.475, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191813735812576e-12}], "language": "en"}
