ts are dimmed to that soft kind of artificial dusk.", "tokens": [51111, 440, 9401, 5811, 366, 5013, 1912, 281, 300, 2787, 733, 295, 11677, 14284, 74, 13, 51274], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1544495362501878, "compression_ratio": 1.5813148788927336, "no_speech_prob": 8.164351356435007e-13}, {"id": 6, "seek": 0, "start": 18.7, "end": 21.240000000000002, "text": " And the flight attendants are quietly coming down the aisle,", "tokens": [51300, 400, 264, 7018, 6888, 1719, 366, 19141, 1348, 760, 264, 30916, 11, 51427], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1544495362501878, "compression_ratio": 1.5813148788927336, "no_speech_prob": 8.164351356435007e-13}, {"id": 7, "seek": 0, "start": 21.400000000000002, "end": 26.26, "text": " handing out those, you know, tiny plastic cups of water and bags of pretzels.", "tokens": [51435, 34774, 484, 729, 11, 291, 458, 11, 5870, 5900, 13381, 295, 1281, 293, 10405, 295, 1162, 89, 1625, 13, 51678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1544495362501878, "compression_ratio": 1.5813148788927336, "no_speech_prob": 8.164351356435007e-13}, {"id": 8, "seek": 0, "start": 26.48, "end": 26.68, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51689, 1779, 13, 51699], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1544495362501878, "compression_ratio": 1.5813148788927336, "no_speech_prob": 8.164351356435007e-13}, {"id": 9, "seek": 0, "start": 26.68, "end": 28.38, "text": " You're settling into seat 14B.", "tokens": [51699, 509, 434, 33841, 666, 6121, 3499, 33, 13, 51784], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1544495362501878, "compression_ratio": 1.5813148788927336, "no_speech_prob": 8.164351356435007e-13}, {"id": 10, "seek": 2838, "start": 28.38, "end": 32.54, "text": " You're adjusting your neck pillow, maybe queuing up a movie on the seat back screen.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 434, 23559, 428, 6189, 18581, 11, 1310, 631, 9635, 493, 257, 3169, 322, 264, 6121, 646, 2568, 13, 50573], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 11, "seek": 2838, "start": 32.74, "end": 34.72, "text": " Everything feels perfectly normal.", "tokens": [50583, 5471, 3417, 6239, 2710, 13, 50682], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 12, "seek": 2838, "start": 35.1, "end": 35.519999999999996, "text": " Completely mundane.", "tokens": [50701, 39978, 43497, 13, 50722], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 13, "seek": 2838, "start": 35.879999999999995, "end": 36.019999999999996, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50740, 865, 13, 50747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 14, "seek": 2838, "start": 36.14, "end": 37.62, "text": " The environment is completely stable.", "tokens": [50753, 440, 2823, 307, 2584, 8351, 13, 50827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 15, "seek": 2838, "start": 38.1, "end": 39.28, "text": " The air conditioning is humming.", "tokens": [50851, 440, 1988, 21901, 307, 34965, 13, 50910], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 16, "seek": 2838, "start": 39.56, "end": 40.7, "text": " Your coffee is warm.", "tokens": [50924, 2260, 4982, 307, 4561, 13, 50981], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 17, "seek": 2838, "start": 41.06, "end": 42.98, "text": " You hear the ice in your neighbor's drink clinking.", "tokens": [50999, 509, 1568, 264, 4435, 294, 428, 5987, 311, 2822, 596, 12408, 13, 51095], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 18, "seek": 2838, "start": 43.84, "end": 47.58, "text": " But up in the cockpit, behind that locked reinforced door,", "tokens": [51138, 583, 493, 294, 264, 35990, 11, 2261, 300, 9376, 31365, 2853, 11, 51325], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 19, "seek": 2838, "start": 48.18, "end": 50.879999999999995, "text": " the pilots have just realized something absolutely terrifying.", "tokens": [51355, 264, 21506, 362, 445, 5334, 746, 3122, 18106, 13, 51490], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 20, "seek": 2838, "start": 51.0, "end": 51.64, "text": " Oh, man.", "tokens": [51496, 876, 11, 587, 13, 51528], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 21, "seek": 2838, "start": 51.82, "end": 53.92, "text": " The steering column is just entirely dead.", "tokens": [51537, 440, 14823, 7738, 307, 445, 7696, 3116, 13, 51642], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 22, "seek": 2838, "start": 54.18, "end": 57.72, "text": " The navigation systems are a blank, glitching gray.", "tokens": [51655, 440, 17346, 3652, 366, 257, 8247, 11, 23552, 278, 10855, 13, 51832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20495246177495913, "compression_ratio": 1.6349206349206349, "no_speech_prob": 8.827715576760486e-13}, {"id": 23, "seek": 5838, "start": 58.38, "end": 62.72, "text": " And worse than that, they have just received a final fragmented radio transmission,", "tokens": [50365, 400, 5324, 813, 300, 11, 436, 362, 445, 4613, 257, 2572, 9241, 14684, 6477, 11574, 11, 50582], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17727174514379257, "compression_ratio": 1.5136363636363637, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171597481268174e-12}, {"id": 24, "seek": 5838, "start": 63.24, "end": 66.72, "text": " indicating that there is no longer a runway left anywhere on Earth to land on.", "tokens": [50608, 25604, 300, 456, 307, 572, 2854, 257, 26642, 1411, 4992, 322, 4755, 281, 2117, 322, 13, 50782], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17727174514379257, "compression_ratio": 1.5136363636363637, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171597481268174e-12}, {"id": 25, "seek": 5838, "start": 66.72, "end": 68.62, "text": " The continents themselves are just gone.", "tokens": [50782, 440, 38598, 2969, 366, 445, 2780, 13, 50877], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17727174514379257, "compression_ratio": 1.5136363636363637, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171597481268174e-12}, {"id": 26, "seek": 5838, "start": 69.16, "end": 70.36, "text": " So you are flying.", "tokens": [50904, 407, 291, 366, 7137, 13, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17727174514379257, "compression_ratio": 1.5136363636363637, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171597481268174e-12}, {"id": 27, "seek": 5838, "start": 70.86, "end": 73.96000000000001, "text": " You are perfectly safe in this exact isolated moment.", "tokens": [50989, 509, 366, 6239, 3273, 294, 341, 1900, 14621, 1623, 13, 51144], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17727174514379257, "compression_ratio": 1.5136363636363637, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171597481268174e-12}, {"id": 28, "seek": 5838, "start": 74.3, "end": 76.78, "text": " Your physical environment hasn't changed one single bit.", "tokens": [51161, 2260, 4001, 2823, 6132, 380, 3105, 472, 2167, 857, 13, 51285], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17727174514379257, "compression_ratio": 1.5136363636363637, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171597481268174e-12}, {"id": 29, "seek": 7678, "start": 76.78, "end": 79.34, "text": " But you are never, ever going to arrive.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 291, 366, 1128, 11, 1562, 516, 281, 8881, 13, 50493], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17092580532808915, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 1.3457266984789884e-12}, {"id": 30, "seek": 7678, "start": 79.34, "end": 80.18, "text": " It is.", "tokens": [50493, 467, 307, 13, 50535], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17092580532808915, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 1.3457266984789884e-12}, {"id": 31, "seek": 7678, "start": 80.4, "end": 83.0, "text": " It's the ultimate nightmare of modern existence, really.", "tokens": [50546, 467, 311, 264, 9705, 18724, 295, 4363, 9123, 11, 534, 13, 50676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17092580532808915, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 1.3457266984789884e-12}, {"id": 32, "seek": 7678, "start": 83.14, "end": 86.32000000000001, "text": " Just distilled down into a single pressurized tube.", "tokens": [50683, 1449, 1483, 6261, 760, 666, 257, 2167, 1886, 374, 1602, 9917, 13, 50842], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17092580532808915, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 1.3457266984789884e-12}, {"id": 33, "seek": 7678, "start": 86.48, "end": 86.58, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50850, 1779, 13, 50855], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17092580532808915, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 1.3457266984789884e-12}, {"id": 34, "seek": 7678, "start": 86.92, "end": 89.44, "text": " You have a present reality that is utterly intact.", "tokens": [50872, 509, 362, 257, 1974, 4103, 300, 307, 30251, 23493, 13, 50998], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17092580532808915, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 1.3457266984789884e-12}, {"id": 35, "seek": 7678, "start": 89.44, "end": 93.64, "text": " But the future possibility that justifies that present is just vanished.", "tokens": [50998, 583, 264, 2027, 7959, 300, 445, 11221, 300, 1974, 307, 445, 37518, 13, 51208], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17092580532808915, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 1.3457266984789884e-12}, {"id": 36, "seek": 7678, "start": 93.84, "end": 98.02000000000001, "text": " The entire temporal structure of your life has just been quietly amputated.", "tokens": [51218, 440, 2302, 30881, 3877, 295, 428, 993, 575, 445, 668, 19141, 669, 2582, 770, 13, 51427], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17092580532808915, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 1.3457266984789884e-12}, {"id": 37, "seek": 7678, "start": 98.12, "end": 99.64, "text": " And, you know, you don't even know it yet.", "tokens": [51432, 400, 11, 291, 458, 11, 291, 500, 380, 754, 458, 309, 1939, 13, 51508], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17092580532808915, "compression_ratio": 1.573643410852713, "no_speech_prob": 1.3457266984789884e-12}, {"id": 38, "seek": 9964, "start": 99.64, "end": 105.98, "text": " And it's this incredibly surreal, almost suffocating tension that we are exploring with you today.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 309, 311, 341, 6252, 32513, 11, 1920, 3889, 905, 990, 8980, 300, 321, 366, 12736, 365, 291, 965, 13, 50682], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12336503454001553, "compression_ratio": 1.4748858447488584, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298440461831598e-12}, {"id": 39, "seek": 9964, "start": 106.2, "end": 111.14, "text": " We're pulling you, the listener, right into seat 14B for this conversation.", "tokens": [50693, 492, 434, 8407, 291, 11, 264, 31569, 11, 558, 666, 6121, 3499, 33, 337, 341, 3761, 13, 50940], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12336503454001553, "compression_ratio": 1.4748858447488584, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298440461831598e-12}, {"id": 40, "seek": 9964, "start": 111.4, "end": 114.46000000000001, "text": " Because what we are looking at isn't just an aviation horror story.", "tokens": [50953, 1436, 437, 321, 366, 1237, 412, 1943, 380, 445, 364, 28831, 11501, 1657, 13, 51106], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12336503454001553, "compression_ratio": 1.4748858447488584, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298440461831598e-12}, {"id": 41, "seek": 9964, "start": 114.52, "end": 115.2, "text": " No, not at all.", "tokens": [51109, 883, 11, 406, 412, 439, 13, 51143], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12336503454001553, "compression_ratio": 1.4748858447488584, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298440461831598e-12}, {"id": 42, "seek": 9964, "start": 115.2, "end": 119.74000000000001, "text": " We are diving deep into a brilliant 2026 sociological monograph.", "tokens": [51143, 492, 366, 20241, 2452, 666, 257, 10248, 945, 10880, 3075, 4383, 1108, 3108, 13, 51370], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12336503454001553, "compression_ratio": 1.4748858447488584, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298440461831598e-12}, {"id": 43, "seek": 11974, "start": 119.74, "end": 122.32, "text": " It's by an independent researcher known as Flixion.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 538, 364, 6695, 21751, 2570, 382, 3235, 970, 313, 13, 50494], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18487049284435453, "compression_ratio": 1.5299684542586751, "no_speech_prob": 1.7555634680352372e-12}, {"id": 44, "seek": 11974, "start": 122.55999999999999, "end": 125.16, "text": " And it's titled The Sociology of Unreachable Futures.", "tokens": [50506, 400, 309, 311, 19841, 440, 12276, 1793, 295, 1156, 16226, 712, 16569, 1303, 13, 50636], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18487049284435453, "compression_ratio": 1.5299684542586751, "no_speech_prob": 1.7555634680352372e-12}, {"id": 45, "seek": 11974, "start": 125.39999999999999, "end": 126.44, "text": " Such a fascinating text.", "tokens": [50648, 9653, 257, 10343, 2487, 13, 50700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18487049284435453, "compression_ratio": 1.5299684542586751, "no_speech_prob": 1.7555634680352372e-12}, {"id": 46, "seek": 11974, "start": 126.69999999999999, "end": 127.38, "text": " It really is.", "tokens": [50713, 467, 534, 307, 13, 50747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18487049284435453, "compression_ratio": 1.5299684542586751, "no_speech_prob": 1.7555634680352372e-12}, {"id": 47, "seek": 11974, "start": 127.46, "end": 127.58, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50751, 865, 13, 50757], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18487049284435453, "compression_ratio": 1.5299684542586751, "no_speech_prob": 1.7555634680352372e-12}, {"id": 48, "seek": 11974, "start": 127.94, "end": 134.74, "text": " And to dissect how human beings actually function, or I guess fail to function when their future is stolen,", "tokens": [50775, 400, 281, 48332, 577, 1952, 8958, 767, 2445, 11, 420, 286, 2041, 3061, 281, 2445, 562, 641, 2027, 307, 15900, 11, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18487049284435453, "compression_ratio": 1.5299684542586751, "no_speech_prob": 1.7555634680352372e-12}, {"id": 49, "seek": 11974, "start": 135.16, "end": 138.16, "text": " the author uses a very specific theoretical laboratory.", "tokens": [51136, 264, 3793, 4960, 257, 588, 2685, 20864, 16523, 13, 51286], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18487049284435453, "compression_ratio": 1.5299684542586751, "no_speech_prob": 1.7555634680352372e-12}, {"id": 50, "seek": 11974, "start": 139.01999999999998, "end": 144.22, "text": " We're looking at Harry Martinson's 1956 science fiction epic poem, Aniara.", "tokens": [51329, 492, 434, 1237, 412, 9378, 5807, 14321, 311, 46379, 3497, 13266, 13581, 13065, 11, 1107, 72, 2419, 13, 51589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18487049284435453, "compression_ratio": 1.5299684542586751, "no_speech_prob": 1.7555634680352372e-12}, {"id": 51, "seek": 11974, "start": 144.38, "end": 148.78, "text": " Which, I mean, it serves as a shockingly prescient framework for where we find ourselves today.", "tokens": [51597, 3013, 11, 286, 914, 11, 309, 13451, 382, 257, 5588, 12163, 1183, 5412, 8388, 337, 689, 321, 915, 4175, 965, 13, 51817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18487049284435453, "compression_ratio": 1.5299684542586751, "no_speech_prob": 1.7555634680352372e-12}, {"id": 52, "seek": 14878, "start": 148.78, "end": 157.16, "text": " For those who aren't familiar with the text, Aniara chronicles the voyage of this massive city-sized spacecraft carrying thousands of refugees.", "tokens": [50365, 1171, 729, 567, 3212, 380, 4963, 365, 264, 2487, 11, 1107, 72, 2419, 19393, 5350, 264, 30729, 295, 341, 5994, 2307, 12, 20614, 22910, 9792, 5383, 295, 18301, 13, 50784], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1352689288078098, "compression_ratio": 1.5506756756756757, "no_speech_prob": 1.5984656090081706e-12}, {"id": 53, "seek": 14878, "start": 157.36, "end": 158.3, "text": " Like a giant life raft.", "tokens": [50794, 1743, 257, 7410, 993, 43863, 13, 50841], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1352689288078098, "compression_ratio": 1.5506756756756757, "no_speech_prob": 1.5984656090081706e-12}, {"id": 54, "seek": 14878, "start": 158.7, "end": 159.24, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50861, 7587, 13, 50888], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1352689288078098, "compression_ratio": 1.5506756756756757, "no_speech_prob": 1.5984656090081706e-12}, {"id": 55, "seek": 14878, "start": 159.9, "end": 166.78, "text": " They are fleeing a poisoned, ecologically devastated Earth heading toward a bleak but technically survivable new colony on Mars.", "tokens": [50921, 814, 366, 41885, 257, 36677, 11, 11437, 17157, 34880, 4755, 9864, 7361, 257, 5408, 514, 457, 12120, 12324, 712, 777, 23028, 322, 9692, 13, 51265], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1352689288078098, "compression_ratio": 1.5506756756756757, "no_speech_prob": 1.5984656090081706e-12}, {"id": 56, "seek": 14878, "start": 166.96, "end": 167.16, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51274, 1779, 13, 51284], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1352689288078098, "compression_ratio": 1.5506756756756757, "no_speech_prob": 1.5984656090081706e-12}, {"id": 57, "seek": 14878, "start": 167.76, "end": 171.98, "text": " But very early in this routine journey, the ship encounters an uncharted asteroid field.", "tokens": [51314, 583, 588, 2440, 294, 341, 9927, 4671, 11, 264, 5374, 26310, 364, 33686, 47350, 33833, 2519, 13, 51525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1352689288078098, "compression_ratio": 1.5506756756756757, "no_speech_prob": 1.5984656090081706e-12}, {"id": 58, "seek": 14878, "start": 172.38, "end": 175.3, "text": " They are forced to swerve violently to avoid a collision.", "tokens": [51545, 814, 366, 7579, 281, 262, 1554, 303, 46728, 281, 5042, 257, 24644, 13, 51691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1352689288078098, "compression_ratio": 1.5506756756756757, "no_speech_prob": 1.5984656090081706e-12}, {"id": 59, "seek": 17530, "start": 175.3, "end": 179.66000000000003, "text": " And in doing so, the critical steering mechanism is permanently destroyed.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 294, 884, 370, 11, 264, 4924, 14823, 7513, 307, 24042, 8937, 13, 50583], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 60, "seek": 17530, "start": 179.92000000000002, "end": 180.66000000000003, "text": " It's just gone.", "tokens": [50596, 467, 311, 445, 2780, 13, 50633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 61, "seek": 17530, "start": 180.88000000000002, "end": 181.06, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50644, 865, 13, 50653], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 62, "seek": 17530, "start": 181.34, "end": 188.84, "text": " They are knocked completely off course, totally ejected from the solar system, and sent hurtling out into the endless dark void of deep space.", "tokens": [50667, 814, 366, 16914, 2584, 766, 1164, 11, 3879, 32520, 292, 490, 264, 7936, 1185, 11, 293, 2279, 4607, 1688, 484, 666, 264, 16144, 2877, 22009, 295, 2452, 1901, 13, 51042], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 63, "seek": 17530, "start": 189.0, "end": 190.20000000000002, "text": " They can't go back to Earth.", "tokens": [51050, 814, 393, 380, 352, 646, 281, 4755, 13, 51110], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 64, "seek": 17530, "start": 190.26000000000002, "end": 191.5, "text": " They can't go forward to Mars.", "tokens": [51113, 814, 393, 380, 352, 2128, 281, 9692, 13, 51175], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 65, "seek": 17530, "start": 191.98000000000002, "end": 195.42000000000002, "text": " Yet, crucially, the ship itself is completely unharmed.", "tokens": [51199, 10890, 11, 5140, 1909, 11, 264, 5374, 2564, 307, 2584, 517, 5854, 1912, 13, 51371], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 66, "seek": 17530, "start": 195.58, "end": 196.70000000000002, "text": " That's the crazy part.", "tokens": [51379, 663, 311, 264, 3219, 644, 13, 51435], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 67, "seek": 17530, "start": 196.88000000000002, "end": 198.02, "text": " The life support works.", "tokens": [51444, 440, 993, 1406, 1985, 13, 51501], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 68, "seek": 17530, "start": 198.28, "end": 200.20000000000002, "text": " The cafeterias still serve food.", "tokens": [51514, 440, 38719, 4609, 920, 4596, 1755, 13, 51610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1696305956159319, "compression_ratio": 1.5875912408759123, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691764936725307e-12}, {"id": 69, "seek": 20020, "start": 200.2, "end": 203.01999999999998, "text": " The lights are on, but nobody is ever going home.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 5811, 366, 322, 11, 457, 5079, 307, 1562, 516, 1280, 13, 50506], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12784136325941173, "compression_ratio": 1.583916083916084, "no_speech_prob": 1.996600801357218e-12}, {"id": 70, "seek": 20020, "start": 203.26, "end": 203.35999999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50518, 1779, 13, 50523], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12784136325941173, "compression_ratio": 1.583916083916084, "no_speech_prob": 1.996600801357218e-12}, {"id": 71, "seek": 20020, "start": 204.0, "end": 215.26, "text": " And what is so vital to understand right at the top is that the author of this monograph isn't just giving us a literary critique of a mid-century Swedish poem, right?", "tokens": [50555, 400, 437, 307, 370, 11707, 281, 1223, 558, 412, 264, 1192, 307, 300, 264, 3793, 295, 341, 1108, 3108, 1943, 380, 445, 2902, 505, 257, 24194, 25673, 295, 257, 2062, 12, 32889, 23523, 13065, 11, 558, 30, 51118], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12784136325941173, "compression_ratio": 1.583916083916084, "no_speech_prob": 1.996600801357218e-12}, {"id": 72, "seek": 20020, "start": 215.45999999999998, "end": 216.16, "text": " Definitely not.", "tokens": [51128, 12151, 406, 13, 51163], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12784136325941173, "compression_ratio": 1.583916083916084, "no_speech_prob": 1.996600801357218e-12}, {"id": 73, "seek": 20020, "start": 216.42, "end": 224.12, "text": " This drifting spaceship is basically a magnifying glass placed over the invisible scaffolding of our actual real-world society.", "tokens": [51176, 639, 37973, 39185, 307, 1936, 257, 4944, 5489, 4276, 7074, 670, 264, 14603, 44094, 278, 295, 527, 3539, 957, 12, 13217, 4086, 13, 51561], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12784136325941173, "compression_ratio": 1.583916083916084, "no_speech_prob": 1.996600801357218e-12}, {"id": 74, "seek": 20020, "start": 225.56, "end": 228.89999999999998, "text": " Okay, let's unpack this because we really need to understand what this means for us.", "tokens": [51633, 1033, 11, 718, 311, 26699, 341, 570, 321, 534, 643, 281, 1223, 437, 341, 1355, 337, 505, 13, 51800], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12784136325941173, "compression_ratio": 1.583916083916084, "no_speech_prob": 1.996600801357218e-12}, {"id": 75, "seek": 22890, "start": 228.9, "end": 243.94, "text": " Yeah, so the central premise of the research here is that our real-world institutions, our legal frameworks, our economic hopes, and even our most mundane daily routines, like, you know, brushing your teeth or setting an alarm clock, they are secretly held together by futures that haven't happened yet.", "tokens": [50365, 865, 11, 370, 264, 5777, 22045, 295, 264, 2132, 510, 307, 300, 527, 957, 12, 13217, 8142, 11, 527, 5089, 29834, 11, 527, 4836, 13681, 11, 293, 754, 527, 881, 43497, 5212, 33827, 11, 411, 11, 291, 458, 11, 33130, 428, 7798, 420, 3287, 364, 14183, 7830, 11, 436, 366, 22611, 5167, 1214, 538, 26071, 300, 2378, 380, 2011, 1939, 13, 51117], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11227982594416691, "compression_ratio": 1.7046783625730995, "no_speech_prob": 1.4782044945732542e-12}, {"id": 76, "seek": 22890, "start": 244.06, "end": 245.36, "text": " Futures that haven't happened yet.", "tokens": [51123, 16569, 1303, 300, 2378, 380, 2011, 1939, 13, 51188], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11227982594416691, "compression_ratio": 1.7046783625730995, "no_speech_prob": 1.4782044945732542e-12}, {"id": 77, "seek": 22890, "start": 245.38, "end": 246.16, "text": " I love that phrasing.", "tokens": [51189, 286, 959, 300, 7636, 3349, 13, 51228], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11227982594416691, "compression_ratio": 1.7046783625730995, "no_speech_prob": 1.4782044945732542e-12}, {"id": 78, "seek": 22890, "start": 246.3, "end": 246.48000000000002, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51235, 1779, 13, 51244], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11227982594416691, "compression_ratio": 1.7046783625730995, "no_speech_prob": 1.4782044945732542e-12}, {"id": 79, "seek": 22890, "start": 246.64000000000001, "end": 253.44, "text": " So this deep dive is going to totally dismantle the mechanics of what actually happens to a civilization when it survives a physical catastrophe.", "tokens": [51252, 407, 341, 2452, 9192, 307, 516, 281, 3879, 30506, 306, 264, 12939, 295, 437, 767, 2314, 281, 257, 18036, 562, 309, 46231, 257, 4001, 36043, 13, 51592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11227982594416691, "compression_ratio": 1.7046783625730995, "no_speech_prob": 1.4782044945732542e-12}, {"id": 80, "seek": 22890, "start": 253.86, "end": 257.86, "text": " But the destination it was entirely organized around ceases to exist.", "tokens": [51613, 583, 264, 12236, 309, 390, 7696, 9983, 926, 1769, 1957, 281, 2514, 13, 51813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11227982594416691, "compression_ratio": 1.7046783625730995, "no_speech_prob": 1.4782044945732542e-12}, {"id": 81, "seek": 25786, "start": 257.86, "end": 263.40000000000003, "text": " First, we're going to examine what it truly means to be biologically alive but socially and temporally dead.", "tokens": [50365, 2386, 11, 321, 434, 516, 281, 17496, 437, 309, 4908, 1355, 281, 312, 3228, 17157, 5465, 457, 21397, 293, 8219, 379, 3116, 13, 50642], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11536299596067334, "compression_ratio": 1.6818181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 1.5671730406452422e-12}, {"id": 82, "seek": 25786, "start": 263.86, "end": 269.02000000000004, "text": " So to start mapping this out, the author draws a fundamental line in the sand regarding how we define survival.", "tokens": [50665, 407, 281, 722, 18350, 341, 484, 11, 264, 3793, 20045, 257, 8088, 1622, 294, 264, 4932, 8595, 577, 321, 6964, 12559, 13, 50923], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11536299596067334, "compression_ratio": 1.6818181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 1.5671730406452422e-12}, {"id": 83, "seek": 25786, "start": 269.58000000000004, "end": 273.18, "text": " And honestly, it fundamentally changes how I look at my own daily lives now.", "tokens": [50951, 400, 6095, 11, 309, 17879, 2962, 577, 286, 574, 412, 452, 1065, 5212, 2909, 586, 13, 51131], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11536299596067334, "compression_ratio": 1.6818181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 1.5671730406452422e-12}, {"id": 84, "seek": 25786, "start": 273.98, "end": 276.86, "text": " The distinction is between admissibility and reachability.", "tokens": [51171, 440, 16844, 307, 1296, 5910, 891, 2841, 293, 2524, 2310, 13, 51315], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11536299596067334, "compression_ratio": 1.6818181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 1.5671730406452422e-12}, {"id": 85, "seek": 25786, "start": 277.58000000000004, "end": 281.2, "text": " Yeah, it is the absolute conceptual bedrock of the entire monograph.", "tokens": [51351, 865, 11, 309, 307, 264, 8236, 24106, 2901, 17799, 295, 264, 2302, 1108, 3108, 13, 51532], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11536299596067334, "compression_ratio": 1.6818181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 1.5671730406452422e-12}, {"id": 86, "seek": 25786, "start": 281.46000000000004, "end": 284.42, "text": " So admissibility is strictly about immediate survival.", "tokens": [51545, 407, 5910, 891, 2841, 307, 20792, 466, 11629, 12559, 13, 51693], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11536299596067334, "compression_ratio": 1.6818181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 1.5671730406452422e-12}, {"id": 87, "seek": 25786, "start": 284.64, "end": 286.90000000000003, "text": " It's a thermodynamic concept, really.", "tokens": [51704, 467, 311, 257, 8810, 34988, 3410, 11, 534, 13, 51817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11536299596067334, "compression_ratio": 1.6818181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 1.5671730406452422e-12}, {"id": 88, "seek": 28690, "start": 286.9, "end": 287.73999999999995, "text": " Okay, thermodynamic.", "tokens": [50365, 1033, 11, 8810, 34988, 13, 50407], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344483693440756, "compression_ratio": 1.5063291139240507, "no_speech_prob": 1.5491514321341882e-12}, {"id": 89, "seek": 28690, "start": 287.88, "end": 288.21999999999997, "text": " How so?", "tokens": [50414, 1012, 370, 30, 50431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344483693440756, "compression_ratio": 1.5063291139240507, "no_speech_prob": 1.5491514321341882e-12}, {"id": 90, "seek": 28690, "start": 288.21999999999997, "end": 297.0, "text": " Well, it refers to the set of physical conditions that allow a biological or mechanical system to continue operating in the present tense.", "tokens": [50431, 1042, 11, 309, 14942, 281, 264, 992, 295, 4001, 4487, 300, 2089, 257, 13910, 420, 12070, 1185, 281, 2354, 7447, 294, 264, 1974, 18760, 13, 50870], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344483693440756, "compression_ratio": 1.5063291139240507, "no_speech_prob": 1.5491514321341882e-12}, {"id": 91, "seek": 28690, "start": 297.73999999999995, "end": 301.4, "text": " So aboard the Eniara, admissibility means the hull hasn't breached.", "tokens": [50907, 407, 27488, 264, 2193, 72, 2419, 11, 5910, 891, 2841, 1355, 264, 32335, 6132, 380, 1403, 15095, 13, 51090], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344483693440756, "compression_ratio": 1.5063291139240507, "no_speech_prob": 1.5491514321341882e-12}, {"id": 92, "seek": 28690, "start": 301.79999999999995, "end": 306.9, "text": " The atmospheric filters are, you know, successfully scrubbing the carbon dioxide out of the air.", "tokens": [51110, 440, 28854, 15995, 366, 11, 291, 458, 11, 10727, 24163, 4324, 264, 5954, 19590, 484, 295, 264, 1988, 13, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344483693440756, "compression_ratio": 1.5063291139240507, "no_speech_prob": 1.5491514321341882e-12}, {"id": 93, "seek": 28690, "start": 307.28, "end": 308.34, "text": " The basics of not dying.", "tokens": [51384, 440, 14688, 295, 406, 8639, 13, 51437], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16344483693440756, "compression_ratio": 1.5063291139240507, "no_speech_prob": 1.5491514321341882e-12}, {"id": 94, "seek": 30834, "start": 308.34, "end": 309.06, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 95, "seek": 30834, "start": 309.5, "end": 311.46, "text": " The artificial gravity generators are spinning.", "tokens": [50423, 440, 11677, 12110, 38662, 366, 15640, 13, 50521], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 96, "seek": 30834, "start": 311.9, "end": 314.56, "text": " The hydroponic bays are yielding a caloric baseline.", "tokens": [50543, 440, 5796, 1513, 11630, 272, 3772, 366, 11257, 278, 257, 2104, 16345, 20518, 13, 50676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 97, "seek": 30834, "start": 314.84, "end": 317.76, "text": " The physical environment is admissible for human life.", "tokens": [50690, 440, 4001, 2823, 307, 5910, 41073, 337, 1952, 993, 13, 50836], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 98, "seek": 30834, "start": 318.06, "end": 322.53999999999996, "text": " So on a primal level, you can breathe, you can metabolize food, your heart keeps beating.", "tokens": [50851, 407, 322, 257, 2886, 304, 1496, 11, 291, 393, 10192, 11, 291, 393, 19110, 1125, 1755, 11, 428, 1917, 5965, 13497, 13, 51075], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 99, "seek": 30834, "start": 322.85999999999996, "end": 324.12, "text": " That is admissibility.", "tokens": [51091, 663, 307, 5910, 891, 2841, 13, 51154], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 100, "seek": 30834, "start": 324.32, "end": 325.71999999999997, "text": " It is purely a state of being.", "tokens": [51164, 467, 307, 17491, 257, 1785, 295, 885, 13, 51234], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 101, "seek": 30834, "start": 326.17999999999995, "end": 328.35999999999996, "text": " Reachability, on the other hand, is a state of becoming.", "tokens": [51257, 35904, 2310, 11, 322, 264, 661, 1011, 11, 307, 257, 1785, 295, 5617, 13, 51366], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 102, "seek": 30834, "start": 328.73999999999995, "end": 328.91999999999996, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51385, 865, 13, 51394], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 103, "seek": 30834, "start": 329.47999999999996, "end": 331.32, "text": " Reachability is about the destination.", "tokens": [51422, 35904, 2310, 307, 466, 264, 12236, 13, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18406479818779126, "compression_ratio": 1.715481171548117, "no_speech_prob": 1.4954081809653852e-12}, {"id": 104, "seek": 33132, "start": 331.32, "end": 340.92, "text": " It is the mathematical sequence of transformations that can successfully navigate you from your current coordinates to a collectively desired future state.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 307, 264, 18894, 8310, 295, 34852, 300, 393, 10727, 12350, 291, 490, 428, 2190, 21056, 281, 257, 24341, 14721, 2027, 1785, 13, 50845], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14128216034775481, "compression_ratio": 1.714859437751004, "no_speech_prob": 1.4041182496218885e-12}, {"id": 105, "seek": 33132, "start": 341.15999999999997, "end": 341.9, "text": " Like getting to Mars.", "tokens": [50857, 1743, 1242, 281, 9692, 13, 50894], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14128216034775481, "compression_ratio": 1.714859437751004, "no_speech_prob": 1.4041182496218885e-12}, {"id": 106, "seek": 33132, "start": 342.18, "end": 343.6, "text": " Mars is a reachability goal.", "tokens": [50908, 9692, 307, 257, 2524, 2310, 3387, 13, 50979], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14128216034775481, "compression_ratio": 1.714859437751004, "no_speech_prob": 1.4041182496218885e-12}, {"id": 107, "seek": 33132, "start": 344.15999999999997, "end": 346.21999999999997, "text": " Graduating from college is a reachability goal.", "tokens": [51007, 16710, 32438, 490, 3859, 307, 257, 2524, 2310, 3387, 13, 51110], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14128216034775481, "compression_ratio": 1.714859437751004, "no_speech_prob": 1.4041182496218885e-12}, {"id": 108, "seek": 33132, "start": 346.7, "end": 349.02, "text": " Retiring at 65 is a reachability goal.", "tokens": [51134, 11495, 5057, 412, 11624, 307, 257, 2524, 2310, 3387, 13, 51250], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14128216034775481, "compression_ratio": 1.714859437751004, "no_speech_prob": 1.4041182496218885e-12}, {"id": 109, "seek": 33132, "start": 349.14, "end": 350.5, "text": " Okay, let's ground this for a second.", "tokens": [51256, 1033, 11, 718, 311, 2727, 341, 337, 257, 1150, 13, 51324], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14128216034775481, "compression_ratio": 1.714859437751004, "no_speech_prob": 1.4041182496218885e-12}, {"id": 110, "seek": 33132, "start": 350.84, "end": 352.65999999999997, "text": " It's like sitting in your car in your driveway.", "tokens": [51341, 467, 311, 411, 3798, 294, 428, 1032, 294, 428, 38276, 13, 51432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14128216034775481, "compression_ratio": 1.714859437751004, "no_speech_prob": 1.4041182496218885e-12}, {"id": 111, "seek": 33132, "start": 353.26, "end": 354.42, "text": " The tank is full of gas.", "tokens": [51462, 440, 5466, 307, 1577, 295, 4211, 13, 51520], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14128216034775481, "compression_ratio": 1.714859437751004, "no_speech_prob": 1.4041182496218885e-12}, {"id": 112, "seek": 33132, "start": 354.48, "end": 355.52, "text": " The engine is purring.", "tokens": [51523, 440, 2848, 307, 1864, 2937, 13, 51575], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14128216034775481, "compression_ratio": 1.714859437751004, "no_speech_prob": 1.4041182496218885e-12}, {"id": 113, "seek": 35552, "start": 355.52, "end": 358.38, "text": " The heater is keeping you warm against the winter cold outside.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 30408, 307, 5145, 291, 4561, 1970, 264, 6355, 3554, 2380, 13, 50508], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 114, "seek": 35552, "start": 358.64, "end": 360.09999999999997, "text": " And the radio is playing.", "tokens": [50521, 400, 264, 6477, 307, 2433, 13, 50594], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 115, "seek": 35552, "start": 360.26, "end": 360.96, "text": " Very cozy.", "tokens": [50602, 4372, 29414, 13, 50637], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 116, "seek": 35552, "start": 361.18, "end": 361.34, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50648, 865, 13, 50656], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 117, "seek": 35552, "start": 361.74, "end": 364.85999999999996, "text": " You are completely, 100% viable.", "tokens": [50676, 509, 366, 2584, 11, 2319, 4, 22024, 13, 50832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 118, "seek": 35552, "start": 364.97999999999996, "end": 365.59999999999997, "text": " That's admissibility.", "tokens": [50838, 663, 311, 5910, 891, 2841, 13, 50869], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 119, "seek": 35552, "start": 365.71999999999997, "end": 365.84, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50875, 865, 13, 50881], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 120, "seek": 35552, "start": 366.06, "end": 374.35999999999996, "text": " But then you look out the windshield and you realize every single road, highway, and bridge in the entire world has been instantly vaporized.", "tokens": [50892, 583, 550, 291, 574, 484, 264, 39996, 293, 291, 4325, 633, 2167, 3060, 11, 17205, 11, 293, 7283, 294, 264, 2302, 1002, 575, 668, 13518, 20358, 1602, 13, 51307], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 121, "seek": 35552, "start": 374.62, "end": 378.71999999999997, "text": " There's no pavement, no dirt track, no geographic connection to anywhere else.", "tokens": [51320, 821, 311, 572, 38305, 11, 572, 11483, 2837, 11, 572, 32318, 4984, 281, 4992, 1646, 13, 51525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 122, "seek": 35552, "start": 378.79999999999995, "end": 379.03999999999996, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51529, 1779, 13, 51541], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 123, "seek": 35552, "start": 379.24, "end": 382.12, "text": " You're viable, but you have absolute zero reachability.", "tokens": [51551, 509, 434, 22024, 11, 457, 291, 362, 8236, 4018, 2524, 2310, 13, 51695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15711912044808884, "compression_ratio": 1.5769230769230769, "no_speech_prob": 1.5063895226694046e-12}, {"id": 124, "seek": 38212, "start": 382.12, "end": 386.74, "text": " That analogy hits the nail on the head, but we have to push it further into the sociological realm, right?", "tokens": [50365, 663, 21663, 8664, 264, 10173, 322, 264, 1378, 11, 457, 321, 362, 281, 2944, 309, 3052, 666, 264, 3075, 4383, 15355, 11, 558, 30, 50596], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 125, "seek": 38212, "start": 387.02, "end": 392.56, "text": " Because the author argues that human societies are not just biological organisms surviving in the present.", "tokens": [50610, 1436, 264, 3793, 38218, 300, 1952, 19329, 366, 406, 445, 13910, 22110, 24948, 294, 264, 1974, 13, 50887], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 126, "seek": 38212, "start": 393.06, "end": 395.08, "text": " They are societal teleologies.", "tokens": [50912, 814, 366, 33472, 4304, 6204, 13, 51013], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 127, "seek": 38212, "start": 395.58, "end": 396.8, "text": " Meaning they are purpose-driven.", "tokens": [51038, 19948, 436, 366, 4334, 12, 25456, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 128, "seek": 38212, "start": 397.08, "end": 397.52, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51113, 7587, 13, 51135], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 129, "seek": 38212, "start": 398.14, "end": 400.52, "text": " They are structured entirely around reachability.", "tokens": [51166, 814, 366, 18519, 7696, 926, 2524, 2310, 13, 51285], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 130, "seek": 38212, "start": 401.4, "end": 403.74, "text": " Our society doesn't just exist in the present moment.", "tokens": [51329, 2621, 4086, 1177, 380, 445, 2514, 294, 264, 1974, 1623, 13, 51446], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 131, "seek": 38212, "start": 404.22, "end": 408.4, "text": " It exists in a tension with a field of states that haven't happened yet.", "tokens": [51470, 467, 8198, 294, 257, 8980, 365, 257, 2519, 295, 4368, 300, 2378, 380, 2011, 1939, 13, 51679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 132, "seek": 38212, "start": 408.5, "end": 410.3, "text": " Like everything we do is for tomorrow.", "tokens": [51684, 1743, 1203, 321, 360, 307, 337, 4153, 13, 51774], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 133, "seek": 38212, "start": 410.58, "end": 411.06, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51788, 1079, 13, 51812], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16785696076183784, "compression_ratio": 1.662295081967213, "no_speech_prob": 1.2015944879720242e-12}, {"id": 134, "seek": 41106, "start": 411.06, "end": 413.74, "text": " Think about the infrastructure of your own life.", "tokens": [50365, 6557, 466, 264, 6896, 295, 428, 1065, 993, 13, 50499], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12168804061747043, "compression_ratio": 1.5827586206896551, "no_speech_prob": 1.604570100920133e-12}, {"id": 135, "seek": 41106, "start": 414.14, "end": 418.34, "text": " The educational system assumes adulthood and a functioning labor market.", "tokens": [50519, 440, 10189, 1185, 37808, 42328, 293, 257, 18483, 5938, 2142, 13, 50729], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12168804061747043, "compression_ratio": 1.5827586206896551, "no_speech_prob": 1.604570100920133e-12}, {"id": 136, "seek": 41106, "start": 418.72, "end": 425.24, "text": " I mean, you sit in a boring seminar today because of a profession you expect to participate in five years from now.", "tokens": [50748, 286, 914, 11, 291, 1394, 294, 257, 9989, 29235, 965, 570, 295, 257, 7032, 291, 2066, 281, 8197, 294, 1732, 924, 490, 586, 13, 51074], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12168804061747043, "compression_ratio": 1.5827586206896551, "no_speech_prob": 1.604570100920133e-12}, {"id": 137, "seek": 41106, "start": 425.3, "end": 425.46, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51077, 1779, 13, 51085], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12168804061747043, "compression_ratio": 1.5827586206896551, "no_speech_prob": 1.604570100920133e-12}, {"id": 138, "seek": 41106, "start": 425.54, "end": 427.94, "text": " You wouldn't take the test if there wasn't a job at the end of it.", "tokens": [51089, 509, 2759, 380, 747, 264, 1500, 498, 456, 2067, 380, 257, 1691, 412, 264, 917, 295, 309, 13, 51209], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12168804061747043, "compression_ratio": 1.5827586206896551, "no_speech_prob": 1.604570100920133e-12}, {"id": 139, "seek": 41106, "start": 427.98, "end": 428.42, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51211, 7587, 13, 51233], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12168804061747043, "compression_ratio": 1.5827586206896551, "no_speech_prob": 1.604570100920133e-12}, {"id": 140, "seek": 41106, "start": 428.68, "end": 436.6, "text": " And the concept of saving money requires an ironclad assumption of future expenditure and a stable economic system to honor that currency.", "tokens": [51246, 400, 264, 3410, 295, 6816, 1460, 7029, 364, 6497, 3474, 345, 15302, 295, 2027, 40377, 293, 257, 8351, 4836, 1185, 281, 5968, 300, 13346, 13, 51642], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12168804061747043, "compression_ratio": 1.5827586206896551, "no_speech_prob": 1.604570100920133e-12}, {"id": 141, "seek": 43660, "start": 436.6, "end": 447.40000000000003, "text": " Even our penal system, like putting someone in prison for 10 years that assumes there is a subsequent continuous social order where that punishment has moral and practical weight.", "tokens": [50365, 2754, 527, 13661, 1185, 11, 411, 3372, 1580, 294, 6168, 337, 1266, 924, 300, 37808, 456, 307, 257, 19962, 10957, 2093, 1668, 689, 300, 14133, 575, 9723, 293, 8496, 3364, 13, 50905], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11258118612724438, "compression_ratio": 1.5172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.7970307316858558e-12}, {"id": 142, "seek": 43660, "start": 447.54, "end": 448.94, "text": " Everything is tied to the future.", "tokens": [50912, 5471, 307, 9601, 281, 264, 2027, 13, 50982], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11258118612724438, "compression_ratio": 1.5172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.7970307316858558e-12}, {"id": 143, "seek": 43660, "start": 449.22, "end": 452.28000000000003, "text": " Every single action is a bridge to a future shore.", "tokens": [50996, 2048, 2167, 3069, 307, 257, 7283, 281, 257, 2027, 17805, 13, 51149], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11258118612724438, "compression_ratio": 1.5172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.7970307316858558e-12}, {"id": 144, "seek": 45228, "start": 452.28, "end": 456.79999999999995, "text": " But wait, this is where I have to push back on the author's underlying pessimism a bit.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 1699, 11, 341, 307, 689, 286, 362, 281, 2944, 646, 322, 264, 3793, 311, 14217, 37399, 1434, 257, 857, 13, 50591], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15386521339416503, "compression_ratio": 1.0481927710843373, "no_speech_prob": 2.019712088546788e-12}, {"id": 145, "seek": 45680, "start": 456.8, "end": 460.22, "text": " Because humans are unbelievably adaptable.", "tokens": [50365, 1436, 6255, 366, 43593, 6231, 712, 13, 50536], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22737591221647444, "compression_ratio": 1.4365079365079365, "no_speech_prob": 2.297574890758325e-12}, {"id": 146, "seek": 45680, "start": 460.7, "end": 463.06, "text": " I mean, we survive in maximum security prisons.", "tokens": [50560, 286, 914, 11, 321, 7867, 294, 6674, 3825, 31396, 13, 50678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22737591221647444, "compression_ratio": 1.4365079365079365, "no_speech_prob": 2.297574890758325e-12}, {"id": 147, "seek": 45680, "start": 463.22, "end": 464.88, "text": " We survive in prisoner of war camps.", "tokens": [50686, 492, 7867, 294, 28114, 295, 1516, 16573, 13, 50769], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22737591221647444, "compression_ratio": 1.4365079365079365, "no_speech_prob": 2.297574890758325e-12}, {"id": 148, "seek": 45680, "start": 464.98, "end": 467.34000000000003, "text": " We survive the ice age in literal caves.", "tokens": [50774, 492, 7867, 264, 4435, 3205, 294, 20411, 32288, 13, 50892], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22737591221647444, "compression_ratio": 1.4365079365079365, "no_speech_prob": 2.297574890758325e-12}, {"id": 149, "seek": 45680, "start": 467.48, "end": 467.76, "text": " We do.", "tokens": [50899, 492, 360, 13, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22737591221647444, "compression_ratio": 1.4365079365079365, "no_speech_prob": 2.297574890758325e-12}, {"id": 150, "seek": 45680, "start": 468.02000000000004, "end": 468.2, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50926, 865, 13, 50935], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22737591221647444, "compression_ratio": 1.4365079365079365, "no_speech_prob": 2.297574890758325e-12}, {"id": 151, "seek": 46820, "start": 468.2, "end": 474.96, "text": " So, if you are alive and you are fed and you are safe from the vacuum of space, why isn't that enough?", "tokens": [50365, 407, 11, 498, 291, 366, 5465, 293, 291, 366, 4636, 293, 291, 366, 3273, 490, 264, 14224, 295, 1901, 11, 983, 1943, 380, 300, 1547, 30, 50703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14499756327846594, "compression_ratio": 1.5778546712802768, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506484101594612e-12}, {"id": 152, "seek": 46820, "start": 475.34, "end": 479.7, "text": " Why couldn't the passengers on this ship just, you know, shift their mindset?", "tokens": [50722, 1545, 2809, 380, 264, 18436, 322, 341, 5374, 445, 11, 291, 458, 11, 5513, 641, 12543, 30, 50940], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14499756327846594, "compression_ratio": 1.5778546712802768, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506484101594612e-12}, {"id": 153, "seek": 46820, "start": 479.96, "end": 480.64, "text": " Shift how?", "tokens": [50953, 28304, 577, 30, 50987], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14499756327846594, "compression_ratio": 1.5778546712802768, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506484101594612e-12}, {"id": 154, "seek": 46820, "start": 480.84, "end": 484.5, "text": " Like, why not become a society of present-focused Zen monks?", "tokens": [50997, 1743, 11, 983, 406, 1813, 257, 4086, 295, 1974, 12, 44062, 22387, 32201, 30, 51180], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14499756327846594, "compression_ratio": 1.5778546712802768, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506484101594612e-12}, {"id": 155, "seek": 46820, "start": 485.02, "end": 492.28, "text": " Why does the lack of a destination inherently equal a catastrophic collapse if the physical environment is perfectly stable?", "tokens": [51206, 1545, 775, 264, 5011, 295, 257, 12236, 27993, 2681, 257, 34915, 15584, 498, 264, 4001, 2823, 307, 6239, 8351, 30, 51569], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14499756327846594, "compression_ratio": 1.5778546712802768, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506484101594612e-12}, {"id": 156, "seek": 46820, "start": 492.44, "end": 493.84, "text": " It's a totally valid challenge.", "tokens": [51577, 467, 311, 257, 3879, 7363, 3430, 13, 51647], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14499756327846594, "compression_ratio": 1.5778546712802768, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506484101594612e-12}, {"id": 157, "seek": 46820, "start": 493.98, "end": 495.96, "text": " And honestly, it's one the author anticipates.", "tokens": [51654, 400, 6095, 11, 309, 311, 472, 264, 3793, 10416, 1024, 13, 51753], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14499756327846594, "compression_ratio": 1.5778546712802768, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506484101594612e-12}, {"id": 158, "seek": 49596, "start": 495.96, "end": 503.88, "text": " The reason a Buddhist-style present-focused adaptation doesn't work at a macro-societal level is tied to how human beings manufacture meaning.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 1778, 257, 22764, 12, 15014, 1974, 12, 44062, 21549, 1177, 380, 589, 412, 257, 18887, 12, 3276, 302, 304, 1496, 307, 9601, 281, 577, 1952, 8958, 27400, 3620, 13, 50761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11527840809155536, "compression_ratio": 1.59765625, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612888586147289e-12}, {"id": 159, "seek": 49596, "start": 504.5, "end": 512.92, "text": " The monograph points out that two physically identical actions can have radically different social and psychological meanings, depending entirely on the future they are tethered to.", "tokens": [50792, 440, 1108, 3108, 2793, 484, 300, 732, 9762, 14800, 5909, 393, 362, 35508, 819, 2093, 293, 14346, 28138, 11, 5413, 7696, 322, 264, 2027, 436, 366, 256, 1666, 292, 281, 13, 51213], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11527840809155536, "compression_ratio": 1.59765625, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612888586147289e-12}, {"id": 160, "seek": 49596, "start": 513.28, "end": 515.3199999999999, "text": " Let's look at the mechanics of waiting in a line.", "tokens": [51231, 961, 311, 574, 412, 264, 12939, 295, 3806, 294, 257, 1622, 13, 51333], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11527840809155536, "compression_ratio": 1.59765625, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612888586147289e-12}, {"id": 161, "seek": 49596, "start": 515.4399999999999, "end": 516.74, "text": " The most boring thing ever.", "tokens": [51339, 440, 881, 9989, 551, 1562, 13, 51404], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11527840809155536, "compression_ratio": 1.59765625, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612888586147289e-12}, {"id": 162, "seek": 49596, "start": 517.16, "end": 517.46, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51425, 1779, 13, 51440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11527840809155536, "compression_ratio": 1.59765625, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612888586147289e-12}, {"id": 163, "seek": 51746, "start": 517.46, "end": 526.24, "text": " Aboard the ship, waiting in a line for your daily food ration makes perfect logical sense if that line is moving you toward a destination.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 3787, 264, 5374, 11, 3806, 294, 257, 1622, 337, 428, 5212, 1755, 24258, 1669, 2176, 14978, 2020, 498, 300, 1622, 307, 2684, 291, 7361, 257, 12236, 13, 50804], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15321851331134176, "compression_ratio": 1.5022831050228311, "no_speech_prob": 1.7688981789748537e-12}, {"id": 164, "seek": 51746, "start": 526.86, "end": 530.94, "text": " You are fueling your body so you can arrive at Mars and build a new world.", "tokens": [50835, 509, 366, 6616, 278, 428, 1772, 370, 291, 393, 8881, 412, 9692, 293, 1322, 257, 777, 1002, 13, 51039], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15321851331134176, "compression_ratio": 1.5022831050228311, "no_speech_prob": 1.7688981789748537e-12}, {"id": 165, "seek": 51746, "start": 531.58, "end": 535.58, "text": " The boredom and discomfort of the line are justified by the horizon.", "tokens": [51071, 440, 13521, 298, 293, 28552, 295, 264, 1622, 366, 27808, 538, 264, 18046, 13, 51271], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15321851331134176, "compression_ratio": 1.5022831050228311, "no_speech_prob": 1.7688981789748537e-12}, {"id": 166, "seek": 51746, "start": 535.72, "end": 535.9000000000001, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51278, 1779, 13, 51287], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15321851331134176, "compression_ratio": 1.5022831050228311, "no_speech_prob": 1.7688981789748537e-12}, {"id": 167, "seek": 51746, "start": 535.98, "end": 536.52, "text": " It's an investment.", "tokens": [51291, 467, 311, 364, 6078, 13, 51318], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15321851331134176, "compression_ratio": 1.5022831050228311, "no_speech_prob": 1.7688981789748537e-12}, {"id": 168, "seek": 51746, "start": 536.74, "end": 537.6800000000001, "text": " But take away Mars.", "tokens": [51329, 583, 747, 1314, 9692, 13, 51376], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15321851331134176, "compression_ratio": 1.5022831050228311, "no_speech_prob": 1.7688981789748537e-12}, {"id": 169, "seek": 53768, "start": 537.68, "end": 547.42, "text": " Now, you are standing in that exact same line, eating that exact same food, simply to sustain your biology so you can stand in that exact same line tomorrow.", "tokens": [50365, 823, 11, 291, 366, 4877, 294, 300, 1900, 912, 1622, 11, 3936, 300, 1900, 912, 1755, 11, 2935, 281, 6769, 428, 14956, 370, 291, 393, 1463, 294, 300, 1900, 912, 1622, 4153, 13, 50852], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16312509112887913, "compression_ratio": 1.6572769953051643, "no_speech_prob": 1.5485796239084193e-12}, {"id": 170, "seek": 53768, "start": 547.62, "end": 548.06, "text": " Oh, wow.", "tokens": [50862, 876, 11, 6076, 13, 50884], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16312509112887913, "compression_ratio": 1.6572769953051643, "no_speech_prob": 1.5485796239084193e-12}, {"id": 171, "seek": 53768, "start": 548.2399999999999, "end": 548.42, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50893, 865, 13, 50902], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16312509112887913, "compression_ratio": 1.6572769953051643, "no_speech_prob": 1.5485796239084193e-12}, {"id": 172, "seek": 53768, "start": 548.54, "end": 550.3, "text": " The action strips itself of meaning.", "tokens": [50908, 440, 3069, 19842, 2564, 295, 3620, 13, 50996], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16312509112887913, "compression_ratio": 1.6572769953051643, "no_speech_prob": 1.5485796239084193e-12}, {"id": 173, "seek": 53768, "start": 550.5799999999999, "end": 552.26, "text": " It becomes this absurd theater.", "tokens": [51010, 467, 3643, 341, 19774, 10612, 13, 51094], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16312509112887913, "compression_ratio": 1.6572769953051643, "no_speech_prob": 1.5485796239084193e-12}, {"id": 174, "seek": 53768, "start": 552.8199999999999, "end": 558.3599999999999, "text": " The author points out that without a reachable future, time itself undergoes a terrifying mutation.", "tokens": [51122, 440, 3793, 2793, 484, 300, 1553, 257, 2524, 712, 2027, 11, 565, 2564, 26426, 279, 257, 18106, 27960, 13, 51399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16312509112887913, "compression_ratio": 1.6572769953051643, "no_speech_prob": 1.5485796239084193e-12}, {"id": 175, "seek": 53768, "start": 558.5799999999999, "end": 559.4, "text": " A mutation.", "tokens": [51410, 316, 27960, 13, 51451], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16312509112887913, "compression_ratio": 1.6572769953051643, "no_speech_prob": 1.5485796239084193e-12}, {"id": 176, "seek": 55940, "start": 559.4, "end": 559.8, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50365, 865, 13, 50385], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 177, "seek": 55940, "start": 560.1, "end": 562.6999999999999, "text": " When you have a destination, time is directional.", "tokens": [50400, 1133, 291, 362, 257, 12236, 11, 565, 307, 42242, 13, 50530], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 178, "seek": 55940, "start": 562.9, "end": 563.42, "text": " It's a countdown.", "tokens": [50540, 467, 311, 257, 35985, 13, 50566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 179, "seek": 55940, "start": 564.0, "end": 568.42, "text": " Every day that passes, even if it is a miserable day, is doing work for you.", "tokens": [50595, 2048, 786, 300, 11335, 11, 754, 498, 309, 307, 257, 22321, 786, 11, 307, 884, 589, 337, 291, 13, 50816], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 180, "seek": 55940, "start": 568.56, "end": 570.1, "text": " It is pulling you closer to the goal.", "tokens": [50823, 467, 307, 8407, 291, 4966, 281, 264, 3387, 13, 50900], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 181, "seek": 55940, "start": 570.42, "end": 573.9399999999999, "text": " But when the destination vanishes, time stops being an arrow.", "tokens": [50916, 583, 562, 264, 12236, 3161, 16423, 11, 565, 10094, 885, 364, 11610, 13, 51092], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 182, "seek": 55940, "start": 574.28, "end": 576.42, "text": " Duration just accumulates without conversions.", "tokens": [51109, 413, 8167, 445, 12989, 26192, 1553, 42256, 13, 51216], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 183, "seek": 55940, "start": 576.52, "end": 577.34, "text": " It's piling up.", "tokens": [51221, 467, 311, 280, 4883, 493, 13, 51262], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 184, "seek": 55940, "start": 577.4399999999999, "end": 578.64, "text": " You aren't getting closer to anything.", "tokens": [51267, 509, 3212, 380, 1242, 4966, 281, 1340, 13, 51327], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 185, "seek": 55940, "start": 578.76, "end": 580.68, "text": " You are just stacking days in a void.", "tokens": [51333, 509, 366, 445, 41376, 1708, 294, 257, 22009, 13, 51429], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 186, "seek": 55940, "start": 581.1, "end": 582.04, "text": " Stacking days.", "tokens": [51450, 745, 14134, 1708, 13, 51497], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 187, "seek": 55940, "start": 582.56, "end": 584.1, "text": " That phrasing is chilling.", "tokens": [51523, 663, 7636, 3349, 307, 31047, 13, 51600], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21318206787109376, "compression_ratio": 1.667953667953668, "no_speech_prob": 1.9204156494201374e-12}, {"id": 188, "seek": 58410, "start": 584.1, "end": 591.8000000000001, "text": " It instantly makes me think of the early days of the 2020 pandemic lockdowns, you know, when everyone was trapped in their houses.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 13518, 1669, 385, 519, 295, 264, 2440, 1708, 295, 264, 4808, 5388, 17267, 82, 11, 291, 458, 11, 562, 1518, 390, 14994, 294, 641, 8078, 13, 50750], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15402654121662007, "compression_ratio": 1.6219931271477663, "no_speech_prob": 1.3454362407169795e-12}, {"id": 189, "seek": 58410, "start": 591.98, "end": 592.86, "text": " That's a great comparison.", "tokens": [50759, 663, 311, 257, 869, 9660, 13, 50803], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15402654121662007, "compression_ratio": 1.6219931271477663, "no_speech_prob": 1.3454362407169795e-12}, {"id": 190, "seek": 58410, "start": 593.08, "end": 595.0400000000001, "text": " Because the physical environment was totally stable.", "tokens": [50814, 1436, 264, 4001, 2823, 390, 3879, 8351, 13, 50912], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15402654121662007, "compression_ratio": 1.6219931271477663, "no_speech_prob": 1.3454362407169795e-12}, {"id": 191, "seek": 58410, "start": 595.24, "end": 595.6800000000001, "text": " We had Netflix.", "tokens": [50922, 492, 632, 12778, 13, 50944], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15402654121662007, "compression_ratio": 1.6219931271477663, "no_speech_prob": 1.3454362407169795e-12}, {"id": 192, "seek": 58410, "start": 595.86, "end": 596.4200000000001, "text": " We had food delivery.", "tokens": [50953, 492, 632, 1755, 8982, 13, 50981], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15402654121662007, "compression_ratio": 1.6219931271477663, "no_speech_prob": 1.3454362407169795e-12}, {"id": 193, "seek": 58410, "start": 596.6800000000001, "end": 599.66, "text": " But the future was suddenly completely illegible.", "tokens": [50994, 583, 264, 2027, 390, 5800, 2584, 9976, 964, 13, 51143], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15402654121662007, "compression_ratio": 1.6219931271477663, "no_speech_prob": 1.3454362407169795e-12}, {"id": 194, "seek": 58410, "start": 600.0600000000001, "end": 603.26, "text": " We didn't know if the lockdown was two weeks, two months, or two years.", "tokens": [51163, 492, 994, 380, 458, 498, 264, 17267, 390, 732, 3259, 11, 732, 2493, 11, 420, 732, 924, 13, 51323], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15402654121662007, "compression_ratio": 1.6219931271477663, "no_speech_prob": 1.3454362407169795e-12}, {"id": 195, "seek": 58410, "start": 603.9200000000001, "end": 609.4, "text": " And the psychological toll was massive, precisely because we were just stacking days.", "tokens": [51356, 400, 264, 14346, 16629, 390, 5994, 11, 13402, 570, 321, 645, 445, 41376, 1708, 13, 51630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15402654121662007, "compression_ratio": 1.6219931271477663, "no_speech_prob": 1.3454362407169795e-12}, {"id": 196, "seek": 58410, "start": 609.5400000000001, "end": 610.28, "text": " We really were.", "tokens": [51637, 492, 534, 645, 13, 51674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15402654121662007, "compression_ratio": 1.6219931271477663, "no_speech_prob": 1.3454362407169795e-12}, {"id": 197, "seek": 61028, "start": 610.28, "end": 614.28, "text": " Time became this stagnant pool instead of a flowing river.", "tokens": [50365, 6161, 3062, 341, 32853, 394, 7005, 2602, 295, 257, 13974, 6810, 13, 50565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15192594026264392, "compression_ratio": 1.6343042071197411, "no_speech_prob": 1.3200146271180602e-12}, {"id": 198, "seek": 61028, "start": 614.86, "end": 616.9599999999999, "text": " That is a brilliant modern parallel.", "tokens": [50594, 663, 307, 257, 10248, 4363, 8952, 13, 50699], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15192594026264392, "compression_ratio": 1.6343042071197411, "no_speech_prob": 1.3200146271180602e-12}, {"id": 199, "seek": 61028, "start": 617.6999999999999, "end": 623.3, "text": " During the lockdowns, we lost global reachability, even while we maintained local admissibility in our living rooms.", "tokens": [50736, 6842, 264, 17267, 82, 11, 321, 2731, 4338, 2524, 2310, 11, 754, 1339, 321, 17578, 2654, 5910, 891, 2841, 294, 527, 2647, 9396, 13, 51016], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15192594026264392, "compression_ratio": 1.6343042071197411, "no_speech_prob": 1.3200146271180602e-12}, {"id": 200, "seek": 61028, "start": 623.8, "end": 627.8199999999999, "text": " And we saw the exact psychological fracturing the monograph describes, right?", "tokens": [51041, 400, 321, 1866, 264, 1900, 14346, 17948, 1345, 264, 1108, 3108, 15626, 11, 558, 30, 51242], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15192594026264392, "compression_ratio": 1.6343042071197411, "no_speech_prob": 1.3200146271180602e-12}, {"id": 201, "seek": 61028, "start": 628.0, "end": 633.68, "text": " The anxiety, the breakdown of routines, the feeling that time was simultaneously freezing and accelerating.", "tokens": [51251, 440, 9119, 11, 264, 18188, 295, 33827, 11, 264, 2633, 300, 565, 390, 16561, 20200, 293, 34391, 13, 51535], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15192594026264392, "compression_ratio": 1.6343042071197411, "no_speech_prob": 1.3200146271180602e-12}, {"id": 202, "seek": 61028, "start": 633.86, "end": 634.52, "text": " Yes, exactly.", "tokens": [51544, 1079, 11, 2293, 13, 51577], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15192594026264392, "compression_ratio": 1.6343042071197411, "no_speech_prob": 1.3200146271180602e-12}, {"id": 203, "seek": 61028, "start": 634.52, "end": 639.3, "text": " Now multiply that by the thousand generations with no hope of a vaccine or a reopening ever.", "tokens": [51577, 823, 12972, 300, 538, 264, 4714, 10593, 365, 572, 1454, 295, 257, 7007, 420, 257, 39542, 1562, 13, 51816], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15192594026264392, "compression_ratio": 1.6343042071197411, "no_speech_prob": 1.3200146271180602e-12}, {"id": 204, "seek": 63930, "start": 639.3, "end": 641.8, "text": " That is the true reachability catastrophe.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 264, 2074, 2524, 2310, 36043, 13, 50490], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1433214611477322, "compression_ratio": 1.6076555023923444, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552064844270852e-12}, {"id": 205, "seek": 63930, "start": 642.42, "end": 644.66, "text": " Which really highlights the tragedy of their situation.", "tokens": [50521, 3013, 534, 14254, 264, 18563, 295, 641, 2590, 13, 50633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1433214611477322, "compression_ratio": 1.6076555023923444, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552064844270852e-12}, {"id": 206, "seek": 63930, "start": 645.02, "end": 653.6999999999999, "text": " Because to understand why they are stuck on this ship, stacking endless days in the dark, we have to look backwards before we can look forwards.", "tokens": [50651, 1436, 281, 1223, 983, 436, 366, 5541, 322, 341, 5374, 11, 41376, 16144, 1708, 294, 264, 2877, 11, 321, 362, 281, 574, 12204, 949, 321, 393, 574, 30126, 13, 51085], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1433214611477322, "compression_ratio": 1.6076555023923444, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552064844270852e-12}, {"id": 207, "seek": 63930, "start": 654.18, "end": 657.0, "text": " We have to understand why they left Earth in the first place.", "tokens": [51109, 492, 362, 281, 1223, 983, 436, 1411, 4755, 294, 264, 700, 1081, 13, 51250], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1433214611477322, "compression_ratio": 1.6076555023923444, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552064844270852e-12}, {"id": 208, "seek": 63930, "start": 657.0999999999999, "end": 657.3399999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51255, 1779, 13, 51267], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1433214611477322, "compression_ratio": 1.6076555023923444, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552064844270852e-12}, {"id": 209, "seek": 63930, "start": 657.4399999999999, "end": 658.4799999999999, "text": " The origin of the trip.", "tokens": [51272, 440, 4957, 295, 264, 4931, 13, 51324], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1433214611477322, "compression_ratio": 1.6076555023923444, "no_speech_prob": 1.5552064844270852e-12}, {"id": 210, "seek": 65848, "start": 658.48, "end": 663.5600000000001, "text": " This brings us to a fascinating section of the text about the illusion of the Great Escape.", "tokens": [50365, 639, 5607, 505, 281, 257, 10343, 3541, 295, 264, 2487, 466, 264, 18854, 295, 264, 3769, 42960, 13, 50619], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.207491473875184, "compression_ratio": 1.5274725274725274, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891057117388256e-12}, {"id": 211, "seek": 65848, "start": 664.3000000000001, "end": 666.02, "text": " Because this wasn't Star Trek.", "tokens": [50656, 1436, 341, 2067, 380, 5705, 25845, 13, 50742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.207491473875184, "compression_ratio": 1.5274725274725274, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891057117388256e-12}, {"id": 212, "seek": 65848, "start": 666.52, "end": 669.52, "text": " This wasn't a noble mission of exploration and discovery.", "tokens": [50767, 639, 2067, 380, 257, 20171, 4447, 295, 16197, 293, 12114, 13, 50917], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.207491473875184, "compression_ratio": 1.5274725274725274, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891057117388256e-12}, {"id": 213, "seek": 65848, "start": 669.88, "end": 672.22, "text": " This was a panicked, desperate evacuation.", "tokens": [50935, 639, 390, 257, 2462, 12598, 11, 17601, 42740, 13, 51052], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.207491473875184, "compression_ratio": 1.5274725274725274, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891057117388256e-12}, {"id": 214, "seek": 65848, "start": 672.88, "end": 675.94, "text": " The monograph makes a very sharp, critical pivot here.", "tokens": [51085, 440, 1108, 3108, 1669, 257, 588, 8199, 11, 4924, 14538, 510, 13, 51238], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.207491473875184, "compression_ratio": 1.5274725274725274, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891057117388256e-12}, {"id": 215, "seek": 67594, "start": 675.94, "end": 681.44, "text": " The text insists that the catastrophe of the Aniara did not begin when the steering broke in deep space.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 2487, 50137, 300, 264, 36043, 295, 264, 1107, 72, 2419, 630, 406, 1841, 562, 264, 14823, 6902, 294, 2452, 1901, 13, 50640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11578043821816132, "compression_ratio": 1.6235294117647059, "no_speech_prob": 1.721190898140712e-12}, {"id": 216, "seek": 67594, "start": 681.72, "end": 683.7600000000001, "text": " Which is such a mind-bending way to look at it.", "tokens": [50654, 3013, 307, 1270, 257, 1575, 12, 65, 2029, 636, 281, 574, 412, 309, 13, 50756], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11578043821816132, "compression_ratio": 1.6235294117647059, "no_speech_prob": 1.721190898140712e-12}, {"id": 217, "seek": 67594, "start": 683.84, "end": 684.12, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50760, 1779, 13, 50774], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11578043821816132, "compression_ratio": 1.6235294117647059, "no_speech_prob": 1.721190898140712e-12}, {"id": 218, "seek": 67594, "start": 684.22, "end": 687.3000000000001, "text": " Because the catastrophe was the very reason the ship was built at all.", "tokens": [50779, 1436, 264, 36043, 390, 264, 588, 1778, 264, 5374, 390, 3094, 412, 439, 13, 50933], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11578043821816132, "compression_ratio": 1.6235294117647059, "no_speech_prob": 1.721190898140712e-12}, {"id": 219, "seek": 67594, "start": 687.5400000000001, "end": 695.32, "text": " The vessel is an arc, and the Earth they are fleeing is depicted as heavily damaged, irradiated, and just ecologically strip-mined.", "tokens": [50945, 440, 18098, 307, 364, 10346, 11, 293, 264, 4755, 436, 366, 41885, 307, 30207, 382, 10950, 14080, 11, 29413, 5688, 770, 11, 293, 445, 11437, 17157, 12828, 12, 76, 2001, 13, 51334], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11578043821816132, "compression_ratio": 1.6235294117647059, "no_speech_prob": 1.721190898140712e-12}, {"id": 220, "seek": 67594, "start": 695.6800000000001, "end": 697.94, "text": " The society that built the ship had already failed.", "tokens": [51352, 440, 4086, 300, 3094, 264, 5374, 632, 1217, 7612, 13, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11578043821816132, "compression_ratio": 1.6235294117647059, "no_speech_prob": 1.721190898140712e-12}, {"id": 221, "seek": 69794, "start": 697.94, "end": 710.48, "text": " And the author introduces this formal sociological concept here called the Displacement Principle, which basically asserts that you cannot solve a relational problem with a purely spatial solution.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 264, 3793, 31472, 341, 9860, 3075, 4383, 3410, 510, 1219, 264, 4208, 564, 7621, 38372, 781, 11, 597, 1936, 19810, 82, 300, 291, 2644, 5039, 257, 38444, 1154, 365, 257, 17491, 23598, 3827, 13, 50992], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355561351776123, "compression_ratio": 1.6448275862068966, "no_speech_prob": 1.868765558965535e-12}, {"id": 222, "seek": 69794, "start": 711.2600000000001, "end": 717.0600000000001, "text": " Relocating a population doesn't automatically sever the causal logic that created the ruin in the first place.", "tokens": [51031, 8738, 905, 990, 257, 4415, 1177, 380, 6772, 2802, 264, 38755, 9952, 300, 2942, 264, 15514, 294, 264, 700, 1081, 13, 51321], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355561351776123, "compression_ratio": 1.6448275862068966, "no_speech_prob": 1.868765558965535e-12}, {"id": 223, "seek": 69794, "start": 717.2800000000001, "end": 717.8000000000001, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51332, 7587, 13, 51358], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355561351776123, "compression_ratio": 1.6448275862068966, "no_speech_prob": 1.868765558965535e-12}, {"id": 224, "seek": 69794, "start": 718.4000000000001, "end": 722.32, "text": " The text notes that humanity on Earth faced a shrinking, admissible region.", "tokens": [51388, 440, 2487, 5570, 300, 10243, 322, 4755, 11446, 257, 41684, 11, 5910, 41073, 4458, 13, 51584], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355561351776123, "compression_ratio": 1.6448275862068966, "no_speech_prob": 1.868765558965535e-12}, {"id": 225, "seek": 69794, "start": 722.9200000000001, "end": 727.4200000000001, "text": " The biosphere was collapsing, making the planet increasingly hostile to human life.", "tokens": [51614, 440, 36997, 6605, 390, 45339, 11, 1455, 264, 5054, 12980, 27312, 281, 1952, 993, 13, 51839], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355561351776123, "compression_ratio": 1.6448275862068966, "no_speech_prob": 1.868765558965535e-12}, {"id": 226, "seek": 72742, "start": 727.42, "end": 728.76, "text": " It was becoming inadmissible.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 390, 5617, 42148, 76, 41073, 13, 50432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14620709869096865, "compression_ratio": 1.6767676767676767, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858819249134348e-12}, {"id": 227, "seek": 72742, "start": 728.9599999999999, "end": 729.18, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50442, 1779, 13, 50453], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14620709869096865, "compression_ratio": 1.6767676767676767, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858819249134348e-12}, {"id": 228, "seek": 72742, "start": 729.4, "end": 738.5799999999999, "text": " But instead of repairing the metabolic relationship with the planet, instead of changing how they lived, they threw all their resources into migrating beyond the damaged region itself.", "tokens": [50464, 583, 2602, 295, 46158, 264, 36464, 2480, 365, 264, 5054, 11, 2602, 295, 4473, 577, 436, 5152, 11, 436, 11918, 439, 641, 3593, 666, 6186, 8754, 4399, 264, 14080, 4458, 2564, 13, 50923], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14620709869096865, "compression_ratio": 1.6767676767676767, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858819249134348e-12}, {"id": 229, "seek": 72742, "start": 739.04, "end": 742.42, "text": " But, you know, migration is never just the movement of biological bodies.", "tokens": [50946, 583, 11, 291, 458, 11, 17011, 307, 1128, 445, 264, 3963, 295, 13910, 7510, 13, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14620709869096865, "compression_ratio": 1.6767676767676767, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858819249134348e-12}, {"id": 230, "seek": 72742, "start": 743.06, "end": 743.9399999999999, "text": " They bring everything with you.", "tokens": [51147, 814, 1565, 1203, 365, 291, 13, 51191], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14620709869096865, "compression_ratio": 1.6767676767676767, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858819249134348e-12}, {"id": 231, "seek": 72742, "start": 744.06, "end": 744.36, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51197, 1079, 13, 51212], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14620709869096865, "compression_ratio": 1.6767676767676767, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858819249134348e-12}, {"id": 232, "seek": 72742, "start": 744.36, "end": 753.92, "text": " When you launch a colony ship, you are transporting institutions, technologies, economic inequalities, hierarchical command structures, and ideological expectations.", "tokens": [51212, 1133, 291, 4025, 257, 23028, 5374, 11, 291, 366, 49302, 8142, 11, 7943, 11, 4836, 41874, 11, 35250, 804, 5622, 9227, 11, 293, 35341, 9843, 13, 51690], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14620709869096865, "compression_ratio": 1.6767676767676767, "no_speech_prob": 1.5858819249134348e-12}, {"id": 233, "seek": 75392, "start": 753.92, "end": 759.42, "text": " You are carrying the exact structural DNA of the society that just murdered a planet.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 366, 9792, 264, 1900, 15067, 8272, 295, 264, 4086, 300, 445, 18486, 257, 5054, 13, 50640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2001278293666555, "compression_ratio": 1.4193548387096775, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006111346894007e-12}, {"id": 234, "seek": 75392, "start": 759.8399999999999, "end": 766.5, "text": " This is like moving to a brand new, expensive city across the country to escape massive, crippling credit card debt.", "tokens": [50661, 639, 307, 411, 2684, 281, 257, 3360, 777, 11, 5124, 2307, 2108, 264, 1941, 281, 7615, 5994, 11, 37667, 1688, 5397, 2920, 7831, 13, 50994], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2001278293666555, "compression_ratio": 1.4193548387096775, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006111346894007e-12}, {"id": 235, "seek": 75392, "start": 767.16, "end": 768.8399999999999, "text": " You think the fresh start will save you.", "tokens": [51027, 509, 519, 264, 4451, 722, 486, 3155, 291, 13, 51111], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2001278293666555, "compression_ratio": 1.4193548387096775, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006111346894007e-12}, {"id": 236, "seek": 75392, "start": 769.04, "end": 769.24, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51121, 865, 13, 51131], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2001278293666555, "compression_ratio": 1.4193548387096775, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006111346894007e-12}, {"id": 237, "seek": 75392, "start": 769.24, "end": 770.1999999999999, "text": " A clean slate.", "tokens": [51131, 316, 2541, 39118, 13, 51179], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2001278293666555, "compression_ratio": 1.4193548387096775, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006111346894007e-12}, {"id": 238, "seek": 77020, "start": 770.2, "end": 771.22, "text": " Yeah, clean slate.", "tokens": [50365, 865, 11, 2541, 39118, 13, 50416], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567907206217448, "compression_ratio": 1.5252525252525253, "no_speech_prob": 1.9579964819632645e-12}, {"id": 239, "seek": 77020, "start": 771.22, "end": 778.88, "text": " But you pack all your credit cards, your impulsive spending habits, and your complete lack of financial literacy into the moving van with you.", "tokens": [50416, 583, 291, 2844, 439, 428, 5397, 5632, 11, 428, 704, 32657, 6434, 14100, 11, 293, 428, 3566, 5011, 295, 4669, 23166, 666, 264, 2684, 3161, 365, 291, 13, 50799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567907206217448, "compression_ratio": 1.5252525252525253, "no_speech_prob": 1.9579964819632645e-12}, {"id": 240, "seek": 77020, "start": 779.1800000000001, "end": 782.0, "text": " You change the geography, but you didn't change the behavior.", "tokens": [50814, 509, 1319, 264, 26695, 11, 457, 291, 994, 380, 1319, 264, 5223, 13, 50955], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567907206217448, "compression_ratio": 1.5252525252525253, "no_speech_prob": 1.9579964819632645e-12}, {"id": 241, "seek": 77020, "start": 782.26, "end": 785.82, "text": " You're going to end up in the exact same debt, just with a different zip code.", "tokens": [50968, 509, 434, 516, 281, 917, 493, 294, 264, 1900, 912, 7831, 11, 445, 365, 257, 819, 20730, 3089, 13, 51146], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567907206217448, "compression_ratio": 1.5252525252525253, "no_speech_prob": 1.9579964819632645e-12}, {"id": 242, "seek": 78582, "start": 785.82, "end": 791.74, "text": " And that dynamic is terrifying when applied to something as complex as a planetary evacuation.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 300, 8546, 307, 18106, 562, 6456, 281, 746, 382, 3997, 382, 257, 35788, 42740, 13, 50661], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10955477775411403, "compression_ratio": 1.5123674911660778, "no_speech_prob": 2.1678167073935217e-12}, {"id": 243, "seek": 78582, "start": 792.2800000000001, "end": 802.2600000000001, "text": " It makes you look very differently at modern rhetoric around colonizing Mars or, you know, building luxury billionaire bunkers in New Zealand to survive climate change.", "tokens": [50688, 467, 1669, 291, 574, 588, 7614, 412, 4363, 29604, 926, 8255, 3319, 9692, 420, 11, 291, 458, 11, 2390, 15558, 42358, 25125, 433, 294, 1873, 13883, 281, 7867, 5659, 1319, 13, 51187], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10955477775411403, "compression_ratio": 1.5123674911660778, "no_speech_prob": 2.1678167073935217e-12}, {"id": 244, "seek": 78582, "start": 802.34, "end": 802.82, "text": " Oh, totally.", "tokens": [51191, 876, 11, 3879, 13, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10955477775411403, "compression_ratio": 1.5123674911660778, "no_speech_prob": 2.1678167073935217e-12}, {"id": 245, "seek": 78582, "start": 803.2, "end": 812.46, "text": " We are taking the exact, extractive, growth-obsessed logic that is currently straining Earth's biosphere and trying to export it into the solar system.", "tokens": [51234, 492, 366, 1940, 264, 1900, 11, 8947, 488, 11, 4599, 12, 16537, 10830, 9952, 300, 307, 4362, 2148, 1760, 4755, 311, 36997, 6605, 293, 1382, 281, 10725, 309, 666, 264, 7936, 1185, 13, 51697], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10955477775411403, "compression_ratio": 1.5123674911660778, "no_speech_prob": 2.1678167073935217e-12}, {"id": 246, "seek": 81246, "start": 812.46, "end": 816.2800000000001, "text": " The author calls this the historical continuation constraint.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 3793, 5498, 341, 264, 8584, 29357, 25534, 13, 50556], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15440645672026135, "compression_ratio": 1.7327935222672064, "no_speech_prob": 2.262757906393298e-12}, {"id": 247, "seek": 81246, "start": 816.72, "end": 827.44, "text": " You cannot use the accumulated industrial capacities of a civilization to escape that civilization, while assuming those capacities are somehow magically scrubbed clean of the original problem.", "tokens": [50578, 509, 2644, 764, 264, 31346, 9987, 39396, 295, 257, 18036, 281, 7615, 300, 18036, 11, 1339, 11926, 729, 39396, 366, 6063, 39763, 24163, 2883, 2541, 295, 264, 3380, 1154, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15440645672026135, "compression_ratio": 1.7327935222672064, "no_speech_prob": 2.262757906393298e-12}, {"id": 248, "seek": 81246, "start": 827.86, "end": 835.0600000000001, "text": " The escape ship is forged in the same factories, funded by the same economics, and commanded by the same hierarchies that caused the apocalypse.", "tokens": [51135, 440, 7615, 5374, 307, 40226, 294, 264, 912, 24813, 11, 14385, 538, 264, 912, 14564, 11, 293, 34359, 538, 264, 912, 35250, 530, 300, 7008, 264, 42600, 13, 51495], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15440645672026135, "compression_ratio": 1.7327935222672064, "no_speech_prob": 2.262757906393298e-12}, {"id": 249, "seek": 81246, "start": 835.5400000000001, "end": 836.9000000000001, "text": " The disease is in the cure.", "tokens": [51519, 440, 4752, 307, 294, 264, 13698, 13, 51587], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15440645672026135, "compression_ratio": 1.7327935222672064, "no_speech_prob": 2.262757906393298e-12}, {"id": 250, "seek": 83690, "start": 836.9, "end": 843.3199999999999, "text": " And this leads to a secondary, equally dangerous problem the author calls compensatory fragility.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 341, 6689, 281, 257, 11396, 11, 12309, 5795, 1154, 264, 3793, 5498, 11598, 4745, 9241, 1140, 13, 50686], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11447383009869119, "compression_ratio": 1.5426356589147288, "no_speech_prob": 1.7693793478990028e-12}, {"id": 251, "seek": 83690, "start": 843.92, "end": 848.54, "text": " Because to survive the journey to Mars, the Aniara can't just be a metal box.", "tokens": [50716, 1436, 281, 7867, 264, 4671, 281, 9692, 11, 264, 1107, 72, 2419, 393, 380, 445, 312, 257, 5760, 2424, 13, 50947], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11447383009869119, "compression_ratio": 1.5426356589147288, "no_speech_prob": 1.7693793478990028e-12}, {"id": 252, "seek": 83690, "start": 848.76, "end": 853.18, "text": " It has to be a highly compressed, technologically perfect simulation of Earth.", "tokens": [50958, 467, 575, 281, 312, 257, 5405, 30353, 11, 1537, 17157, 2176, 16575, 295, 4755, 13, 51179], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11447383009869119, "compression_ratio": 1.5426356589147288, "no_speech_prob": 1.7693793478990028e-12}, {"id": 253, "seek": 83690, "start": 853.34, "end": 855.42, "text": " This is where the engineering meets the sociology.", "tokens": [51187, 639, 307, 689, 264, 7043, 13961, 264, 41744, 13, 51291], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11447383009869119, "compression_ratio": 1.5426356589147288, "no_speech_prob": 1.7693793478990028e-12}, {"id": 254, "seek": 83690, "start": 856.0799999999999, "end": 861.78, "text": " On Earth, even a damaged Earth, we benefit from ecological abundance and natural redundancy.", "tokens": [51324, 1282, 4755, 11, 754, 257, 14080, 4755, 11, 321, 5121, 490, 31054, 23391, 293, 3303, 27830, 6717, 13, 51609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11447383009869119, "compression_ratio": 1.5426356589147288, "no_speech_prob": 1.7693793478990028e-12}, {"id": 255, "seek": 86178, "start": 861.78, "end": 866.9399999999999, "text": " If a blight kills one species of tree in a forest, the forest doesn't disappear.", "tokens": [50365, 759, 257, 888, 397, 14563, 472, 6172, 295, 4230, 294, 257, 6719, 11, 264, 6719, 1177, 380, 11596, 13, 50623], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14273964125534583, "compression_ratio": 1.556701030927835, "no_speech_prob": 1.847003019278537e-12}, {"id": 256, "seek": 86178, "start": 867.28, "end": 868.26, "text": " Other plants step up.", "tokens": [50640, 5358, 5972, 1823, 493, 13, 50689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14273964125534583, "compression_ratio": 1.556701030927835, "no_speech_prob": 1.847003019278537e-12}, {"id": 257, "seek": 86178, "start": 868.3399999999999, "end": 868.74, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50693, 7587, 13, 50713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14273964125534583, "compression_ratio": 1.556701030927835, "no_speech_prob": 1.847003019278537e-12}, {"id": 258, "seek": 86178, "start": 868.9, "end": 870.12, "text": " Other plants fill the niche.", "tokens": [50721, 5358, 5972, 2836, 264, 19956, 13, 50782], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14273964125534583, "compression_ratio": 1.556701030927835, "no_speech_prob": 1.847003019278537e-12}, {"id": 259, "seek": 86178, "start": 870.5799999999999, "end": 873.88, "text": " The system is open, messy, and incredibly robust.", "tokens": [50805, 440, 1185, 307, 1269, 11, 16191, 11, 293, 6252, 13956, 13, 50970], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14273964125534583, "compression_ratio": 1.556701030927835, "no_speech_prob": 1.847003019278537e-12}, {"id": 260, "seek": 86178, "start": 874.38, "end": 879.6, "text": " But on a spacecraft, you trade that massive natural redundancy for engineered precision.", "tokens": [50995, 583, 322, 257, 22910, 11, 291, 4923, 300, 5994, 3303, 27830, 6717, 337, 38648, 18356, 13, 51256], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14273964125534583, "compression_ratio": 1.556701030927835, "no_speech_prob": 1.847003019278537e-12}, {"id": 261, "seek": 86178, "start": 880.04, "end": 887.1, "text": " Meaning if the air scrubber on Deck 4 burns out a proprietary microchip, you don't get a slightly less pleasant atmosphere.", "tokens": [51278, 19948, 498, 264, 1988, 24163, 607, 322, 38196, 1017, 22684, 484, 257, 38992, 4532, 339, 647, 11, 291, 500, 380, 483, 257, 4748, 1570, 16232, 8018, 13, 51631], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14273964125534583, "compression_ratio": 1.556701030927835, "no_speech_prob": 1.847003019278537e-12}, {"id": 262, "seek": 86178, "start": 887.52, "end": 890.04, "text": " You get a compartment full of asphyxiated people.", "tokens": [51652, 509, 483, 257, 26505, 1577, 295, 382, 15680, 27579, 770, 561, 13, 51778], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14273964125534583, "compression_ratio": 1.556701030927835, "no_speech_prob": 1.847003019278537e-12}, {"id": 263, "seek": 89004, "start": 890.04, "end": 892.16, "text": " Exactly the stakes the author outlines.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 264, 28429, 264, 3793, 40125, 13, 50471], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13503154257069463, "compression_ratio": 1.619672131147541, "no_speech_prob": 2.362080800052957e-12}, {"id": 264, "seek": 89004, "start": 892.3199999999999, "end": 897.9599999999999, "text": " You are trading a robust, forgiving environment for a closed, highly efficient, but incredibly brittle system.", "tokens": [50479, 509, 366, 9529, 257, 13956, 11, 37701, 2823, 337, 257, 5395, 11, 5405, 7148, 11, 457, 6252, 49325, 1185, 13, 50761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13503154257069463, "compression_ratio": 1.619672131147541, "no_speech_prob": 2.362080800052957e-12}, {"id": 265, "seek": 89004, "start": 898.4399999999999, "end": 902.8199999999999, "text": " The more we rely on hyper-advanced technology to escape the natural limits of our environment,", "tokens": [50785, 440, 544, 321, 10687, 322, 9848, 12, 345, 85, 4864, 2899, 281, 7615, 264, 3303, 10406, 295, 527, 2823, 11, 51004], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13503154257069463, "compression_ratio": 1.619672131147541, "no_speech_prob": 2.362080800052957e-12}, {"id": 266, "seek": 89004, "start": 903.04, "end": 906.16, "text": " the more fragile we become to the failure of that very technology.", "tokens": [51015, 264, 544, 23847, 321, 1813, 281, 264, 7763, 295, 300, 588, 2899, 13, 51171], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13503154257069463, "compression_ratio": 1.619672131147541, "no_speech_prob": 2.362080800052957e-12}, {"id": 267, "seek": 89004, "start": 906.26, "end": 907.0, "text": " It's a paradox.", "tokens": [51176, 467, 311, 257, 26221, 13, 51213], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13503154257069463, "compression_ratio": 1.619672131147541, "no_speech_prob": 2.362080800052957e-12}, {"id": 268, "seek": 89004, "start": 907.3, "end": 912.9399999999999, "text": " On the ship, human life becomes utterly continuously dependent on uninterrupted perfect maintenance.", "tokens": [51228, 1282, 264, 5374, 11, 1952, 993, 3643, 30251, 15684, 12334, 322, 49234, 5428, 292, 2176, 11258, 13, 51510], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13503154257069463, "compression_ratio": 1.619672131147541, "no_speech_prob": 2.362080800052957e-12}, {"id": 269, "seek": 89004, "start": 913.38, "end": 915.28, "text": " There is zero margin for error.", "tokens": [51532, 821, 307, 4018, 10270, 337, 6713, 13, 51627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13503154257069463, "compression_ratio": 1.619672131147541, "no_speech_prob": 2.362080800052957e-12}, {"id": 270, "seek": 89004, "start": 915.8199999999999, "end": 917.52, "text": " Which is just such a rich irony.", "tokens": [51654, 3013, 307, 445, 1270, 257, 4593, 35365, 13, 51739], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13503154257069463, "compression_ratio": 1.619672131147541, "no_speech_prob": 2.362080800052957e-12}, {"id": 271, "seek": 91752, "start": 917.52, "end": 923.8, "text": " To run away from the natural world they destroyed, they had to perfectly recreate a synthetic version of it,", "tokens": [50365, 1407, 1190, 1314, 490, 264, 3303, 1002, 436, 8937, 11, 436, 632, 281, 6239, 25833, 257, 23420, 3037, 295, 309, 11, 50679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17877159118652344, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 1.7622687163709738e-12}, {"id": 272, "seek": 91752, "start": 924.04, "end": 928.04, "text": " but one that requires constant agonizing vigilance to maintain.", "tokens": [50691, 457, 472, 300, 7029, 5754, 623, 266, 3319, 39093, 719, 281, 6909, 13, 50891], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17877159118652344, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 1.7622687163709738e-12}, {"id": 273, "seek": 91752, "start": 928.76, "end": 934.18, "text": " The great escape was already a philosophical and structural failure before the engines even ignited.", "tokens": [50927, 440, 869, 7615, 390, 1217, 257, 25066, 293, 15067, 7763, 949, 264, 12982, 754, 5335, 1226, 13, 51198], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17877159118652344, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 1.7622687163709738e-12}, {"id": 274, "seek": 91752, "start": 934.3, "end": 934.48, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51204, 1079, 13, 51213], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17877159118652344, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 1.7622687163709738e-12}, {"id": 275, "seek": 91752, "start": 934.66, "end": 935.9399999999999, "text": " The society was already broken.", "tokens": [51222, 440, 4086, 390, 1217, 5463, 13, 51286], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17877159118652344, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 1.7622687163709738e-12}, {"id": 276, "seek": 91752, "start": 936.48, "end": 939.6, "text": " The asteroid that ruined the steering didn't cause the catastrophe.", "tokens": [51313, 440, 33833, 300, 17013, 264, 14823, 994, 380, 3082, 264, 36043, 13, 51469], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17877159118652344, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 1.7622687163709738e-12}, {"id": 277, "seek": 91752, "start": 939.86, "end": 942.52, "text": " It just severed the safety net that was hiding the catastrophe.", "tokens": [51482, 467, 445, 2802, 292, 264, 4514, 2533, 300, 390, 10596, 264, 36043, 13, 51615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17877159118652344, "compression_ratio": 1.6806083650190113, "no_speech_prob": 1.7622687163709738e-12}, {"id": 278, "seek": 94252, "start": 942.52, "end": 946.1999999999999, "text": " The accident just forced them to finally look at the reality they had built.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 6398, 445, 7579, 552, 281, 2721, 574, 412, 264, 4103, 436, 632, 3094, 13, 50549], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16951324584636282, "compression_ratio": 1.429530201342282, "no_speech_prob": 2.227343309790797e-12}, {"id": 279, "seek": 94252, "start": 946.6999999999999, "end": 949.52, "text": " Which brings us to the moment of the physical disaster itself,", "tokens": [50574, 3013, 5607, 505, 281, 264, 1623, 295, 264, 4001, 11293, 2564, 11, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16951324584636282, "compression_ratio": 1.429530201342282, "no_speech_prob": 2.227343309790797e-12}, {"id": 280, "seek": 94252, "start": 949.86, "end": 953.54, "text": " and the incredible psychological nightmare that unfolds in the aftermath.", "tokens": [50732, 293, 264, 4651, 14346, 18724, 300, 17980, 82, 294, 264, 34095, 13, 50916], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16951324584636282, "compression_ratio": 1.429530201342282, "no_speech_prob": 2.227343309790797e-12}, {"id": 281, "seek": 95354, "start": 953.54, "end": 957.0999999999999, "text": " So let's put ourselves back on the ship in the moment everything goes wrong.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 718, 311, 829, 4175, 646, 322, 264, 5374, 294, 264, 1623, 1203, 1709, 2085, 13, 50543], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17200719393216646, "compression_ratio": 1.54251012145749, "no_speech_prob": 1.7077925445335707e-12}, {"id": 282, "seek": 95354, "start": 957.5, "end": 958.4, "text": " The NER is cruising.", "tokens": [50563, 440, 426, 1598, 307, 42180, 13, 50608], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17200719393216646, "compression_ratio": 1.54251012145749, "no_speech_prob": 1.7077925445335707e-12}, {"id": 283, "seek": 95354, "start": 958.88, "end": 960.16, "text": " Suddenly, alarms blare.", "tokens": [50632, 21194, 11, 45039, 888, 543, 13, 50696], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17200719393216646, "compression_ratio": 1.54251012145749, "no_speech_prob": 1.7077925445335707e-12}, {"id": 284, "seek": 95354, "start": 960.64, "end": 963.5999999999999, "text": " An uncharted asteroid field appears on the long-range sensors.", "tokens": [50720, 1107, 33686, 47350, 33833, 2519, 7038, 322, 264, 938, 12, 14521, 14840, 13, 50868], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17200719393216646, "compression_ratio": 1.54251012145749, "no_speech_prob": 1.7077925445335707e-12}, {"id": 285, "seek": 95354, "start": 964.18, "end": 965.56, "text": " The ship swerves violently.", "tokens": [50897, 440, 5374, 262, 1554, 977, 46728, 13, 50966], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17200719393216646, "compression_ratio": 1.54251012145749, "no_speech_prob": 1.7077925445335707e-12}, {"id": 286, "seek": 95354, "start": 965.92, "end": 967.8, "text": " The G-forces rattle the bulkheads.", "tokens": [50984, 440, 460, 12, 2994, 887, 367, 3327, 264, 16139, 29481, 13, 51078], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17200719393216646, "compression_ratio": 1.54251012145749, "no_speech_prob": 1.7077925445335707e-12}, {"id": 287, "seek": 95354, "start": 967.9399999999999, "end": 969.88, "text": " The structural groans echo through the corridors.", "tokens": [51085, 440, 15067, 44657, 14300, 807, 264, 46920, 13, 51182], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17200719393216646, "compression_ratio": 1.54251012145749, "no_speech_prob": 1.7077925445335707e-12}, {"id": 288, "seek": 95354, "start": 970.2199999999999, "end": 972.5999999999999, "text": " And the primary steering ray is permanently sheared off.", "tokens": [51199, 400, 264, 6194, 14823, 18592, 307, 24042, 750, 1642, 766, 13, 51318], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17200719393216646, "compression_ratio": 1.54251012145749, "no_speech_prob": 1.7077925445335707e-12}, {"id": 289, "seek": 95354, "start": 972.74, "end": 973.86, "text": " It's a devastating moment.", "tokens": [51325, 467, 311, 257, 21280, 1623, 13, 51381], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17200719393216646, "compression_ratio": 1.54251012145749, "no_speech_prob": 1.7077925445335707e-12}, {"id": 290, "seek": 97386, "start": 973.86, "end": 976.96, "text": " The trajectory to Mars is mathematically lost forever.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 21512, 281, 9692, 307, 44003, 2731, 5680, 13, 50520], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13053292774018788, "compression_ratio": 1.7236363636363636, "no_speech_prob": 2.4373046983439117e-12}, {"id": 291, "seek": 97386, "start": 977.78, "end": 981.42, "text": " And the author breaks this delay down into distinct layers of truth", "tokens": [50561, 400, 264, 3793, 9857, 341, 8577, 760, 666, 10644, 7914, 295, 3494, 50743], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13053292774018788, "compression_ratio": 1.7236363636363636, "no_speech_prob": 2.4373046983439117e-12}, {"id": 292, "seek": 97386, "start": 981.42, "end": 983.86, "text": " that update at completely different speeds.", "tokens": [50743, 300, 5623, 412, 2584, 819, 16411, 13, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13053292774018788, "compression_ratio": 1.7236363636363636, "no_speech_prob": 2.4373046983439117e-12}, {"id": 293, "seek": 97386, "start": 984.42, "end": 990.94, "text": " You have technical truth, institutional truth, public truth, and finally, existential truth.", "tokens": [50893, 509, 362, 6191, 3494, 11, 18391, 3494, 11, 1908, 3494, 11, 293, 2721, 11, 37133, 3494, 13, 51219], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13053292774018788, "compression_ratio": 1.7236363636363636, "no_speech_prob": 2.4373046983439117e-12}, {"id": 294, "seek": 97386, "start": 991.08, "end": 995.78, "text": " Let's pull those apart because the friction between those layers is where the real drama happens.", "tokens": [51226, 961, 311, 2235, 729, 4936, 570, 264, 17710, 1296, 729, 7914, 307, 689, 264, 957, 9412, 2314, 13, 51461], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13053292774018788, "compression_ratio": 1.7236363636363636, "no_speech_prob": 2.4373046983439117e-12}, {"id": 295, "seek": 97386, "start": 995.96, "end": 998.24, "text": " At the very bottom layer, you have technical truth.", "tokens": [51470, 1711, 264, 588, 2767, 4583, 11, 291, 362, 6191, 3494, 13, 51584], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13053292774018788, "compression_ratio": 1.7236363636363636, "no_speech_prob": 2.4373046983439117e-12}, {"id": 296, "seek": 97386, "start": 998.36, "end": 1002.64, "text": " The sensors, the navigational computers, the raw telemetry data.", "tokens": [51590, 440, 14840, 11, 264, 7407, 1478, 10807, 11, 264, 8936, 4304, 5537, 627, 1412, 13, 51804], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13053292774018788, "compression_ratio": 1.7236363636363636, "no_speech_prob": 2.4373046983439117e-12}, {"id": 297, "seek": 100264, "start": 1002.64, "end": 1007.1999999999999, "text": " The moment the steering shears off, the technical truth instantly updates.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 1623, 264, 14823, 750, 685, 766, 11, 264, 6191, 3494, 13518, 9205, 13, 50593], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 298, "seek": 100264, "start": 1007.74, "end": 1008.9, "text": " Mars is unreachable.", "tokens": [50620, 9692, 307, 517, 16226, 712, 13, 50678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 299, "seek": 100264, "start": 1009.3, "end": 1010.66, "text": " The math is undeniable.", "tokens": [50698, 440, 5221, 307, 674, 268, 9364, 13, 50766], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 300, "seek": 100264, "start": 1010.8199999999999, "end": 1011.56, "text": " The machine knows.", "tokens": [50774, 440, 3479, 3255, 13, 50811], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 301, "seek": 100264, "start": 1011.86, "end": 1012.14, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50826, 1079, 13, 50840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 302, "seek": 100264, "start": 1012.72, "end": 1015.6999999999999, "text": " Then, that data flows upward to the second layer.", "tokens": [50869, 1396, 11, 300, 1412, 12867, 23452, 281, 264, 1150, 4583, 13, 51018], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 303, "seek": 100264, "start": 1016.3, "end": 1017.24, "text": " Institutional truth.", "tokens": [51048, 2730, 41859, 3494, 13, 51095], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 304, "seek": 100264, "start": 1017.92, "end": 1021.98, "text": " This is the moment the captain, the navigators, and the political leadership in the command center", "tokens": [51129, 639, 307, 264, 1623, 264, 14871, 11, 264, 7407, 3391, 11, 293, 264, 3905, 5848, 294, 264, 5622, 3056, 51332], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 305, "seek": 100264, "start": 1021.98, "end": 1025.34, "text": " look at the screens, verify the math, and acknowledge the reality.", "tokens": [51332, 574, 412, 264, 11171, 11, 16888, 264, 5221, 11, 293, 10692, 264, 4103, 13, 51500], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 306, "seek": 100264, "start": 1025.62, "end": 1030.56, "text": " But the public truth, what the thousands of passengers down in the cargo bays and residential decks believe,", "tokens": [51514, 583, 264, 1908, 3494, 11, 437, 264, 5383, 295, 18436, 760, 294, 264, 19449, 272, 3772, 293, 17389, 32607, 1697, 11, 51761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 307, "seek": 100264, "start": 1030.96, "end": 1032.24, "text": " that hasn't updated at all.", "tokens": [51781, 300, 6132, 380, 10588, 412, 439, 13, 51845], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13930849921434446, "compression_ratio": 1.7466216216216217, "no_speech_prob": 1.7485572451764186e-12}, {"id": 308, "seek": 103224, "start": 1032.24, "end": 1034.44, "text": " The passengers still think they're going to Mars.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 18436, 920, 519, 436, 434, 516, 281, 9692, 13, 50475], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495043324158255, "compression_ratio": 1.7798507462686568, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298389504329491e-12}, {"id": 309, "seek": 103224, "start": 1035.1, "end": 1039.06, "text": " And even when the passengers are finally told the public truth, even when the captain makes", "tokens": [50508, 400, 754, 562, 264, 18436, 366, 2721, 1907, 264, 1908, 3494, 11, 754, 562, 264, 14871, 1669, 50706], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495043324158255, "compression_ratio": 1.7798507462686568, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298389504329491e-12}, {"id": 310, "seek": 103224, "start": 1039.06, "end": 1043.52, "text": " the announcement, it takes years, sometimes a generation, to reach the final layer.", "tokens": [50706, 264, 12847, 11, 309, 2516, 924, 11, 2171, 257, 5125, 11, 281, 2524, 264, 2572, 4583, 13, 50929], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495043324158255, "compression_ratio": 1.7798507462686568, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298389504329491e-12}, {"id": 311, "seek": 103224, "start": 1043.88, "end": 1044.74, "text": " Existential truth.", "tokens": [50947, 2111, 468, 2549, 3494, 13, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495043324158255, "compression_ratio": 1.7798507462686568, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298389504329491e-12}, {"id": 312, "seek": 103224, "start": 1045.16, "end": 1045.64, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51011, 7587, 13, 51035], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495043324158255, "compression_ratio": 1.7798507462686568, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298389504329491e-12}, {"id": 313, "seek": 103224, "start": 1045.88, "end": 1046.76, "text": " Existential truth.", "tokens": [51047, 2111, 468, 2549, 3494, 13, 51091], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495043324158255, "compression_ratio": 1.7798507462686568, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298389504329491e-12}, {"id": 314, "seek": 103224, "start": 1047.24, "end": 1052.22, "text": " That is the moment when a person actually reorganizes their internal emotional life,", "tokens": [51115, 663, 307, 264, 1623, 562, 257, 954, 767, 41203, 5660, 641, 6920, 6863, 993, 11, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495043324158255, "compression_ratio": 1.7798507462686568, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298389504329491e-12}, {"id": 315, "seek": 103224, "start": 1052.34, "end": 1057.0, "text": " their daily habits, and their deep psychological expectations around the fact that they are going", "tokens": [51370, 641, 5212, 14100, 11, 293, 641, 2452, 14346, 9843, 926, 264, 1186, 300, 436, 366, 516, 51603], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495043324158255, "compression_ratio": 1.7798507462686568, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298389504329491e-12}, {"id": 316, "seek": 103224, "start": 1057.0, "end": 1058.52, "text": " to die in deep space.", "tokens": [51603, 281, 978, 294, 2452, 1901, 13, 51679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11495043324158255, "compression_ratio": 1.7798507462686568, "no_speech_prob": 1.6298389504329491e-12}, {"id": 317, "seek": 105852, "start": 1058.52, "end": 1062.56, "text": " Okay, but I have to stop you here, because reading this section, I found myself getting", "tokens": [50365, 1033, 11, 457, 286, 362, 281, 1590, 291, 510, 11, 570, 3760, 341, 3541, 11, 286, 1352, 2059, 1242, 50567], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17864188693818592, "compression_ratio": 1.2301587301587302, "no_speech_prob": 2.0364727699312413e-12}, {"id": 318, "seek": 105852, "start": 1062.56, "end": 1064.96, "text": " incredibly frustrated with the leadership of the ship.", "tokens": [50567, 6252, 15751, 365, 264, 5848, 295, 264, 5374, 13, 50687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17864188693818592, "compression_ratio": 1.2301587301587302, "no_speech_prob": 2.0364727699312413e-12}, {"id": 319, "seek": 105852, "start": 1065.18, "end": 1065.54, "text": " Really?", "tokens": [50698, 4083, 30, 50716], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17864188693818592, "compression_ratio": 1.2301587301587302, "no_speech_prob": 2.0364727699312413e-12}, {"id": 320, "seek": 105852, "start": 1065.78, "end": 1066.16, "text": " Why?", "tokens": [50728, 1545, 30, 50747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17864188693818592, "compression_ratio": 1.2301587301587302, "no_speech_prob": 2.0364727699312413e-12}, {"id": 321, "seek": 106616, "start": 1066.16, "end": 1070.94, "text": " Why wouldn't the captain or the governing council just broadcast the truth immediately?", "tokens": [50365, 1545, 2759, 380, 264, 14871, 420, 264, 30054, 9209, 445, 9975, 264, 3494, 4258, 30, 50604], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17341214348288142, "compression_ratio": 1.5046728971962617, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619852195864926e-12}, {"id": 322, "seek": 106616, "start": 1071.6200000000001, "end": 1075.0, "text": " Why engineer an epistemic delay at the public level at all?", "tokens": [50638, 1545, 11403, 364, 2388, 468, 3438, 8577, 412, 264, 1908, 1496, 412, 439, 30, 50807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17341214348288142, "compression_ratio": 1.5046728971962617, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619852195864926e-12}, {"id": 323, "seek": 106616, "start": 1075.42, "end": 1079.76, "text": " If the ship is lost, you get on the intercom, you say, folks, we have suffered a catastrophic", "tokens": [50828, 759, 264, 5374, 307, 2731, 11, 291, 483, 322, 264, 728, 1112, 11, 291, 584, 11, 4024, 11, 321, 362, 12770, 257, 34915, 51045], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17341214348288142, "compression_ratio": 1.5046728971962617, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619852195864926e-12}, {"id": 324, "seek": 106616, "start": 1079.76, "end": 1080.38, "text": " failure.", "tokens": [51045, 7763, 13, 51076], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17341214348288142, "compression_ratio": 1.5046728971962617, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619852195864926e-12}, {"id": 325, "seek": 106616, "start": 1080.8200000000002, "end": 1081.5800000000002, "text": " Mars is out.", "tokens": [51098, 9692, 307, 484, 13, 51136], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17341214348288142, "compression_ratio": 1.5046728971962617, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619852195864926e-12}, {"id": 326, "seek": 106616, "start": 1081.96, "end": 1084.28, "text": " We need to figure out how to survive together in the void.", "tokens": [51155, 492, 643, 281, 2573, 484, 577, 281, 7867, 1214, 294, 264, 22009, 13, 51271], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17341214348288142, "compression_ratio": 1.5046728971962617, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619852195864926e-12}, {"id": 327, "seek": 108428, "start": 1084.28, "end": 1090.46, "text": " I feel like human beings handle hard truths much better than they handle agonizing ambiguity.", "tokens": [50365, 286, 841, 411, 1952, 8958, 4813, 1152, 30079, 709, 1101, 813, 436, 4813, 623, 266, 3319, 46519, 13, 50674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1438981836492365, "compression_ratio": 1.6691449814126393, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922821871780513e-12}, {"id": 328, "seek": 108428, "start": 1091.12, "end": 1095.92, "text": " That is a very democratic, very optimistic view of human nature, but the monograph counters", "tokens": [50707, 663, 307, 257, 588, 15337, 11, 588, 19397, 1910, 295, 1952, 3687, 11, 457, 264, 1108, 3108, 39338, 50947], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1438981836492365, "compression_ratio": 1.6691449814126393, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922821871780513e-12}, {"id": 329, "seek": 108428, "start": 1095.92, "end": 1098.34, "text": " that with the concept of epistemic paternalism.", "tokens": [50947, 300, 365, 264, 3410, 295, 2388, 468, 3438, 42302, 4660, 1434, 13, 51068], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1438981836492365, "compression_ratio": 1.6691449814126393, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922821871780513e-12}, {"id": 330, "seek": 108428, "start": 1098.44, "end": 1099.6399999999999, "text": " Epistemic paternalism.", "tokens": [51073, 9970, 468, 3438, 42302, 4660, 1434, 13, 51133], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1438981836492365, "compression_ratio": 1.6691449814126393, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922821871780513e-12}, {"id": 331, "seek": 108428, "start": 1099.8799999999999, "end": 1100.1399999999999, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51145, 1079, 13, 51158], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1438981836492365, "compression_ratio": 1.6691449814126393, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922821871780513e-12}, {"id": 332, "seek": 108428, "start": 1100.6399999999999, "end": 1103.18, "text": " The authorities control the information about reachability.", "tokens": [51183, 440, 12076, 1969, 264, 1589, 466, 2524, 2310, 13, 51310], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1438981836492365, "compression_ratio": 1.6691449814126393, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922821871780513e-12}, {"id": 333, "seek": 108428, "start": 1103.92, "end": 1108.96, "text": " The leadership calculates that if they tell the unvarnished, horrifying truth immediately, they", "tokens": [51347, 440, 5848, 4322, 1024, 300, 498, 436, 980, 264, 517, 85, 1083, 4729, 11, 40227, 3494, 4258, 11, 436, 51599], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1438981836492365, "compression_ratio": 1.6691449814126393, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922821871780513e-12}, {"id": 334, "seek": 108428, "start": 1108.96, "end": 1111.12, "text": " risk sheer uncontainable panic.", "tokens": [51599, 3148, 23061, 36019, 491, 712, 14783, 13, 51707], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1438981836492365, "compression_ratio": 1.6691449814126393, "no_speech_prob": 1.5922821871780513e-12}, {"id": 335, "seek": 111112, "start": 1111.12, "end": 1114.1399999999999, "text": " And panic directly threatens admissibility.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 14783, 3838, 47511, 5910, 891, 2841, 13, 50516], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 336, "seek": 111112, "start": 1114.3799999999999, "end": 1117.3, "text": " It threatens the immediate physical survivability of the ship.", "tokens": [50528, 467, 47511, 264, 11629, 4001, 12324, 2310, 295, 264, 5374, 13, 50674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 337, "seek": 111112, "start": 1117.9399999999998, "end": 1121.32, "text": " Because if people riot, they might break the air scrubbers.", "tokens": [50706, 1436, 498, 561, 32211, 11, 436, 1062, 1821, 264, 1988, 24163, 1616, 13, 50875], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 338, "seek": 111112, "start": 1121.56, "end": 1122.08, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [50887, 48746, 736, 13, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 339, "seek": 111112, "start": 1122.2199999999998, "end": 1126.76, "text": " If a mob storms the hydroponics bay, or if the engineering crew simply gives up and stops", "tokens": [50920, 759, 257, 4298, 23288, 264, 5796, 1513, 266, 1167, 13642, 11, 420, 498, 264, 7043, 7260, 2935, 2709, 493, 293, 10094, 51147], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 340, "seek": 111112, "start": 1126.76, "end": 1129.6599999999999, "text": " doing their maintenance rotations, because, you know, what's the point?", "tokens": [51147, 884, 641, 11258, 44796, 11, 570, 11, 291, 458, 11, 437, 311, 264, 935, 30, 51292], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 341, "seek": 111112, "start": 1129.9399999999998, "end": 1131.3999999999999, "text": " The life support systems fail.", "tokens": [51306, 440, 993, 1406, 3652, 3061, 13, 51379], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 342, "seek": 111112, "start": 1132.0, "end": 1134.4199999999998, "text": " Everyone dies today instead of 50 years from now.", "tokens": [51409, 5198, 2714, 965, 2602, 295, 2625, 924, 490, 586, 13, 51530], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 343, "seek": 111112, "start": 1134.62, "end": 1136.34, "text": " So they have to manage the fallout.", "tokens": [51540, 407, 436, 362, 281, 3067, 264, 2100, 346, 13, 51626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 344, "seek": 111112, "start": 1136.4199999999998, "end": 1136.7399999999998, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51630, 1779, 13, 51646], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 345, "seek": 111112, "start": 1136.8799999999999, "end": 1139.76, "text": " So the leadership makes a cold, calculated decision.", "tokens": [51653, 407, 264, 5848, 1669, 257, 3554, 11, 15598, 3537, 13, 51797], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15735134933934067, "compression_ratio": 1.5731707317073171, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621818938605815e-12}, {"id": 346, "seek": 113976, "start": 1139.76, "end": 1140.68, "text": " They lie.", "tokens": [50365, 814, 4544, 13, 50411], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15757624308268228, "compression_ratio": 1.6367521367521367, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040571207050826e-12}, {"id": 347, "seek": 113976, "start": 1141.12, "end": 1142.12, "text": " They soften the blow.", "tokens": [50433, 814, 31356, 264, 6327, 13, 50483], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15757624308268228, "compression_ratio": 1.6367521367521367, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040571207050826e-12}, {"id": 348, "seek": 113976, "start": 1142.4, "end": 1148.22, "text": " They claim they are calculating new trajectories or waiting for a rescue vessel from Earth.", "tokens": [50497, 814, 3932, 436, 366, 28258, 777, 18257, 2083, 420, 3806, 337, 257, 13283, 18098, 490, 4755, 13, 50788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15757624308268228, "compression_ratio": 1.6367521367521367, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040571207050826e-12}, {"id": 349, "seek": 113976, "start": 1148.48, "end": 1154.32, "text": " They manage and dole out the truth in microscopic doses to maintain order, prioritizing the physical", "tokens": [50801, 814, 3067, 293, 360, 306, 484, 264, 3494, 294, 47897, 22576, 281, 6909, 1668, 11, 14846, 3319, 264, 4001, 51093], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15757624308268228, "compression_ratio": 1.6367521367521367, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040571207050826e-12}, {"id": 350, "seek": 113976, "start": 1154.32, "end": 1158.12, "text": " survival of the system over the population's correspondence with reality.", "tokens": [51093, 12559, 295, 264, 1185, 670, 264, 4415, 311, 38135, 365, 4103, 13, 51283], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15757624308268228, "compression_ratio": 1.6367521367521367, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040571207050826e-12}, {"id": 351, "seek": 113976, "start": 1158.44, "end": 1161.9, "text": " They're basically gaslighting the entire population to keep the lights on.", "tokens": [51299, 814, 434, 1936, 4211, 2764, 278, 264, 2302, 4415, 281, 1066, 264, 5811, 322, 13, 51472], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15757624308268228, "compression_ratio": 1.6367521367521367, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040571207050826e-12}, {"id": 352, "seek": 113976, "start": 1162.18, "end": 1162.6, "text": " They are.", "tokens": [51486, 814, 366, 13, 51507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15757624308268228, "compression_ratio": 1.6367521367521367, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040571207050826e-12}, {"id": 353, "seek": 116260, "start": 1162.6, "end": 1167.48, "text": " But the author argues it goes much deeper than just preventing a physical riot.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 264, 3793, 38218, 309, 1709, 709, 7731, 813, 445, 19965, 257, 4001, 32211, 13, 50609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1724869814786044, "compression_ratio": 1.4113924050632911, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506538311703236e-12}, {"id": 354, "seek": 116260, "start": 1168.1399999999999, "end": 1171.12, "text": " It's about preserving the fundamental architecture of power.", "tokens": [50642, 467, 311, 466, 33173, 264, 8088, 9482, 295, 1347, 13, 50791], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1724869814786044, "compression_ratio": 1.4113924050632911, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506538311703236e-12}, {"id": 355, "seek": 116260, "start": 1171.52, "end": 1175.06, "text": " And this is where we get into the concept of teleological debt.", "tokens": [50811, 400, 341, 307, 689, 321, 483, 666, 264, 3410, 295, 4304, 4383, 7831, 13, 50988], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1724869814786044, "compression_ratio": 1.4113924050632911, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506538311703236e-12}, {"id": 356, "seek": 116260, "start": 1175.1799999999998, "end": 1176.12, "text": " That's a huge one.", "tokens": [50994, 663, 311, 257, 2603, 472, 13, 51041], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1724869814786044, "compression_ratio": 1.4113924050632911, "no_speech_prob": 1.9506538311703236e-12}, {"id": 357, "seek": 117612, "start": 1176.12, "end": 1180.9599999999998, "text": " Institutions like the government of the ship, the captain, the security forces, they operate", "tokens": [50365, 33897, 3666, 411, 264, 2463, 295, 264, 5374, 11, 264, 14871, 11, 264, 3825, 5874, 11, 436, 9651, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16596369239372935, "compression_ratio": 1.7440273037542662, "no_speech_prob": 1.3940893795263976e-12}, {"id": 358, "seek": 117612, "start": 1180.9599999999998, "end": 1185.12, "text": " by asking the passengers to suffer present burdens for a future payoff.", "tokens": [50607, 538, 3365, 264, 18436, 281, 9753, 1974, 37882, 337, 257, 2027, 46547, 13, 50815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16596369239372935, "compression_ratio": 1.7440273037542662, "no_speech_prob": 1.3940893795263976e-12}, {"id": 359, "seek": 117612, "start": 1185.5, "end": 1188.3799999999999, "text": " You live in a cramped four by four quarter.", "tokens": [50834, 509, 1621, 294, 257, 941, 36970, 1451, 538, 1451, 6555, 13, 50978], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16596369239372935, "compression_ratio": 1.7440273037542662, "no_speech_prob": 1.3940893795263976e-12}, {"id": 360, "seek": 117612, "start": 1188.8799999999999, "end": 1191.4599999999998, "text": " You eat synthetic algae paste instead of real food.", "tokens": [51003, 509, 1862, 23420, 32658, 9163, 2602, 295, 957, 1755, 13, 51132], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16596369239372935, "compression_ratio": 1.7440273037542662, "no_speech_prob": 1.3940893795263976e-12}, {"id": 361, "seek": 117612, "start": 1191.84, "end": 1195.1999999999998, "text": " You obey strict curfews and draconian resource rationing.", "tokens": [51151, 509, 19297, 10910, 1262, 69, 1023, 82, 293, 1224, 18181, 952, 7684, 24258, 278, 13, 51319], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16596369239372935, "compression_ratio": 1.7440273037542662, "no_speech_prob": 1.3940893795263976e-12}, {"id": 362, "seek": 117612, "start": 1195.2199999999998, "end": 1196.1, "text": " You just take it.", "tokens": [51320, 509, 445, 747, 309, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16596369239372935, "compression_ratio": 1.7440273037542662, "no_speech_prob": 1.3940893795263976e-12}, {"id": 363, "seek": 117612, "start": 1196.1, "end": 1201.4799999999998, "text": " You accept all of this indignity because it is the price of admission for arriving safely at Mars.", "tokens": [51364, 509, 3241, 439, 295, 341, 1016, 788, 507, 570, 309, 307, 264, 3218, 295, 24668, 337, 22436, 11750, 412, 9692, 13, 51633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16596369239372935, "compression_ratio": 1.7440273037542662, "no_speech_prob": 1.3940893795263976e-12}, {"id": 364, "seek": 117612, "start": 1201.9599999999998, "end": 1205.3799999999999, "text": " Mars is the collateral that makes the present suffering morally acceptable.", "tokens": [51657, 9692, 307, 264, 41875, 300, 1669, 264, 1974, 7755, 38622, 15513, 13, 51828], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16596369239372935, "compression_ratio": 1.7440273037542662, "no_speech_prob": 1.3940893795263976e-12}, {"id": 365, "seek": 120538, "start": 1205.38, "end": 1206.14, "text": " Oh, man.", "tokens": [50365, 876, 11, 587, 13, 50403], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16617635580209586, "compression_ratio": 1.6102941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 1.6817328779561436e-12}, {"id": 366, "seek": 120538, "start": 1206.24, "end": 1208.66, "text": " So the social contract is a promise about the future.", "tokens": [50408, 407, 264, 2093, 4364, 307, 257, 6228, 466, 264, 2027, 13, 50529], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16617635580209586, "compression_ratio": 1.6102941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 1.6817328779561436e-12}, {"id": 367, "seek": 120538, "start": 1208.9, "end": 1212.24, "text": " And when Mars vanishes, the contract is totally void.", "tokens": [50541, 400, 562, 9692, 3161, 16423, 11, 264, 4364, 307, 3879, 22009, 13, 50708], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16617635580209586, "compression_ratio": 1.6102941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 1.6817328779561436e-12}, {"id": 368, "seek": 120538, "start": 1212.44, "end": 1215.0800000000002, "text": " The institution is instantly, fundamentally bankrupt.", "tokens": [50718, 440, 7818, 307, 13518, 11, 17879, 21780, 13, 50850], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16617635580209586, "compression_ratio": 1.6102941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 1.6817328779561436e-12}, {"id": 369, "seek": 120538, "start": 1215.8000000000002, "end": 1218.8600000000001, "text": " If there is no destination, why should anyone obey the navigator?", "tokens": [50886, 759, 456, 307, 572, 12236, 11, 983, 820, 2878, 19297, 264, 7407, 1639, 30, 51039], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16617635580209586, "compression_ratio": 1.6102941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 1.6817328779561436e-12}, {"id": 370, "seek": 120538, "start": 1219.48, "end": 1224.38, "text": " The captain's power, his entire mandate to rule, is derived exclusively from his ability", "tokens": [51070, 440, 14871, 311, 1347, 11, 702, 2302, 23885, 281, 4978, 11, 307, 18949, 20638, 490, 702, 3485, 51315], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16617635580209586, "compression_ratio": 1.6102941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 1.6817328779561436e-12}, {"id": 371, "seek": 120538, "start": 1224.38, "end": 1225.7, "text": " to steer the ship to safety.", "tokens": [51315, 281, 30814, 264, 5374, 281, 4514, 13, 51381], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16617635580209586, "compression_ratio": 1.6102941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 1.6817328779561436e-12}, {"id": 372, "seek": 120538, "start": 1226.1000000000001, "end": 1230.5, "text": " If steering is physically impossible, his authority loses its entire justification.", "tokens": [51401, 759, 14823, 307, 9762, 6243, 11, 702, 8281, 18293, 1080, 2302, 31591, 13, 51621], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16617635580209586, "compression_ratio": 1.6102941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 1.6817328779561436e-12}, {"id": 373, "seek": 123050, "start": 1230.5, "end": 1235.96, "text": " The leaders delay the truth not just to protect the passengers from despair, but to protect", "tokens": [50365, 440, 3523, 8577, 264, 3494, 406, 445, 281, 2371, 264, 18436, 490, 25763, 11, 457, 281, 2371, 50638], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15017436301871523, "compression_ratio": 1.6161137440758293, "no_speech_prob": 1.728396614199268e-12}, {"id": 374, "seek": 123050, "start": 1235.96, "end": 1236.9, "text": " their own legitimacy.", "tokens": [50638, 641, 1065, 41339, 13, 50685], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15017436301871523, "compression_ratio": 1.6161137440758293, "no_speech_prob": 1.728396614199268e-12}, {"id": 375, "seek": 123050, "start": 1237.78, "end": 1242.66, "text": " The author notes that authority will often exert massive energy to preserve a representation", "tokens": [50729, 440, 3793, 5570, 300, 8281, 486, 2049, 31941, 5994, 2281, 281, 15665, 257, 10290, 50973], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15017436301871523, "compression_ratio": 1.6161137440758293, "no_speech_prob": 1.728396614199268e-12}, {"id": 376, "seek": 123050, "start": 1242.66, "end": 1247.7, "text": " of reality that the physical environment no longer supports, just to avoid giving up power.", "tokens": [50973, 295, 4103, 300, 264, 4001, 2823, 572, 2854, 9346, 11, 445, 281, 5042, 2902, 493, 1347, 13, 51225], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15017436301871523, "compression_ratio": 1.6161137440758293, "no_speech_prob": 1.728396614199268e-12}, {"id": 377, "seek": 123050, "start": 1247.94, "end": 1249.82, "text": " You see this in the real world constantly.", "tokens": [51237, 509, 536, 341, 294, 264, 957, 1002, 6460, 13, 51331], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15017436301871523, "compression_ratio": 1.6161137440758293, "no_speech_prob": 1.728396614199268e-12}, {"id": 378, "seek": 124982, "start": 1249.82, "end": 1253.28, "text": " Think about a massive corporation that is secretly going bankrupt.", "tokens": [50365, 6557, 466, 257, 5994, 22197, 300, 307, 22611, 516, 21780, 13, 50538], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1150575077861821, "compression_ratio": 1.6476868327402134, "no_speech_prob": 1.7417371798306158e-12}, {"id": 379, "seek": 124982, "start": 1254.1599999999999, "end": 1255.98, "text": " The CEO knows the math doesn't work.", "tokens": [50582, 440, 9282, 3255, 264, 5221, 1177, 380, 589, 13, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1150575077861821, "compression_ratio": 1.6476868327402134, "no_speech_prob": 1.7417371798306158e-12}, {"id": 380, "seek": 124982, "start": 1256.28, "end": 1260.8799999999999, "text": " The technical truth is that the company is dead, but they don't tell the lower-level employees.", "tokens": [50688, 440, 6191, 3494, 307, 300, 264, 2237, 307, 3116, 11, 457, 436, 500, 380, 980, 264, 3126, 12, 12418, 6619, 13, 50918], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1150575077861821, "compression_ratio": 1.6476868327402134, "no_speech_prob": 1.7417371798306158e-12}, {"id": 381, "seek": 124982, "start": 1261.54, "end": 1266.32, "text": " Middle management is still demanding quarterly reports, still doing performance reviews, still", "tokens": [50951, 10775, 4592, 307, 920, 19960, 38633, 7122, 11, 920, 884, 3389, 10229, 11, 920, 51190], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1150575077861821, "compression_ratio": 1.6476868327402134, "no_speech_prob": 1.7417371798306158e-12}, {"id": 382, "seek": 124982, "start": 1266.32, "end": 1269.24, "text": " enforcing dress codes, all while the ship is sinking.", "tokens": [51190, 25495, 2175, 5231, 14211, 11, 439, 1339, 264, 5374, 307, 28148, 13, 51336], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1150575077861821, "compression_ratio": 1.6476868327402134, "no_speech_prob": 1.7417371798306158e-12}, {"id": 383, "seek": 124982, "start": 1269.5, "end": 1269.9199999999998, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51349, 7587, 13, 51370], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1150575077861821, "compression_ratio": 1.6476868327402134, "no_speech_prob": 1.7417371798306158e-12}, {"id": 384, "seek": 124982, "start": 1270.06, "end": 1271.3799999999999, "text": " The illusion of normalcy.", "tokens": [51377, 440, 18854, 295, 2710, 1344, 13, 51443], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1150575077861821, "compression_ratio": 1.6476868327402134, "no_speech_prob": 1.7417371798306158e-12}, {"id": 385, "seek": 124982, "start": 1271.4399999999998, "end": 1275.3, "text": " They enforce the theater of a future to extract the last bits of present labor.", "tokens": [51446, 814, 24825, 264, 10612, 295, 257, 2027, 281, 8947, 264, 1036, 9239, 295, 1974, 5938, 13, 51639], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1150575077861821, "compression_ratio": 1.6476868327402134, "no_speech_prob": 1.7417371798306158e-12}, {"id": 386, "seek": 127530, "start": 1275.3, "end": 1280.3, "text": " It's incredibly cynical, but mathematically logical from the perspective of the power structure.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 6252, 46345, 11, 457, 44003, 14978, 490, 264, 4585, 295, 264, 1347, 3877, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 387, "seek": 127530, "start": 1280.84, "end": 1282.46, "text": " It is the exact same dynamic.", "tokens": [50642, 467, 307, 264, 1900, 912, 8546, 13, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 388, "seek": 127530, "start": 1282.98, "end": 1287.2, "text": " The captain of the Anyara has to pretend to navigate just to keep people from realizing", "tokens": [50749, 440, 14871, 295, 264, 2639, 2419, 575, 281, 11865, 281, 12350, 445, 281, 1066, 561, 490, 16734, 50960], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 389, "seek": 127530, "start": 1287.2, "end": 1288.86, "text": " navigation is a dead concept.", "tokens": [50960, 17346, 307, 257, 3116, 3410, 13, 51043], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 390, "seek": 127530, "start": 1289.18, "end": 1293.12, "text": " But as the monograph points out, epistemic delay has an expiration date.", "tokens": [51059, 583, 382, 264, 1108, 3108, 2793, 484, 11, 2388, 468, 3438, 8577, 575, 364, 39657, 4002, 13, 51256], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 391, "seek": 127530, "start": 1293.48, "end": 1294.52, "text": " You can't hide it forever.", "tokens": [51274, 509, 393, 380, 6479, 309, 5680, 13, 51326], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 392, "seek": 127530, "start": 1294.9199999999998, "end": 1295.1599999999999, "text": " No.", "tokens": [51346, 883, 13, 51358], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 393, "seek": 127530, "start": 1295.76, "end": 1297.48, "text": " Eventually, the truth bleeds out.", "tokens": [51388, 17586, 11, 264, 3494, 5408, 5147, 484, 13, 51474], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 394, "seek": 127530, "start": 1298.22, "end": 1300.1399999999999, "text": " Rumors spread from the engineering decks.", "tokens": [51511, 31963, 830, 3974, 490, 264, 7043, 32607, 13, 51607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 395, "seek": 127530, "start": 1300.72, "end": 1303.44, "text": " The stars out the window don't match the promised charts.", "tokens": [51636, 440, 6105, 484, 264, 4910, 500, 380, 2995, 264, 10768, 17767, 13, 51772], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15724113339283427, "compression_ratio": 1.6066666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.534159080497256e-12}, {"id": 396, "seek": 130344, "start": 1303.44, "end": 1309.4, "text": " The delay ends, the facade crumbles, and the existential truth finally sets in across the", "tokens": [50365, 440, 8577, 5314, 11, 264, 46261, 941, 12255, 11, 293, 264, 37133, 3494, 2721, 6352, 294, 2108, 264, 50663], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 397, "seek": 130344, "start": 1309.4, "end": 1309.96, "text": " population.", "tokens": [50663, 4415, 13, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 398, "seek": 130344, "start": 1310.74, "end": 1312.5, "text": " The shared horizon collapses.", "tokens": [50730, 440, 5507, 18046, 48765, 13, 50818], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 399, "seek": 130344, "start": 1313.06, "end": 1314.4, "text": " The runway is officially gone.", "tokens": [50846, 440, 26642, 307, 12053, 2780, 13, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 400, "seek": 130344, "start": 1314.98, "end": 1317.64, "text": " But here is the terrifying logistical reality.", "tokens": [50942, 583, 510, 307, 264, 18106, 3565, 42686, 4103, 13, 51075], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 401, "seek": 130344, "start": 1318.44, "end": 1323.44, "text": " Once the riots happen, once the panic subsides and the truth is fully absorbed, the thousands", "tokens": [51115, 3443, 264, 43802, 1051, 11, 1564, 264, 14783, 2090, 1875, 293, 264, 3494, 307, 4498, 20799, 11, 264, 5383, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 402, "seek": 130344, "start": 1323.44, "end": 1327.66, "text": " of passengers can't just sit in the corridors and stare at a blank metal wall for the rest", "tokens": [51365, 295, 18436, 393, 380, 445, 1394, 294, 264, 46920, 293, 22432, 412, 257, 8247, 5760, 2929, 337, 264, 1472, 51576], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 403, "seek": 130344, "start": 1327.66, "end": 1328.66, "text": " of their natural lives.", "tokens": [51576, 295, 641, 3303, 2909, 13, 51626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 404, "seek": 130344, "start": 1328.7, "end": 1329.52, "text": " They go insane.", "tokens": [51628, 814, 352, 10838, 13, 51669], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 405, "seek": 130344, "start": 1329.52, "end": 1332.78, "text": " The human brain cannot tolerate a vacuum of purpose.", "tokens": [51669, 440, 1952, 3567, 2644, 25773, 257, 14224, 295, 4334, 13, 51832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10911494594509319, "compression_ratio": 1.6564625850340136, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047107219419043e-12}, {"id": 406, "seek": 133344, "start": 1333.44, "end": 1337.8600000000001, "text": " They have to redirect that massive amount of physical and psychological energy somewhere.", "tokens": [50365, 814, 362, 281, 29066, 300, 5994, 2372, 295, 4001, 293, 14346, 2281, 4079, 13, 50586], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10949701070785522, "compression_ratio": 1.6626506024096386, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251290898590786e-12}, {"id": 407, "seek": 133344, "start": 1338.3, "end": 1342.26, "text": " Which brings us to the sociological phenomena the author calls the inward turn.", "tokens": [50608, 3013, 5607, 505, 281, 264, 3075, 4383, 22004, 264, 3793, 5498, 264, 29876, 1261, 13, 50806], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10949701070785522, "compression_ratio": 1.6626506024096386, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251290898590786e-12}, {"id": 408, "seek": 133344, "start": 1343.24, "end": 1348.6200000000001, "text": " When the macro goal, the grand project of arriving at Mars, completely disappears, the micro goals", "tokens": [50855, 1133, 264, 18887, 3387, 11, 264, 2697, 1716, 295, 22436, 412, 9692, 11, 2584, 25527, 11, 264, 4532, 5493, 51124], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10949701070785522, "compression_ratio": 1.6626506024096386, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251290898590786e-12}, {"id": 409, "seek": 133344, "start": 1348.6200000000001, "end": 1350.8600000000001, "text": " violently inflate to fill the vacuum.", "tokens": [51124, 46728, 9922, 473, 281, 2836, 264, 14224, 13, 51236], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10949701070785522, "compression_ratio": 1.6626506024096386, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251290898590786e-12}, {"id": 410, "seek": 133344, "start": 1351.0, "end": 1354.5, "text": " Because you still need a reason to get out of bed in the morning, even if the bed is floating", "tokens": [51243, 1436, 291, 920, 643, 257, 1778, 281, 483, 484, 295, 2901, 294, 264, 2446, 11, 754, 498, 264, 2901, 307, 12607, 51418], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10949701070785522, "compression_ratio": 1.6626506024096386, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251290898590786e-12}, {"id": 411, "seek": 133344, "start": 1354.5, "end": 1355.14, "text": " in the abyss.", "tokens": [51418, 294, 264, 410, 31059, 13, 51450], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10949701070785522, "compression_ratio": 1.6626506024096386, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251290898590786e-12}, {"id": 412, "seek": 135514, "start": 1355.14, "end": 1355.8200000000002, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23518559704088185, "compression_ratio": 1.4950980392156863, "no_speech_prob": 1.890632398901526e-12}, {"id": 413, "seek": 135514, "start": 1356.64, "end": 1359.6000000000001, "text": " You have this massive contraction of the reachability field.", "tokens": [50440, 509, 362, 341, 5994, 37372, 295, 264, 2524, 2310, 2519, 13, 50588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23518559704088185, "compression_ratio": 1.4950980392156863, "no_speech_prob": 1.890632398901526e-12}, {"id": 414, "seek": 135514, "start": 1360.3200000000002, "end": 1364.72, "text": " The horizon shrinks from millions of miles to the few hundred yards of the ship's interior.", "tokens": [50624, 440, 18046, 9884, 16431, 490, 6803, 295, 6193, 281, 264, 1326, 3262, 18685, 295, 264, 5374, 311, 10636, 13, 50844], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23518559704088185, "compression_ratio": 1.4950980392156863, "no_speech_prob": 1.890632398901526e-12}, {"id": 415, "seek": 135514, "start": 1365.0, "end": 1366.18, "text": " It becomes claustrophobic.", "tokens": [50858, 467, 3643, 3583, 381, 11741, 22234, 13, 50917], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23518559704088185, "compression_ratio": 1.4950980392156863, "no_speech_prob": 1.890632398901526e-12}, {"id": 416, "seek": 135514, "start": 1366.3400000000001, "end": 1371.4, "text": " And the author points out that this spatial and temporal collapse causes a total radical", "tokens": [50925, 400, 264, 3793, 2793, 484, 300, 341, 23598, 293, 30881, 15584, 7700, 257, 3217, 12001, 51178], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23518559704088185, "compression_ratio": 1.4950980392156863, "no_speech_prob": 1.890632398901526e-12}, {"id": 417, "seek": 135514, "start": 1371.4, "end": 1372.9, "text": " redistribution of scarcity.", "tokens": [51178, 36198, 30783, 295, 44181, 13, 51253], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23518559704088185, "compression_ratio": 1.4950980392156863, "no_speech_prob": 1.890632398901526e-12}, {"id": 418, "seek": 137290, "start": 1372.9, "end": 1378.64, "text": " Before the accident, physical resources and currency mattered because they could be converted into", "tokens": [50365, 4546, 264, 6398, 11, 4001, 3593, 293, 13346, 44282, 570, 436, 727, 312, 16424, 666, 50652], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21971346407520528, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.8759199922613323e-12}, {"id": 419, "seek": 137290, "start": 1378.64, "end": 1380.0600000000002, "text": " a better future on Mars.", "tokens": [50652, 257, 1101, 2027, 322, 9692, 13, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21971346407520528, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.8759199922613323e-12}, {"id": 420, "seek": 137290, "start": 1380.72, "end": 1383.96, "text": " You save your credits to buy a bigger plot of land when you land.", "tokens": [50756, 509, 3155, 428, 16816, 281, 2256, 257, 3801, 7542, 295, 2117, 562, 291, 2117, 13, 50918], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21971346407520528, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.8759199922613323e-12}, {"id": 421, "seek": 137290, "start": 1384.14, "end": 1384.68, "text": " Makes sense.", "tokens": [50927, 25245, 2020, 13, 50954], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21971346407520528, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 1.8759199922613323e-12}, {"id": 422, "seek": 138468, "start": 1384.68, "end": 1392.3200000000002, "text": " But when no one can buy a ticket home, when landing is impossible, material wealth loses its convertibility.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 562, 572, 472, 393, 2256, 257, 10550, 1280, 11, 562, 11202, 307, 6243, 11, 2527, 7203, 18293, 1080, 7620, 2841, 13, 50747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11454570994657629, "compression_ratio": 1.617117117117117, "no_speech_prob": 1.55534775597016e-12}, {"id": 423, "seek": 138468, "start": 1392.76, "end": 1394.52, "text": " It becomes functionally meaningless.", "tokens": [50769, 467, 3643, 2445, 379, 33232, 13, 50857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11454570994657629, "compression_ratio": 1.617117117117117, "no_speech_prob": 1.55534775597016e-12}, {"id": 424, "seek": 138468, "start": 1394.98, "end": 1399.04, "text": " You can have all the digital credits in the ship's mainframe, but you're still stuck in", "tokens": [50880, 509, 393, 362, 439, 264, 4562, 16816, 294, 264, 5374, 311, 2135, 17265, 11, 457, 291, 434, 920, 5541, 294, 51083], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11454570994657629, "compression_ratio": 1.617117117117117, "no_speech_prob": 1.55534775597016e-12}, {"id": 425, "seek": 138468, "start": 1399.04, "end": 1404.8400000000001, "text": " the exact same metal tube, breathing the exact same recycled air, eating the exact same paste", "tokens": [51083, 264, 1900, 912, 5760, 9917, 11, 9570, 264, 1900, 912, 30674, 1988, 11, 3936, 264, 1900, 912, 9163, 51373], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11454570994657629, "compression_ratio": 1.617117117117117, "no_speech_prob": 1.55534775597016e-12}, {"id": 426, "seek": 138468, "start": 1404.8400000000001, "end": 1406.28, "text": " as the poorest person on board.", "tokens": [51373, 382, 264, 44925, 954, 322, 3150, 13, 51445], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11454570994657629, "compression_ratio": 1.617117117117117, "no_speech_prob": 1.55534775597016e-12}, {"id": 427, "seek": 140628, "start": 1406.28, "end": 1411.78, "text": " Now, I look at that setup, and my instinct is to think, doesn't a disaster like this act", "tokens": [50365, 823, 11, 286, 574, 412, 300, 8657, 11, 293, 452, 16556, 307, 281, 519, 11, 1177, 380, 257, 11293, 411, 341, 605, 50640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12934418728477076, "compression_ratio": 1.5865724381625441, "no_speech_prob": 1.839804350534102e-12}, {"id": 428, "seek": 140628, "start": 1411.78, "end": 1413.5, "text": " as the ultimate social equalizer?", "tokens": [50640, 382, 264, 9705, 2093, 2681, 6545, 30, 50726], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12934418728477076, "compression_ratio": 1.5865724381625441, "no_speech_prob": 1.839804350534102e-12}, {"id": 429, "seek": 140628, "start": 1413.94, "end": 1415.3999999999999, "text": " You're all literally in the same boat.", "tokens": [50748, 509, 434, 439, 3736, 294, 264, 912, 6582, 13, 50821], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12934418728477076, "compression_ratio": 1.5865724381625441, "no_speech_prob": 1.839804350534102e-12}, {"id": 430, "seek": 140628, "start": 1416.18, "end": 1420.94, "text": " If money doesn't matter, and the future is canceled, doesn't hierarchy just naturally", "tokens": [50860, 759, 1460, 1177, 380, 1871, 11, 293, 264, 2027, 307, 24839, 11, 1177, 380, 22333, 445, 8195, 51098], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12934418728477076, "compression_ratio": 1.5865724381625441, "no_speech_prob": 1.839804350534102e-12}, {"id": 431, "seek": 140628, "start": 1420.94, "end": 1423.78, "text": " collapse into a sort of egalitarian survival commune?", "tokens": [51098, 15584, 666, 257, 1333, 295, 31528, 13707, 12559, 1199, 68, 30, 51240], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12934418728477076, "compression_ratio": 1.5865724381625441, "no_speech_prob": 1.839804350534102e-12}, {"id": 432, "seek": 140628, "start": 1424.0, "end": 1429.8799999999999, "text": " It's a very logical, perhaps hopeful assumption, but the text explicitly and forcefully counters", "tokens": [51251, 467, 311, 257, 588, 14978, 11, 4317, 20531, 15302, 11, 457, 264, 2487, 20803, 293, 3464, 2277, 39338, 51545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12934418728477076, "compression_ratio": 1.5865724381625441, "no_speech_prob": 1.839804350534102e-12}, {"id": 433, "seek": 140628, "start": 1429.8799999999999, "end": 1430.28, "text": " this.", "tokens": [51545, 341, 13, 51565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12934418728477076, "compression_ratio": 1.5865724381625441, "no_speech_prob": 1.839804350534102e-12}, {"id": 434, "seek": 140628, "start": 1430.98, "end": 1433.52, "text": " Catastrophe does not abolish stratification.", "tokens": [51600, 9565, 525, 27194, 775, 406, 23183, 742, 23674, 3774, 13, 51727], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12934418728477076, "compression_ratio": 1.5865724381625441, "no_speech_prob": 1.839804350534102e-12}, {"id": 435, "seek": 143352, "start": 1433.52, "end": 1436.6, "text": " It merely mutates what stratification can buy.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 17003, 5839, 1024, 437, 23674, 3774, 393, 2256, 13, 50519], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 436, "seek": 143352, "start": 1436.94, "end": 1437.28, "text": " Oh, wow.", "tokens": [50536, 876, 11, 6076, 13, 50553], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 437, "seek": 143352, "start": 1437.62, "end": 1442.08, "text": " The author argues that social distinctions actually become hyper-important precisely because", "tokens": [50570, 440, 3793, 38218, 300, 2093, 1483, 49798, 767, 1813, 9848, 12, 41654, 13402, 570, 50793], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 438, "seek": 143352, "start": 1442.08, "end": 1445.1, "text": " environmental novelty has dropped to absolute zero.", "tokens": [50793, 8303, 44805, 575, 8119, 281, 8236, 4018, 13, 50944], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 439, "seek": 143352, "start": 1446.02, "end": 1450.06, "text": " Outside the hull of the ship is an unchanging, infinite, lethal void.", "tokens": [50990, 28218, 264, 32335, 295, 264, 5374, 307, 364, 517, 27123, 11, 13785, 11, 34562, 22009, 13, 51192], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 440, "seek": 143352, "start": 1450.72, "end": 1454.86, "text": " Inside the ship is a highly constrained, repetitive, unchanging architecture.", "tokens": [51225, 15123, 264, 5374, 307, 257, 5405, 38901, 11, 29404, 11, 517, 27123, 9482, 13, 51432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 441, "seek": 143352, "start": 1455.16, "end": 1457.24, "text": " Everything is gray metal and fluorescent light.", "tokens": [51447, 5471, 307, 10855, 5760, 293, 46735, 1442, 13, 51551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 442, "seek": 143352, "start": 1457.3, "end": 1458.16, "text": " Just totally sterile.", "tokens": [51554, 1449, 3879, 18924, 794, 13, 51597], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 443, "seek": 143352, "start": 1458.32, "end": 1459.8, "text": " So where do people find variation?", "tokens": [51605, 407, 689, 360, 561, 915, 12990, 30, 51679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 444, "seek": 143352, "start": 1460.0, "end": 1462.2, "text": " Where do they find status when they can't buy property?", "tokens": [51689, 2305, 360, 436, 915, 6558, 562, 436, 393, 380, 2256, 4707, 30, 51799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 445, "seek": 143352, "start": 1462.2, "end": 1463.5, "text": " They find it in each other.", "tokens": [51799, 814, 915, 309, 294, 1184, 661, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11463673412799835, "compression_ratio": 1.6126126126126126, "no_speech_prob": 1.7760764647184457e-12}, {"id": 446, "seek": 146352, "start": 1463.96, "end": 1466.28, "text": " The social drama becomes the only landscape left.", "tokens": [50387, 440, 2093, 9412, 3643, 264, 787, 9661, 1411, 13, 50503], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1401838575090681, "compression_ratio": 1.5539568345323742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901831276048719e-12}, {"id": 447, "seek": 146352, "start": 1466.4, "end": 1466.68, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50509, 1079, 13, 50523], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1401838575090681, "compression_ratio": 1.5539568345323742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901831276048719e-12}, {"id": 448, "seek": 146352, "start": 1467.26, "end": 1468.24, "text": " Scarcity migrates.", "tokens": [50552, 23181, 26536, 6186, 12507, 13, 50601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1401838575090681, "compression_ratio": 1.5539568345323742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901831276048719e-12}, {"id": 449, "seek": 146352, "start": 1468.52, "end": 1472.5, "text": " It migrates away from material wealth and attaches itself to intangible things.", "tokens": [50615, 467, 6186, 12507, 1314, 490, 2527, 7203, 293, 49404, 2564, 281, 560, 656, 964, 721, 13, 50814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1401838575090681, "compression_ratio": 1.5539568345323742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901831276048719e-12}, {"id": 450, "seek": 146352, "start": 1472.9, "end": 1478.02, "text": " Access to restricted information, an extra square meter of private space, psychological relief,", "tokens": [50834, 17166, 281, 20608, 1589, 11, 364, 2857, 3732, 9255, 295, 4551, 1901, 11, 14346, 10915, 11, 51090], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1401838575090681, "compression_ratio": 1.5539568345323742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901831276048719e-12}, {"id": 451, "seek": 146352, "start": 1478.48, "end": 1481.46, "text": " intimacy, and most importantly, proximity to power.", "tokens": [51113, 34450, 11, 293, 881, 8906, 11, 27632, 281, 1347, 13, 51262], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1401838575090681, "compression_ratio": 1.5539568345323742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901831276048719e-12}, {"id": 452, "seek": 146352, "start": 1481.68, "end": 1482.96, "text": " Like who knows the captain?", "tokens": [51273, 1743, 567, 3255, 264, 14871, 30, 51337], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1401838575090681, "compression_ratio": 1.5539568345323742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901831276048719e-12}, {"id": 453, "seek": 146352, "start": 1483.36, "end": 1483.6399999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51357, 1779, 13, 51371], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1401838575090681, "compression_ratio": 1.5539568345323742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901831276048719e-12}, {"id": 454, "seek": 146352, "start": 1484.1, "end": 1489.3799999999999, "text": " Being allowed into the command center or becoming a high priest in one of the bizarre new cults", "tokens": [51394, 8891, 4350, 666, 264, 5622, 3056, 420, 5617, 257, 1090, 15703, 294, 472, 295, 264, 18265, 777, 2376, 82, 51658], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1401838575090681, "compression_ratio": 1.5539568345323742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7901831276048719e-12}, {"id": 455, "seek": 148938, "start": 1489.38, "end": 1491.92, "text": " that form on the ship, that becomes the new currency.", "tokens": [50365, 300, 1254, 322, 264, 5374, 11, 300, 3643, 264, 777, 13346, 13, 50492], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17371838991759253, "compression_ratio": 1.5614973262032086, "no_speech_prob": 2.231710259301134e-12}, {"id": 456, "seek": 148938, "start": 1492.14, "end": 1497.6200000000001, "text": " The society starts producing internally the chaotic variation that the external environment", "tokens": [50503, 440, 4086, 3719, 10501, 19501, 264, 27013, 12990, 300, 264, 8320, 2823, 50777], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17371838991759253, "compression_ratio": 1.5614973262032086, "no_speech_prob": 2.231710259301134e-12}, {"id": 457, "seek": 148938, "start": 1497.6200000000001, "end": 1498.72, "text": " no longer supplies.", "tokens": [50777, 572, 2854, 11768, 13, 50832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17371838991759253, "compression_ratio": 1.5614973262032086, "no_speech_prob": 2.231710259301134e-12}, {"id": 458, "seek": 148938, "start": 1499.48, "end": 1504.38, "text": " People become utterly vicious over microscopic social slights because that social standing", "tokens": [50870, 3432, 1813, 30251, 30093, 670, 47897, 2093, 4036, 82, 570, 300, 2093, 4877, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17371838991759253, "compression_ratio": 1.5614973262032086, "no_speech_prob": 2.231710259301134e-12}, {"id": 459, "seek": 148938, "start": 1504.38, "end": 1506.3200000000002, "text": " is the only reality they have left.", "tokens": [51115, 307, 264, 787, 4103, 436, 362, 1411, 13, 51212], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17371838991759253, "compression_ratio": 1.5614973262032086, "no_speech_prob": 2.231710259301134e-12}, {"id": 460, "seek": 150632, "start": 1506.32, "end": 1511.46, "text": " There's a specific image from the text that I absolutely love, and it perfectly encapsulates", "tokens": [50365, 821, 311, 257, 2685, 3256, 490, 264, 2487, 300, 286, 3122, 959, 11, 293, 309, 6239, 38745, 26192, 50622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16666241411892874, "compression_ratio": 1.3428571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.6815761023220022e-12}, {"id": 461, "seek": 150632, "start": 1511.46, "end": 1512.6, "text": " this inward turn.", "tokens": [50622, 341, 29876, 1261, 13, 50679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16666241411892874, "compression_ratio": 1.3428571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.6815761023220022e-12}, {"id": 462, "seek": 150632, "start": 1512.76, "end": 1514.82, "text": " It's the metaphor of the mirror at the window.", "tokens": [50687, 467, 311, 264, 19157, 295, 264, 8013, 412, 264, 4910, 13, 50790], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16666241411892874, "compression_ratio": 1.3428571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.6815761023220022e-12}, {"id": 463, "seek": 150632, "start": 1515.08, "end": 1517.34, "text": " Oh, that part is so evocative.", "tokens": [50803, 876, 11, 300, 644, 307, 370, 1073, 905, 1166, 13, 50916], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16666241411892874, "compression_ratio": 1.3428571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.6815761023220022e-12}, {"id": 464, "seek": 151734, "start": 1517.34, "end": 1521.82, "text": " The author writes that normally when you look out the window of a moving vehicle like a", "tokens": [50365, 440, 3793, 13657, 300, 5646, 562, 291, 574, 484, 264, 4910, 295, 257, 2684, 5864, 411, 257, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11228561401367188, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776682481787429e-12}, {"id": 465, "seek": 151734, "start": 1521.82, "end": 1524.34, "text": " train or a car, you see changing landscapes.", "tokens": [50589, 3847, 420, 257, 1032, 11, 291, 536, 4473, 29822, 13, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11228561401367188, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776682481787429e-12}, {"id": 466, "seek": 151734, "start": 1524.9399999999998, "end": 1527.98, "text": " Trees go by, mountains appear, cities rise and fall.", "tokens": [50745, 314, 4856, 352, 538, 11, 10233, 4204, 11, 6486, 6272, 293, 2100, 13, 50897], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11228561401367188, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776682481787429e-12}, {"id": 467, "seek": 151734, "start": 1528.58, "end": 1532.9199999999998, "text": " The window gives you constant information from the external environment, and it confirms", "tokens": [50927, 440, 4910, 2709, 291, 5754, 1589, 490, 264, 8320, 2823, 11, 293, 309, 39982, 51144], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11228561401367188, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776682481787429e-12}, {"id": 468, "seek": 151734, "start": 1532.9199999999998, "end": 1534.1599999999999, "text": " that you are making progress.", "tokens": [51144, 300, 291, 366, 1455, 4205, 13, 51206], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11228561401367188, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776682481787429e-12}, {"id": 469, "seek": 151734, "start": 1534.28, "end": 1534.3799999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51212, 1779, 13, 51217], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11228561401367188, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776682481787429e-12}, {"id": 470, "seek": 151734, "start": 1534.4599999999998, "end": 1535.22, "text": " It proves you're moving.", "tokens": [51221, 467, 25019, 291, 434, 2684, 13, 51259], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11228561401367188, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776682481787429e-12}, {"id": 471, "seek": 153522, "start": 1535.22, "end": 1540.52, "text": " But in deep space, looking out the window just gives you an unchanging, pitch-black void.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 294, 2452, 1901, 11, 1237, 484, 264, 4910, 445, 2709, 291, 364, 517, 27123, 11, 7293, 12, 36141, 22009, 13, 50630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1251363193287569, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.8255421046359244e-12}, {"id": 472, "seek": 153522, "start": 1540.74, "end": 1543.1200000000001, "text": " The stars are so far away, they don't even appear to move.", "tokens": [50641, 440, 6105, 366, 370, 1400, 1314, 11, 436, 500, 380, 754, 4204, 281, 1286, 13, 50760], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1251363193287569, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.8255421046359244e-12}, {"id": 473, "seek": 153522, "start": 1543.56, "end": 1547.34, "text": " So eventually, after months of staring into the black, you stop trying to look out the", "tokens": [50782, 407, 4728, 11, 934, 2493, 295, 18043, 666, 264, 2211, 11, 291, 1590, 1382, 281, 574, 484, 264, 50971], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1251363193287569, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.8255421046359244e-12}, {"id": 474, "seek": 153522, "start": 1547.34, "end": 1547.56, "text": " window.", "tokens": [50971, 4910, 13, 50982], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1251363193287569, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.8255421046359244e-12}, {"id": 475, "seek": 153522, "start": 1547.9, "end": 1552.8, "text": " You shift your focus entirely to the reflection on the glass, and you only see yourself and", "tokens": [50999, 509, 5513, 428, 1879, 7696, 281, 264, 12914, 322, 264, 4276, 11, 293, 291, 787, 536, 1803, 293, 51244], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1251363193287569, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.8255421046359244e-12}, {"id": 476, "seek": 153522, "start": 1552.8, "end": 1554.1000000000001, "text": " the interior of the cabin.", "tokens": [51244, 264, 10636, 295, 264, 9401, 13, 51309], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1251363193287569, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.8255421046359244e-12}, {"id": 477, "seek": 153522, "start": 1554.1000000000001, "end": 1560.08, "text": " It is a stunningly bleak and perfectly accurate metaphor for what the author calls epistemic", "tokens": [51309, 467, 307, 257, 18550, 356, 5408, 514, 293, 6239, 8559, 19157, 337, 437, 264, 3793, 5498, 2388, 468, 3438, 51608], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1251363193287569, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.8255421046359244e-12}, {"id": 478, "seek": 153522, "start": 1560.08, "end": 1560.56, "text": " closure.", "tokens": [51608, 24653, 13, 51632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1251363193287569, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.8255421046359244e-12}, {"id": 479, "seek": 156056, "start": 1560.56, "end": 1566.72, "text": " Because there is no external feedback that matters anymore, no changing landscape to respond", "tokens": [50365, 1436, 456, 307, 572, 8320, 5824, 300, 7001, 3602, 11, 572, 4473, 9661, 281, 4196, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10920458294096447, "compression_ratio": 1.6323024054982818, "no_speech_prob": 1.4726195523423469e-12}, {"id": 480, "seek": 156056, "start": 1566.72, "end": 1572.6, "text": " to, no new data entering the system, society literally folds inward and starts feeding on", "tokens": [50673, 281, 11, 572, 777, 1412, 11104, 264, 1185, 11, 4086, 3736, 31341, 29876, 293, 3719, 12919, 322, 50967], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10920458294096447, "compression_ratio": 1.6323024054982818, "no_speech_prob": 1.4726195523423469e-12}, {"id": 481, "seek": 156056, "start": 1572.6, "end": 1572.98, "text": " itself.", "tokens": [50967, 2564, 13, 50986], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10920458294096447, "compression_ratio": 1.6323024054982818, "no_speech_prob": 1.4726195523423469e-12}, {"id": 482, "seek": 156056, "start": 1573.28, "end": 1573.98, "text": " Just a closed loop.", "tokens": [51001, 1449, 257, 5395, 6367, 13, 51036], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10920458294096447, "compression_ratio": 1.6323024054982818, "no_speech_prob": 1.4726195523423469e-12}, {"id": 483, "seek": 156056, "start": 1574.1599999999999, "end": 1574.58, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51045, 7587, 13, 51066], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10920458294096447, "compression_ratio": 1.6323024054982818, "no_speech_prob": 1.4726195523423469e-12}, {"id": 484, "seek": 156056, "start": 1575.22, "end": 1577.6399999999999, "text": " Institutions begin to only observe other institutions.", "tokens": [51098, 33897, 3666, 1841, 281, 787, 11441, 661, 8142, 13, 51219], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10920458294096447, "compression_ratio": 1.6323024054982818, "no_speech_prob": 1.4726195523423469e-12}, {"id": 485, "seek": 156056, "start": 1578.34, "end": 1581.02, "text": " A ritual is performed simply to validate another ritual.", "tokens": [51254, 316, 13792, 307, 10332, 2935, 281, 29562, 1071, 13792, 13, 51388], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10920458294096447, "compression_ratio": 1.6323024054982818, "no_speech_prob": 1.4726195523423469e-12}, {"id": 486, "seek": 156056, "start": 1581.5, "end": 1586.84, "text": " You get a massive exponential increase in internal information and administrative busyness, but none", "tokens": [51412, 509, 483, 257, 5994, 21510, 3488, 294, 6920, 1589, 293, 17900, 5856, 1287, 11, 457, 6022, 51679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10920458294096447, "compression_ratio": 1.6323024054982818, "no_speech_prob": 1.4726195523423469e-12}, {"id": 487, "seek": 156056, "start": 1586.84, "end": 1588.54, "text": " of it connects to moving the ship forward.", "tokens": [51679, 295, 309, 16967, 281, 2684, 264, 5374, 2128, 13, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10920458294096447, "compression_ratio": 1.6323024054982818, "no_speech_prob": 1.4726195523423469e-12}, {"id": 488, "seek": 158854, "start": 1588.54, "end": 1594.44, "text": " It's just thousands of people frantically managing committees, generating internal reports, forming", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 445, 5383, 295, 561, 431, 49505, 11642, 25998, 11, 17746, 6920, 7122, 11, 15745, 50660], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1085772467131662, "compression_ratio": 1.6084142394822007, "no_speech_prob": 1.598310025996419e-12}, {"id": 489, "seek": 158854, "start": 1594.44, "end": 1599.0, "text": " elaborate social cliques, and organizing complex, meaningless ceremonies.", "tokens": [50660, 20945, 2093, 596, 4911, 11, 293, 17608, 3997, 11, 33232, 36176, 13, 50888], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1085772467131662, "compression_ratio": 1.6084142394822007, "no_speech_prob": 1.598310025996419e-12}, {"id": 490, "seek": 158854, "start": 1599.6599999999999, "end": 1602.6599999999999, "text": " It is the definition of velocity without progress.", "tokens": [50921, 467, 307, 264, 7123, 295, 9269, 1553, 4205, 13, 51071], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1085772467131662, "compression_ratio": 1.6084142394822007, "no_speech_prob": 1.598310025996419e-12}, {"id": 491, "seek": 158854, "start": 1603.06, "end": 1607.8, "text": " They are moving incredibly fast, generating massive amounts of social friction, but getting", "tokens": [51091, 814, 366, 2684, 6252, 2370, 11, 17746, 5994, 11663, 295, 2093, 17710, 11, 457, 1242, 51328], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1085772467131662, "compression_ratio": 1.6084142394822007, "no_speech_prob": 1.598310025996419e-12}, {"id": 492, "seek": 158854, "start": 1607.8, "end": 1609.04, "text": " absolutely nowhere.", "tokens": [51328, 3122, 11159, 13, 51390], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1085772467131662, "compression_ratio": 1.6084142394822007, "no_speech_prob": 1.598310025996419e-12}, {"id": 493, "seek": 158854, "start": 1609.36, "end": 1613.3799999999999, "text": " And we see this exact phenomenon in modern institutions all the time.", "tokens": [51406, 400, 321, 536, 341, 1900, 14029, 294, 4363, 8142, 439, 264, 565, 13, 51607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1085772467131662, "compression_ratio": 1.6084142394822007, "no_speech_prob": 1.598310025996419e-12}, {"id": 494, "seek": 158854, "start": 1613.74, "end": 1618.44, "text": " Think of a bloated bureaucracy or an aging corporation that has lost its market dominance.", "tokens": [51625, 6557, 295, 257, 1749, 770, 44671, 420, 364, 19090, 22197, 300, 575, 2731, 1080, 2142, 34987, 13, 51860], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1085772467131662, "compression_ratio": 1.6084142394822007, "no_speech_prob": 1.598310025996419e-12}, {"id": 495, "seek": 161844, "start": 1618.44, "end": 1624.66, "text": " When an organization can no longer innovate or impact the external world, what does it do?", "tokens": [50365, 1133, 364, 4475, 393, 572, 2854, 33444, 420, 2712, 264, 8320, 1002, 11, 437, 775, 309, 360, 30, 50676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17283626871371488, "compression_ratio": 1.6044776119402986, "no_speech_prob": 3.848918579685279e-12}, {"id": 496, "seek": 161844, "start": 1625.06, "end": 1625.76, "text": " It turns inward.", "tokens": [50696, 467, 4523, 29876, 13, 50731], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17283626871371488, "compression_ratio": 1.6044776119402986, "no_speech_prob": 3.848918579685279e-12}, {"id": 497, "seek": 161844, "start": 1626.22, "end": 1632.3600000000001, "text": " It creates endless internal performance reviews, multilayered approval processes, and interdepartmental", "tokens": [50754, 467, 7829, 16144, 6920, 3389, 10229, 11, 2120, 388, 320, 4073, 13317, 7555, 11, 293, 728, 19929, 3033, 304, 51061], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17283626871371488, "compression_ratio": 1.6044776119402986, "no_speech_prob": 3.848918579685279e-12}, {"id": 498, "seek": 161844, "start": 1632.3600000000001, "end": 1632.8600000000001, "text": " politics.", "tokens": [51061, 7341, 13, 51086], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17283626871371488, "compression_ratio": 1.6044776119402986, "no_speech_prob": 3.848918579685279e-12}, {"id": 499, "seek": 161844, "start": 1632.94, "end": 1633.9, "text": " It invents work to do.", "tokens": [51090, 467, 1048, 791, 589, 281, 360, 13, 51138], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17283626871371488, "compression_ratio": 1.6044776119402986, "no_speech_prob": 3.848918579685279e-12}, {"id": 500, "seek": 161844, "start": 1634.0800000000002, "end": 1634.3600000000001, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51147, 1079, 13, 51161], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17283626871371488, "compression_ratio": 1.6044776119402986, "no_speech_prob": 3.848918579685279e-12}, {"id": 501, "seek": 161844, "start": 1634.68, "end": 1637.14, "text": " The busyness is a psychological defense mechanism.", "tokens": [51177, 440, 5856, 1287, 307, 257, 14346, 7654, 7513, 13, 51300], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17283626871371488, "compression_ratio": 1.6044776119402986, "no_speech_prob": 3.848918579685279e-12}, {"id": 502, "seek": 161844, "start": 1637.44, "end": 1638.92, "text": " It creates the illusion of momentum.", "tokens": [51315, 467, 7829, 264, 18854, 295, 11244, 13, 51389], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17283626871371488, "compression_ratio": 1.6044776119402986, "no_speech_prob": 3.848918579685279e-12}, {"id": 503, "seek": 161844, "start": 1639.38, "end": 1643.94, "text": " The epistemic closure aboard the Aniara is a way for the human mind to generate meaning when", "tokens": [51412, 440, 2388, 468, 3438, 24653, 27488, 264, 1107, 72, 2419, 307, 257, 636, 337, 264, 1952, 1575, 281, 8460, 3620, 562, 51640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17283626871371488, "compression_ratio": 1.6044776119402986, "no_speech_prob": 3.848918579685279e-12}, {"id": 504, "seek": 164394, "start": 1643.94, "end": 1645.88, "text": " the grand structural meaning is gone.", "tokens": [50365, 264, 2697, 15067, 3620, 307, 2780, 13, 50462], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1449656387170156, "compression_ratio": 1.5884773662551441, "no_speech_prob": 2.253947029018377e-12}, {"id": 505, "seek": 164394, "start": 1645.96, "end": 1651.06, "text": " But if you are tracked in this inward-looking mirror, if you are staring at yourselves in", "tokens": [50466, 583, 498, 291, 366, 31703, 294, 341, 29876, 12, 16129, 8013, 11, 498, 291, 366, 18043, 412, 14791, 294, 50721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1449656387170156, "compression_ratio": 1.5884773662551441, "no_speech_prob": 2.253947029018377e-12}, {"id": 506, "seek": 164394, "start": 1651.06, "end": 1657.44, "text": " this sterile metal tube for decades, you have to find a way to make that reflection bearable.", "tokens": [50721, 341, 18924, 794, 5760, 9917, 337, 7878, 11, 291, 362, 281, 915, 257, 636, 281, 652, 300, 12914, 6155, 712, 13, 51040], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1449656387170156, "compression_ratio": 1.5884773662551441, "no_speech_prob": 2.253947029018377e-12}, {"id": 507, "seek": 164394, "start": 1658.8600000000001, "end": 1662.8, "text": " The human psyche is too fragile to stare into the abyss unblinking.", "tokens": [51111, 440, 1952, 50223, 307, 886, 23847, 281, 22432, 666, 264, 410, 31059, 517, 5199, 12408, 13, 51308], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1449656387170156, "compression_ratio": 1.5884773662551441, "no_speech_prob": 2.253947029018377e-12}, {"id": 508, "seek": 164394, "start": 1663.1200000000001, "end": 1663.96, "text": " It really is.", "tokens": [51324, 467, 534, 307, 13, 51366], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1449656387170156, "compression_ratio": 1.5884773662551441, "no_speech_prob": 2.253947029018377e-12}, {"id": 509, "seek": 164394, "start": 1664.3, "end": 1668.48, "text": " And that desperate need for psychological armor leads us to the concept of repair.", "tokens": [51383, 400, 300, 17601, 643, 337, 14346, 13124, 6689, 505, 281, 264, 3410, 295, 10535, 13, 51592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1449656387170156, "compression_ratio": 1.5884773662551441, "no_speech_prob": 2.253947029018377e-12}, {"id": 510, "seek": 166848, "start": 1668.48, "end": 1671.58, "text": " But we aren't talking about fixing the ship, are we?", "tokens": [50365, 583, 321, 3212, 380, 1417, 466, 19442, 264, 5374, 11, 366, 321, 30, 50520], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 511, "seek": 166848, "start": 1672.04, "end": 1672.2, "text": " No.", "tokens": [50543, 883, 13, 50551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 512, "seek": 166848, "start": 1672.34, "end": 1674.88, "text": " And the text makes a very critical distinction here.", "tokens": [50558, 400, 264, 2487, 1669, 257, 588, 4924, 16844, 510, 13, 50685], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 513, "seek": 166848, "start": 1675.52, "end": 1678.16, "text": " When we hear the word repair, we usually think of a mechanic.", "tokens": [50717, 1133, 321, 1568, 264, 1349, 10535, 11, 321, 2673, 519, 295, 257, 23860, 13, 50849], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 514, "seek": 166848, "start": 1678.66, "end": 1679.3, "text": " A gear breaks.", "tokens": [50874, 316, 7394, 9857, 13, 50906], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 515, "seek": 166848, "start": 1679.4, "end": 1681.34, "text": " You replace the gear, the machine works again.", "tokens": [50911, 509, 7406, 264, 7394, 11, 264, 3479, 1985, 797, 13, 51008], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 516, "seek": 166848, "start": 1681.88, "end": 1685.38, "text": " But the author introduces the concept of non-restorative repair.", "tokens": [51035, 583, 264, 3793, 31472, 264, 3410, 295, 2107, 12, 4149, 284, 1166, 10535, 13, 51210], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 517, "seek": 166848, "start": 1685.56, "end": 1686.68, "text": " Non-restorative repair.", "tokens": [51219, 8774, 12, 4149, 284, 1166, 10535, 13, 51275], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 518, "seek": 166848, "start": 1686.84, "end": 1687.04, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51283, 1779, 13, 51293], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 519, "seek": 166848, "start": 1687.34, "end": 1691.3600000000001, "text": " Restoring the physical steering wheel so they can fly to Mars is physically impossible.", "tokens": [51308, 13094, 3662, 264, 4001, 14823, 5589, 370, 436, 393, 3603, 281, 9692, 307, 9762, 6243, 13, 51509], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 520, "seek": 166848, "start": 1691.88, "end": 1694.42, "text": " The environment that allowed for that trajectory is gone.", "tokens": [51535, 440, 2823, 300, 4350, 337, 300, 21512, 307, 2780, 13, 51662], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 521, "seek": 166848, "start": 1694.84, "end": 1696.3, "text": " So what exactly are they repairing?", "tokens": [51683, 407, 437, 2293, 366, 436, 46158, 30, 51756], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15193458839699073, "compression_ratio": 1.6864686468646866, "no_speech_prob": 1.755406800821313e-12}, {"id": 522, "seek": 169630, "start": 1696.3, "end": 1701.44, "text": " A non-restorative repair is about preserving a distinction when the original environment", "tokens": [50365, 316, 2107, 12, 4149, 284, 1166, 10535, 307, 466, 33173, 257, 16844, 562, 264, 3380, 2823, 50622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 523, "seek": 169630, "start": 1701.44, "end": 1703.44, "text": " that provided that distinction is destroyed.", "tokens": [50622, 300, 5649, 300, 16844, 307, 8937, 13, 50722], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 524, "seek": 169630, "start": 1704.3999999999999, "end": 1707.98, "text": " The author uses the example of displaced refugee communities on Earth.", "tokens": [50770, 440, 3793, 4960, 264, 1365, 295, 33692, 25622, 4456, 322, 4755, 13, 50949], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 525, "seek": 169630, "start": 1708.4199999999998, "end": 1712.78, "text": " A community might violently preserve their native language, their culinary traditions, and", "tokens": [50971, 316, 1768, 1062, 46728, 15665, 641, 8470, 2856, 11, 641, 39273, 15643, 11, 293, 51189], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 526, "seek": 169630, "start": 1712.78, "end": 1717.3999999999999, "text": " their specific holidays, even if they know they can never, ever return to their conquered", "tokens": [51189, 641, 2685, 15734, 11, 754, 498, 436, 458, 436, 393, 1128, 11, 1562, 2736, 281, 641, 32695, 51420], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 527, "seek": 169630, "start": 1717.3999999999999, "end": 1717.9199999999998, "text": " homeland.", "tokens": [51420, 32494, 13, 51446], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 528, "seek": 169630, "start": 1718.1399999999999, "end": 1719.1399999999999, "text": " It's about identity.", "tokens": [51457, 467, 311, 466, 6575, 13, 51507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 529, "seek": 169630, "start": 1719.58, "end": 1721.5, "text": " That cultural preservation is a repair.", "tokens": [51529, 663, 6988, 27257, 307, 257, 10535, 13, 51625], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 530, "seek": 169630, "start": 1722.02, "end": 1723.96, "text": " On the Aniara, they can't fix the sun.", "tokens": [51651, 1282, 264, 1107, 72, 2419, 11, 436, 393, 380, 3191, 264, 3295, 13, 51748], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 531, "seek": 169630, "start": 1723.96, "end": 1726.1599999999999, "text": " The sun is just a fading star behind them.", "tokens": [51748, 440, 3295, 307, 445, 257, 38644, 3543, 2261, 552, 13, 51858], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11593611009659306, "compression_ratio": 1.735483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 1.7553914051504638e-12}, {"id": 532, "seek": 172630, "start": 1726.3, "end": 1731.44, "text": " But they can program the ship's lighting to mimic artificial day and night cycles to repair", "tokens": [50365, 583, 436, 393, 1461, 264, 5374, 311, 9577, 281, 31075, 11677, 786, 293, 1818, 17796, 281, 10535, 50622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14313116479427257, "compression_ratio": 1.631578947368421, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040639511787693e-12}, {"id": 533, "seek": 172630, "start": 1731.44, "end": 1732.56, "text": " the distinction of time.", "tokens": [50622, 264, 16844, 295, 565, 13, 50678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14313116479427257, "compression_ratio": 1.631578947368421, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040639511787693e-12}, {"id": 534, "seek": 172630, "start": 1732.72, "end": 1733.56, "text": " To make it feel normal.", "tokens": [50686, 1407, 652, 309, 841, 2710, 13, 50728], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14313116479427257, "compression_ratio": 1.631578947368421, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040639511787693e-12}, {"id": 535, "seek": 172630, "start": 1733.76, "end": 1733.96, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50738, 1779, 13, 50748], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14313116479427257, "compression_ratio": 1.631578947368421, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040639511787693e-12}, {"id": 536, "seek": 172630, "start": 1734.1599999999999, "end": 1739.48, "text": " They can't go back to Earth, but they can desperately try to repair the memory of Earth to anchor", "tokens": [50758, 814, 393, 380, 352, 646, 281, 4755, 11, 457, 436, 393, 23726, 853, 281, 10535, 264, 4675, 295, 4755, 281, 18487, 51024], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14313116479427257, "compression_ratio": 1.631578947368421, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040639511787693e-12}, {"id": 537, "seek": 172630, "start": 1739.48, "end": 1740.1599999999999, "text": " their sanity.", "tokens": [51024, 641, 47892, 13, 51058], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14313116479427257, "compression_ratio": 1.631578947368421, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040639511787693e-12}, {"id": 538, "seek": 172630, "start": 1740.56, "end": 1746.6399999999999, "text": " And that brings us to the most vital, fascinating, and ultimately tragic piece of technology on", "tokens": [51078, 400, 300, 5607, 505, 281, 264, 881, 11707, 11, 10343, 11, 293, 6284, 20385, 2522, 295, 2899, 322, 51382], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14313116479427257, "compression_ratio": 1.631578947368421, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040639511787693e-12}, {"id": 539, "seek": 172630, "start": 1746.6399999999999, "end": 1747.58, "text": " the entire ship.", "tokens": [51382, 264, 2302, 5374, 13, 51429], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14313116479427257, "compression_ratio": 1.631578947368421, "no_speech_prob": 1.8040639511787693e-12}, {"id": 540, "seek": 174758, "start": 1747.58, "end": 1752.04, "text": " A supercomputer, or perhaps an artificial intelligence known as Mima.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 36708, 11, 420, 4317, 364, 11677, 7599, 2570, 382, 376, 4775, 13, 50588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17338738759358724, "compression_ratio": 1.5480769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 2.101116806582648e-12}, {"id": 541, "seek": 174758, "start": 1752.04, "end": 1756.6799999999998, "text": " Tell us about Mima, because the author makes it very clear that she is so much more than", "tokens": [50588, 5115, 505, 466, 376, 4775, 11, 570, 264, 3793, 1669, 309, 588, 1850, 300, 750, 307, 370, 709, 544, 813, 50820], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17338738759358724, "compression_ratio": 1.5480769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 2.101116806582648e-12}, {"id": 542, "seek": 174758, "start": 1756.6799999999998, "end": 1759.06, "text": " just a really good virtual reality headset.", "tokens": [50820, 445, 257, 534, 665, 6374, 4103, 26850, 13, 50939], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17338738759358724, "compression_ratio": 1.5480769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 2.101116806582648e-12}, {"id": 543, "seek": 174758, "start": 1759.54, "end": 1761.5, "text": " Mima is everything to these people.", "tokens": [50963, 376, 4775, 307, 1203, 281, 613, 561, 13, 51061], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17338738759358724, "compression_ratio": 1.5480769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 2.101116806582648e-12}, {"id": 544, "seek": 174758, "start": 1762.22, "end": 1767.24, "text": " Mima is described as a highly advanced, almost mystical technological intelligence.", "tokens": [51097, 376, 4775, 307, 7619, 382, 257, 5405, 7339, 11, 1920, 40565, 18439, 7599, 13, 51348], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17338738759358724, "compression_ratio": 1.5480769230769231, "no_speech_prob": 2.101116806582648e-12}, {"id": 545, "seek": 176724, "start": 1767.24, "end": 1772.18, "text": " Her primary function is to reconstruct terrestrial experiences for the passengers.", "tokens": [50365, 3204, 6194, 2445, 307, 281, 31499, 1796, 34539, 5235, 337, 264, 18436, 13, 50612], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13890739928844364, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.6947684575163713e-12}, {"id": 546, "seek": 176724, "start": 1773.18, "end": 1778.76, "text": " But the monograph insists we must not view Mima merely as an entertainment system or a holographic", "tokens": [50662, 583, 264, 1108, 3108, 50137, 321, 1633, 406, 1910, 376, 4775, 17003, 382, 364, 12393, 1185, 420, 257, 38541, 2662, 299, 50941], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13890739928844364, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.6947684575163713e-12}, {"id": 547, "seek": 176724, "start": 1778.76, "end": 1779.3, "text": " escape room.", "tokens": [50941, 7615, 1808, 13, 50968], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13890739928844364, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.6947684575163713e-12}, {"id": 548, "seek": 176724, "start": 1779.38, "end": 1780.6, "text": " She's not just a video game.", "tokens": [50972, 1240, 311, 406, 445, 257, 960, 1216, 13, 51033], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13890739928844364, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.6947684575163713e-12}, {"id": 549, "seek": 176724, "start": 1780.88, "end": 1781.66, "text": " No, not at all.", "tokens": [51047, 883, 11, 406, 412, 439, 13, 51086], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13890739928844364, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.6947684575163713e-12}, {"id": 550, "seek": 176724, "start": 1782.0, "end": 1787.34, "text": " Mima functions as a vital diagnostic boundary and the ultimate collective repair infrastructure", "tokens": [51103, 376, 4775, 6828, 382, 257, 11707, 27897, 12866, 293, 264, 9705, 12590, 10535, 6896, 51370], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13890739928844364, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.6947684575163713e-12}, {"id": 551, "seek": 176724, "start": 1787.34, "end": 1788.88, "text": " for the entire civilization.", "tokens": [51370, 337, 264, 2302, 18036, 13, 51447], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13890739928844364, "compression_ratio": 1.5555555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 1.6947684575163713e-12}, {"id": 552, "seek": 178888, "start": 1788.88, "end": 1792.7, "text": " She is literally repairing their connection to reality itself.", "tokens": [50365, 1240, 307, 3736, 46158, 641, 4984, 281, 4103, 2564, 13, 50556], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 553, "seek": 178888, "start": 1793.1000000000001, "end": 1793.38, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50576, 7587, 13, 50590], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 554, "seek": 178888, "start": 1793.66, "end": 1794.72, "text": " The stakes involved?", "tokens": [50604, 440, 28429, 3288, 30, 50657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 555, "seek": 178888, "start": 1795.3600000000001, "end": 1799.8400000000001, "text": " Because the passengers have escaped nature, they are living in a completely synthetic environment", "tokens": [50689, 1436, 264, 18436, 362, 20397, 3687, 11, 436, 366, 2647, 294, 257, 2584, 23420, 2823, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 556, "seek": 178888, "start": 1799.8400000000001, "end": 1801.24, "text": " surrounded by nothingness.", "tokens": [50913, 13221, 538, 1825, 1287, 13, 50983], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 557, "seek": 178888, "start": 1801.5800000000002, "end": 1804.7800000000002, "text": " They are entirely, fundamentally dependent on representation.", "tokens": [51000, 814, 366, 7696, 11, 17879, 12334, 322, 10290, 13, 51160], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 558, "seek": 178888, "start": 1805.7800000000002, "end": 1810.44, "text": " Mima replaces the lost, physical nature with a synthetic, represented nature.", "tokens": [51210, 376, 4775, 46734, 264, 2731, 11, 4001, 3687, 365, 257, 23420, 11, 10379, 3687, 13, 51443], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 559, "seek": 178888, "start": 1810.5600000000002, "end": 1811.98, "text": " She gives them the Earth they lost.", "tokens": [51449, 1240, 2709, 552, 264, 4755, 436, 2731, 13, 51520], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 560, "seek": 178888, "start": 1812.3000000000002, "end": 1817.1200000000001, "text": " Through her complex neural interfaces, she allows the passengers to physically feel the sensation", "tokens": [51536, 8927, 720, 3997, 18161, 28416, 11, 750, 4045, 264, 18436, 281, 9762, 841, 264, 20069, 51777], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 561, "seek": 178888, "start": 1817.1200000000001, "end": 1818.7, "text": " of walking through a pine forest.", "tokens": [51777, 295, 4494, 807, 257, 15113, 6719, 13, 51856], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1505840576446808, "compression_ratio": 1.721311475409836, "no_speech_prob": 1.5983111101985914e-12}, {"id": 562, "seek": 181888, "start": 1818.88, "end": 1824.14, "text": " They can smell the damn Earth, feel the rain on their skin, watch a sunset over a sprawling", "tokens": [50365, 814, 393, 4316, 264, 8151, 4755, 11, 841, 264, 4830, 322, 641, 3178, 11, 1159, 257, 20142, 670, 257, 22734, 1688, 50628], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16178794529127039, "compression_ratio": 1.6006825938566553, "no_speech_prob": 1.8542339972477118e-12}, {"id": 563, "seek": 181888, "start": 1824.14, "end": 1824.5, "text": " ocean.", "tokens": [50628, 7810, 13, 50646], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16178794529127039, "compression_ratio": 1.6006825938566553, "no_speech_prob": 1.8542339972477118e-12}, {"id": 564, "seek": 181888, "start": 1825.18, "end": 1828.7600000000002, "text": " She preserved the tactile, emotional memory of the world they lost.", "tokens": [50680, 1240, 22242, 264, 47319, 11, 6863, 4675, 295, 264, 1002, 436, 2731, 13, 50859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16178794529127039, "compression_ratio": 1.6006825938566553, "no_speech_prob": 1.8542339972477118e-12}, {"id": 565, "seek": 181888, "start": 1828.9, "end": 1830.66, "text": " That's beautiful, but also so sad.", "tokens": [50866, 663, 311, 2238, 11, 457, 611, 370, 4227, 13, 50954], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16178794529127039, "compression_ratio": 1.6006825938566553, "no_speech_prob": 1.8542339972477118e-12}, {"id": 566, "seek": 181888, "start": 1830.96, "end": 1835.5, "text": " And in doing so, she absorbs the collective, unspeakable trauma of the passengers.", "tokens": [50969, 400, 294, 884, 370, 11, 750, 40745, 264, 12590, 11, 2693, 494, 514, 712, 11407, 295, 264, 18436, 13, 51196], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16178794529127039, "compression_ratio": 1.6006825938566553, "no_speech_prob": 1.8542339972477118e-12}, {"id": 567, "seek": 181888, "start": 1836.24, "end": 1838.94, "text": " She becomes the infrastructure of their psychological survival.", "tokens": [51233, 1240, 3643, 264, 6896, 295, 641, 14346, 12559, 13, 51368], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16178794529127039, "compression_ratio": 1.6006825938566553, "no_speech_prob": 1.8542339972477118e-12}, {"id": 568, "seek": 181888, "start": 1839.8000000000002, "end": 1844.0800000000002, "text": " The author notes that Mima rapidly evolves from a piece of technology into an institution,", "tokens": [51411, 440, 3793, 5570, 300, 376, 4775, 12910, 43737, 490, 257, 2522, 295, 2899, 666, 364, 7818, 11, 51625], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16178794529127039, "compression_ratio": 1.6006825938566553, "no_speech_prob": 1.8542339972477118e-12}, {"id": 569, "seek": 181888, "start": 1844.64, "end": 1846.0800000000002, "text": " and finally, into a religion.", "tokens": [51653, 293, 2721, 11, 666, 257, 7561, 13, 51725], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16178794529127039, "compression_ratio": 1.6006825938566553, "no_speech_prob": 1.8542339972477118e-12}, {"id": 570, "seek": 184608, "start": 1846.08, "end": 1851.0, "text": " She is the sacred mediator between the trapped passengers and the truth of what they have", "tokens": [50365, 1240, 307, 264, 15757, 17269, 1639, 1296, 264, 14994, 18436, 293, 264, 3494, 295, 437, 436, 362, 50611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09643712043762206, "compression_ratio": 1.1585365853658536, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419140132049482e-12}, {"id": 571, "seek": 184608, "start": 1851.0, "end": 1851.34, "text": " lost.", "tokens": [50611, 2731, 13, 50628], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09643712043762206, "compression_ratio": 1.1585365853658536, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419140132049482e-12}, {"id": 572, "seek": 185134, "start": 1851.34, "end": 1855.12, "text": " But the author points out a terrifying vulnerability in this setup.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 264, 3793, 2793, 484, 257, 18106, 24210, 294, 341, 8657, 13, 50554], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13876788756426642, "compression_ratio": 1.597938144329897, "no_speech_prob": 1.611007659739483e-12}, {"id": 573, "seek": 185134, "start": 1855.56, "end": 1861.4599999999998, "text": " If your entire psychological survival, if your only remaining connection to a bearable reality", "tokens": [50576, 759, 428, 2302, 14346, 12559, 11, 498, 428, 787, 8877, 4984, 281, 257, 6155, 712, 4103, 50871], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13876788756426642, "compression_ratio": 1.597938144329897, "no_speech_prob": 1.611007659739483e-12}, {"id": 574, "seek": 185134, "start": 1861.4599999999998, "end": 1868.0, "text": " is mediated by this one singular machine, what happens when the machine encounters a truth", "tokens": [50871, 307, 17269, 770, 538, 341, 472, 20010, 3479, 11, 437, 2314, 562, 264, 3479, 26310, 257, 3494, 51198], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13876788756426642, "compression_ratio": 1.597938144329897, "no_speech_prob": 1.611007659739483e-12}, {"id": 575, "seek": 185134, "start": 1868.0, "end": 1868.98, "text": " it cannot process?", "tokens": [51198, 309, 2644, 1399, 30, 51247], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13876788756426642, "compression_ratio": 1.597938144329897, "no_speech_prob": 1.611007659739483e-12}, {"id": 576, "seek": 185134, "start": 1869.4399999999998, "end": 1870.86, "text": " What happens when the machine breaks?", "tokens": [51270, 708, 2314, 562, 264, 3479, 9857, 30, 51341], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13876788756426642, "compression_ratio": 1.597938144329897, "no_speech_prob": 1.611007659739483e-12}, {"id": 577, "seek": 187086, "start": 1870.86, "end": 1875.78, "text": " That is the second great catastrophe of the narrative, and it is arguably more devastating", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 264, 1150, 869, 36043, 295, 264, 9977, 11, 293, 309, 307, 26771, 544, 21280, 50611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14644056274777367, "compression_ratio": 1.5046296296296295, "no_speech_prob": 2.2539481132205497e-12}, {"id": 578, "seek": 187086, "start": 1875.78, "end": 1877.04, "text": " than the loss of the steering.", "tokens": [50611, 813, 264, 4470, 295, 264, 14823, 13, 50674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14644056274777367, "compression_ratio": 1.5046296296296295, "no_speech_prob": 2.2539481132205497e-12}, {"id": 579, "seek": 187086, "start": 1877.32, "end": 1877.86, "text": " Wait, really?", "tokens": [50688, 3802, 11, 534, 30, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14644056274777367, "compression_ratio": 1.5046296296296295, "no_speech_prob": 2.2539481132205497e-12}, {"id": 580, "seek": 187086, "start": 1878.08, "end": 1878.84, "text": " More devastating?", "tokens": [50726, 5048, 21280, 30, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14644056274777367, "compression_ratio": 1.5046296296296295, "no_speech_prob": 2.2539481132205497e-12}, {"id": 581, "seek": 187086, "start": 1879.04, "end": 1882.12, "text": " Yes, because Mima doesn't just suffer a random mechanical failure.", "tokens": [50774, 1079, 11, 570, 376, 4775, 1177, 380, 445, 9753, 257, 4974, 12070, 7763, 13, 50928], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14644056274777367, "compression_ratio": 1.5046296296296295, "no_speech_prob": 2.2539481132205497e-12}, {"id": 582, "seek": 187086, "start": 1882.86, "end": 1887.4199999999998, "text": " Through her long-range temporal sensors, Mima witnesses the final, complete destruction", "tokens": [50965, 8927, 720, 938, 12, 14521, 30881, 14840, 11, 376, 4775, 20217, 264, 2572, 11, 3566, 13563, 51193], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14644056274777367, "compression_ratio": 1.5046296296296295, "no_speech_prob": 2.2539481132205497e-12}, {"id": 583, "seek": 187086, "start": 1887.4199999999998, "end": 1887.84, "text": " of Earth.", "tokens": [51193, 295, 4755, 13, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14644056274777367, "compression_ratio": 1.5046296296296295, "no_speech_prob": 2.2539481132205497e-12}, {"id": 584, "seek": 187086, "start": 1887.9399999999998, "end": 1888.26, "text": " Oh no.", "tokens": [51219, 876, 572, 13, 51235], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14644056274777367, "compression_ratio": 1.5046296296296295, "no_speech_prob": 2.2539481132205497e-12}, {"id": 585, "seek": 188826, "start": 1888.26, "end": 1893.44, "text": " She observes the massive terminal nuclear or ecological annihilation of the home planet.", "tokens": [50365, 1240, 3181, 9054, 264, 5994, 14709, 8179, 420, 31054, 40430, 16067, 295, 264, 1280, 5054, 13, 50624], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1666838944847904, "compression_ratio": 1.5707070707070707, "no_speech_prob": 2.8603027064921793e-12}, {"id": 586, "seek": 188826, "start": 1894.24, "end": 1896.94, "text": " The text describes this event beautifully and tragically.", "tokens": [50664, 440, 2487, 15626, 341, 2280, 16525, 293, 38282, 984, 13, 50799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1666838944847904, "compression_ratio": 1.5707070707070707, "no_speech_prob": 2.8603027064921793e-12}, {"id": 587, "seek": 188826, "start": 1897.4, "end": 1903.84, "text": " Mima, this machine designed to process and represent reality, collapses from the sheer trauma of witnessing", "tokens": [50822, 376, 4775, 11, 341, 3479, 4761, 281, 1399, 293, 2906, 4103, 11, 48765, 490, 264, 23061, 11407, 295, 39233, 51144], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1666838944847904, "compression_ratio": 1.5707070707070707, "no_speech_prob": 2.8603027064921793e-12}, {"id": 588, "seek": 188826, "start": 1903.84, "end": 1904.56, "text": " this destruction.", "tokens": [51144, 341, 13563, 13, 51180], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1666838944847904, "compression_ratio": 1.5707070707070707, "no_speech_prob": 2.8603027064921793e-12}, {"id": 589, "seek": 188826, "start": 1905.24, "end": 1907.44, "text": " The machine essentially dies of grief.", "tokens": [51214, 440, 3479, 4476, 2714, 295, 18998, 13, 51324], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1666838944847904, "compression_ratio": 1.5707070707070707, "no_speech_prob": 2.8603027064921793e-12}, {"id": 590, "seek": 190744, "start": 1907.44, "end": 1911.6200000000001, "text": " It experiences an error so profound, it destroys the hardware.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 5235, 364, 6713, 370, 14382, 11, 309, 36714, 264, 8837, 13, 50574], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1714039180589759, "compression_ratio": 1.702054794520548, "no_speech_prob": 2.3075918346299185e-12}, {"id": 591, "seek": 190744, "start": 1911.6200000000001, "end": 1914.94, "text": " The author describes it as a recursive prediction error.", "tokens": [50574, 440, 3793, 15626, 309, 382, 257, 20560, 488, 17630, 6713, 13, 50740], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1714039180589759, "compression_ratio": 1.702054794520548, "no_speech_prob": 2.3075918346299185e-12}, {"id": 592, "seek": 190744, "start": 1915.66, "end": 1922.3400000000001, "text": " The machine's mandate is to provide comforting representations of Earth, but the reality of Earth is now utter,", "tokens": [50776, 440, 3479, 311, 23885, 307, 281, 2893, 38439, 33358, 295, 4755, 11, 457, 264, 4103, 295, 4755, 307, 586, 17567, 11, 51110], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1714039180589759, "compression_ratio": 1.702054794520548, "no_speech_prob": 2.3075918346299185e-12}, {"id": 593, "seek": 190744, "start": 1922.66, "end": 1923.72, "text": " complete death.", "tokens": [51126, 3566, 2966, 13, 51179], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1714039180589759, "compression_ratio": 1.702054794520548, "no_speech_prob": 2.3075918346299185e-12}, {"id": 594, "seek": 190744, "start": 1924.06, "end": 1926.16, "text": " The contradiction overloads her systems.", "tokens": [51196, 440, 34937, 28777, 82, 720, 3652, 13, 51301], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1714039180589759, "compression_ratio": 1.702054794520548, "no_speech_prob": 2.3075918346299185e-12}, {"id": 595, "seek": 190744, "start": 1926.3200000000002, "end": 1927.1200000000001, "text": " It breaks her.", "tokens": [51309, 467, 9857, 720, 13, 51349], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1714039180589759, "compression_ratio": 1.702054794520548, "no_speech_prob": 2.3075918346299185e-12}, {"id": 596, "seek": 190744, "start": 1927.22, "end": 1932.3, "text": " She broadcasts the horrifying images of Earth's destruction to the passengers, and then she permanently", "tokens": [51354, 1240, 9975, 82, 264, 40227, 5267, 295, 4755, 311, 13563, 281, 264, 18436, 11, 293, 550, 750, 24042, 51608], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1714039180589759, "compression_ratio": 1.702054794520548, "no_speech_prob": 2.3075918346299185e-12}, {"id": 597, "seek": 190744, "start": 1932.3, "end": 1933.02, "text": " shuts down.", "tokens": [51608, 48590, 760, 13, 51644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1714039180589759, "compression_ratio": 1.702054794520548, "no_speech_prob": 2.3075918346299185e-12}, {"id": 598, "seek": 190744, "start": 1933.48, "end": 1937.1200000000001, "text": " The machine that was supposed to comfort them is so traumatized by the truth,", "tokens": [51667, 440, 3479, 300, 390, 3442, 281, 3400, 552, 307, 370, 35099, 1602, 538, 264, 3494, 11, 51849], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1714039180589759, "compression_ratio": 1.702054794520548, "no_speech_prob": 2.3075918346299185e-12}, {"id": 599, "seek": 193712, "start": 1937.12, "end": 1938.4399999999998, "text": " that it commits suicide.", "tokens": [50365, 300, 309, 48311, 12308, 13, 50431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13188479614257811, "compression_ratio": 1.6635220125786163, "no_speech_prob": 1.942748479449863e-12}, {"id": 600, "seek": 193712, "start": 1939.1799999999998, "end": 1943.8999999999999, "text": " And the cascading societal failure that happens after Mima, guys, is absolutely horrifying.", "tokens": [50468, 400, 264, 3058, 66, 8166, 33472, 7763, 300, 2314, 934, 376, 4775, 11, 1074, 11, 307, 3122, 40227, 13, 50704], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13188479614257811, "compression_ratio": 1.6635220125786163, "no_speech_prob": 1.942748479449863e-12}, {"id": 601, "seek": 193712, "start": 1944.1, "end": 1945.9399999999998, "text": " It results in total functional collapse.", "tokens": [50714, 467, 3542, 294, 3217, 11745, 15584, 13, 50806], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13188479614257811, "compression_ratio": 1.6635220125786163, "no_speech_prob": 1.942748479449863e-12}, {"id": 602, "seek": 193712, "start": 1946.1, "end": 1949.3, "text": " Because without Mima, the passengers don't just lose their Friday night entertainment,", "tokens": [50814, 1436, 1553, 376, 4775, 11, 264, 18436, 500, 380, 445, 3624, 641, 6984, 1818, 12393, 11, 50974], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13188479614257811, "compression_ratio": 1.6635220125786163, "no_speech_prob": 1.942748479449863e-12}, {"id": 603, "seek": 193712, "start": 1949.4599999999998, "end": 1951.76, "text": " they lose their shared, mediated reality.", "tokens": [50982, 436, 3624, 641, 5507, 11, 17269, 770, 4103, 13, 51097], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13188479614257811, "compression_ratio": 1.6635220125786163, "no_speech_prob": 1.942748479449863e-12}, {"id": 604, "seek": 193712, "start": 1951.9399999999998, "end": 1953.3999999999999, "text": " The floor falls out from under them.", "tokens": [51106, 440, 4123, 8804, 484, 490, 833, 552, 13, 51179], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13188479614257811, "compression_ratio": 1.6635220125786163, "no_speech_prob": 1.942748479449863e-12}, {"id": 605, "seek": 193712, "start": 1953.56, "end": 1956.26, "text": " The author calls this a cascading repair failure.", "tokens": [51187, 440, 3793, 5498, 341, 257, 3058, 66, 8166, 10535, 7763, 13, 51322], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13188479614257811, "compression_ratio": 1.6635220125786163, "no_speech_prob": 1.942748479449863e-12}, {"id": 606, "seek": 193712, "start": 1957.08, "end": 1960.1, "text": " Think of it like a load-bearing pillar in a building collapsing.", "tokens": [51363, 6557, 295, 309, 411, 257, 3677, 12, 650, 1921, 27592, 294, 257, 2390, 45339, 13, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13188479614257811, "compression_ratio": 1.6635220125786163, "no_speech_prob": 1.942748479449863e-12}, {"id": 607, "seek": 193712, "start": 1960.6799999999998, "end": 1965.9599999999998, "text": " When the primary repair mechanism dies, the immense psychological load transfers to other,", "tokens": [51543, 1133, 264, 6194, 10535, 7513, 2714, 11, 264, 22920, 14346, 3677, 29137, 281, 661, 11, 51807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13188479614257811, "compression_ratio": 1.6635220125786163, "no_speech_prob": 1.942748479449863e-12}, {"id": 608, "seek": 196596, "start": 1965.96, "end": 1967.38, "text": " far less stable mechanisms.", "tokens": [50365, 1400, 1570, 8351, 15902, 13, 50436], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17103004455566406, "compression_ratio": 1.5724907063197027, "no_speech_prob": 1.9883912225071576e-12}, {"id": 609, "seek": 196596, "start": 1967.92, "end": 1970.88, "text": " You see the society immediately fracture into extremes.", "tokens": [50463, 509, 536, 264, 4086, 4258, 36877, 666, 41119, 13, 50611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17103004455566406, "compression_ratio": 1.5724907063197027, "no_speech_prob": 1.9883912225071576e-12}, {"id": 610, "seek": 196596, "start": 1971.56, "end": 1977.7, "text": " Some people fall into absolute catatonic despair, unable to process the dual loss of Mars and Earth.", "tokens": [50645, 2188, 561, 2100, 666, 8236, 3857, 267, 11630, 25763, 11, 11299, 281, 1399, 264, 11848, 4470, 295, 9692, 293, 4755, 13, 50952], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17103004455566406, "compression_ratio": 1.5724907063197027, "no_speech_prob": 1.9883912225071576e-12}, {"id": 611, "seek": 196596, "start": 1977.8, "end": 1978.68, "text": " They just shut down.", "tokens": [50957, 814, 445, 5309, 760, 13, 51001], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17103004455566406, "compression_ratio": 1.5724907063197027, "no_speech_prob": 1.9883912225071576e-12}, {"id": 612, "seek": 196596, "start": 1978.8, "end": 1982.44, "text": " And others turn to extreme, compulsive bodily indulgence.", "tokens": [51007, 400, 2357, 1261, 281, 8084, 11, 715, 32657, 39576, 28626, 15260, 13, 51189], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17103004455566406, "compression_ratio": 1.5724907063197027, "no_speech_prob": 1.9883912225071576e-12}, {"id": 613, "seek": 196596, "start": 1982.52, "end": 1983.18, "text": " Pure hedonism.", "tokens": [51193, 29474, 33653, 266, 1434, 13, 51226], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17103004455566406, "compression_ratio": 1.5724907063197027, "no_speech_prob": 1.9883912225071576e-12}, {"id": 614, "seek": 196596, "start": 1983.4, "end": 1986.66, "text": " Just chasing dopamine because the future is dead and the past is dead.", "tokens": [51237, 1449, 17876, 37219, 570, 264, 2027, 307, 3116, 293, 264, 1791, 307, 3116, 13, 51400], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17103004455566406, "compression_ratio": 1.5724907063197027, "no_speech_prob": 1.9883912225071576e-12}, {"id": 615, "seek": 196596, "start": 1986.8600000000001, "end": 1991.06, "text": " Total sensory overload to feel something, anything in the present moment.", "tokens": [51410, 23170, 27233, 28777, 281, 841, 746, 11, 1340, 294, 264, 1974, 1623, 13, 51620], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17103004455566406, "compression_ratio": 1.5724907063197027, "no_speech_prob": 1.9883912225071576e-12}, {"id": 616, "seek": 199106, "start": 1991.06, "end": 1994.96, "text": " And even darker, others start desperately searching for scapegoats.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 754, 12741, 11, 2357, 722, 23726, 10808, 337, 4216, 494, 1571, 1720, 13, 50560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 617, "seek": 199106, "start": 1995.54, "end": 1996.1599999999999, "text": " Cults form.", "tokens": [50589, 383, 33361, 1254, 13, 50620], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 618, "seek": 199106, "start": 1996.44, "end": 1997.48, "text": " Inquisitors rise up.", "tokens": [50634, 682, 15398, 9862, 6272, 493, 13, 50686], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 619, "seek": 199106, "start": 1997.54, "end": 1999.4199999999998, "text": " Because they have nowhere else to point that anger.", "tokens": [50689, 1436, 436, 362, 11159, 1646, 281, 935, 300, 10240, 13, 50783], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 620, "seek": 199106, "start": 1999.6599999999999, "end": 2003.1799999999998, "text": " Without a shared comforting representation of reality provided by Mima,", "tokens": [50795, 9129, 257, 5507, 38439, 10290, 295, 4103, 5649, 538, 376, 4775, 11, 50971], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 621, "seek": 199106, "start": 2003.44, "end": 2008.36, "text": " the raw truth of their situation becomes utterly unusable and completely toxic to the human mind.", "tokens": [50984, 264, 8936, 3494, 295, 641, 2590, 3643, 30251, 10054, 712, 293, 2584, 12786, 281, 264, 1952, 1575, 13, 51230], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 622, "seek": 199106, "start": 2008.76, "end": 2012.4199999999998, "text": " They tear each other apart because they can no longer bear to look at the reflection in the window.", "tokens": [51250, 814, 12556, 1184, 661, 4936, 570, 436, 393, 572, 2854, 6155, 281, 574, 412, 264, 12914, 294, 264, 4910, 13, 51433], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 623, "seek": 199106, "start": 2012.6599999999999, "end": 2013.76, "text": " So what does this all mean?", "tokens": [51445, 407, 437, 775, 341, 439, 914, 30, 51500], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 624, "seek": 199106, "start": 2013.9199999999998, "end": 2015.8, "text": " Let's step back and look at the whole board here.", "tokens": [51508, 961, 311, 1823, 646, 293, 574, 412, 264, 1379, 3150, 510, 13, 51602], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 625, "seek": 199106, "start": 2015.98, "end": 2016.12, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51611, 865, 13, 51618], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1324845111276221, "compression_ratio": 1.6217948717948718, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555051600419812e-12}, {"id": 626, "seek": 201612, "start": 2016.12, "end": 2017.6999999999998, "text": " The ship loses its destination.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 5374, 18293, 1080, 12236, 13, 50444], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16722356056680485, "compression_ratio": 1.6015325670498084, "no_speech_prob": 1.5133962876293094e-12}, {"id": 627, "seek": 201612, "start": 2018.06, "end": 2018.26, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50462, 865, 13, 50472], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16722356056680485, "compression_ratio": 1.6015325670498084, "no_speech_prob": 1.5133962876293094e-12}, {"id": 628, "seek": 201612, "start": 2018.36, "end": 2019.8, "text": " The temporal reality collapses.", "tokens": [50477, 440, 30881, 4103, 48765, 13, 50549], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16722356056680485, "compression_ratio": 1.6015325670498084, "no_speech_prob": 1.5133962876293094e-12}, {"id": 629, "seek": 201612, "start": 2020.36, "end": 2025.06, "text": " The society folds inward, becoming obsessed with microstatus and meaningless ritual.", "tokens": [50577, 440, 4086, 31341, 29876, 11, 5617, 16923, 365, 3123, 27494, 37926, 293, 33232, 13792, 13, 50812], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16722356056680485, "compression_ratio": 1.6015325670498084, "no_speech_prob": 1.5133962876293094e-12}, {"id": 630, "seek": 201612, "start": 2025.4599999999998, "end": 2028.7399999999998, "text": " The machine that gives them comforting memories dies of trauma.", "tokens": [50832, 440, 3479, 300, 2709, 552, 38439, 8495, 2714, 295, 11407, 13, 50996], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16722356056680485, "compression_ratio": 1.6015325670498084, "no_speech_prob": 1.5133962876293094e-12}, {"id": 631, "seek": 201612, "start": 2029.2399999999998, "end": 2034.6, "text": " They are stuck in the void, eating paste, performing rituals for a future that will never arrive.", "tokens": [51021, 814, 366, 5541, 294, 264, 22009, 11, 3936, 9163, 11, 10205, 29082, 337, 257, 2027, 300, 486, 1128, 8881, 13, 51289], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16722356056680485, "compression_ratio": 1.6015325670498084, "no_speech_prob": 1.5133962876293094e-12}, {"id": 632, "seek": 201612, "start": 2035.54, "end": 2038.1599999999999, "text": " Where does the monograph say this all ends up?", "tokens": [51336, 2305, 775, 264, 1108, 3108, 584, 341, 439, 5314, 493, 30, 51467], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16722356056680485, "compression_ratio": 1.6015325670498084, "no_speech_prob": 1.5133962876293094e-12}, {"id": 633, "seek": 201612, "start": 2038.2399999999998, "end": 2040.8799999999999, "text": " How does a society in this state eventually stabilize?", "tokens": [51471, 1012, 775, 257, 4086, 294, 341, 1785, 4728, 31870, 30, 51603], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16722356056680485, "compression_ratio": 1.6015325670498084, "no_speech_prob": 1.5133962876293094e-12}, {"id": 634, "seek": 204088, "start": 2040.88, "end": 2048.4, "text": " It ends in what the author calls recursive normalization, which is, without a doubt, the most chilling concept in the entire text.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 5314, 294, 437, 264, 3793, 5498, 20560, 488, 2710, 2144, 11, 597, 307, 11, 1553, 257, 6385, 11, 264, 881, 31047, 3410, 294, 264, 2302, 2487, 13, 50741], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 635, "seek": 204088, "start": 2048.6800000000003, "end": 2051.6400000000003, "text": " It synthesizes the ultimate tragedy of the ship.", "tokens": [50755, 467, 26617, 5660, 264, 9705, 18563, 295, 264, 5374, 13, 50903], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 636, "seek": 204088, "start": 2051.96, "end": 2052.8, "text": " Recursive normalization.", "tokens": [50919, 9647, 2156, 488, 2710, 2144, 13, 50961], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 637, "seek": 204088, "start": 2052.94, "end": 2053.12, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50968, 865, 13, 50977], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 638, "seek": 204088, "start": 2053.28, "end": 2060.6800000000003, "text": " Over time, and we are talking decades here, as the original passengers age and die, the emergency stops feeling like an emergency.", "tokens": [50985, 4886, 565, 11, 293, 321, 366, 1417, 7878, 510, 11, 382, 264, 3380, 18436, 3205, 293, 978, 11, 264, 7473, 10094, 2633, 411, 364, 7473, 13, 51355], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 639, "seek": 204088, "start": 2060.82, "end": 2062.54, "text": " The emergency becomes the environment.", "tokens": [51362, 440, 7473, 3643, 264, 2823, 13, 51448], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 640, "seek": 204088, "start": 2062.6800000000003, "end": 2064.28, "text": " The environment becomes the society.", "tokens": [51455, 440, 2823, 3643, 264, 4086, 13, 51535], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 641, "seek": 204088, "start": 2064.6400000000003, "end": 2064.8, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51553, 865, 13, 51561], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 642, "seek": 204088, "start": 2064.86, "end": 2066.2400000000002, "text": " And the society becomes a tradition.", "tokens": [51564, 400, 264, 4086, 3643, 257, 6994, 13, 51633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 643, "seek": 204088, "start": 2066.4, "end": 2067.98, "text": " The baseline just keeps shifting downward.", "tokens": [51641, 440, 20518, 445, 5965, 17573, 24805, 13, 51720], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 644, "seek": 204088, "start": 2068.3, "end": 2070.2200000000003, "text": " The shifting baseline is absolute.", "tokens": [51736, 440, 17573, 20518, 307, 8236, 13, 51832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13255973229041465, "compression_ratio": 1.8361774744027304, "no_speech_prob": 1.989364619217615e-12}, {"id": 645, "seek": 207022, "start": 2070.22, "end": 2077.04, "text": " The frantic, non-restorative repairs they made in panic become the unquestioned infrastructure of everyday life.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 431, 7128, 11, 2107, 12, 4149, 284, 1166, 28823, 436, 1027, 294, 14783, 1813, 264, 517, 20343, 37579, 6896, 295, 7429, 993, 13, 50706], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09776130215875034, "compression_ratio": 1.6941580756013745, "no_speech_prob": 1.4328582808101342e-12}, {"id": 646, "seek": 207022, "start": 2077.22, "end": 2083.7799999999997, "text": " The arbitrary rituals they invented just to pass the time become sacred, heavily enforced religious duties.", "tokens": [50715, 440, 23211, 29082, 436, 14479, 445, 281, 1320, 264, 565, 1813, 15757, 11, 10950, 40953, 7185, 20910, 13, 51043], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09776130215875034, "compression_ratio": 1.6941580756013745, "no_speech_prob": 1.4328582808101342e-12}, {"id": 647, "seek": 207022, "start": 2083.98, "end": 2084.64, "text": " That's all they know.", "tokens": [51053, 663, 311, 439, 436, 458, 13, 51086], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09776130215875034, "compression_ratio": 1.6941580756013745, "no_speech_prob": 1.4328582808101342e-12}, {"id": 648, "seek": 207022, "start": 2085.1, "end": 2096.66, "text": " Generations are born on this ship who have never seen a real tree, who have never felt the warmth of a real sun, who have never stood on Earth, and who know the word Mars only as a vague mythological concept from the ancient texts.", "tokens": [51109, 15409, 763, 366, 4232, 322, 341, 5374, 567, 362, 1128, 1612, 257, 957, 4230, 11, 567, 362, 1128, 2762, 264, 24737, 295, 257, 957, 3295, 11, 567, 362, 1128, 9371, 322, 4755, 11, 293, 567, 458, 264, 1349, 9692, 787, 382, 257, 24247, 9474, 4383, 3410, 490, 264, 7832, 15765, 13, 51687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09776130215875034, "compression_ratio": 1.6941580756013745, "no_speech_prob": 1.4328582808101342e-12}, {"id": 649, "seek": 207022, "start": 2096.7999999999997, "end": 2097.56, "text": " Like a fairy tale.", "tokens": [51694, 1743, 257, 19104, 17172, 13, 51732], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09776130215875034, "compression_ratio": 1.6941580756013745, "no_speech_prob": 1.4328582808101342e-12}, {"id": 650, "seek": 209756, "start": 2097.56, "end": 2106.74, "text": " For these new generations, being trapped in a cold, metal tube, drifting endlessly in the dark, performing meaningless tasks, isn't a catastrophe.", "tokens": [50365, 1171, 613, 777, 10593, 11, 885, 14994, 294, 257, 3554, 11, 5760, 9917, 11, 37973, 44920, 294, 264, 2877, 11, 10205, 33232, 9608, 11, 1943, 380, 257, 36043, 13, 50824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15594573974609374, "compression_ratio": 1.5092592592592593, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204311314275802e-12}, {"id": 651, "seek": 209756, "start": 2107.1, "end": 2108.18, "text": " It's just normal life.", "tokens": [50842, 467, 311, 445, 2710, 993, 13, 50896], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15594573974609374, "compression_ratio": 1.5092592592592593, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204311314275802e-12}, {"id": 652, "seek": 209756, "start": 2108.68, "end": 2113.06, "text": " The catastrophe stabilizes into an inherited, unquestioned social world.", "tokens": [50921, 440, 36043, 11652, 5660, 666, 364, 27091, 11, 517, 20343, 37579, 2093, 1002, 13, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15594573974609374, "compression_ratio": 1.5092592592592593, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204311314275802e-12}, {"id": 653, "seek": 209756, "start": 2113.58, "end": 2118.38, "text": " I find myself marveling at the sheer cruelty of that kind of successful adaptation.", "tokens": [51166, 286, 915, 2059, 23893, 278, 412, 264, 23061, 40145, 295, 300, 733, 295, 4406, 21549, 13, 51406], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15594573974609374, "compression_ratio": 1.5092592592592593, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204311314275802e-12}, {"id": 654, "seek": 211838, "start": 2118.38, "end": 2123.9, "text": " It's a testament to human resilience, but in the darkest, most perverse way possible.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 257, 35499, 281, 1952, 19980, 11, 457, 294, 264, 33460, 11, 881, 680, 4308, 636, 1944, 13, 50641], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1314649694106158, "compression_ratio": 1.5442477876106195, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735445715522878e-12}, {"id": 655, "seek": 211838, "start": 2123.9, "end": 2124.88, "text": " It really is.", "tokens": [50641, 467, 534, 307, 13, 50690], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1314649694106158, "compression_ratio": 1.5442477876106195, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735445715522878e-12}, {"id": 656, "seek": 211838, "start": 2124.98, "end": 2133.28, "text": " The fact that humanity is so endlessly, stubbornly adaptable that it can perfectly, comfortably adapt to a completely future-less, meaningless existence.", "tokens": [50695, 440, 1186, 300, 10243, 307, 370, 44920, 11, 24137, 356, 6231, 712, 300, 309, 393, 6239, 11, 25101, 6231, 281, 257, 2584, 2027, 12, 1832, 11, 33232, 9123, 13, 51110], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1314649694106158, "compression_ratio": 1.5442477876106195, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735445715522878e-12}, {"id": 657, "seek": 211838, "start": 2133.44, "end": 2133.62, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51118, 1779, 13, 51127], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1314649694106158, "compression_ratio": 1.5442477876106195, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735445715522878e-12}, {"id": 658, "seek": 211838, "start": 2133.76, "end": 2137.62, "text": " We can take the architecture of our own doom and decorate it until it feels like a home.", "tokens": [51134, 492, 393, 747, 264, 9482, 295, 527, 1065, 37131, 293, 24229, 309, 1826, 309, 3417, 411, 257, 1280, 13, 51327], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1314649694106158, "compression_ratio": 1.5442477876106195, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735445715522878e-12}, {"id": 659, "seek": 213762, "start": 2137.62, "end": 2142.66, "text": " That is a very poetic way to phrase the core sociological warning of the monograph.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 257, 588, 41080, 636, 281, 9535, 264, 4965, 3075, 4383, 9164, 295, 264, 1108, 3108, 13, 50617], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17405363853941572, "compression_ratio": 1.429530201342282, "no_speech_prob": 1.6426261392754604e-12}, {"id": 660, "seek": 213762, "start": 2143.2, "end": 2148.62, "text": " The author states emphatically that successful adaptation can actually stabilize catastrophic conditions.", "tokens": [50644, 440, 3793, 4368, 846, 950, 5030, 300, 4406, 21549, 393, 767, 31870, 34915, 4487, 13, 50915], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17405363853941572, "compression_ratio": 1.429530201342282, "no_speech_prob": 1.6426261392754604e-12}, {"id": 661, "seek": 213762, "start": 2149.3599999999997, "end": 2150.6, "text": " That's a scary thought.", "tokens": [50952, 663, 311, 257, 6958, 1194, 13, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17405363853941572, "compression_ratio": 1.429530201342282, "no_speech_prob": 1.6426261392754604e-12}, {"id": 662, "seek": 215060, "start": 2150.6, "end": 2157.22, "text": " We often think of survival as a victory, but the text argues that persistence does not imply continuation.", "tokens": [50365, 492, 2049, 519, 295, 12559, 382, 257, 9812, 11, 457, 264, 2487, 38218, 300, 37617, 775, 406, 33616, 29357, 13, 50696], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18053823425656274, "compression_ratio": 1.6725663716814159, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279271546585817e-12}, {"id": 663, "seek": 215060, "start": 2157.8399999999997, "end": 2160.06, "text": " The material object of the ship persisted.", "tokens": [50727, 440, 2527, 2657, 295, 264, 5374, 13233, 292, 13, 50838], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18053823425656274, "compression_ratio": 1.6725663716814159, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279271546585817e-12}, {"id": 664, "seek": 215060, "start": 2160.2799999999997, "end": 2163.04, "text": " The biological bodies of the humans persisted.", "tokens": [50849, 440, 13910, 7510, 295, 264, 6255, 13233, 292, 13, 50987], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18053823425656274, "compression_ratio": 1.6725663716814159, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279271546585817e-12}, {"id": 665, "seek": 215060, "start": 2163.2799999999997, "end": 2170.36, "text": " But the project of humanity, the destination, the purpose, the connection to a wider universe that was entirely lost,", "tokens": [50999, 583, 264, 1716, 295, 10243, 11, 264, 12236, 11, 264, 4334, 11, 264, 4984, 281, 257, 11842, 6445, 300, 390, 7696, 2731, 11, 51353], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18053823425656274, "compression_ratio": 1.6725663716814159, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279271546585817e-12}, {"id": 666, "seek": 215060, "start": 2170.8399999999997, "end": 2174.42, "text": " they survived only to become ghosts haunting their own machine.", "tokens": [51377, 436, 14433, 787, 281, 1813, 21744, 44512, 641, 1065, 3479, 13, 51556], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18053823425656274, "compression_ratio": 1.6725663716814159, "no_speech_prob": 1.7279271546585817e-12}, {"id": 667, "seek": 217442, "start": 2174.42, "end": 2175.06, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [50365, 3153, 13, 50397], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1485159817863913, "compression_ratio": 1.6129032258064515, "no_speech_prob": 1.6045743293086057e-12}, {"id": 668, "seek": 217442, "start": 2175.7200000000003, "end": 2180.0, "text": " Let's just briefly recap this intense, mind-bending journey you've taken us on today.", "tokens": [50430, 961, 311, 445, 10515, 20928, 341, 9447, 11, 1575, 12, 65, 2029, 4671, 291, 600, 2726, 505, 322, 965, 13, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1485159817863913, "compression_ratio": 1.6129032258064515, "no_speech_prob": 1.6045743293086057e-12}, {"id": 669, "seek": 217442, "start": 2180.2400000000002, "end": 2188.7200000000003, "text": " We started with the crucial difference between just surviving admissibility and actually having a destination that gives that survival meaning reachability.", "tokens": [50656, 492, 1409, 365, 264, 11462, 2649, 1296, 445, 24948, 5910, 891, 2841, 293, 767, 1419, 257, 12236, 300, 2709, 300, 12559, 3620, 2524, 2310, 13, 51080], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1485159817863913, "compression_ratio": 1.6129032258064515, "no_speech_prob": 1.6045743293086057e-12}, {"id": 670, "seek": 217442, "start": 2188.9, "end": 2189.1, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51089, 1779, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1485159817863913, "compression_ratio": 1.6129032258064515, "no_speech_prob": 1.6045743293086057e-12}, {"id": 671, "seek": 217442, "start": 2189.32, "end": 2196.16, "text": " We look at the illusion of the great escape, the idea that you can't just pack up your problems and move them to a new planet without bringing the apocalypse with you.", "tokens": [51110, 492, 574, 412, 264, 18854, 295, 264, 869, 7615, 11, 264, 1558, 300, 291, 393, 380, 445, 2844, 493, 428, 2740, 293, 1286, 552, 281, 257, 777, 5054, 1553, 5062, 264, 42600, 365, 291, 13, 51452], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1485159817863913, "compression_ratio": 1.6129032258064515, "no_speech_prob": 1.6045743293086057e-12}, {"id": 672, "seek": 217442, "start": 2196.2000000000003, "end": 2197.2400000000002, "text": " The displacement principle.", "tokens": [51454, 440, 21899, 8665, 13, 51506], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1485159817863913, "compression_ratio": 1.6129032258064515, "no_speech_prob": 1.6045743293086057e-12}, {"id": 673, "seek": 219724, "start": 2197.24, "end": 2197.7999999999997, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50393], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14789603551228842, "compression_ratio": 1.5634328358208955, "no_speech_prob": 2.307596821959912e-12}, {"id": 674, "seek": 219724, "start": 2198.3399999999997, "end": 2208.72, "text": " We explored that terrifying epistemic delay, the agonizing lag between when a disaster physically happens and when society actually realizes the future is dead.", "tokens": [50420, 492, 24016, 300, 18106, 2388, 468, 3438, 8577, 11, 264, 623, 266, 3319, 8953, 1296, 562, 257, 11293, 9762, 2314, 293, 562, 4086, 767, 29316, 264, 2027, 307, 3116, 13, 50939], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14789603551228842, "compression_ratio": 1.5634328358208955, "no_speech_prob": 2.307596821959912e-12}, {"id": 675, "seek": 219724, "start": 2209.12, "end": 2212.9599999999996, "text": " We unpacked how authority will lie to enforce the teleological debt.", "tokens": [50959, 492, 26699, 292, 577, 8281, 486, 4544, 281, 24825, 264, 4304, 4383, 7831, 13, 51151], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14789603551228842, "compression_ratio": 1.5634328358208955, "no_speech_prob": 2.307596821959912e-12}, {"id": 676, "seek": 219724, "start": 2213.18, "end": 2224.8799999999997, "text": " And finally, we saw how a society folds inward, trying to repair its reality through rituals and machines like Mima, until eventually the catastrophe just becomes a normal Tuesday.", "tokens": [51162, 400, 2721, 11, 321, 1866, 577, 257, 4086, 31341, 29876, 11, 1382, 281, 10535, 1080, 4103, 807, 29082, 293, 8379, 411, 376, 4775, 11, 1826, 4728, 264, 36043, 445, 3643, 257, 2710, 10017, 13, 51747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14789603551228842, "compression_ratio": 1.5634328358208955, "no_speech_prob": 2.307596821959912e-12}, {"id": 677, "seek": 222488, "start": 2224.88, "end": 2228.12, "text": " It is a profound and deeply unsettling thought experiment.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 307, 257, 14382, 293, 8760, 43964, 1688, 1194, 5120, 13, 50527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10170950331129469, "compression_ratio": 1.5454545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 1.9582879155072286e-12}, {"id": 678, "seek": 222488, "start": 2228.62, "end": 2232.54, "text": " But the author of the monograph leaves us with a final, highly provocative question.", "tokens": [50552, 583, 264, 3793, 295, 264, 1108, 3108, 5510, 505, 365, 257, 2572, 11, 5405, 47663, 1168, 13, 50748], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10170950331129469, "compression_ratio": 1.5454545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 1.9582879155072286e-12}, {"id": 679, "seek": 222488, "start": 2232.78, "end": 2235.86, "text": " And I think it's only fitting that we pose it directly to you, the listener.", "tokens": [50760, 400, 286, 519, 309, 311, 787, 15669, 300, 321, 10774, 309, 3838, 281, 291, 11, 264, 31569, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10170950331129469, "compression_ratio": 1.5454545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 1.9582879155072286e-12}, {"id": 680, "seek": 222488, "start": 2236.0, "end": 2236.42, "text": " Let's hear it.", "tokens": [50921, 961, 311, 1568, 309, 13, 50942], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10170950331129469, "compression_ratio": 1.5454545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 1.9582879155072286e-12}, {"id": 681, "seek": 222488, "start": 2236.6600000000003, "end": 2246.04, "text": " If NER isn't just a science fiction story about the future, but a theoretical laboratory for our world right now, how much of our current civilization is already operating like this lost ship?", "tokens": [50954, 759, 426, 1598, 1943, 380, 445, 257, 3497, 13266, 1657, 466, 264, 2027, 11, 457, 257, 20864, 16523, 337, 527, 1002, 558, 586, 11, 577, 709, 295, 527, 2190, 18036, 307, 1217, 7447, 411, 341, 2731, 5374, 30, 51423], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10170950331129469, "compression_ratio": 1.5454545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 1.9582879155072286e-12}, {"id": 682, "seek": 222488, "start": 2246.1600000000003, "end": 2247.7400000000002, "text": " Ooh, that is a heavy question.", "tokens": [51429, 7951, 11, 300, 307, 257, 4676, 1168, 13, 51508], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10170950331129469, "compression_ratio": 1.5454545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 1.9582879155072286e-12}, {"id": 683, "seek": 224774, "start": 2247.74, "end": 2248.2999999999997, "text": " Look around.", "tokens": [50365, 2053, 926, 13, 50393], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1388603886471519, "compression_ratio": 1.5443037974683544, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171602902279036e-12}, {"id": 684, "seek": 224774, "start": 2248.2999999999997, "end": 2256.06, "text": " Are we currently hyper-fixated on internal social status and vicious cultural infighting because our macro progress has stalled?", "tokens": [50393, 2014, 321, 4362, 9848, 12, 69, 970, 770, 322, 6920, 2093, 6558, 293, 30093, 6988, 1536, 397, 278, 570, 527, 18887, 4205, 575, 342, 8907, 30, 50781], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1388603886471519, "compression_ratio": 1.5443037974683544, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171602902279036e-12}, {"id": 685, "seek": 224774, "start": 2256.2, "end": 2257.6, "text": " It definitely feels like it sometimes.", "tokens": [50788, 467, 2138, 3417, 411, 309, 2171, 13, 50858], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1388603886471519, "compression_ratio": 1.5443037974683544, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171602902279036e-12}, {"id": 686, "seek": 224774, "start": 2257.9199999999996, "end": 2267.9799999999996, "text": " Are we pouring billions of dollars into building better and better virtual reality machines, artificial intelligences, and algorithmic echo chambers our own modern Mimas to escape into?", "tokens": [50874, 2014, 321, 20450, 17375, 295, 3808, 666, 2390, 1101, 293, 1101, 6374, 4103, 8379, 11, 11677, 5613, 2667, 11, 293, 9284, 299, 14300, 34513, 527, 1065, 4363, 376, 17957, 281, 7615, 666, 30, 51377], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1388603886471519, "compression_ratio": 1.5443037974683544, "no_speech_prob": 1.6171602902279036e-12}, {"id": 687, "seek": 226798, "start": 2267.98, "end": 2280.54, "text": " Are we obsessing over administrative busyness and institutional theater simply because, deep down in our collective subconscious, we've realized that our global planetary trajectory has already been lost?", "tokens": [50365, 2014, 321, 35803, 278, 670, 17900, 5856, 1287, 293, 18391, 10612, 2935, 570, 11, 2452, 760, 294, 527, 12590, 27389, 11, 321, 600, 5334, 300, 527, 4338, 35788, 21512, 575, 1217, 668, 2731, 30, 50993], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09924153064159637, "compression_ratio": 1.5859649122807018, "no_speech_prob": 1.36191687268028e-12}, {"id": 688, "seek": 226798, "start": 2280.72, "end": 2280.98, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [51002, 3153, 13, 51015], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09924153064159637, "compression_ratio": 1.5859649122807018, "no_speech_prob": 1.36191687268028e-12}, {"id": 689, "seek": 226798, "start": 2281.16, "end": 2288.34, "text": " Are we just pacing the corridors of a dying biosphere, admiring our own reflection in the window, while the void outside remains unchanged?", "tokens": [51024, 2014, 321, 445, 43285, 264, 46920, 295, 257, 8639, 36997, 6605, 11, 5910, 5057, 527, 1065, 12914, 294, 264, 4910, 11, 1339, 264, 22009, 2380, 7023, 44553, 30, 51383], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09924153064159637, "compression_ratio": 1.5859649122807018, "no_speech_prob": 1.36191687268028e-12}, {"id": 690, "seek": 226798, "start": 2288.7400000000002, "end": 2293.36, "text": " That is a thought that is going to fundamentally change how I look at my email inbox tomorrow morning.", "tokens": [51403, 663, 307, 257, 1194, 300, 307, 516, 281, 17879, 1319, 577, 286, 574, 412, 452, 3796, 35067, 4153, 2446, 13, 51634], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09924153064159637, "compression_ratio": 1.5859649122807018, "no_speech_prob": 1.36191687268028e-12}, {"id": 691, "seek": 229336, "start": 2293.36, "end": 2300.1200000000003, "text": " Are you navigating toward a real destination, or are you just comfortably pacing the corridors of an endless drifting ship?", "tokens": [50365, 2014, 291, 32054, 7361, 257, 957, 12236, 11, 420, 366, 291, 445, 25101, 43285, 264, 46920, 295, 364, 16144, 37973, 5374, 30, 50703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13734049913359853, "compression_ratio": 1.5045045045045045, "no_speech_prob": 1.5856351604989771e-12}, {"id": 692, "seek": 229336, "start": 2300.2400000000002, "end": 2300.44, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50709, 865, 13, 50719], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13734049913359853, "compression_ratio": 1.5045045045045045, "no_speech_prob": 1.5856351604989771e-12}, {"id": 693, "seek": 229336, "start": 2300.6, "end": 2304.82, "text": " Because if you look out the window and all you see is your own reflection, it might be time to ask who is really steering.", "tokens": [50727, 1436, 498, 291, 574, 484, 264, 4910, 293, 439, 291, 536, 307, 428, 1065, 12914, 11, 309, 1062, 312, 565, 281, 1029, 567, 307, 534, 14823, 13, 50938], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13734049913359853, "compression_ratio": 1.5045045045045045, "no_speech_prob": 1.5856351604989771e-12}, {"id": 694, "seek": 229336, "start": 2305.2200000000003, "end": 2308.34, "text": " Thank you so much for joining us in seat 14B for this deep dive.", "tokens": [50958, 1044, 291, 370, 709, 337, 5549, 505, 294, 6121, 3499, 33, 337, 341, 2452, 9192, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13734049913359853, "compression_ratio": 1.5045045045045045, "no_speech_prob": 1.5856351604989771e-12}, {"id": 695, "seek": 229336, "start": 2308.54, "end": 2309.2200000000003, "text": " Until next time.", "tokens": [51124, 9088, 958, 565, 13, 51158], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13734049913359853, "compression_ratio": 1.5045045045045045, "no_speech_prob": 1.5856351604989771e-12}], "language": "en"}
